window.FWN_FEY_EVOLUTION_MERCHANT_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_FEY_EVOLUTION_MERCHANT_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":401,"title":"Chapter 401: A King-Class Expert Dares to Eavesdrop With Impunity?","paragraphs":["The middle-aged man with a full beard picked up this piece of paper as if he was in disbelief, and after scanning it, he asked in confusion, “Big Brother, how come this is still a paper document?”","The older middle-aged man had a sarcastic smile on his face.","“The person who sent the message was afraid of leaving evidence and didn’t want to lose his loyalty to the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce on the surface.”","The middle-aged man with a full beard coughed in dissatisfaction and said, “Big Brother, don’t leave me hanging.”","Seeing that his brother was very impatient, the older middle-aged man just replied, “Besides Listen, the only person who can know such important information about the Lingerie Chamber of Commerce is the old butler, Qian De. He has been serving the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s presidents for three generations. Tell me, who told me this piece of news?”","The middle-aged man with a full beard became more and more surprised.","“Qian De is very loyal. I promised to give him two Bronze/Flawless feys and 200,000 Radiance dollars, but he refused to tell me about Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s online resources.","“I told him to quote a price, and this old man was still unrelenting. For someone like him who’s unafraid of death, how did you do it, Big Brother?”","The older middle-aged man rubbed over the wine pot with the dragon beast pattern and answered calmly, “I had Elder Fei capture Qian De’s son and two grandsons and transplant the Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu larvae into his son’s body.","“Then, I had Elder Fei let Qian De’s son return. After just three days, Qian De delivered the information himself, saying that he wanted to hand over the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s online resources to me.","“Qian De is not afraid of death, but he’s afraid of his son’s death and that I’ll lay my hands on his two grandsons.”","The more the middle-aged man with a full beard listened, the more his eyes lit up.","After listening to the older middle-aged man, the middle-aged man with a full beard could not help but say, “Big Brother, since we have already gotten Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s online resources, why don’t we have Elder Fei put Qian De’s—”","Before he could finish his words, the older middle-aged man interrupted what his brother was going to say next and said with resentment for failing to meet his expectations, “How many times have I told you? Reputation is the most important for our Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce to develop. Why haven’t you understood that yet?","“If word spreads out about this, even the Zheng family will have scruples when investing resources in our Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce, let alone the other faction excluding us.”","Seeing that he was being lectured by his big brother again, the middle-aged man with a full beard raised the wine glass in his hand out of habit and said, “I’ve noted down your words, Big Brother. I know I was in the wrong. Cheers!”","As soon as the older middle-aged man heard this, he put the wine pot in his hand on the table with force. He only felt that there was nothing more to see in this wine pot with a dragon beast pattern.","...","Lin Yuan looked at Listen, who was standing beside him, and asked, “Are you going to be unable to hold on this week?”","Listen’s eyes were red from staying up all night for the past few days, and his expression was full of fatigue.","However, after seeing Lin Yuan, a relaxed smile appeared on Listen’s face.","“It will take another three days before I can’t hold on!","“The Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce should have just grasped the resources from my side, which it can’t devour within three days.”","Upon hearing Listen’s words, Lin Yuan raised his eyebrow slightly.","“How do you know that the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce has lost all of its online resources?”","When Listen heard that, his expression became somewhat sullen and cold.","“Grandpa Qian has been supporting me all this time. I went to look for him three days ago, but he was not at the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","“After returning the next day, he started looking at me with a pang of faint guilt in his eyes, and he didn’t say much.","“Only Grandpa Qian and I know about the online resources.”","Listen made a point without going into details. However, Lin Yuan did not speak after listening. Instead, he looked toward Listen, indicating for him to continue speaking.","Upon seeing Lin Yuan’s eyes, Listen understood what he meant and added, “After this is over, I’ll send Grandpa Qian away from the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce to retire in Indigo Azure City. All matters regarding the chamber of commerce will have nothing to do with him in the future.”","Lin Yuan slightly raised his hand.","A Platinum fey storage box landed in front of Listen, and Lin Yuan said, “Here are 1,350 objects of various sizes. Can you hold on without the online resources and with these objects?”","Listen picked up the Platinum fey storage box, and the fatigue on his face was swept away. Although Listen had not slept and had red eyes from staying up late in the past few days, he had unparalleled confidence in his eyes at this moment.","“These 1,350 objects are akin to an injection of 13,500,000 Radiance dollars. These objects are even top resources.","“If I still can’t hold on, how will I dare to make a promise of letting the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce become a rising faction in four months?”","The corners of Lin Yuan’s mouth curled up.","“Hu Quan has found 27 Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen. They can create 70 pieces more than the expected 200 pieces that can be produced every day.","“You just need to develop the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce well, and I’ll solve the problems regarding martial force for you.”","Lin Yuan proceeded to start the plan of white-clothed followers.","Before opening a space tunnel to the Divine Wood Federation, the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce was the best place for the white-clothed followers to return to.","Given the current situation, the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce would be advancing toward becoming a rising faction by relying on these objects made from completely jade-textured wood powder within four months.","He didn’t know how many eyes were eyeing in the shadows and how many hungry wolves wanted to pounce on them and tear the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s flesh to share the gourmet feast in the cup.","At that time, without the martial force support of king-class experts, the cold stream mixed with wind and rain would soon blow the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce into pieces.","When Listen heard Lin Yuan’s words, his eyes lit up instantly, and he said quickly, “If you can ensure that the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce has enough combat power, I’m confident of letting it hit the threshold of a rising faction in three months.”","Lin Yuan did not reply. In his opinion, even with so many resources injected, it was already extremely difficult for Listen to achieve the transformation to a rising faction within four months.","The three months that Listen had proclaimed was really a bit harsh.","At that moment, the peculiar and nice voice of the Mother of Bloodbath that had not uttered a word suddenly sounded, its tone cold.","“A king-class expert dares to eavesdrop? Do you really think that the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce has no one?”"]},{"number":402,"title":"Chapter 402: Stripping Away the Willpower Rune","paragraphs":["The Mother of Bloodbath’s voice had faded for a long time, but no one responded.","Lin Yuan scanned the empty room and did not discover anything. Nonetheless, he knew that since the Mother of Bloodbath had said that, there was certainly a king-class expert eavesdropping on their conversation.","At that moment, the Mother of Bloodbath’s voice sounded again. Lin Yuan could clearly hear the Mother of Bloodbath’s words this time were laced with strong killing intent.","“Why? Since you’re not coming out voluntarily, do you need me to invite you out?”","A black figure appeared by the window. It was a thin, black-robed old man with white hair and a beard. It was as abrupt as a bat suddenly appearing in front of a window at noon.","The old man kicked the window and jumped down into the room, looking superior. An ugly and hideous-looking insect-species fey was lying on each side of his shoulders.","Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to check the two ugly insect-species feys’ attributes.","[Fey Name]: Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu","[Fey Species]: Bombycidae/Mind Silkworm","[Fey Grade]: Diamond (4/10)","[Fey Type]: Dark/Poison","[Fey Quality]: Fantasy II","...","[Fey Name]: Blood-Toothed Cricket","[Fey Species]: Wingless Gryllus/Toothed Cricket","[Fey Grade]: Diamond (3/10)","[Fey Type]: Blood/Poison","[Fey Quality]: Fantasy III","...","Lin Yuan looked at their attributes and then at this black-robed old man. He couldn’t help but say inwardly, This old man’s strength is not bad. One of his two poison-type insect-species fey is good at cursing, while the other is good at assassination. At the same time, they’re high-grade Fantasy Breeds.","Before casting curse abilities, the Diamond IV/Fantasy II Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu must devour a large number of hearts to be able to enhance the curse effect.","The Diamond III/Fantasy III Blood-Toothed Cricket was an insect-species fey that usually needed to drink a lot of blood.","From the pairing of such insidious and poisonous insect-species feys, it could be seen that this old man was not someone nice.","“F*ck! You have discerning eyes, little girl. You’re able to detect my presence.”","After the old man finished speaking, Lin Yuan inwardly said, This is bad.","Although the Mother of Bloodbath was a glutton and extremely friendly to the people in the mansion, it was undeniable that it was an insect-species fey and the cruelest spider fey.","The Mother of Bloodbath possessed the Blood Law Rune. Only when it truly understood the nature of blood could it dare to say that it could see through the law of blood.","Therefore, how could the Mother of Bloodbath master the Blood Law Rune without staining its hands into bloodbaths?","Surprisingly, this old man was speaking to the Mother of Bloodbath like a monk being hanged.","The Mother of Bloodbath stepped forward with a clearly interesting expression on its face.","“Hehe, you called me little girl?”","The black-robed old man had already known that the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce wasn’t presided over by any king-class experts.","Although he did not know how the woman with the strange mask with dark patterns of flowing clouds in front of him had found out about himself, so what if he had been discovered? They were just a bunch of trash.","This black-robed old man had a teasing face. He looked at Lin Yuan, Listen, and the Mother of Bloodbath like they were three funny toys.","“You’re so young, yet your ears don’t work well. Are you maybe not a little girl but a sissy dressed in female clothing?”","Lin Yuan had actually wanted to tell the Mother of Bloodbath not to launch a vicious attack, but since this old man had spoken like that, he could no longer stop the Mother of Bloodbath. After all, dignity was always what mattered to experts.","The old man’s words had obviously touched the Mother of Bloodbath’s bottom line.","The Mother of Bloodbath suddenly laughed. However, its nice voice was filled with extreme evilness. The frequency of this laughter was vaguely the hissing sound spider feys let out when they were hunting for food.","For some reason, this black-robed old man with a white beard and hair felt a chill in his body after hearing the Mother of Bloodbath’s laughter.","Goosebumps immediately crawled all over him, and even the age spots on his face were uneven due to the goosebumps.","An inexplicable sense of crisis emerged in his heart, and the old man shouted, “Blood-Toothed Cricket, kill this woman with Blood Poison Stabbing Teeth!”","The Blood-Toothed Cricket was only half the size of a palm, with a blood-red color throughout its body.","However, its blood-red body was covered in black patches and brown-green prickly hair, which was very ugly.","When the Blood-Toothed Cricket received the old man’s command, it stared at its powerful hind legs, thinking of pouncing at the Mother of Bloodbath. At the same time, two fangs formed by blood energy appeared in front of the Mother of Bloodbath.","The front end of the fangs also contained green venom that emitted a dark-black glow. At that moment, the aura that the Mother of Bloodbath always restrained dispersed the Blood-Toothed Cricket’s Blood Poison Stabbing Teeth in one blow.","An aura of a sovereign descending the world radiated from the Mother of Bloodbath’s body. However, it controlled this aura within the house.","At the same time, the aura also emitted a kind of evil coldness. It was as if this bright house had instantly turned into a dark crypt for a spider to hunt all of a sudden.","The Blood-Toothed Cricket landed on the ground from mid-air and twitched violently. A blood-red luster flickered on its body, and a will similar to blood suddenly appeared.","“Hehe, this Fantasy Breed Blood-Toothed Cricket and this Blood Poison Willpower Rune really match! It’s interesting to have a small Fantasy Breed insect attack me with its blood-type ability.”","When the Mother of Bloodbath’s words just fell, this Blood Poison Will energy was stripped away from the Blood-Toothed Cricket’s body. Then it slowly fused into the Mother of Bloodbath’s body. The Mother of Bloodbath’s body swirled with a scarlet blood-like luster.","After the Blood-Toothed Cricket’s Blood Poison Willpower was stripped away, it fell from a Fantasy Breed into a Diamond III/Legend fey.","This black-clothed old man suddenly exclaimed, “A Suzerain/Myth Breed fey!”","The old man’s words were filled with astonishment and fear, and even his voice trembled.","The Mother of Bloodbath approached the fallen Blood-Toothed Cricket step by step and said, “You’re a little knowledgeable. You even know about Law Stripping and Same-Type Control.”","When this old man had ordered his Blood-Toothed Cricket attack the Mother of Bloodbath, Listen’s heart had tightened.","He couldn’t be any more familiar with this old man. He was precisely the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce’s third authoritative figure, Fei Qianqiong."]},{"number":403,"title":"Chapter 403: Let’s Break the Contract!","paragraphs":["Fei Qianqiong could definitely be called a veteran king-class expert. As someone with the third-highest ranking in the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce, he had a notorious reputation outside.","Just as the Mother of Bloodbath had suddenly revealed its aura, Listen and Fei Qianqiong were shocked as well. However, Listen’s shock was different from Fei Qianqiong’s. Fei Qianqiong was in panic and fear, while Listen was pleasantly surprised.","Listen looked at Lin Yuan and realized that he was sitting there indifferently, without the slightest change in his expression. It was as though the king-class expert’s sudden attack was merely the wind brushing past and wasn’t worth mentioning.","Previously, Listen had only seen Lin Yuan inadvertently reveal the foundation of his resources.","However, when Fei Qianqiong shouted, ‘A Suzerain/Myth Breed fey’, it was enough to prove that Lin Yuan’s foundation in terms of martial force was even deeper than that of resources.","Listen moved his gaze away from Lin Yuan and once again glanced at the Mother of Bloodbath and the Blood-Toothed Cricket, which was twitching and struggling on the ground.","Although Listen had never heard of a Myth Breed fey’s Law Stripping and Same-Type Control toward a Fantasy Breed fey, his grandfather had shared some things with him.","Law Stripping referred to the Law Rune stripping away the willpower within the law that belonged to a Fantasy Breed fey.","Same-Type Control referred to the superior same-type fey dominating the inferior one.","Although Listen did not know what species of fey the Mother of Bloodbath was, from the fact that it could strip away the Blood-Toothed Cricket’s bloodline and was able to use Same-Type Control, it was evidently a Suzerain/Myth Breed insect-species fey that controlled the blood law.","Fei Qianqiong could now clearly sense that he had lost control of the Blood-Toothed Cricket, but the Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu on his other shoulder was still under his control.","He vaguely glanced at the youth sitting on the sofa without uttering a word. At the same time, he took a heartbreaking glance at the Blood-Toothed Cricket on the ground. Its Willpower Rune had been stripped away, and its quality was no longer Fantasy Breed.","A hint of madness flashed in Fei Qianqiong’s eyes.","He did not know about the identity of the youth sitting on the sofa. However, just by looking at the style of the mask on his face, he could tell that his status was clearly higher than this Suzerain/Myth fey in its human form.","Just then, Fei Qianqiong heard a peculiar and pleasant voice ring beside his ear.","“You’ve raised the Blood-Toothed Cricket well. Even if it has been demoted, this Diamond IV/Legend Blood-Toothed Cricket is still somewhat useful.","“So destroy your spiritual energy fragment to break the contract and let this Blood-Toothed Cricket become a wild fey.”","The tone in which the Mother of Bloodbath said this was as if it was talking about a very common thing. However, these words were like a command to Fei Qianqiong that carried weight.","Although Fei Qianqiong had been prepared not to leave this room alive and a hint of madness flashed in his eyes, he couldn’t help but shiver after hearing the Mother of Bloodbath’s words.","What was the difference between self-destroying one’s spiritual energy fragment to break a contract with a specific fey and letting a spirit qi professional die?","After the fey and the contractor formed a contract, it was akin to a lifetime bond. However, if a spirit qi professional destroyed the spiritual energy fragment in their mind with a specific fey, it would be akin to breaking the bridge of the previous contract with the particular fey, and the contracted fey could regain its freedom by doing so.","Furthermore, it would be akin to him seriously injuring his spiritual roots, which couldn’t be healed. This meant that the spirit qi professional could never contract a fey again in the future. In serious cases, it might even affect the contract of the other feys.","It wasn’t unheard of for spirit qi professionals to destroy the spiritual fragments with a particular fey and break the contract with it.","However, this was usually the case when a spirit qi professional was facing a desperate situation and knew that they couldn’t survive. Thus, they would destroy the spiritual fragment with the contracted fey, allowing it to revert to a wild fey. This would prevent the fey from losing its life due to the contract when he died.","However, how could Fei Qianqiong be willing to destroy the spiritual fragment between him and the Blood-Toothed Cricket obediently?","When the Mother of Bloodbath saw that Fei Qianqiong was not moving, it reached out toward the air and gently touched it. The moment it did that, its nails turned as red as sticky blood plasma.","While the Mother of Bloodbath reached out to touch, Fei Qianqiong’s miserable howl sounded in this room. It was unusually harsh, as if he had been subject to the cruelest punishment in the world. It only lasted for a moment, and Fei Qianqiong could no longer howl as his body continued to twist into a strange arc on the ground.","The Mother of Bloodbath walked up to Lin Yuan and said, “This old man still has a Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu that can be used. Just now, he refused to destroy the spiritual fragment obediently, so he must still be thinking of using the Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu for ill intentions.”","After saying that, the Mother of Bloodbath grabbed the fat red-gold Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu. Its red-gold body looked very smooth, covered with dark-red spots.","Every time the Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu used its larvae to parasitize the target’s body to control their lives, a dark-red spot would appear on its back. The red spots were packed together, almost in patches.","There were at least 1,000 of them. In other words, thousands of people’s lives were in the hands of Fei Qianqiong now.","If he wanted those controlled people to die, he would only need to give the Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu a command. The larvae lurking in the target’s body would penetrate through the target’s heart.","Lin Yuan looked at the rolling Fei Qianqiong, whose body was twisting into a strange shape on the ground, without feeling the slightest pity for him.","If the Mother of Bloodbath were not more powerful than Fei Qianqiong, it would’ve died thanks to the Blood-Toothed Cricket’s abilities.","The Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce had been targeting the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, and the latter had always been in a passive position.","Lin Yuan couldn’t help but be doubtful. The Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce was already a rising faction, so it would be more profitable just to do something than to target the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","Why did the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce continue to pursue the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, which had only an empty shell left?"]},{"number":404,"title":"Chapter 404: Lin Yuan’s Hot Potato","paragraphs":["If the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce did not have any feud with the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce to the bitter end, it would be a losing deal to spend so much effort to target its online resources.","Since the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce’s third highest-ranking person was now before them, this was clearly an excellent opportunity to know why.","Lin Yuan glanced at the Mother of Bloodbath that was standing beside him. The Mother of Bloodbath was playing with the Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu that was struggling violently in its hand, and its fingertips exerted force from time to time.","The Mother of Bloodbath watched the Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu with interest as it was slowly being on the brink of death.","Upon seeing Lin Yuan look at it, the Mother of Bloodbath said, “This old man is now experiencing the pain of the blade condensed by blood carving into every bone, and he no longer has the slightest possibility of being able to resist!”","Lin Yuan turned to Listen and said, “Why has the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce been targeting the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce? I guess you should have a lot of things to ask, right? You might as well ask about it.”","Listen’s expression froze, and then he looked at Lin Yuan with a grateful gaze. Lin Yuan didn’t say anything else. He just gently patted Listen’s shoulder and gave him an affirmative look.","When Listen glanced at Fei Qianqiong, his gaze became sharp, while his expression was becoming gloomier and gloomier.","But during this month or so, it was the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce’s relentless suppression and harsh attacks that had almost put the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce on the verge of collapse.","Without Lin Yuan’s support, the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce would no longer exist in this world when the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce controlled its online resources three days later.","After receiving Lin Yuan’s encouragement and tacit consent, Listen approached and looked at the struggling Fei Qianqiong at his feet with mixed feelings.","He had countless questions to ask Fei Qianqiong—why did the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce not let the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce off and forced it to a dead end? What kind of benefits had the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce given his uncles that they left Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce without even saying goodbye?","However, all these words were stuck in Listen’s throat when he wanted to ask.","It was now his first time to have a condescending look at someone from the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce as someone powerful, and this person was the third highest-ranking person.","Listen was not a fool. He knew that the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce must be scheming against the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce by treating it this way for this month or so.","No matter how Listen thought about it, he didn’t know what he possessed that made the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce covet them.","Listen watched Fei Qianqiong struggle for a long time with a cold expression, not uttering a word. When Listen showed a condescending look, Fei Qianqiong’s eyes betrayed his pleading emotions.","At that moment, Listen said coldly, “Fei Qianqiong, do you have anything to say about the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce?”","Fei Qianqiong was unable to make a sound due to the intense pain, but he nodded vigorously as if in a frenzy.","When he nodded madly, the Mother of Bloodbath’s eyes flashed with a blood-red luster.","At that moment, although Fei Qianqiong was still in pain and could not stand up, he was able to suppress the pain and speak barely.","“I don’t know why the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce is targeting you. I take orders from the two brothers, Bi Chenghu and Bi Chengxiong.”","As soon as Fei Qianqiong spoke, he heard a peculiar and pleasant voice speaking playfully. “Hehe! Take orders?","“So it seems that you’re just an underling who does what you’re told to do! In this case, you’re no longer useful. The feeling of the blood carved on each bone still seems too light. Why don’t—”","Before the Mother of Bloodbath could finish speaking, Fei Qianqiong’s last trace of mental defense collapsed.","“It’s Young Master Zheng. It’s Young Master Zheng of the Zheng family who’s behind all this.”","When Listen suddenly heard the name Young Master Zheng, he subconsciously asked, “Indigo Azure City’s Zheng family?”","Fei Qianqiong hurriedly nodded. Since he had divulged the matter, he also had no worries.","“Although I don’t know why Young Master Zheng wants to lay his hands on the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, this order was issued a month and a half ago.","“Don’t you know exactly why people in Indigo Azure City are targeting the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce?”","As he spoke, Fei Qianqiong only felt a little aggrieved.","Listen’s eyebrows furrowed.","Lin Yuan couldn’t help but raise his eyebrows.","Young Master Zheng? Zheng family?","Lin Yuan had also been caught up on the information about the large and small factions in the Radiance Federation at Wen Yu’s place during this period.","Although he had finished cramming up on the larger factions, there were simply too many small factions. Thus, he hadn’t had the time to start going through the information.","The information related to the small factions was simply too much. Lin Yuan intended to let Genius write down the information of those small factions. This was no different from him understanding the information.","Although Lin Yuan had only gone through the information of the larger factions, he was aware of the Zheng family.","The Zheng family was one of the three major families in Indigo Azure City that equally shared three parts of the city. It could be said that they were all equally excellent.","The Zheng family was a rich and powerful family and a veteran faction without a deep foundation.","In terms of martial force, all the veteran factions had emperor-class experts. Therefore, Lin Yuan had no advantage compared to the Zheng family in terms of top combat power.","Other than the two top experts, Endless Summer and the Mother of Bloodbath, Lin Yuan didn’t have other powerhouses.","He only had a king-class expert at the moment. And that was Hu Quan!","However, Hu Quan was only good at Spirit Craftsmanship, and his contracted feys were all meant to assist a Spirit Craftsman. If they were really to fight, Hu Quan would not be able to beat Liu Jie.","It could be said that Lin Yuan had weak king-class combat power or not even any.","In terms of resources, although the Zheng family, a family that could preside over a third of Indigo Azure City and was inferior to the Gao family, when Lin Yuan recalled that the Gao family could take out resources like the Island Whale and the Elemental Shellfish, the Zheng family’s foundation became evident from the comparison.","Lin Yuan didn’t expect this hot potato to land in his hands after taking over the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","However, Fei Qianqiong had said that the Zheng family’s Young Master Zheng was behind all this, rather than the Zheng family.","The Zheng family and the Gao family were different, as the Gao family’s only descendant was Gao Feng. It could be said that Gao Feng would be able to have an absolute say in the family after a few decades, but the Zheng family had many descendants.","In the Zheng family’s younger generation were nine fellows that could be called Young Master Zheng, of which there were only three direct descendants."]},{"number":405,"title":"Chapter 405: Fei Qianqiong’s Submission","paragraphs":["Any rich and powerful family valued one’s background very much. The direct descendants’ words could represent the family, while indirect descendants could only represent themselves.","“Fei Qianqiong, is the Young Master Zheng that you’re talking about the direct descendant of the Zheng family of Indigo Azure City?”","Lin Yuan’s clear voice sounded next to Fei Qianqiong’s ears. Fei Qianqiong did not dare to be the least bit slow, but he felt somewhat awkward due to Lin Yuan’s question.","“Only the two brothers, Bi Chenghu and Bi Chengxiong, have seen Young Master Zheng. I’ve not seen what he looks like, so whether he’s the Zheng family’s direct descendant, I...”","Fei Qianqiong knew that the youth who had asked him was the most significant person in this room. When the Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu was still under Fei Qianqiong’s control, crazy ideas had flashed in his head, but the Blood-Toothed Cricket was now struggling on the ground without being under his control at all.","The Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu was also on the brink of death in the hands of the Suzerain/Myth Breed humanoid fey.","Fei Qianqiong simply did not have the ability to go crazy even if he wanted to. It was an instantaneous decision when one was unafraid of death. However, when making this decision and after experiencing the line between life and death, almost everyone would change their mind and become afraid of death. Fei Qianqiong was no exception. What he wanted most now was to be able to live.","When Fei Qianqiong finished speaking, Lin Yuan pondered. When he looked up, he saw Listen’s eyes looking at him, clearly waiting for him to make a decision.","Lin Yuan knew what was in Listen’s mind. When facing a veteran faction, most people would not hesitate to leave behind an empty shelf with nothing like the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","Listen was now like a deer that had just found its way in despair. However, this deer was worried that the direction it was searching for would regard him as a burden and leave him behind.","Just as Listen felt that the air was getting thinner and felt vaguely stuffy in his lungs, he saw Lin Yuan throw over something. Listen hurriedly went to take it, which felt warm in his hands.","At a glance, he found that it was a piece of wooden token made of completely jade-textured wenge, carved with ‘Quan’ on it.","At that moment, Lin Yuan said, “In the future, I won’t send those objects mixed with completely jade-textured wood powder. Take this token and pick them up at the Spirit Craftsman Association at a certain time every day.”","Listen tightly clenched the token in his hands. This token and Lin Yuan’s words showed Lin Yuan’s attitude toward himself and the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","Fei Qianqiong suddenly held his breath. He could sense from the masked youth’s words that he had not given up on supporting the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce because of Young Master Zheng. This at least showed that he was unafraid of Young Master Zheng.","People with extremely high emotional intelligence like Listen were rarely emotional. However, after hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Listen needed a long time to calm down before whispering, “Okay.”","After a moment of deliberation, Listen said, “The only thing left in Indigo Azure City’s Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce is an old mansion that has been emptied and a shallow coastal sea that is extremely windy.","“Could the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce be coveting this shallow coastal sea?","“Although this sea is on the coast, it has a deep water level, and great dangers lurk underwater.”","Listen’s heart sank upon mentioning this shallow sea. It was this shallow sea that had taken the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s core members away, leaving behind only him.","Lin Yuan felt that Listen’s speculation was more reasonable. The Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce was now completely an empty shelf, and the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce was spending a great deal of effort for nothing by dominating it, let alone a behemoth like the Zheng family.","The only thing left that the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce could now call as resources was this shallow sea area. This shallow sea area might also be what the Zheng family coveted.","Lin Yuan couldn’t help but have a trace of interest.","“Before the dimensional rift is active, I’ll go with you to Indigo Azure City to explore this shallow sea.”","Although Red Thorn’s ability to breathe underwater had yet to fully mutate, it no longer had any problem surviving in the water.","Lin Yuan could not test how strong Red Thorn’s ability to breathe underwater was in the mansion’s man-made lake. Thanks to this opportunity to explore the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s shallow sea area, he could test the limit of Red Thorn’s ability to breathe underwater.","Listen didn’t want to face the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s coastal shallow sea in Indigo Azure City again.","However, since Lin Yuan had said he wanted to go explore, Listen hurriedly replied, “Young Master, you can call me to depart whenever you have time.”","Fei Qianqiong’s face was getting paler and paler. The more he heard the masked youth and Listen’s unrestrained conversation, the more he knew that these two were either talking about unimportant matters or the presence of an outsider like him didn’t matter. However, how could this matter be trivial since it involved the Zheng family?","This also meant that this masked youth was simply unafraid that he would hear the secrets, implying that he was actually equivalent to being a dead person in the eyes of others because only a dead man couldn’t talk.","Fei Qianqiong hurriedly crawled two steps forward and said with difficulty, “I’ve told you everything I know. Can you guys spare my life? I can swear by the Willpower Rune to submit to you.”","At that moment, Fei Qianqiong heard the Mother of Bloodbath’s peculiar and pleasant voice that was filled with insincerity.","“You’re even going to swear by the Willpower Rune. That Blood Poison Willpower Rune is good, but unfortunately, this Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu’s Willpower Rune is a dark type. Otherwise, I could taste it again.”","The Mother of Bloodbath’s words made Fei Qianqiong’s body tremble. He shouted, “I can swear by the Willpower Rune to become a servant. Also, I’ve killed no one from the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.”","As Fei Qianqiong said this, he couldn’t help but break out in a sweat.","He had never killed the people from the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, but he had abducted the son and grandsons of the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s butler, Qian De, and used the Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu to control Qian De’s son in exchange for the online resources. It could be said that he was the culprit who had made the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce lose its online resources.","Lin Yuan raised his eyebrows when he heard Fei Qianqiong. Taking in Fei Qianqiong was considered a good thing for Lin Yuan at present because he currently didn’t have any available king-class experts.","Even though Fei Qianqiong’s Blood-Toothed Cricket had dropped from a Fantasy Breed to a Diamond IV/Legend fey, it still had strong combat power. Moreover, Fei Qianqiong’s Diamond II/Fantasy II Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu was still around.","Nonetheless, Fei Qianqiong was still a member of the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce and was considered Listen’s enemy.","Since Lin Yuan had taken over the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, he didn’t respond to Fei Qianqiong’s submission.","Instead, he said to Listen, who was standing next to him, “The Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce doesn’t have any king-class experts now. Since Fei Qianqiong wants to submit, keep him if you want. Otherwise, just kill him.”","Lin Yuan uttered those words lightly, but he had taken Listen into consideration."]},{"number":406,"title":"Chapter 406: It’s Time to Perform Real Acting Skills!","paragraphs":["A person’s perception could be easily seen from how said person handled a matter.","Often, a person’s perception could determine the scale of his stall and how big he could manage. It was often said that ‘those with a wider perception must have the elegance of tolerance’.","If Listen had a wide perception, he would accept Fei Qianqiong.","Although Lin Yuan’s current attitude toward Listen would not change regardless of whether he let Fei Qianqiong live or die, the wider Listen’s perception was. Thus, the more Lin Yuan would be willing to put the resources to him for operation. He would even let Listen have comprehensive management of Sky City’s external resources.","When Fei Qianqiong heard Lin Yuan’s words, an abnormal fear crept up in his heart, and his body trembled. He had always felt that he was a king-class expert, after all.","As long as he was willing to swear allegiance with the Willpower Rune, it would not be a problem to exchange his strength for his life. However, this masked youth had casually thrown his life Listen.","The Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce had caused the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce to end up like this. If he were Listen, how would he give him a chance to live?","Listen didn’t expect that Lin Yuan would throw Fei Qianqiong’s life to him. He knew the ways of the world and could understand that Lin Yuan didn’t accept Fei Qianqiong’s allegiance because he was concerned about his feelings.","Otherwise, a king-class expert volunteering to become a servant was akin to offering all of himself.","Such a benefit was right in front of him, yet Lin Yuan didn’t accept it.","Listen had previously sworn by the Willpower Rune to rely on Lin Yuan mainly because of finding a way out for himself and the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce. But now, Listen had a deep sense of belonging to Lin Yuan.","Listen narrowed his eyes at Fei Qianqiong, but before Fei Qianqiong could fall in despair, Listen turned to Lin Yuan and answered firmly, “I’m willing to take Fei Qianqiong. He’s more valuable alive than dead!”","Lin Yuan was a bit amazed at how quickly Listen had chosen. This showed that Listen was not vindictive and that he treated Fei Qianqiong as a valuable piece of standard weight. Such a perception couldn’t be considered narrow.","Lin Yuan nodded and said, “This way, the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce will have a king-class expert stationed from today onward.”","Fei Qianqiong, who was on the ground and still in a state of despair, only felt that his emotions were changing too quickly, and his brain couldn’t take it.","Listen glanced at Fei Qianqiong and said word by word, “In the future, if you can contribute to the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, I won’t treat you poorly because of what you’ve done before.”","Listen’s words had made Fei Qianqiong, whose mind was in turmoil, immediately feel that he had become much closer to Listen.","After Fei Qianqiong used the Willpower Rune to swear allegiance as Listen’s servant, he officially became Listen’s servant and also the first real combat-class king-class expert in Lin Yuan’s faction.","Lin Yuan got up from the sofa and said, “You decide whether you’ll keep Fei Qianqiong at the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce or use him as a mole and let him return to the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce.”","After saying that, Lin Yuan took out a tentacle of the Ethereal Jellyfish and set up a spatial node in the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce. Then he left with the Mother of Bloodbath.","Listen thought about his future plans with his mind racing. He was now calculating that the 270 objects made of completely jade-textured wood powder that Lin Yuan would be giving him every day were equivalent to a capital injection of 2,700,000 Radiance dollars. So for three months, it would be a total of 243,000,000 Radiance dollars.","Fei Qianqiong stood respectfully beside Listen as a feeling of absurdity rose in his heart. I can’t believe that my life has changed in just an hour, and I even came back from the gates of hell.","Fei Qianqiong stood beside Listen but did not know what Listen was thinking currently—how to rely on this mole and a capital injection of 243,000,000 to devour the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce within three months?","...","“Big Brother, why isn’t Elder Fei back at this time? This old man actually let us wait for him here!”","The older middle-aged man, Bi Chenghu, had an ugly expression on his face and said while expecting better from him, “Will you starve to death if you eat dinner a little later? When will you mend this problem of implicating someone? When you have nothing to do, think about what you should say and what you should not.”","The full-bearded middle-aged man, Bi Chengxiong, subconsciously raised the wine glass in his hands and replied, “Big Brother, I was wrong. Cheers.”","Bi Chenghu’s face suddenly turned red, and he couldn’t help but rub his temples. He felt the fire in his heart surging up, making his head a little swollen.","At that moment, Bi Chengxiong saw Fei Qianqiong walk in and shouted at the top of his voice, “Elder Fei, why did you take so long to take care of such a small matter!?”","Fei Qianqiong could not stand Bi Chengxiong’s words.","What do you mean by such a small matter!?","F*ck! It was such a small matter that almost cost my life!","Bi Chengxiong stood up, fiercely glared at Bi Chengxiong, and went forward to say, “Elder Fei, thank you for your hard work. Try the Dragon Tiger Blood Tendon Wine I specially prepared.”","Bi Chenghu enthusiastically pulled Fei Qianqiong to take his seat, and Bi Chengxiong was eating a meal with a big fuss.","When Fei Qianqiong was eating, he seemed to be talking to Bi Chenghu as usual, but he had complicated feelings.","The last time he had been eating with them, he was still the third-highest ranking person in the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce. Surprisingly, he had now become the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s mole.","Fei Qianqiong had sworn with the Willpower Rune and become Listen’s servant, so he had no other choice. As long as he broke the oath, he would die.","At the same time, Fei Qianqiong had to let nobody in the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce see through his flaws.","His biggest flaw now was the Blood-Toothed Cricket’s demotion from a Fantasy Breed. Bi Chengxiong might not think much about it if he found out, but if Bi Chenghu, a sly old fox, found out, he would definitely be wary. Then it wouldn’t be easy to do certain things as a mole.","If he was exposed, not only would Bi Chenghu and Bi Chengxiong not let him off, but the Zheng family’s Young Master Zheng would also take action to put him to death.","Fei Qianqiong felt bitter at this moment. But likewise, he also knew that it was time to perform his real acting skills!","Fei Qianqiong recalled the task that Listen had given him, so he said to Bi Chenghu while drinking wine, “Chenghu, we’ve too many online and offline resources in the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce that don’t make much money. Why don’t we sell off some of them and instead tread on the path of luxury objects? That way, there’ll be profit!”"]},{"number":407,"title":"Chapter 407: Watch Me Screw You Up!","paragraphs":["Fei Qianqiong’s words made Bi Chenghu ponder, obviously contemplating the feasibility of Fei Qianqiong’s opinion. However, Bi Chenghu looked at Fei Qianqiong with a somewhat strange gaze.","When Bi Chengxiong, who was chucking meat into this mouth, heard Fei Qianqiong’s words, he couldn’t help but exclaim, “Elder Fei, when have you started to care about the chamber of commerce’s operation?","“In the past, when I let you manage the chamber of commerce’s operation, didn’t you say that you only love to do things that don’t require your brain, such as killing?”","Fei Qianqiong felt somewhat bitter. Bi Chengxiong wasn’t very smart, so he could just find a random reason to justify himself, but Bi Chenghu was not so easily fooled.","Fei Qianqiong couldn’t be bothered to manage the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce’s affairs because Bi Chenghu’s desire to control was too strong.","Another reason was that Fei Qianqiong preferred to improve his strength if he had time and not put his energy into the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce’s operation.","Fei Qianqiong knew that it was indeed a little abrupt for him to rashly raise the issue of the chamber of commerce’s development now, but the task that Listen had given him was his first step as a mole.","Therefore, he had to say what he should. He couldn’t be bothered with Bi Chengxiong’s attitude.","When Fei Qianqiong glanced at Bi Chenghu, he found that Bi Chenghu looked at him with some scrutiny.","Fei Qianqiong took a deep breath and brought himself a glass of wine. His emotions were brewing as he held the wine glass. After downing the wine in one gulp, Fei Qianqiong turned and looked at Bi Chenghu seriously.","Even if Bi Chenghu had deep thoughts, he was also caught off guard by Fei Qianqiong’s next move.","Bi Chenghu never thought that Fei Qianqiong’s eyes would turn red. Fei Qianqiong was not an actor, but he showed true feelings because he was thinking over and over again about his Blood-Toothed Cricket’s stripped Willpower Rune.","The more he thought about it, the more he felt aggrieved. In less than five minutes, a few drops of tears streamed down from his eyes. The more he thought about the Blood-Toothed Cricket, the sadder he felt.","Fei Qianqiong used this instance of sadness and said, “Chenghu! I’ve been following you for years.","“Although I’m a dozen years older than you, I’ve always treated you as a brother!","“These years in the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce are the happiest years of my life.","“Now, the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce has been promoted to a rising faction. Chengxiong usually doesn’t help you much, and you have to take care of everything by yourself.","“Now I’m thinking that I can try to help you handle some of the work that does not require racking brains.”","Although Bi Chenghu was caught off guard when he saw Fei Qianqiong’s red eyes, he calmed down immediately after that.","Bi Chenghu was very wary and had never treated Fei Qianqiong as one of his own people. He had also never let Fei Qianqiong interfere with the operations of the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce’s core aspects.","When Fei Qianqiong had hinted many times before that he wanted to go to meet Young Master Zheng together, Bi Chenghu had refused him with the excuse that Young Master Zheng didn’t like to meet outsiders.","It was because Bi Chenghu wanted to completely have control over Fei Qianqiong and regard him as a sharp weapon of the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce.","Otherwise, if Fei Qianqiong defected to Young Master Zheng behind his back and went to develop in the Zheng family, the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce would have one less sharp weapon.","Bi Chenghu could see that Fei Qianqiong’s tears were not fake. Otherwise, his eyes would have dried up after a few tears, and it definitely wouldn’t remain like this.","Bi Chenghu was a little surprised that Fei Qianqiong was so considerate of himself. When he looked at his younger brother, Bi Chengxiong, who was eating and drinking, Bi Chenghu felt that the more he looked at this old man, the more he was pleasant to the eye.","However, Bi Chenghu felt somewhat strange to suddenly have a brother who had a white beard and hair.","Bi Chenghu felt that Fei Qianqiong’s suggestion made some sense. Although the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce had become a rising faction, it had not yet opened a private faction territory on Star Web, nor did it have a clear direction for private faction operations.","At present, the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce still had a large amount of cumbersome online and offline resources like the basic spiritual materials and ordinary feys.","The ordinary spiritual materials were fine. Even though a lot of manpower was required, they could also bring a certain amount of stable income to the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce every day.","However, the offline and online resources of ordinary feys were different. Not only did they require manpower to take care of them, but they also needed to be fed regularly daily. At the same time, there was the risk of ordinary feys dying.","There were no valuable spiritual materials on the dead ordinary feys, so they could only be fed to other feys as meat.","Such online and offline resources were already dispensable for the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce.","Even if these ordinary feys could screen out a lot of mutated feys in the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce each year, they could only resell these mutated feys.","There were benefits for the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce to have connections with the Zheng family, but the Zheng family strictly controlled the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce’s Creation Masters. Thus, the entire Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce did not have any Creation Masters.","As a result, the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce could only depend on the Zheng family. At the same time, it was useless for the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce to have these mutated feys.","Bi Chenghu saw Fei Qianqiong pouring wine for himself and thought about giving Fei Qianqiong a chance.","Thus, he said, “Elder Fei, don’t touch the ordinary spiritual materials first. I’ll hand over the ordinary spirit beasts to you.”","Fei Qianqiong hurriedly toasted Bi Chenghu and replied, “Chenghu, see if those high-end luxury objects—”","Bi Chenghu refused him without even thinking and said, “I’ll think of a way.”","Bi Chenghu’s heart, which had been somewhat moved before, instantly became firm. His gaze at Fei Qianqiong immediately became wary.","The Zheng family’s main business direction was high-end luxury objects.","Bi Chenghu couldn’t help but think, Fei Qianqiong isn’t trying to let me give him the chance to get close to Young Master Zheng, right?","Bi Chenghu had already made up his mind that Fei Qianqiong could help take over some Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce matters in the future. However, he had to keep a close eye on Fei Qianqiong and not give him any chance to have any connections with Young Master Zheng.","Fei Qianqiong secretly exhaled and thought, The task that Listen assigned to me can be considered complete.","As Fei Qianqiong saw Bi Chenghu’s gaze at him turn from scrutinizing him to becoming close and then wary, he felt unusually excited.","Somehow, Fei Qianqiong suddenly felt that as compared to enhancing his strength and using the Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu to control a human’s heart, acting seemed more exciting!","At the same time, he couldn’t help but scold Bi Chenghu in his heart!","My neck is wet from the tears, and I even cried so sincerely. I didn’t cry this badly even when my wife died!","You’re even wary of me. Watch me screw you up!"]},{"number":408,"title":"Chapter 408: The Admin Has Actually Become Active Again!","paragraphs":["In the study on the second floor of the Return from Faraway mansion, a huge wooden shelf was placed on each of the two walls. A pile of information about each faction was placed in each of the small compartments on the shelf.","Wen Yu had only organized a small part of the information about the veteran factions during this period, and this small part of the information filled half of the shelf.","Obviously, if the information on these large and small factions were completely organized, these two sides of the shelf would not be enough in any case.","“Young Master, one of the three direct descendants of the Zheng family is a Radiance Hundred Sequence member and has been busy with the S Tournament for over a month.","“This direct descendant of the Zheng family has established a guild club of his own and is seeking to qualify as a B-level guild club this year. According to the tight schedule of the S Tournament, he shouldn’t have the time to arrange for the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce to deal with the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","“One of the other two descendants was born with a serious illness that caused both legs to be severely atrophied and is unable to walk. Thus, he has been recuperating in Indigo Azure City.","“The third direct descendant is a Creation Master that the Zheng family had poured in a lot of resources to nurture. I’m sure the Zheng family wouldn’t let a Creation Master who is being nurtured waste time on something as trivial as the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.”","Lin Yuan didn’t expect that he had only come to ask Wen Yu’s opinion about the Zheng family’s situation, but she had actually grasped such detailed information about the Zheng family without leaving anything out.","Lin Yuan had some doubts whether Genius was living in her head.","At that moment, Wen Yu suddenly thought of something and said, “The Zheng family’s third lineage bought Indigo Azure City’s offshore coastal resources five years ago.","“They’ve occupied more and more of the offshore coast over the years but have not begun to work on the development of these offshore coastal resources.","“If the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce has an offshore coastal resource in Indigo Azure City, it should have blocked the way of the Zheng family’s third lineage.”","Lin Yuan couldn’t help but ask, “What’s the difference between the Zheng family and its third lineage?”","Wen Yu explained, “The Zheng family is thriving, and the main family is the direct descendants. There are four lineages under the main family, each of which is a collateral branch of the main family.","“The main family will selectively inject resources into the four lineages based on their development. In a sense, the main family is considered the real Zheng family.","“In terms of identity, although the main family’s direct descendants and the four lineages’ descendants born from mistresses are all the young masters and young ladies of the Zheng family, the direct descendants have absolute dominance over the four lineages’ descendants.”","After Lin Yuan nodded thoughtfully, he then said, “Since the main family of the Zheng family will selectively pour resources into the four lineages, then the relationship between these four lineages shouldn’t be very good!”","Wen Yu said with a smile, “The Zheng family’s four lineages don’t have any open rivalry, but there is a constant fight in the dark.","“Since the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s matter is related to the third lineage of the Zheng family, then this matter shouldn’t involve the first lineage, second lineage, and the fourth lineage.”","Lin Yuan chatted with Wen Yu for a while more before returning to his room. He had asked her about the Zheng family to have an accurate understanding of his possible enemies in the future.","Lin Yuan did not have a clear conflict with the Zheng family yet, but if the Zheng family made a move on him, then he would have to take appropriate measures.","Lin Yuan thought for a while and looked for Endless Summer and asked it to stay at the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce in secret for a period.","He had poured resources into the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, and it was a bone that the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce couldn’t gnaw. In that case, the Zheng family’s third lineage could not achieve its goal.","A rabbit bit when it was anxious, let alone a rabid lion.","After the arrangement, Lin Yuan logged on Star Web to harvest the proceeds from the previous blind trade of Flower Brocade Pearls.","Lin Yuan found that he had gotten more mid-grade strange flames from the blind trade than the first time. This time, his ten Flower Brocade Pearls were exchanged for a total of 127 mid-grade strange flames through the blind trade, which was 27 more than the last time he had gotten 100.","In Lin Yuan’s amber-button-shaped Diamond fey storage box, in addition to the 30 Flower Brocade Pearls that he had exchanged for the blind trade, he still had 170 of them in stock.","The next batch of Flower Brocade Pearls would also mature again in the Spirit Lock spatial zone after over ten days.","Lin Yuan hadn’t chosen to use the Flower Brocade Pearls in his hands to exchange for resources with other factions because he didn’t have any urgent material needs at the moment.","On the other hand, he wanted to gain a reputation for his Purchase With No Loss store over time and let people think of his store when thinking about the Flower Brocade Pearls.","He checked his Star Web store’s fan club and found that through the accumulation of blind trade three times, the number of Creation Masters in the fan club had now reached almost half of all members, and the lowest among these Creation Masters was also a Class 3 Creation Master.","Lin Yuan had never spoken in his own fan club before, but he took the initiative to send a message in his fan club this time.","Deep Mountain Elder Lin: “Group welfare. 30 Flower Brocade Pearls for sale to the highest bidder. Only for members.”","When Lin Yuan sent this message, the already active Purchase With No Loss store’s fan club exploded into a frenzy.","Stream in the Cloud: “F*ck! The admin has actually become active again!”","Violent-Tempered Woman: “Congratulations to the group admin for his first words after creating the group! You’ve unlocked the achievement of ‘I’m not dumb’!”","Fan Zhi: “30 Flower Brocade Pearls? What great welfare!”","Jealous Me: “So many Flower Brocade Pearls are enough for me to use for years. Brothers, you guys should take it easy on the bidding and give me a chance.”","Time to Take Medicine: “It’s so damn thrilling to be called ‘Brother’ by a Class 4 Creation Master.”","Noble Evening Painting: “Admin, how are the spiritual materials exchanged? If it’s the market price, it would be too much of a loss to exchange the rare spiritual materials.”","When Lin Yuan saw Noble Evening Painting’s message, he thought for a moment and replied, “I’ll exchange the rare spiritual materials at a premium of 2% of the Rare Lifeform Pavilion’s transaction price. If the Rare Lifeform Pavilion doesn’t have a transaction price on it, then I don’t think you’ll be able to take it out in exchange for these Flower Brocade Pearls.”","After reading Lin Yuan’s answer...","Noble Evening Painting: “2%? Admin, you’re impressive!”","Rare spiritual materials were not cheap. Although 2% seemed relatively little, if one took out rare spiritual materials worth 10,000,000 Radiance dollars for trade, one could at least save 100,000 Radiance dollars.","Anyway, these rare spiritual materials were auctioned in the Rare Lifeform Pavilion, so one could always collect them back after about a year.","100,000 Radiance dollars was not a small amount of money.","Lin Yuan found that Listen was now in the group, so he mentioned him."]},{"number":409,"title":"Chapter 409: Become Food for the Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger!","paragraphs":["Deep Mountain Elder Lin: “@Listen, help me take note of the group members’ bids and let me know the highest one.”","After saying that, Lin Yuan then lurked again.","The reason Lin Yuan would mention Listen was very simple. He usually didn’t have the time to take care of the Purchase With No Loss store’s fan club. Listen was very active in the fan club and had good interpersonal relationships.","Furthermore, Listen was one of his own people, so Lin Yuan intended to establish Listen’s prestige and status in the fan club through this. In the future, he would let Listen help maintain the Purchase With No Loss store’s fan club.","It was still very harmonious in the fan club now, but as the number of people slowly increased, it was inevitable that some discordance would arise. As such, someone needed to regulate or manage.","Given Listen’s talent, he was obviously very suitable to take up this job. In fact, Lin Yuan was also giving him a chance to use his connections within the Purchase With No Loss store as much as possible so that the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, which had thousands of things to do, could rise a little.","After Lin Yuan left the fan club, he put another ten Flower Brocade Pearls in his Star Web store for display. At the same time, he set to exchange them directly through a blind trade after a day.","His previous welfare of 30 Flower Brocade Pearls in the fan club was just the first bait he threw that could attract more attention and let more factions and high-class Creation Masters that needed many Flower Brocade Pearls to want to join his fan club urgently.","Lin Yuan knew that there were only two ways to enter his Star Web store’s fan club—buy these ten Flower Brocade Pearls through the blind trade to get the qualification to enter or grab those Usneas in his Purchase With No Loss store that were sold in limited quantities.","But now, he had stopped the sales of those Silver Usneas in his Star Web store, so the only way to get into the fan club of his Star Web store was by grabbing the ten Flower Brocade Pearls through the blind trade.","The news on Star Web spread very quickly, and the news in his store’s fan club was now probably buzzing.","Lin Yuan set aside a day, which was enough for those factions and Creation Masters who wanted to obtain many Flower Brocade Pearls to prepare.","He intended to see how many unexpected gains he could obtain through the blind trade of the ten Flower Brocade Pearls this time.","He thought that after the end of this blind trade, the mid-grade strange flames that Chimey needed to advance from Fantasy II to Fantasy III should be sufficient.","The purpose of throwing bricks was to draw jade[1]. Moreover, what he threw out was solid gold brick.","Lin Yuan believed that the gain from this brick he had thrown would not be small, and if the gain was too little, Listen would probably become the buyer of this brick.","After that, Lin Yuan clicked on the trade message that he had issued in his Star Web store and checked on the messages he had received inside.","He realized that he had received quite a few messages. However, most of these messages were inquiring about what kind of resources they could invest in and what kind of future could be given.","Some people even called him stupid, saying that he had issued this trade message purely for pretense, which rendered Lin Yuan speechless.","At the same time, based on the feedback, he knew that people despised the foundation of his Purchase With No Loss store. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have said such things.","However, Lin Yuan didn’t feel sad. On the contrary, as these 30 Flower Brocade Pearls were being auctioned as welfare, he believed that more king-class experts would rush to join his private faction in the future.","After sifting through the messages, he found that only three king-class experts had sent their personal information among so many messages, and only one of them met Lin Yuan’s requirement.","Of the remaining two, one of them had only comprehended two Willpower Runes and had a weak main fey.","Even if such a king-class expert obtained Lin Yuan’s high-quality Bronze feys, he would still be weak among the many king-class experts after enhancing it.","This was because a king-class expert would need at least two stronger main feys for cooperation in a battle in order to be able to reveal enough strength. Therefore, Lin Yuan had screened out this king-class expert.","The other king-class expert had two extremely powerful power offense-type main feys. In terms of strength, it was not much different from Fei Qianqiong when he was in full strength.","However, the other king-class expert made his own request in his message, stating that he needed a Bronze/Epic lizard fey.","Lin Yuan could easily fulfill such a request. Hence, he sent a message to these two king-class experts at the same time and arranged to meet them in his Star Web store at ten o’clock tomorrow morning.","After sending the messages, Lin Yuan went to the Rare Lifeform Pavilion, wanting to pick up a lizard fey that was superior in all aspects.","Regarding the request from the king-class expert, who had two powerful main feys and comparable strength to Fei Qianqiong, Lin Yuan needed to prepare in advance before the appointment with him. This would show Lin Yuan’s sincerity and also give this king-class expert a guarantee.","After searching in the Rare Lifeform Pavilion, he found a lizard fey with a trace of dragon-species fey bloodline awakened in its body when it was at Elite and bought it, ready to enhance it before tomorrow’s meeting.","...","“Young Master, Old Master has just sent word that the coastal resources that our third lineage developed have received the main family’s Second Young Master’s support.”","A hunched old man, almost bending over at a right angle and leaning on his walking stick, lowered his voice and said to a youth with sinister eyebrows beside him.","The youth immediately revealed an ecstatic expression on his face when he heard that.","“It took our third lineage three years to finally obtain the main family’s Second Young Master’s support!","“This is a good opportunity for us to be able to surpass the second lineage, fourth lineage, and the first lineage. There must not be the slightest mistake!”","The youth with sinister eyebrows turned ruthless in a flash.","“Since Father’s side is ready, then I don’t have the time for the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce and the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","“Elder Niu, go tonight and let the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s owner become the Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger’s food!”","[1] A sprat to catch a mackerel."]},{"number":410,"title":"Chapter 410: Heavenly-Maiden-Grade Pearl","paragraphs":["After the hunched old man heard the words of the youth with sinister eyebrows, he immediately replied, “Young Master, I’ll get it done immediately.”","Elder Niu thought for a while and tapped the ground a few times with his walking stick before turning to say, “Young Master, I heard that the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s owner is extraordinarily talented.","“I wonder if you would like to take Listen under your command, Young Master. If you’re willing to reveal your identity to Listen, as long as he is not stupid and knows about the current situation, he certainly won’t refuse your recruitment.”","The youth with sinister eyebrows was admiring the boundless night outside the window at this moment.","Upon hearing Elder Niu’s words, he didn’t even turn his head. He raised his hand and replied, “This matter involves the plans of our third lineage. Even if Listen has extraordinary talents, it’s not worthwhile for me to reveal my identity.","“Moreover, he’s nothing more than a powerless person with an empty frame and is stubbornly resisting.”","Elder Niu stopped talking after hearing the youth’s words and exited the room. He summoned a black shadow with a wave of his hand and then disappeared into the night together with it.","The youth with sinister eyebrows had joy in his eyes, clearly in a good mood. He mumbled, “I wonder what price Father paid to get the support of the main family’s Second Young Master. With a connection to Second Young Master, the offshore coastal resources that our third lineage developed can finally be called proper!”","...","The night was coming to an end in Ascending Dragon City. At the entrance of Ascending Dragon City’s Creation Master Association, a woman wearing a Class 4 Creation Master’s retainer crest said rudely, “My teacher said that if you want to evolve your Iron Bone Iguana’s bloodline, you can’t succeed just by relying on those spiritual materials you brought to induce its dragon-species bloodline. At the very least, you’ll need a Gold Dragon’s Mouth Orchid flower.”","There was an evident trace of disappointment on the face of the man standing opposite to the woman.","But immediately afterward, his expression returned to normal, and he answered, “Thank you, Master Duan Li, for being willing to help nurture my Iron Bone Iguana. When I can find a Gold Dragon’s Mouth Orchid flower, I’ll come back to ask you to help enhance my fey.”","The woman with the Class 4 Creation Master’s retainer crest then said, “My teacher took your payment before and didn’t enhance your Iron Bone Iguana’s bloodline due to your lack of preparation of spiritual materials.","“So the next time you come to find him, you only need to prepare half of the payment as last time.”","A bitter smile appeared on the man’s face, and he thought, Although I have outstanding talents and an affinity toward lizard feys, I only have one main fey, a defense-type lizard fey, the Iron Bone Iguana.","I’ve already spent three years of savings to ask Master Duan Li to help me enhance my fey.","Even if I have to pay half of the last payment for Master Duan Li’s help, I will have to save up for at least a year and a half.","A defense-type spirit qi professional is a shield standing in front of the team. But given my Iron Bone Iguana’s strength, I simply can’t assume the duty of that.","Despite the bitter smile in his heart, he replied very respectfully, “Thank you for your generosity. Express my gratitude to Master Duan Li on my behalf.”","After saying that, the man was prepared to leave the Ascending Dragon City’s Creation Master Association.","The woman with the Class 4 Creation Master’s retainer crest thought for a moment and said, “It’s not only a matter of the bloodline for this Iron Bone Iguana of yours.","“Even if this Iron Bone Iguana’s dragon-species bloodline is stimulated with the Gold Dragon’s Mouth Orchid flower, it still wouldn’t be powerful.","“I heard from my teacher that the flesh bump on the side of this Iron Bone Iguana’s head belongs to a kind of mutation.”","The man hurriedly turned around and said nervously, “Didn’t Master Duan Li say before that this flesh bump won’t affect its health?","“And it’s been over ten years. This flesh bump has never changed much.”","Upon hearing that, the woman wearing the retainer crest didn’t care much about the urgency and impudence in the man’s words. She answered, “That’s why my teacher said it’s a mutation.”","The man also realized that he had been a little too agitated, but just as he wanted to apologize, the woman with the retainer crest said, “The flesh bump on the neck of your Iron Bone Iguana is a prototype of a nascent head.","“My teacher has tested this flesh bump and found that the attributes in it differ from the ones in the body. They’re fire attributes.","“If this flesh bump develops into a head, it can turn the Iron Bone Iguana from an earth-type into an earth-fire-type fey.","“You’re lucky. After the head grows out, the Iron Bone Iguana will turn into a powerful defense-type fey.”","After hearing this, the man revealed an ecstatic look on his face. However, he had some doubts as to why Master Duan Li hadn’t shared this piece of information about the flesh bump just now inside.","Before the man could be happy for a while, the woman with the retainer crest added, “However, if you want to develop this Iron Bone Iguana’s sarcoma into a head, you’ll need the elemental pearls produced by the fire-type Scorching Elemental Shellfish mutated from the Elemental Shellfish.”","The man’s heart sank after hearing that. He might be able to save the money with a few years of frugal efforts to get the Gold Dragon’s Mouth Orchid.","However, were the elemental pearls produced by the Elemental Shellfish something that he, an A-rank spirit qi professional with a Fantasy Breed fey that could barely be called a king-class expert and couldn’t even beat many non-king-class experts, could have delusions about?","The woman with the Class 4 Creation Master’s retainer crest said seriously, “The elemental pearls produced by the Scorching Elemental Shellfish are divided into many grades according to the purity of the elemental energy contained in them.","“My teacher said that the elemental pearls that are useful to this Iron Bone Iguana of yours must be of the highest grade—the heavenly maiden grade.","“The purity of the elemental energy in the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls is 99% to 100%. My teacher couldn’t even get such elemental pearls.","“Moreover, you’ll need five heavenly-maiden-grade pearls containing the fire-element energy produced by the Scorching Elemental Shellfish for your Iron Bone Iguana to grow a second head.”","The man’s hope was squashed. He couldn’t afford to even ask Master Duan Li to enhance his fey once, let alone the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls that even Master Duan Li couldn’t get.","The woman wearing the Class 4 Creation Master’s retainer crest looked at the man’s expression and added, “My teacher didn’t intend to say this to you, but I told you because, without the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls for its metamorphosis, this Iron Bone Iguana’s growth has already reached the limit now.”"]},{"number":411,"title":"Chapter 411: Do It Well","paragraphs":["The woman wearing the Class 4 Creation Master’s retainer crest didn’t care about the bitterness on the man’s face. She just continued to say what she felt should be said.","“It’ll only be a waste of spiritual materials to continue nurturing this Iron Bone Iguana, and this would be a waste of your potential. You might as well pour the resources from nurturing this Iron Bone Iguana into your other feys.”","The man’s expression became even more bitter. He only had one main fey, the Iron Bone Iguana.","Although he had comprehended three Willpower Runes, with one of them fused with the Iron Bone Iguana to allow it to become a Fantasy Breed, the other two Willpower Runes were flying around the spiritual energy in his spiritual spatial zone.","Even if he nurtured the other feys instead of the Iron Bone Iguana, he could only contract a Bronze/Flawless fey at most since the resources he could get were limited.","How many years would he need to accumulate the resources needed to raise the Bronze/Flawless fey to Legend?","The man thanked the woman wearing the Class 4 Creation Master’s retainer crest seriously and walked firmly in the night.","This world had always been a one where it was hard for successful people to come from poor families.","The children of rich families had an advantage over the children of poor families right from the first fey they contracted at a young age. It was just like a gap in the sky.","Even if the children of poor families were fortunate enough to become king-class experts, they would have to pay an unknown amount of blood and tears as compared to those born in rich families. A king-class expert born from a poor family would always be at the bottom.","Zhou Luo had long seen through this word. Despite being desperate earlier, he was very calm now.","The children of poor families always needed to face troubles and despair on the road of growing up and step over all the hurdles one by one.","Despite enjoying life through sorrow and adversity, he actually wanted to change his fate. Zhou Luo felt he was a hero along his journey.","In his opinion, there was only one kind of heroism in the world—recognizing the truth about life and still loving it.","Zhou Luo had planned to go to the Guild Alliance to see if there were any suitable missions for him. Suddenly, he recalled the application he had submitted when he saw the trade message of the small store he followed on Star Web before.","...","Listen was in his room, thinking about how to help the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce develop with the 270 pieces of objects mixed with completely jade-textured wood powder every day while recording the bids of the members for the 30 Flower Brocade Pearls in the Purchase With No Loss store.","Although Listen had known that most of these people were bigshots, their offers still alarmed him.","He couldn’t help but sigh, These bigshots are really too rich!","At the same time, he could sense that after Lin Yuan mentioned him to manage his fan club’s welfare auction, these bigshots’ attitude toward him had changed.","Listen knew his strengths and wanted to get along with the others in the group. Thus, he was very popular in the group, but that was just a relationship where they could help each other with postings.","Listen could clearly feel that some bigshots in the group were trying to rope him in. They wanted to exchange for more Flower Brocade Pearls from Lin Yuan through him.","Since Lin Yuan hadn’t been replying to the Star Web messages, many people wanted to get a chance to contact Lin Yuan through Listen.","Due to their solicitation and goodwill, Listen didn’t refuse them. Instead, he was happy to accept.","Lin Yuan had taken out the resources for bidding, and Listen naturally had to help him maximize the benefits of these resources with all his might.","However, Listen also had to make good use of these derived benefits to subtly help the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s development.","Otherwise, if he wasted this network resource, Listen would feel that he would disappoint Lin Yuan for thinking highly of him.","At that moment, he heard three knocks on the door, and he rhythmically knocked on the table with his fingers three times.","Fei Qianqiong pushed open the door and came to Listen’s side before saying to him respectfully, “President, I didn’t fumble the ball. Bi Chenghu has already handed over all the online and offline fey resources of the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce to me.","“Please let me know what I should do after that.”","Upon hearing that, Listen asked doubtfully, “How can the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce give up the spirit beast resources that can select high-quality mutated feys?”","Fei Qianqiong replied bluntly, “President, the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce has now become a rising faction, but it doesn’t even have a single Creation Master.","“Bi Chenghu was even forced to transfer their Class 1 and Class 2 Creation Masters to the Zheng family. He loathes the spirit beast resources, which don’t have the support of Creation Masters, but he hasn’t made up his mind to dispose of them.”","Fei Qianqiong couldn’t help but praise his excellent acting skills before Bi Chenghu and Bi Chengxiong.","After Listen pondered for a while, he replied, “Since the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce wants to let go of the spirit beast resources in its hands, we’ll secretly take them.”","Fei Qianqiong remembered Bi Chenghu’s expression when he had talked about the spirit beasts and spiritual materials. He said, “After the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce’s online and offline spirit beast resources are sold, Bi Chenghu will shift the direction of the business to high-end luxury resources through the Zheng family. I reckon it won’t be long before the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce’s spiritual materials are sold.”","As Fei Qianqiong spoke, he admired the red-phoenix-eyed youth with a mole at the corner of his eye sitting in front of the table.","Based on what Listen had taught him, he had chatted with Bi Chenghu for an hour before Bi Chenghu firmly decided to shift the development of the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce to high-end luxury resources.","Otherwise, based on just his acting skills and without what Listen had taught him, even if he could fool Bi Chenghu, he would never have been able to influence his ambition and thoughts.","Listen gently tapped his fingers on the table as he was rapidly calculating in his mind.","“The investment required for high-end luxury resources is not a small amount.","“If Bi Chenghu is bent on developing into that direction, then he’ll inevitably collect supplies and constantly throw out the other resources in his hands, bit by bit.","“So you must do a good job when throwing out the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce’s online and offline spirit beast resources for Bi Chenghu.","“Only when you let Bi Chenghu taste success will he be assured to let you do such things in the future.”"]},{"number":412,"title":"Chapter 412: Head-On Attack","paragraphs":["Fei Qianqiong felt goosebumps, feeling somewhat creeped out.","How big a game of chess was Listen playing? Was he going to devour all of the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce?","Previously, Fei Qianqiong had listened to the conversation between Listen and Lin Yuan and vaguely learned that the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce would also be heading in the direction of high-end luxury resources in the future. They would definitely clash with the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce.","Lin Yuan would deliver hundreds of luxury items to the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce every day. Even if the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce was willing to sacrifice everything it had, how long could it resist?","Fei Qianqiong felt that he was much stronger than Listen in terms of strength, but no matter how powerful his battle prowess was, he could only maintain his morals at most when facing the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce.","However, Listen’s strategy could turn the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce’s advantageous position into nothing.","At that moment, Listen asked, “How’s the Zheng family’s attitude toward the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce?”","Fei Qianqiong was carefully thinking about Listen’s question when he heard an unusually old voice inside the room.","“The Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce is just a dog of the Zheng family. What do you think its attitude is?”","Listen’s eyes instantly widened, and they stared at the shadow that suddenly appeared in the room. It slowly condensed into a strange, fierce black tiger.","It wasn’t big and was only two meters long, but it had three pupils that were like black holes. Its entire body was covered with body armor, which belonged to an insect-species fey.","The most surprising thing was that it had a thick scorpion tail high up that was even longer than its body.","The stinger on its scorpion tail was wrapped in black mist, which was not distinct. Only a sharp cold flash could be faintly seen from the black mist.","On the back of the strange, fierce tiger stood an old man, who was hunched almost at a right angle. The hand that was holding onto the walking stick seemed to be trembling, but he stood on the fierce tiger’s back firmly.","Upon sensing this old man’s rising aura and then comparing it to Fei Qianqiong’s during the day, Listen could feel that this hunchbacked old man’s aura was clearly stronger than Fei Qianqiong’s.","Listen quickly calmed down and said, “Your Excellency knows the Zheng family so well, so I guess you should be from the Zheng family. But I wonder what the people from the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce will feel when they find out that the Zheng family treats them like dogs.”","As Listen spoke, Fei Qianqiong felt he was speechless. Fei Qianqiong, who wasn’t superstitious, couldn’t help but want to find someone to do divination for him and see whether he was the reincarnation of the God of Bad Luck. Why had he encountered so many unlucky things in a day?","The strange, fierce tiger’s black shadow circle was clearly the prototype of a domain. Although it hadn’t formed the domain yet, it was infinitely close. This meant that this hunchbacked old man was a true king-class expert.","Even Fei Qianqiong, at full strength, couldn’t handle a few moves from a pinnacle king-class expert, let alone the fact that his main fey, the Blood-Toothed Cricket’s Willpower Rune, had been stripped away, and it was no longer a Fantasy Breed.","The hunchbacked old man looked at Listen, and a trace of regret flashed in his eyes. Then he glanced at Fei Qianqiong and said, “What the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce’s dogs think has nothing to do with me. If they’re disobedient, they’ll obey with more training.","“Our Zheng family trains them well, unlike the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce that trained their own dogs to betray them.","“You have to take note that such turncoats cannot be tamed.”","The hunchbacked old man, also known as Elder Niu by Young Master Zheng’s side, was puzzled.","The Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce was just an empty shelf. How blind was Fei Qianqiong to betray the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce to help Listen instead?","Was it because of the news he had released that the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce had found the support of a major faction?","If that was true, would the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce still be suppressed so badly by the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce?","Was Fei Qianqiong stupid? Did he believe such rumors?","If he told Fei Qianqiong he could quickly comprehend a Willpower Rune by burying himself in the soil, would he really do so and suffocate?","When Fei Qianqiong heard this hunchbacked old man’s words, he suddenly felt some sadness. If he hadn’t chosen to live between life and death previously, he wouldn’t have used the Willpower Rune to swear to become Listen’s servant and betray the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce.","He had been working for the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce for so many years, and both his merits and hard work were definitely above Bi Chengxiong’s.","However, Bi Chengxiong had to suspect everything, and Fei Qianqiong had to endure his inflexibility.","In the eyes of the Zheng family, he was just a dog from the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce. This explained the attitudes of Bi Chenghu and Bi Chengxiong toward him when facing the Zheng family.","At that moment, Listen said, “Since the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce and the Zheng family love dogs so much, I guess your surname is not Zheng, right?”","Listen’s words immediately made Elder Niu’s expression change. The regret in his eyes was replaced by gloominess.","Listen added, “I, Listen, and the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce never raise dogs. Since Fei Qianqiong has joined the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, he is one of our own from now on.”","Fei Qianqiong glanced deeply at Listen and took a step forward before summoning his two feys.","After summoning the Diamond II/Fantasy II Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu and the Diamond IV/Legend Blood-Toothed Cricket, he assumed a defensive stance in front of Listen.","Elder Niu tapped his walking stick on the Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger’s back. It could sense the anger in its owner’s heart, so it let out a violent yet silent roar.","Then a strange dark energy ripple swept Fei Qianqiong and Listen.","Fei Qianqiong immediately shouted, “Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu, use Gu Poison Whipping Touch! Blood-Toothed Cricket, use Sound of Cricket!”","As Fei Qianqiong shouted, the Diamond II/Fantasy II Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu shot whip-like light from its antenna that collided with the dark energy ripple and dispersed a part of it.","However, this dark energy ripple regained its form while rippling. Then the Blood-Toothed Cricket instantly let out a violent buzzing sound, and layers of invisible and massless violent sound waves crashed into the dark energy ripple. Unfortunately, it was like a stone thrown into a stream.","Although the dark energy ripples rippled, it couldn’t stop the dark energy ripples from heading to the two people."]},{"number":413,"title":"Chapter 413: How Can This Still Be Fought?","paragraphs":["Fei Qianqiong couldn’t help but sigh. The Blood-Toothed Cricket had always been his main fey. However, its Willpower Rune had been stripped away, and it had dropped from Fantasy III to a regular fey. Even if he still had the Diamond II/Fantasy II Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu, he couldn’t even reach 30% of his previous battle prowess.","Fei Qianqiong hurriedly channeled a large amount of spiritual power from his body into the Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu, causing a red-gold luster to quickly light up on its body.","The silky and dazzling red-gold silk threads quickly shot out of the Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu’s body and then tightly entwined, forming three red-gold ribbons covered with dark-red spots.","“Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu, use one strand of Mind Wall Ribbon in front of me and two in front of Listen!”","The Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu obviously hesitated a little when it heard its owner’s words. It didn’t understand why its contractor wanted to protect one of those people who had made a move on itself and the Blood-Toothed Cricket during the day.","However, due to its absolute obedience to Fei Qianqiong in a battle, the Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu didn’t hesitate to do as it was told.","At that moment, the dark energy ripple approached and sent Fei Qianqiong and Listen flying.","Thanks to the Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu’s Mind Wall Ribbon’s double protection, Listen felt that his blood energy was surging.","Since Fei Qianqiong had a layer less of protection from the Mind Wall Ribbon, crimson blood flowed out of his nose, staining his white beard due to the erosion of this dark energy ripple.","Fei Qianqiong stood up and said softly to Listen, “I’m ready to give it my all. I wouldn’t dare to guarantee how long I can hold this off. Summon your feys out and smash through the wall to escape.”","When Listen heard Fei Qianqiong’s words, he also looked at him deeply, just like how Fei Qianqiong had looked at him earlier.","However, Listen didn’t intend to escape. The king-class expert opposite of Fei Qianqiong was clearly much stronger than him.","Fei Qianqiong could barely handle the dark energy ripples created from the hunchbacked old man’s fey’s roar.","Even if he ran, how could he escape?","The appearance of this hunchbacked old man was different from Fei Qianqiong’s. The Mother of Bloodbath had discovered Fei Qianqiong’s traces, and he had shown up because its words had enraged him.","However, this old man had shown up after hearing the conversation between himself and Fei Qianqiong. The purpose of his appearance on behalf of the Zheng family should be to reap Listen’s life.","Although Listen wasn’t planning to run away, he still summoned his two feys. One of them was the Pain Illusory Fox that he had previously exchanged with Lin Yuan for source-type items and the Day and Night Spirit Silver, while the other was a three-tailed crimson fox with a very beautiful fur color. Its three fluffy tails at the back were like a blooming three-petaled crabapple.","At that moment, the hunchbacked old man said regretfully, “A Silver VII/Fantasy I Pain Illusory Fox and a Silver III/Fantasy I Three-Tailed Crimson Fox. It seems you did spend many resources on yourself during your time in control of the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","“The Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce is such a small chamber of commerce. It should have taken a lot of effort to nurture a fey like yours!”","Listen’s expression remained the same, but he recalled his dead relatives. The Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce was now a small chamber of commerce, but not in the past.","He had been able to get a high-quality fey such as the Three-Tailed Crimson Fox because of his family’s unreserved devotion and care.","Listen also understood the importance of his strength for the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s development.","Therefore, after Listen had seen Lin Yuan’s trade message, he had been willing to take out source-type items in exchange for suitable high-quality Bronze feys.","Listen took a step forward toward the hunchbacked old man standing on the back of the Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger and said, “You came supposedly to kill me. Why don’t I give you the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, and you let Fei Qianqiong go?”","Fei Qianqiong widened his eyes and looked at Listen in confusion. Listen faintly raised his eyes at Fei Qianqiong and then at the Diamond II/Fantasy II Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu. He took a step forward and looked at the hunchbacked old man.","Fei Qianqiong understood what Listen meant. He was Listen’s servant. When he had sworn with the Willpower Rune, he had sworn a death contract for loyalty. If Listen died, Fei Qianqiong would also lose his life because of the Willpower Rune’s backlash.","Based on Listen’s instructions, Fei Qianqiong secretly channeled all the spirit qi in his body into the Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu’s body without a trace, ready to wait for Listen’s next instructions.","The corners of Elder Niu’s mouth suddenly formed a smile as if he was mocking. His gaze at Listen also carried scrutiny and playfulness.","“Are you showing your master-servant relationship in front of me? It’s my first time seeing a master who would say something like being willing to die for his dog.","“Hehe, you guys don’t need such cheap tricks. The flow of spiritual power is as conspicuous as a splendid ribbon in front of my eyes.”","After saying that, Elder Niu threw his walking stick up, which changed its shape in mid-air and turned into a strange tadpole that was not even half the size of a palm. There were seven or eight nerve ducts at its sides, with compound eyes growing on each of them.","“With this Dark Spirit Eye Tadpole, not even the slightest change in spiritual power cannot escape my perception.","“Dark Spirit Eye Tadpole, use Dark Spirit Confinement.”","Just as this old man standing on the Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger spoke, the compound eyes on the Dark Spirit Eye Tadpole’s nerve ducts flickered, and the light in the entire room went dark.","Listen and Fei Qianqiong, who was channeling spiritual power into the Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu, found that the spiritual power in their bodies seemed to have been confined.","Listen felt as if the spiritual power in his body had turned into a crystalline substance that simply couldn’t be used. Fei Qianqiong also felt that although the confined spiritual power in his body was not as difficult to use as crystals, it was no different than sticky asphalt.","At the same time, the flow of spiritual power in the Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu’s body was so slow that the use of its previous instantaneous abilities now required a few seconds of preparation time.","Upon sensing this situation, Fei Qianqiong couldn’t help but let out a long sigh. It’s another fey that’s about to reach Suzerain.","How can this battle still be fought?","There’s simply no way!"]},{"number":414,"title":"Chapter 414: Midsummer Cage","paragraphs":["The hunchbacked old man, Elder Niu, stroked the Dark Spirit Eye Tadpole in his hand, looked at Listen, and said, “Your spiritual power has been sealed, so don’t resist anymore. Realize the last value of life.","“Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger, treat those six units over there as your midnight snack tonight.","“Eat them quickly so that I can report it back to Young Master Zheng!”","Upon receiving its contractor’s order, the sharpness hidden in the shadows of the Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger’s scorpion tail poked out, and its black tail hook flashed.","Six hooked shadows with a layer of dark domain prototype launched an attack toward the four feys that Listen and Fei Qianqiong had summoned.","Fei Qianqiong’s face turned pale. The Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger’s attack even contained a layer of domain power.","His spiritual power had been sealed, so he could not even let the Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu use Mind Wall Ribbon again even if he wanted to.","Could the Mind-Controlling Silkworm Gu really block this attack containing the domain power even if it used Mind Wall Ribbon?","Just as these six hooked shadows landed on the four feys, a fist-sized pink-purple embroidered ball-shaped flower appeared in the middle of the room out of nowhere. It gently swirled in the air, looking marvelous.","The six hooked shadows were pulled into the pink-purple embroidered ball-shaped flower and crushed by the layers of pink-purple petals.","A clear but unusually gentle voice sounded out of nowhere.","“What you just said is not right. There are more spirit qi fluctuations that you can’t see.”","Listen and Fei Qianqiong both thought that it was hard for them to escape this calamity but never expected things would take a turn for the better.","A pink-purple embroidered ball-shaped flower had actually saved both of them.","Listen instantly thought of Lin Yuan. He looked at this pink-purple embroidered ball-shaped flower, and his heart was filled with peace of mind.","Although it did not block in front of him, it was like an absolute defense. It had even taken away the power he had received from the opposite side while it was rotating beautifully.","The hunchbacked old man turned nervous and consumed a lot of spirit qi to control the Dark Spirit Eye Tadpole, letting its main eye hidden in the compound eyes light up. However, he found that he simply couldn’t see this pink-purple embroidered ball-shaped flower’s spiritual power fluctuation through its main eye.","Without even thinking, he drained the spiritual power in his body and provided almost all the spirit qi inside a pinnacle A-rank spirit qi professional’s body to this Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger that was about to reach Suzerain.","The Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger’s black insect armor instantly lit up and seemed to pull all the light in this room into the darkness before turning the world inside this room into a world of darkness.","The Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger’s tail shook with a strange frequency and finally plunged directly into the insect armor on its back.","The dark energy that was originally wrapped around the tail at the tip was frantically injected into the Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger’s body, causing the domain around the Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger to become even more solid. It was as if the back half of the Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger’s body had been hidden in the darkness.","Immediately after that, the Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger’s three black eye sockets suddenly condensed into three strange eyes with black vertical pupils that spun rapidly, as if adding to the domain power around it.","The domain power spread out all of a sudden from its original state of constant solidification and surrounded the spinning pink-purple embroidered ball-shaped flower in the air, trying to pull it completely into the dark domain.","An unusually gentle voice once again sounded out of thin air.","“You don’t have a domain until you reach Suzerain. Your Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger is only at Diamond X/Fantasy IV.","“Even if you reach the threshold of the domain, you can only grasp onto its form, but not its essence. Activating the domain to launch an attack is just attending to the minor, unimportant details while neglecting the essentials!”","The darkness domain that was constantly expanding had pulled the slowly rotating flower into it. However, based on the feedback from the Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger in the dark domain, Elder Niu found that the pink-purple embroidered ball-shaped flower still seemed to be non-existent in the domain.","He stared at it, and his voice was unusually grave.","“Who’s there!?”","Elder Niu’s heart had completely sunk while a feeling of absurdity arose.","He was a pinnacle king-class expert. The only things that could escape his contracted Diamond VIII/Fantasy III Dark Spirit Eye Tadpole full-strength detection ability were Suzerain/Myth Breed feys. This Myth Breed fey must be at least Myth II, one good at stealth.","Elder Niu felt that even if the Dark Spirit Eye Tadpole couldn’t find the target’s existence, the Diamond X/Fantasy IV Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger’s domain could do so.","He had clearly been a raging hunter a few seconds ago, playing with two insignificant preys, but in the blink of an eye, the world had changed. He was the prey now.","An unusually gentle voice carried a hint of laughter.","“From the time you came into this room, I saw you being blatant. I was here earlier than you, yet you asked me who I am. I should be the one asking you that!”","Fei Qianqiong swallowed a mouthful of saliva with difficulty. What was the background of the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s backer, the youth wearing the strange mask?","This Myth Breed fey was obviously not the one that had followed the masked youth during the day.","He was lucky enough to see two Suzerain/Myth Breed feys on the same day.","Since when were Suzerain/Myth Breed feys so worthless?","For some reason, the pink-purple embroidered ball-shaped flower that was spinning beautifully in mid-air didn’t show the slightest bit of aura, but its existence made him feel a suppression like a jack had been pressing on it.","Elder Niu shouted in a deep voice, “Your Excellency, the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce is something that my Zheng family aspires to obtain. Listen is also someone that my Zheng family wants to kill tonight.”","Just as Elder Niu uttered these words, a hint of coldness colored the unusually gentle voice.","“Can’t I keep the item that the Zheng family aspires to get and the person who it wants to kill?”","This unusually gentle voice fell, and the lightly rotating pink-purple embroidered ball-shaped flower in mid-air suddenly bloomed into bright pink radiance.","Countless pink-purple petals poured out of the embroidered ball-shaped flower and danced in the air.","The petals were graceful, like the rainbow-colored clothes worn by the Eight Immortals, and had a tinge of deep midsummer.","At that moment, a gentle, soft voice sounded.","“Midsummer Cage!”"]},{"number":415,"title":"Chapter 415: People Respect Themselves","paragraphs":["The moment this gentle voice sounded, the pink-purple petals tore this dark domain to pieces, just like the dawn that banished the darkness.","Then Elder Niu found that these pink-colored petals combined with each other, confining him, his contracted Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger, and the Dark Spirit Eye Tadpole just like a shackle.","Under the confinement of this petal, he couldn’t move his body or channel the spirit qi in his body. He had no resistance, just like a lamb waiting to be slaughtered.","The unusually gentle voice that appeared out of nowhere had a calm tone, but the words that came out seemed to be mocking.","“Compared to the spiritual power confinement you just proudly used, how do you find this tactic of mine?”","A beautiful figure appeared at Listen’s side. It raised its hands, lightly shaking the bracelet on its wrist.","This bracelet also contained a lot of pink-purple embroidered ball-shaped flowers and produced a crisp colliding sound while being shaken.","The pink-purple embroidered ball-shaped flower rotating in the air flew toward the woman’s wrist and shrank as if it had found its home.","It transformed into a pink-purple embroidered ball-shaped flower pendant that was the same as the other pendants.","Elder Niu couldn’t help but exclaim with indescribable shock in his voice, “Fey Weaponization! You’re actually at Myth III!”","Endless Summer ignored his exclamation and snapped its fingers before gently shouting, “The law of enlightenment, the probing of willpower.”","As soon as Endless Summer said that, Elder Niu felt a kind of pain, like being pierced by a spike in his spiritual spatial zone. After this pang of pain, it returned to normal. Elder Niu found that there were no abnormalities in his body.","At that moment, Endless Summer furrowed its eyebrows and said, “I heard you talking so much about dogs, but it turns out you’re just a servant. How ironic!”","Elder Niu’s face turned red, but before he could speak, Endless Summer added, “People value themselves, and all living things can be called humans. If you regard others as dogs, then you’re truly a dog.","“Since you’ve sworn by the Willpower Rune, there’s really no use of keeping you!”","Elder Niu had never thought the news that Listen had put out about the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce having a backer was true. Its backer was definitely not weak.","Otherwise, given his pinnacle king-class strength, he would not have ended up in a hopeless situation, unable to complete Young Master Zheng’s task.","Elder Niu hurriedly said, “I swore allegiance with the Willpower Rune to the family head of the Zheng family’s third lineage, the—”","Before he could finish his words, Endless Summer snapped its fingers again.","“What I hate the most are dark-type feys. Such feys deserve to die! Especially this black tiger that likes to take out hearts to eat!","“The law of enlightenment, the mind is calm.”","Just as Endless Summer uttered the last word, Elder Niu, the Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger, and the Dark Spirit Eye Tadpole fell into a state of dead silence, as if they had entered into an endless, long slumber.","Then, Endless Summer moved its hand forward, clenched it tightly, and shouted, “Bloom! The Shooting Spears of Summer!”","The Midsummer Cage that had confined Elder Niu, the Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger, and the Dark Spirit Eye Tadpole turned into three pink-purple petal-spears in the blink of an eye.","The moment the spears condensed, they penetrated through the heart. The pinnacle king-class expert, Elder Niu, the Diamond X/Fantasy IV Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger, and the Diamond VIII/Fantasy II Dark Spirit Eye Tadpole died due to these three Shooting Spears of Summer without any struggles in their slumber.","Fei Qianqiong was utterly shocked and felt a lot of sweat on his palms that made his palms all wet.","Bi Chenghu had also hinted for him to swear with the Willpower Rune as the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce’s Protector. Although there were usually no restrictions in becoming one, and he wouldn’t be like a servant where his life was in the hands of someone’s thoughts, the allegiance oath from the Willpower Rune was different from the trade oath. The allegiance oath could only be done once in a lifetime.","If he chose to become a Protector to serve a faction or a person, it would be a lifetime thing. Even if the person he was protecting died or the faction was annihilated, the allegiance oath couldn’t be taken a second time.","Fei Qianqiong was now glad that he hadn’t taken the allegiance oath to the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce even though Bi Chenghu had been hinting at him.","If he had really done so, he would have died in the morning. This hunchbacked old man in front of him was an example.","Endless Summer shook the pink-purple metal bell hanging on its bracelet. The corpses of the Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger and the Dark Spirit Eye Tadpole were collected into Endless Summer’s pink-purple bell-shaped Diamond fey storage, and it nodded in satisfaction.","The Shooting Spears of Summer had killed the two Diamond/Fantasy Breed feys during their dormancy, so they managed to preserve their maximum integrity.","Listen hurriedly bent down to Endless Summer to show his gratitude and said, “Thank you, senior, for coming to the rescue.”","Endless Summer turned and looked at Listen before replying gently, “Young Master arranged for me to guard this place during this period. Just continue with your plans without worries.”","Upon hearing that, Listen no longer worried about his future safety. Since the Zheng family had sent a pinnacle king-class expert to kill him, it was the same as saying that the Zheng family had set its mind on killing him.","As long as he was alive, the Zheng family wouldn’t have the means to get what they wanted from him. The dangers he would face in the future would never end.","Fei Qianqiong couldn’t help but have an ecstatic expression on his face. His safety could be considered to be guaranteed with a Suzerain/Myth III that could use Body Weaponization.","He was simply afraid of the feeling of experiencing life and death twice in a day.","Fei Qianqiong suddenly felt that the battles of spirit qi professionals were simply too boring and that acting was more interesting.","Endless Summer glanced at Fei Qianqiong with a trace of approval in its eyes. It flipped its hand, a Willpower Rune that contained blood was injected into the Blood-Toothed Cricket.","Fei Qianqiong felt this Willpower Rune, and his body couldn’t help but tremble a little.","At that moment, the unusually gentle voice sounded next to his ears.","“You did a good job just now. Sister Blood said to return your Blood Poison Willpower based on the situation. I’ll just give it to you directly now.”","Fei Qianqiong had been excited to the point of incoherence, almost choking up a little. He didn’t feel anything when the Blood-Toothed Cricket was a Fantasy Breed fey, but only after its demotion did he feel how desperate the feeling of powerlessness was.","Fortunately, he had recovered the Blood Poison Willpower. Even though the Blood-Toothed Cricket needed a period of warm nourishment before it could return to its full strength, without this Blood Poison Willpower, Fei Qianqiong wasn’t really sure if he could comprehend a suitable Willpower Rune for the Blood-Toothed Cricket in this lifetime."]},{"number":416,"title":"Chapter 416: I Want 50%!","paragraphs":["The sea surrounded indigo Azure City on three sides, and it just so happened that the wind had picked up on this day. The waves rolled against the reefs on the shore, creating the sounds of raging waves.","People who lived on the shore tend to be accustomed to this sound. When they slept with this sound, they slept more soundly.","There was a luxuriously decorated mansion in the middle of Indigo Azure City.","A middle-aged man with a sinister look in his eyes said enthusiastically, “Second Young Master, are my chess pieces carved from jade-textured ebony and jade-textured white sandalwood to your liking?","“If they are, I’ll have someone send these Othello pieces to you when you go back.”","This so-called Second Young Master was a slim youth in a Creation Master long robe. He was standing there, counting the rows of books on the shelves with his fingers.","Upon hearing the words of the middle-aged man with sinister eyes, he said with a wave of his hand without looking back, “I never put jade-textured Othello chess pieces in my study. I only put completely jade-textured ones.","“Speaking of completely jade-textured Othello pieces, I do have two pots there.","“Third Uncle, if you like them, I’ll have someone send one pot over so that you can widen your horizons.”","The words of this youth wearing a Creation Master long robe caused the enthusiastic smile on the face of the sinister-eyed middle-aged man to pause and look embarrassed.","Just as he wanted to speak, Second Young Master said, “Third Uncle, your third lineage has always been afraid to make a move on the offshore coast resources, afraid of being targeted by the Qiu family and the Wei family, as well as the other lineages secretly causing trouble.","“I, Zheng Kaiyuan, am lending my support to you in the main family, yet you didn’t mention the percentage of the offshore coastal resources you want to share with me.","“Aren’t you not taking me, Zheng Kaiyuan, seriously with only a pot of jade-textured Othello pieces as your token of sincerity?”","The sinister-eyed middle-aged man had an even more embarrassed look on his face. He hurriedly replied, “Second Young Master is willing to support the third lineage, so how can we forget about giving you resources?","“What does Second Young Master think about the third lineage giving you 30% of proceeds from developing the offshore coastal resources?”","Zheng Kaiyuan summoned a small sable with one black and one white tail with a wave of his hand.","When it was summoned, it saw the pot of Othello pieces made of jade-textured ebony and white sandalwood. It immediately became nimble and looked at its master with its watery eyes.","As Zheng Kaiyuan looked at his contracted little sable, a touch of tenderness appeared on his face.","“Go on, Sen Luo. Eat more.”","With its master’s consent, the little sable with one black and one white tail scurried straight into the pot containing the Othello pieces, nibbling the chess pieces with a snapping sound.","Zheng Kaiyuan gently stroked off a strand of sable hair that was on his sleeve. He looked up at the sinister-eyed middle-aged man and said, “Third Uncle, my Yin-Yang Senluo Sable is hungry. I can’t control this little thing from eating. I think Third Uncle won’t mind this little thing, right?”","The sinister-eyed middle-aged man hurriedly replied with a smile, “It’s a blessing of this pot of chess pieces that your fey loves to eat it.”","Zheng Kaiyuan seemed to have completely forgotten that he was the one who had asked it to eat a little more earlier.","He seemed a little sleepy and rubbed his temples before saying with a yawn, “I want 50%!”","Without giving the sinister-eyed middle-aged man a chance, he added, “The Radiance Creation Master Youth Conference will start next year. I’m tight. If Third Uncle is unwilling to give me 50%, the other three lineages should be very happy to do so.”","Upon hearing that, the sinister-eyed middle-aged man’s expression stiffened, and he hurriedly responded, “Second Young Master, why don’t we talk it over again?”","Zheng Kaiyuan laughed lightly and answered, “Little Sen Luo, let’s go. The chess pieces here are not something we should eat!”","The sinister-eyed middle-aged man immediately turned pale and said in a panic, “Second Young Master, 50% it will be!”","Zheng Kaiyuan picked up the pitiful little sable that obviously hadn’t yet eaten enough and yawned again.","“I’m sleepy. Third Uncle, why don’t you come to my house tomorrow with your utmost sincerity?”","After Zheng Kaiyuan left, the sinister-eyed middle-aged man turned gloomy right away. He sat in his chair for a long time without uttering a word as he clenched his fists tighter and tighter.","At that moment, he suddenly became startled before feeling shocked and worried. He picked up his phone and dialed a number. The phone rang twice, and someone picked it up.","When the sinister-eyed middle-aged man heard the voice that usually contained a hint of joy, the worry in his heart dissipated a lot. But after that, anger rushed forth, and he asked as he suppressed his emotions, “Where’s Elder Niu?”","The youth who received the call replied indifferently, “I arranged for Elder Niu to do something trivial. Father, how did you persuade Second Young Master to stand on our side?”","The sinister-eyed middle-aged man could no longer suppress his monstrous anger. He erupted and scolded him, “A trivial matter? The allegiance oath between Elder Niu and me has broken, yet you still say it’s a trivial matter? Then should I pretend that nothing happened when you die outside?”","He poured his rage wildly over the phone, making the sinister-eyed youth fall into a state of dismay. Immediately after that, the sinister-eyed youth’s face emerged with unconcealable shock as his hand holding the phone trembled.","Elder Niu had sworn to his father with the Willpower Rune and become his father’s servant, but his father now had said that Elder Niu’s allegiance oath had been broken. Didn’t this mean that Elder Niu had died?","Elder Niu was a pinnacle king-class expert with a Diamond X/Fantasy IV Dark-Eyed Scorpion Tiger. How could someone with such strength have died silently?","Elder Niu had only gone to the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, a place where an insignificant person was holding on with an empty frame to kill that person. How could he have died?","Before the sinister-eyed youth could make more guesses, he heard his father say in an angry voice over the phone, “Hurry up and get your ass back to Indigo Azure City! How did the third lineage produce such a useless thing like you!?”","As he spoke, the sinister-eyed middle-aged man felt his lungs were about to explode with anger. What on earth was the reason that he had unaccountably lost a pinnacle king-class expert!?","After hanging up the phone, the sinister-eyed middle-aged man slammed his fist on the table in front of him, creating a loud ‘bang’.","At that moment, an expert, who was even older than Elder Niu but had a straight back, walked in and said, “Master, why are you so angry?”","When the sinister-eyed middle-aged man saw this old man, he hurriedly got up and replied, “Uncle Jiao, please go to the Royal Capital and help me bring back that unfilial son. I’d like to see what kind of trouble this unfilial son has caused there!”","...","After Lin Yuan got up in the morning and ate breakfast downstairs, he went back to his room and logged on to Star Web. Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up when he saw that the two messages he had sent last night had both received a reply.","However, his brows furrowed deeply when he opened one of the messages."]},{"number":417,"title":"Chapter 417: Lin Yuan Is Embarrassed","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan frowned as he looked at the reply.","Freezing Cold: “10 o’clock is fine. I’ll be there. I need to see the Bronze/Epic lizard feys in this meeting. I also have some conditions that I need to state in advance.”","When Lin Yuan had sent the trade message, Freezing Cold was the king-class expert with two main feys among the two king-class experts.","Freezing Cold had three Willpower Runes and two main feys, and it was considered a good allocation among the king-class experts. Therefore, Lin Yuan had enhanced a Bronze/Epic lizard fey when he had asked him whether he had one.","From the personal information that Freezing Cold had sent over, his two contracted feys were a Diamond III/Fantasy II Bucktooth Terror Skink and a Diamond I/Fantasy II Swordtooth Lizard Dragon.","In terms of strength, Freezing Cold was inferior to Fei Qianqiong. Still, his Diamond I/Fantasy II Swordtooth Lizard Dragon had completed the transformation from a lizard bloodline to a dragon bloodline and had a lot of potential.","Lin Yuan, who showed an interest in Freezing Cold’s potential, didn’t have any available king-class experts under him, so he had met Freezing Cold’s conditions in advance. Otherwise, given Freezing Cold’s strength, he wasn’t really qualified to propose such conditions.","It was just like how the pinnacle king-class experts’ squad that Lightning Sparrow King was in needed to gather resources and had spent a small amount of effort for a Bronze/Epic fey.","As the saying went, “One should have respect for the wise.”","Since Lin Yuan was ready to implement the ‘white-clothed followers’ plan, he wouldn’t be stingy with resources for the capable. However, this plan was not easy to implement. The premise was that he needed absolute control.","Lin Yuan had already drawn a question mark in his heart about this king-class expert named Freezing Cold.","The white-clothed follower plan was to form the Sky City and sweep the swords in all directions. What all sharp weapons, like a sword, needed to do was to be obedient. Otherwise, no matter how sharp it was, it would hurt him.","However, Lin Yuan didn’t directly exclude Freezing Cold as he intended to meet him before making a decision.","It was still early now. Since Lin Yuan had nothing to do, he went to his store’s fan club, ready to look through the chat records.","After flipping through, he found that a night had passed.","The members were still enthusiastically discussing the 30 Flower Brocade Pearls that were auctioned as welfare. Thus, every member’s bid would be seen by all the group members.","Every time someone bid with new prices, they would be praised by the others in the groups and be called ‘Big Brothers’.","Over time, other members would increase the bid again, together with the uproar from the braised egg head, the violent-tempered woman, the violent-tempered woman’s daughter, the Buddha-tempered person, and Zhou Jiaxin.","Lin Yuan found that the 30 Flower Brocade Pearls auction, which was used as group welfare, had vaguely turned into a ranking competition for the Big Brothers in the group.","He saw that the current highest bidder was a Class 4 Creation Master with a source-type item, 250kg of the Gold metal Thorn Aluminum Ores, and 70 mid-grade strange flames.","Lin Yuan looked at this offer and couldn’t help but secretly click his tongue.","A resource like a source-type item was much more precious than Flower Brocade Pearls. In other words, it was hard to exchange the Flower Brocade Pearls for a source-type item.","However, this Class 4 Creation Master was willing to take out a source-type item to exchange for Flower Brocade Pearls now.","This could really reflect a Creation Master’s wealth and overbearingness. They wouldn’t consider the price for something they wanted.","The Thorn Aluminium Ores was a kind of very dangerous metal that could hurt people if left alone. They would constantly release sharp metal sword flares that would hurt any surrounding objects.","After injecting spiritual power into them, the metal sword flares released by the Thorn Aluminium Ores would become even sharper and stronger within an expanded range.","Lin Yuan had once thought of using these ores to fuse with the Source Sand, but he still chose the Day and Night Spirit Silver after weighing the matter.","For Lin Yuan at that time, instead of strengthening his attacks, it was more important to strengthen his defense.","The Thorn Aluminium Ores were rarer than the Day and Night Spirit Silver, and the last time they had been auctioned in the Rare Lifeform Pavilion was eight months ago.","After looking through the group chat records for a while, Lin Yuan found that someone had bid higher than this Class 4 Creation Master.","Lin Yuan was very interested in the 250kg of Thorn Aluminium Ores. He couldn’t help but think that even if this Class 4 Creation Master couldn’t win the final bid, this Class 4 Creation Master should be willing if Lin Yuan exchanged the Flower Brocade Pearls for the Thorn Aluminium Ores with him.","Lin Yuan now felt the huge benefits of the network of relations formed by his Purchase With No Loss store’s fan club members to his own collection of spiritual materials.","After feeling this huge benefit, he dismissed the intention of trading out over 100 Flower Brocade Pearls in his hands with other factions.","He understood through this group welfare auction the terrifying purchasing power of these Big Brothers in the group.","There was still half a day before the end of the group welfare auction, but the bidding price of these 30 Flower Brocade Pearls had already greatly exceeded the market price.","As a result, rather than trading the remaining Flower Brocade Pearls outside, he would auction them through group welfare. This was akin to deepening the toughness and flexibility of the network of relations within the group.","Lin Yuan looked at the 10 Flower Brocade Pearls that were on display in his store and could already imagine that they would stir up a reign of terror once tonight’s display period was over.","He went to check the price for the mid-grade strange flames and found that it had increased a lot compared to before. He blinked his eyes and couldn’t help but think whether this was considered as leveraging the price of mid-grade strange flames.","Lin Yuan went on the Star Web forum and searched about his fan club’s welfare to see if it had spread as he thought it would.","Once he checked it, Lin Yuan was embarrassed. The welfare of his fan club had spread out, but half of these posts he had checked were from lifestyle-class spirit qi professionals scolding him."]},{"number":418,"title":"Chapter 418: The Boss Can’t Be Lin Yuan, Right?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The ones who needed the strange flames the most in the Radiance Federation were those lifestyle-class spirit qi professionals.","They verbally attacked the Purchase With No Loss store owner for acquiring mid-grade strange flames without restraint using the blind trade method.","This led to a price increase of mid-grade strange flames in the market, which seriously affected the daily consumption of lifestyle-class spirit qi professionals.","Their accusations made Lin Yuan a little aggrieved.","I’ve only acquired more than 200 mid-grade strange flames. How big an impact could it have? Why do these lifestyle-class spirit qi professionals hate me so much!?","What he didn’t know was that some factions and Creation Masters had privately hoarded a lot of mid-grade strange flames in order to make a deal with him in the future in exchange for the Flower Brocade Pearls.","Of course, some factions that didn’t need the Flower Brocade Pearls took advantage of this situation and wanted to acquire a large amount of mid-grade strange flames, which were not considered abundant in the market. Then, they would raise the price of the mid-grade strange flames to take the chance to make a big profit.","After looking at the time, Lin Yuan logged off Star Web and went downstairs to find Liu Jie. He had already told Hu Quan about the arrangements needed inside his private faction territory on Star Web during the time Hu Quan had been promoted to a Class 5 Spirit Craftsman. Hu Quan was also working overtime to make it according to Lin Yuan’s requests.","Lin Yuan knew that he would be busy immediately after his private faction on Star Web announced its function and started issuing Fate Letters.","When he established the space tunnel to the Divine Wood Federation after New Year’s, he would still have to attend to the development in the Divine Wood Federation. Naturally, he wouldn’t have the energy to manage these white-clothed followers.","Liu Jie was his retainer knight, so he was obviously the most suitable to control these white-clothed followers.","Lin Yuan had just come downstairs when he saw Liu Jie walking out of the training room.","When Liu Jie saw Lin Yuan, he immediately walked up excitedly and said, “Lin Yuan, the genetic model of the Bayonet Beetle inscribed by my Insect Queen has evolved. It should now be renamed as the Flesh-Mincing Blade Insect.”","After saying that, Liu Jie circulated his spiritual energy and summoned the half-palm-sized Insect Queen in front of Lin Yuan. When it was summoned out, it was just the same when it had been in imminent danger.","However, a small head suddenly popped out of this wriggling purple flesh cocoon. Upon seeing Liu Jie, this little thing revealed a surprised emotion on its face. A petite figure flew out of the purple flesh cocoon and hugged Liu Jie’s neck.","Lin Yuan didn’t know until now that the Insect Queen was actually a fairy source-type lifeform after it had recovered from imminent danger.","Fairy source-type lifeforms were those that were not animals, plants, or lifeforms. Most of them had a human-like appearance.","Liu Jie’s Insect Queen had been hugging Liu Jie’s neck since it came out. It looked especially shy and dependent on him, and Liu Jie lovingly rubbed the Insect Queen with his cheek.","At that moment, two words flashed in Lin Yuan’s mind—father-daughter love.","Liu Jie was not raising a source-type lifeform. He was simply raising a daughter!","Then, Liu Jie said to the petite Insect Queen, “Elegance, produce a Flesh-Mincing Blade Insect.”","Liu Jie’s fairy-like Insect Queen, Elegance, transformed into a purple stream of light and returned to the purple flesh cocoon. Then the purple flesh cocoon landed on the ground and immediately turned into an insect base.","Its body size swelled three meters outward, and many sac-like ducts unique to insect-species fey were inserted into the body.","The moment the Insect Queen transformed, a beetle with a protruding shell and eight long, sharp legs was produced by this huge insect base and appeared in front of Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan was quite surprised after carefully examining the Flesh-Mincing Beetle produced by Liu Jie’s Insect Queen.","This source-type lifeform, the Cocoon of Evolution, was actually so powerful!","It had allowed an insect-species fey with a relatively simple genetic model to be so greatly strengthened.","The Bayonet Beetle’s attack method was to use the sharp horns on its head to make stabbing attacks and use its eight legs for assisted attacks. On the other hand, the Flesh-Mincing Beetle, which the Bayonet Beetle had turned into after being enhanced by the Cocoon of Evolution, had weakened horns.","Although its head was weakened, its body’s protruding armor was sharp on every side and played the same role as its horns.","While moving rapidly, the eight sharp bone-scraping-like legs could quickly cut the skin of feys and churn the flesh into mush.","Although the Flesh-Mincing Blade Insect and Bayonet Beetle’s sattack method hadn’t changed, a Flesh-Mincing Blade Insect could completely single out three Bayonet Beetles of the same size.","Such a change was the process of Liu Jie’s sea of insects having a qualitative to quantitative change.","Coupled with the Insect Queen’s exclusive skills, Swarm Frenzy and Explosive Recycling, Liu Jie had increased his strength to another level just by having another ability.","Lin Yuan, who was very happy about Liu Jie’s strength increase, said with a smile, “Congratulations to Big Brother Liu on your new sea of insects.”","Lin Yuan could feel that the current Liu Jie was significantly more confident than before.","It was now the time to meet with those two king-class experts, so Lin Yuan said, “Big Brother Liu, let’s log onto Star Web together and meet at the entrance of a Star Web store called Purchase With No Loss.”","When Liu Jie heard Lin Yuan say that, he was a little confused. Was Lin Yuan asking him to buy something together?","Even if Liu Jie didn’t go onto forums, he had heard of the Purchase With No Loss Fey Store’s explosive popularity.","It was a premium store with a mysterious boss and only sold premium items.","Despite feeling doubtful, Liu Jie naturally wouldn’t refuse Lin Yuan’s request, so he replied with a nod, “Okay. I’ll go back to my room now and log on to Star Web.”","Hu Quan had recently stopped staying up late, so he used the daytime to make various objects.","When he saw Lin Yuan going to do something on Star Web with Liu Jie, he said, “Wear the masks I made for the two of you before going out. Boys should protect themselves outside.”","When Lin Yuan heard Hu Quan’s words, he felt that Uncle Hu was a little strange, as if he had a hidden, unknown story behind him.","Why did boys have to protect themselves?","Wasn’t it always the girls who had to protect themselves?","When Liu Jie heard Hu Quan mention that strange yet light mask, he couldn’t help but say, “Uncle Hu, aren’t we wearing the mask you made only when we go out on behalf of the faction? Wouldn’t it look strange to wear it for shopping at the Star Web store?”","Before Hu Quan could reply, Lin Yuan smiled brightly at Liu Jie and revealed his small white teeth before saying, “Big Brother Liu, we really have to wear them this time.”","Liu Jie suddenly became solemn upon learning that Lin Yuan wanted him to go to Star Web to do something related to the private faction.","All of a sudden, Liu Jie recalled the rumors on Star Web, saying that the owner of the Purchase With No Loss store was a young man who was not very old.","Liu Jie couldn’t help but have some doubts. This person wouldn’t be Lin Yuan, right?"]},{"number":419,"title":"Chapter 419: What a Scumbag!","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Liu Jie returned to the room one step ahead of Lin Yuan. Just when Lin Yuan was also ready to return to his room, Hu Quan said, “I really don’t know how you came up with these ideas. Other people who get their hands on this completely jade-textured phoebe zhennan are afraid of even wasting it slightly.","“And yet, you made me extract out each thread of the crystallized golden silk in the phoebe zhennan for you.”","Upon hearing that, Lin Yuan scratched the back of his head and asked Hu Quan, “Uncle Hu, are there any difficulties in extracting the gold threads from the completely jade-textured phoebe zhennan?”","Hu Quan chuckled and answered, “If I didn’t have this Fantasy Breed Wood Weaving House Centipede, I really couldn’t have managed these crystallized gold threads.","“Even if I was able to separate these crystallized golden threads from the completely jade-textured phoebe zhennan, I wouldn’t have been able to do it so completely like this.","“However, this batch of completely jade-textured phoebe zhennan that you gave me was really quite a lot.","“It’ll take at least 13 or 14 days to extract all the crystallized golden threads in it.”","Hu Quan rolled his eyes and said with a grin, “Why don’t you tell Wen Yu to let me stay up late during this period?","“Also, don’t let Liu Jie make pork liver soup for me again.”","Upon hearing that, Lin Yuan replied without even thinking about it, “Uncle Hu, there’s no rush. Get it done during the day. Even if I tell Wen Yu about you staying up late, it doesn’t count.”","Lin Yuan also objected to Hu Quan staying up all night.","More than Hu Quan’s creativity as a Class 5 Spirit Craftsman, Lin Yuan would prefer Hu Quan to be able to create in a healthy state, instead of staying up late and affecting his health to rush his work.","Lin Yuan had never treated Hu Quan as a toolman or wanted to make use of his labor at any time.","When Hu Quan’s image was pieced together on the feature wall behind him, he was already a part of the mansion.","When Hu Quan saw that his idea didn’t work, he said, “Okay. I’m going to get to work. Go back to your room quickly. Don’t let Liu Jie wait too long.”","Lin Yuan now knew what it meant by throwing something away after using it!","No, I should say that I was thrown away without even being used!","What a scumbag!","When Lin Yuan logged onto Star Web this time, he had put on the mask with the majestic sky city pattern that Hu Quan had created with the completely jade-textured silk threads on his face in advance.","When Lin Yuan arrived at the Purchase With No Loss store entrance, he happened to see an acquaintance.","He saw the violent-tempered woman and greeted her. Only when Lin Yuan took the initiative to say hello to her did she then recognize him.","It had to be said that Lin Yuan really looked a bit mature with just his mouth and chin showing from wearing Hu Quan’s mask.","When the violent-tempered woman saw Lin Yuan, she hurriedly said, “Sir, why has the store recently stopped selling Silver Usneas and Elite Spirit-Siphon Goldfish?”","Upon hearing that, Lin Yuan replied with a smile, “It only stopped yesterday, and it’s uncertain until when it will be. If you need Silver Usneas, you can just send me a message directly.”","Lin Yuan cherished the people he knew when he was weak.","Upon hearing that, the violent-tempered woman hurriedly waved her hand and replied, “Sir, there’s no need to trouble you. I don’t know how many benefits I’ve gotten just from your fan club alone!”","She was very grateful to Lin Yuan. While Lin Yuan had helped heal her daughter’s fey’s damaged roots, he had also helped to promote its quality, which was simply a great kindness.","During this period, the violent-tempered woman had met a lot of bigwigs in the Purchase With No Loss store’s fan club.","By listening to the information that these bigwigs shared during the chat, the violent-tempered woman had exchanged several spiritual materials, allowing her to earn lots of Radiance dollars.","The amount of Radiance dollars she had earned in this month was more than what she usually earned in two years of hard work in receiving missions in the Guild Alliance.","Lin Yuan wanted to invite the violent-tempered woman into the store to sit for a while. Just as he was about to do so, she said, “Sir, continue with what you’re doing. My roasted chicken is particularly delicious. I’ll send you a roasted chicken!”","After the violent-tempered woman left Lin Yuan’s Purchase With No Loss store, she kept posting in the store’s fan club as usual, but she accidentally leaked something.","Violent-Tempered Woman: “I saw the group admin of the Star Web store at the entrance. He seems to be ready to enter the store and do something.”","The information that the violent-tempered woman posted made many bigwigs’ eyes light up.","The admin had always been mysterious. After she and the others had entered the group, they had only seen him auction 30 Flower Brocade Pearls through group welfare in the fan club.","They had never seen him say other superfluous words and usually couldn’t even contact him. This was because this mysterious group admin was so aloof that he simply didn’t reply to any messages.","Now that they heard the group admin had shown up at the store, many bigwigs who saw the violent-tempered woman’s post took action.","Lin Yuan stood at the entrance for less than a few minutes before he saw Liu Jie walking over wearing Hu Quan’s mask.","Liu Jie usually wore the Radiance Hundred Sequence battle suit on Star Web that the Radiance Sacred Hall specially made for the members. However, he changed that and wore a red-gold half-body armor.","Liu Jie looked unusually valiant with a mask that only showed his knife-sharp chin.","Liu Jie saw Lin Yuan. The latter was standing at the store entrance and opening the door to the closed Star Web store.","Upon seeing that, Liu Jie knew that he had really guessed right previously. Lin Yuan was the Purchase With No Loss store’s mysterious owner.","After Lin Yuan and Liu Jie met, they entered the store. Lin Yuan’s Purchase With No Loss store was not placed with shelves. Since Lin Yuan had recently taken down the Silver Usneas and Elite Spirit-Siphon Goldfish, the Purchase With No Loss store was empty.","In addition, the long table that Star Web had sent when Lin Yuan opened the store was still placed inside. This made the Purchase With No Loss Fey Store look like a restaurant with only one table rather than a store selling feys and spiritual materials.","Lin Yuan had arranged to meet Liu Jie half an hour earlier, which was 9.30, at the store. However, in less than five minutes after they sat down, they saw a slim man walk in.","When Lin Yuan saw this skinny guy, he asked, “Are you Zhou Luo?”","The information of the two king-class experts that Lin Yuan had previously received all had their looks. Thus, Lin Yuan had already recognized Zhou Luo as the king-class expert who had three Willpower Runes but whose main fey was extremely weak."]},{"number":420,"title":"Chapter 420: Are You Worthy?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Once Zhou Luo heard this youth with a strange mask in the store call out his name, he was finally sure that he hadn’t gone to the wrong place.","He was surprised to look at the furnishings around the store and was somewhat in disbelief that this legendary Purchase With No Loss Fey Store didn’t have any feys or spiritual materials but only an ordinary table.","Zhou Luo hurriedly said, “My name is Zhou Luo. Can my main fey, the Iron Bone Iguana, reach your standard?”","Upon hearing that, Lin Yuan flipped his hands and summoned a chair that was the same as the one Lin Yuan was sitting on. Both were gifted by Star Web when he had opened his store.","At that moment, Zhou Luo heard one of the youths with a strange mask say, “Take a seat first. There’ll be someone in a while. We’ll talk when everyone is here.”","Zhou Luo sat down on the chair and secretly sized up the two masked youths sitting not far from him.","Based on the masks alone, he could tell that the man in the white-and-blue long robe was obviously of a higher status than the man in the red-and-gold half-body armor. The former should be the Purchase With No Loss store’s owner.","At the same time, Zhou Luo felt dejected. His Iron Bone Iguana was just a Platinum IX/Fantasy I fey. It was hard to say who would win if it fought with those Diamond IV or Diamond V feys in terms of strength.","Did such strength really have a chance to fight for a future?","At that moment, the most beautiful future that Zhou Luo dreamed of was to be able to get five heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls produced from the Scorching Elemental Shellfish so that his main fey, the Iron Bone Iguana, could mutate the huge sarcoma on its neck into a second head.","Just as Zhou Luo was letting his imagination run wild, Lin Yuan had set up entry access to his Purchase With No Loss store where only Freezing Cold could enter later.","The setting of the entry access was the privilege of a private store owner on Star Web. Of course, except for stores like Lin Yuan’s store that were not worried about having buyers at all, other stores might not even use this privilege once in their lifetime.","Time flew by, and half an hour passed quickly. Lin Yuan’s eyebrows slowly frowned. The time had come to the appointed ten o’clock, but Freezing Cold didn’t appear during this appointed timing.","After another five minutes, just as Lin Yuan was ready to remove Freezing Cold’s access from entering the door, a tall and strong man walked in. He was Freezing Cold.","He scanned the room and walked to Lin Yuan before saying carefreely, “I was watching the competition video in the Star Web video library, so I was five minutes late.”","When Lin Yuan heard Freezing Cold’s careless tone, his brow furrowed even more tightly. He changed the question mark on Freezing Cold into a cross in his heart. His careless attitude showed that he didn’t take this meeting seriously at all.","Not only did it show his contempt toward Lin Yuan’s faction, but it also showed that Freezing Cold was not a punctual person.","Before Lin Yuan could say anything, Lin Yuan heard Freezing Cold speak again.","“You don’t have as much good stuff inside this little store as others have told me!","“I would like you to show me first. If it doesn’t meet my expectations, it’s not worthwhile wasting time with you here.”","Upon hearing that, Lin Yuan’s furrowed eyebrows relaxed, but he no longer placed his gaze on Freezing Cold.","Lin Yuan asked with a tone no different from usual, “Did you come to me intending to exchange this Bronze/Epic fey for your allegiance?”","Freezing Cold shook his head and replied, “Allegiance? What kind of allegiance? The allegiance oath is definitely impossible, but I can complete missions according to your orders. After completing a certain amount of missions, I’ll exchange for this Bronze/Epic lizard fey.","“If your mission is harder to complete, I can also find more king-class experts to help you complete it, but you’ll need to pay for that.","“Of course, if you’re willing to give me this Bronze/Epic lizard fey first, I can take 10% less for each mission’s payment.”","Just as Freezing Cold finished speaking, a low voice echoed.","“Give you the Bronze/Epic fey first? Are you worthy?”","Liu Jie, who was clad in red-and-gold half-armor, had stood up. Based on what Lin Yuan had just told him, Liu Jie knew that the purpose of coming to the Star Web store this time was to recruit king-class experts and let them become Sky City’s white-clothed followers.","Essentially, Lin Yuan planned to start expanding Sky City’s martial force, and he had also said that he would provide Bronze/Epic feys to the newly recruited white-clothed followers.","This was akin to saying that Lin Yuan was going to make a considerable investment into each white-clothed follower.","Probably few people would understand Lin Yuan’s wealth and overbearingness clearly more than Liu Jie, who had been with him since the earliest days.","However, this tall and strong man in front was talking big and wanted to obtain the Bronze/Epic feys first, yet he was unwilling to pledge allegiance. He was simply too greedy.","If Lin Yuan took out the Bronze/Epic fey, he could hire a pinnacle king-class expert squad to go on a mission. Rather than hiring such a king-class expert without a sense of time to do multiple missions, it was still better to hire a king-class expert squad.","Freezing Cold showed a dissatisfied look on his face.","“This is just a Star Web store. If I hadn’t heard from someone before that you’ve sold any species of Bronze/Epic feys in this store, I wouldn’t have thought of coming to your place to do odd jobs. Your Star Web store is still far from our Huge Axe Mercenaries!”","Liu Jie’s face became even gloomier. On the other hand, Lin Yuan was not angry but just a little dumbfounded.","Lin Yuan had always been used to treating other factions as leeks and would always harvest them like crazy with the items produced in his Spirit Lock spatial zone.","But this time, a king-class expert, who obviously had a faction that he had pledged allegiance to, wanted to come to his Purchase With No Loss store to take up missions to reap the benefits for himself. Freezing Cold wanted to reap his leeks and also earn the price difference as a broker.","Speaking of the Huge Axe Mercenaries, Lin Yuan had learned about all the factions from Wen Yu, but there was really no such name.","Lin Yuan glanced at Liu Jie and asked, “Big Brother Liu, have you heard of the Huge Axe Mercenaries?”","Liu Jie shook his head and looked at Freezing Cold with an even gloomier gaze."]},{"number":421,"title":"Chapter 421: Huge Axe Mercenaries","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan turned his head and looked at the man, who had come in first and sat on the chair, before asking, “Zhou Luo, have you heard of the Huge Axe Mercenaries?”","Zhou Luo had always felt that he didn’t have the slightest sense of existence, but he didn’t expect to be called by the youth with the strange mask now.","He quickly answered, “Of course, I’ve heard of the Huge Axe Mercenaries. It’s a very powerful faction with 11 king-class experts, the strongest of which is said to be just a hair’s breadth away from being a pinnacle king-class expert.”","Lin Yuan nodded at his words. From the number and strength of the king-class experts, the Huge Axe Mercenaries should be considered a veteran and rising faction.","Just by hearing the word ‘mercenaries’, it was clear that the role of this rising faction was to be hired to complete missions and obtain supplies. It was a rising faction that relied on martial force.","It was now almost New Year’s and in time for the Radiance Federation’s S Tournament season. The Huge Axe Mercenaries probably could not receive any missions now, so Freezing Cold had begun to come out to do odd jobs as a member.","Lin Yuan couldn’t help but feel that what Zhou Luo had said earlier about the strongest expert in the Huge Axe Mercenaries being a hair’s breadth away from being a pinnacle king-class expert was interesting.","The pinnacle king-class didn’t refer to a specific rank, but all king-class experts who had Diamond VIII/Fantasy III feys and above could be called pinnacle king-class experts.","Therefore, this introduction of being a hair’s breadth away from being a pinnacle king-class expert was somewhat confusing.","The Huge Axe Mercenaries were probably introducing themselves to the outside world, hoping to take on more missions.","Such mercenary factions that gathered king-class experts had very fierce competition because they let their strength speak for them, so it was obvious at a glance which faction had better business.","Just as Zhou Luo had just finished speaking, he didn’t expect to be immediately targeted by the tall and strong man beside him.","“A few days ago, my big brother became a pinnacle king-class expert. What do you mean by being a hair’s breadth away from being a pinnacle king-class expert?”","Zhou Luo was rendered speechless.","I’m not a member of the Huge Axe Mercenaries. Who would keep an eye on the latest news of the Huge Axe Mercenaries all the time?","What has it got to do with me whether your Huge Axe Mercenaries have any pinnacle king-class experts?","Lin Yuan looked at Freezing Cold, who was standing there, obviously a bit angry, and said, “Since you can’t give me your allegiance, I can’t give you a future either. You don’t need to waste your time.”","When Freezing Cold heard that, his expression stiffened, and he immediately became reluctant.","“My time is also worthless. It doesn’t matter if I waste it. I guess he’s also a king-class expert that you invited.","“I’d like to see if I’m unsuitable, or he’s unsuitable. You’re running a store. You can’t drive people away, right?”","Zhou Luo, who was sitting on the chair, felt a little puzzled. Why is this strong man targeting me once again?","Oh my god! This strong man doesn’t have any improper thoughts about me, does he!?","Liu Jie’s fists had clenched up, and he glanced at Lin Yuan. His eyes were conveying the message: ‘I’ll blast him out if you agree’.","Lin Yuan shook his head at Liu Jie and then replied indifferently to Freezing Cold, “You can stay as long as you want. Your entry access is open, so you can leave anytime you get tired of staying.”","Lin Yuan thought, I won’t drive anyone away from my store.","However, I’ll set the entry access and block all the customers outside without allowing them to come in.","After saying that, Lin Yuan would not spend any more energy on Freezing Cold, who was standing at the side.","Since Freezing Cold couldn’t become a member of the white-clothed followers, Lin Yuan did not need to put effort into Freezing Cold.","Lin Yuan said to Zhou Luo, who was sitting on the stool, “You’ve heard what we said just now. If I can pour resources into you so that you grow quickly, would you be willing to offer your allegiance to me?”","Upon hearing that, Zhou Luo nodded without hesitation. He had heard the conversation between Lin Yuan and Freezing Cold, so he naturally knew that offering his allegiance meant swearing with the Willpower Rune and issuing an allegiance oath.","Only through this way could he most directly express his allegiance and let the other party pour resources into him without worrying.","Although what one gave might not necessarily be proportional to what one received, there would certainly be no returns without giving something. Zhou Luo understood this principle.","Given the current situation, if he could find a faction to rely on, he wouldn’t have to suffer anymore.","However, Zhou Luo didn’t know how much resources this masked youth in front of him would pour into him in the future.","In fact, he wasn’t the most worried about much he could get after his allegiance, but whether the youth wearing a strange mask would accept his allegiance.","Zhou Luo was still not confident about the strength of his main fey, the Iron Bone Iguana. He took a deep breath and said with some apprehension, “Do you think I meet the requirements with my strength?”","Zhou Luo clearly understood that he never had the qualifications to be picky when he wanted to join a faction. He could only quietly wait for others to pick him.","Lin Yuan didn’t care about the weakness of Zhou Luo’s main fey, which he remembered was a Platinum IX/Fantasy I defense-type Iron Bone Iguana.","The only thing that Zhou Luo had written in his information was that this Platinum IX/Fantasy I Iron Bone Iguana had a mutation at its neck that would affect some body movements, thus affecting its strength to a certain extent.","Since Zhou Luo was right in front of him, Lin Yuan also wanted to see what exactly had gone wrong with his Iron Bone Iguana.","If the strength of Zhou Luo’s main fey, the Iron Bone Iguana, was seriously affected by the mutation at the neck, Zhou Luo would be a burden to Lin Yuan.","After all, Zhou Luo’s main fey was already weak, and the mutation affected it at its neck, so it was hard for him to get the resources to nurture a new fey.","In this case, even if Lin Yuan gave Zhou Luo a Bronze/Epic fey, Zhou Luo would still need Lin Yuan’s investment if he wanted to become stronger. Lin Yuan would not do such a losing deal.","He said, “Summon your main fey out for me to see.”","Upon hearing that, Zhou Luo clearly hesitated for a moment. Then he took a deep breath, channeled his spiritual energy, and summoned the Iron Bone Iguana.","The moment Zhou Luo summoned his Iron Bone Iguana, Lin Yuan’s eyes were fixed on its neck. It wasn’t that he deliberately stared at its neck. Rather, the sarcoma was too obvious, as it was one-quarter of its head.","This made Lin Yuan suddenly think of a dish—potatoes in a pressure cooker."]},{"number":422,"title":"Chapter 422: I’m Willing","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","After the Iron Bone Iguana was summoned, it seemed to have felt uncomfortable with its neck and started to habitually shake its neck. Since the huge bump grew on the right side of the neck, it was clearly a considerable burden for it.","This situation made the Iron Bone Iguana, a defense-type fey, unable to quickly respond to attacks on the right side of its body when defending.","Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to check the Iron Bone Iguana’s attributes.","[Fey Name]: Iron Bone Iguana","[Fey Species]: Iguanidae/Huge Iguana","[Fey Grade]: Platinum (9/10)","[Fey Type]: Earth","[Fey Quality]: Fantasy I","Lin Yuan found that there was nothing wrong with the Iron Bone Iguana’s basic attributes. However, his pupils shrank when he saw the True Data about the cause of the mutation at the neck of the Iron Bone Iguana.","It could be said that this Iron Bone Iguana was giving itself a ladder toward the peak through mutation. But as the Iron Bone Iguana’s contractor, Zhou Luo was not in a position to send it to the bottom of the mountain peak and let it climb against the mountain peak.","As for the pure fire-element energy needed to make this Iron Bone Iguana undergo metamorphosis, as stated in True Data, Lin Yuan had a lot.","The Scorching Elemental Shellfish in Morbius’ Spirit Lock spatial zone would produce an elemental pearl containing pure fire-element energy every few minutes.","However, the main flower of the Heaven and Earth Fey, the Twin Red Pagoda, was not as powerful as the Floating Island Whale at the absorption of the fire-element energy.","The speed of the elemental pearls produced by the Scorching Elemental Shellfish was faster than that of the absorption by the Twin Red Pagoda’s main flower.","So every once in a while, Lin Yuan had to collect these elemental pearls that contained pure fire-element energy, and he had collected nearly 500 of them.","These elemental pearls were also considered to be his rarer resource reserves at present.","At this time, Lin Yuan heard a peal of loud and unrestrained laughter. He saw Freezing Cold pointing at the Iron Bone Iguana with a disdainful face and said, “I didn’t expect you to have an affinity toward lizard-species feys like me. However, this deformed lizard of yours is too weak! My fey can bite it to death with just one bite.”","After saying that, Freezing Cold circulated his spiritual energy and summoned his two lizard-species main feys.","Zhou Luo’s Iron Bone Iguana was seven meters long because it was a Huge Iguana genus. However, in front of the two feys that Freezing Cold summoned, the Iron Bone Iguana instantly became very tiny.","Although the Bucktooth Terror Skink’s body length was also seven meters, it looked very strong. Its bulging muscles and mouth full of sharp teeth were enough to show its valiant attack power.","Even though the other Swordtooth Lizard Dragon’s grade and quality were inferior to the Bucktooth Terror Skink, the Swordtooth Lizard Dragon was nearly 12 meters long and had an intimidating aura unique to a dragon-species fey.","Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to check these two lizard-species feys’ attributes.","[Fey Name]: Bucktooth Terror Skink","[Fey Species]: Tyrant Lizard/Toothed Lizard","[Fey Grade]: Diamond (3/10)","[Fey Type]: Metal","[Fey Quality]: Fantasy II","...","[Fey Name]: Swordtooth Lizard Dragon","[Fey Species]: Sword Dragon/Toothed Lizard","[Fey Grade]: Diamond (1/10)","[Fey Type]: Earth/Metal","[Fey Quality]: Fantasy II","When Lin Yuan was done checking the attributes of the two lizard-species feys that Freezing Cold had summoned, he felt that this Diamond I/Fantasy II Swordtooth Lizard Dragon was really good.","It had a very high degree of dragon-species bloodline stimulation. If it was lucky enough to become a Myth Breed in the future, it could probably advance into a true ancient dragon species.","Freezing Cold saw Lin Yuan looking at his summoned feys and immediately withdrew them back. Then he also gave Lin Yuan a somewhat cautious look.","If one summoned feys that were Gold and above in other people’s Star Web stores without the store owner’s permission, one would be subjected to punishment if the store owner reported it.","The lightest punishment would be to have one’s Star Web account banned for two days, while the more serious ones would be for a month.","Freezing Cold didn’t want to bear such punishments. He had summoned his two feys mainly to taunt Zhou Luo’s main fey, the Iron Bone Iguana.","When Freezing Cold saw that Lin Yuan had no intention of reporting him, he continued to mockingly glance at the Iron Bone Iguana on the ground.","He scanned the bulging sarcoma on its neck twice before he contemptuously glanced at Zhou Luo and whistled.","At that moment, Liu Jie, who was sitting next to Lin Yuan, admired Lin Yuan’s magnanimity.","Even though there had been no news of him for three years, and he had been used to seeing the change of human emotions and had humbly felt this real world, he still couldn’t control his temper.","However, Lin Yuan had a calm expression, as if he didn’t care about Freezing Cold’s rudeness and rashness.","Zhou Luo was taunted, and his expression turned livid. This undisguised contempt only made Zhou Luo feel a hard stabbing pain inside.","However, he didn’t fight back with words but glanced at Lin Yuan and said firmly, “If you can really give me a future so that I have a chance to become stronger, I’m willing to swear with the Willpower Rune and issue a servant oath.”","As Zhou Luo said these words, a thought suddenly came to his mind.","Should he ask if he could get five heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls produced by the Scorching Elemental Shellfish?","But when he thought of the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, which the retainer knight of the Class 4 Creation Master, Master Duan Li, had said before that even Master Duan Li couldn’t get, he forcibly held back the hope and request of getting the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","When Freezing Cold, who had still wanted to taunt Zhou Luo, heard Zhou Luo’s words, he subconsciously froze. There were three kinds of allegiance oaths—protector oath, retainer oath, and servant oath.","Generally, when king-class experts swore by a Willpower Rune and issued an allegiance oath, most of them sign a protector oath, while few would sign retainer oaths.","Very few of them were willing to sign a servant oath with a Willpower Rune and put their entire life on a faction or a certain person.","Although a person could only issue an allegiance oath once in their life, due to the different types of allegiance oaths issued, the status and degree of freedom in the faction to which one was loyal were completely different."]},{"number":423,"title":"Chapter 423: I’ll Solve It for You","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Freezing Cold didn’t think that Zhou Luo was really crazy. King-class experts at the bottom were exceptionally shrewd because it was hard for them to obtain resources.","Freezing Cold stared at the two masked youths for a moment and carefully looked at the empty Star Web store.","He couldn’t help but suspect that the Star Web store that his Huge Axe Mercenaries comrades had introduced to him to try his luck and see if he could get high-quality Bronze feys by doing odd jobs had a deep background.","When Freezing Cold usually logged onto Star Web, he would spend half of the time on the Celestial Stairway duels and the other half in the Celestial Stairway video library, watching the duel videos. He rarely visited the Star Web forum and never paid attention to some Star Web stores’ gossip.","At that moment, Freezing Cold felt that after returning to the Huge Axe Mercenaries, he had to ask his comrades what this Star Web store was all about.","However, he still thought that maybe he was overthinking it. Maybe he should poke and prod a little.","Lin Yuan was a little surprised to hear Zhou Luo’s words. Zhou Luo actually didn’t directly make a request. Instead, he only said that he would be willing to issue the servant oath if he could help him become stronger.","Although Zhou Luo did not say it, Lin Yuan understood that before Zhou Luo would swear to himself with the Willpower Rune, he had to show what he could give to Zhou Luo.","Just as Lin Yuan was about to give Zhou Luo a promise, Freezing Cold said, “Even if things don’t work out for me, you should take out the Bronze/Epic lizard-species feys that I requested before and let me take a look!”","Hearing Freezing Cold talk about the Bronze/Epic lizard-species feys, Zhou Luo widened his eyes at once, and his breathing became heavier.","Lin Yuan ignored Freezing Cold’s words. Instead, he looked at Zhou Luo and asked, “Your affinity is also toward lizard-species feys, right?”","Zhou Luo nodded at his words.","Lin Yuan waved his hand and summoned a lizard with a body length of nearly four meters and three huge bone plates on its body. Its huge dark-purple bone plate was pointed up. Spirit-snake-like black energy was swimming above the huge bone plate like a drawing board.","This lizard fey’s sharp teeth were like the venomous teeth of a snake fey.","However, when the lizard was summoned and erected its three huge bone plates and roared, its sharp teeth instantly ejected, and the fine hollow sharp teeth wrapped around its lower jaw.","Although the roar was the hissing sound of lizard feys, it was sharper and had the unique intimidation of dragon-species feys.","The moment Zhou Luo saw this lizard fey, he felt his brain rapidly filled with blood, making him a little dizzy. Such an incredible lizard fey that had awakened its dragon-species bloodline at Bronze/Legend was legendary and rare! He was actually lucky to see such a fey in this life!","Based on the youth wearing the strange mask, it seemed that he was going to give this fey to himself.","Lin Yuan found that after he summoned the Dark Snake Dragon Lizard, Zhou Luo’s eyes never left it. He knew that Zhou Luo liked this lizard-species fey, so he said, “This Dark Snake Dragon Lizard is considered a little superior.","“Its exclusive skill, Darkened Body, can effectively help it resist physical damage and increase its movement speed. At the same time, it gives some enhancements to its dark-type abilities.","“Since you’ve chosen to serve me, this Dark Snake Dragon Lizard is the future that I’ll give you.”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Zhou Luo’s heart pounded even more violently. Extreme excitement and ecstasy surged to his heart.","Although he had guessed it before, he still felt a bit in disbelief now. This young man wearing a strange mask had actually given such a superior Bronze/Epic fey after he decided to pledge his allegiance.","It was simply a great deal!","When Freezing Cold saw this Dark Snake Dragon Lizard, he felt that he had managed to give up a small goal and had lost 100,000,000.","He had actually given a superior fey like the Dark Snake Dragon Lizard, just like that, to this king-class expert, whose main fey was so pitifully weak and deformed.","Freezing Cold felt that such behavior was simply a defeat.","If this Dark Snake Dragon Lizard was given to him, he would be qualified to try his luck at Ascending Dragon City’s Long family with two dragon-species feys. At the same time, he could be sure that he had underestimated this Star Web store’s background.","Zhou Luo had slowly calmed down from his excitement and hurriedly stood up from the stool before he respectfully said to Lin Yuan, “Master, Zhou Luo is at your disposal from now on.”","When Lin Yuan heard Zhou Luo’s words, the corners of his mouth under the strange mask curved up.","“Come over right away to the Royal Capital according to the address I sent you. After you swear with the Willpower Rune, you can also take this Dark Snake Dragon Lizard and nurture it early.”","As Zhou Luo was about to thank him, Lin Yuan added, “The sarcoma on your Iron Bone Iguana’s neck is mutating in a good direction. It just needs extremely pure fire-element energy to prompt the completion of its mutation. When you come to the Royal Capital, I can solve it for you.”","Zhou Luo’s body trembled from the pleasant surprise. At this time, he was far more surprised than he was when he knew he was going to get the Dark Snake Dragon Lizard.","Zhou Luo could be said to have lived with the Iron Bone Iguana since a young age. In order to survive, it was unknown how many times they had experienced life and death together.","Zhou Luo didn’t have other feys, so he had poured all his feelings into the Iron Bone Iguana. It could be said that the Iron Bone Iguana was akin to his life.","Zhou Luo’s face was red with excitement, and his lips were trembling a little as he said, “Master, you have heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls?”","Zhou Luo was also bewildered. Master Duan Li had discovered the Iron Bone Iguana’s mutation only after some examination.","However, that young man wearing a strange mask had seen right through the real reason for the sarcoma on the Iron Bone Iguana’s neck with a single glance.","Lin Yuan was slightly stunned when he heard Zhou Luo talk about the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls. Then he remembered what Gao Feng had said before. After the Elemental Shellfish were induced to mutate, the elemental pearls they produced were divided into several grades depending on the purity of the aura absorbed.","The heavenly-maiden-grade was the highest grade of the elemental pearls.","Since the elemental pearls in his hands absorbed the spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, it could be said that the purity was almost 100%. The heavenly-maiden-grade was also a supreme existence.","Lin Yuan had previously thought that Zhou Luo did not know the cause of the sarcoma on the Iron Bone Iguana’s neck, but he did not expect Zhou Luo to know about it very well.","“Yes, I’ve some heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls that contain fire-element energy produced by the Scorching Elemental Shellfish.”"]},{"number":424,"title":"Chapter 424: Being Surrounded by Bigwigs","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","When Freezing Cold saw that the Purchase With No Loss store owner gave the Dark Snake Dragon Lizard to Zhou Luo, he couldn’t help but sigh that the store was not simple. After all, who knew if the store owner had this Bronze/Epic Dark Snake Dragon Lizard by chance before?","However, the concentration of spirit qi needed for the formation of the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls could only be achieved by Class 4 Creation Masters and above.","This also meant that this 1-Star Star Web store must have at least a Class 4 Creation Master behind it.","What shocked Freezing Cold was that the Purchase With No Loss store owner was actually willing to save this deformed lizard with such a rare heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearl.","He always had deep feelings for the Huge Axe Mercenaries. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have been willing to issue an allegiance oath to them.","However, he couldn’t help but think if he hadn’t issued an allegiance oath to the Huge Axe Mercenaries with a Willpower Rune, would all the good stuff be his now?","At that moment, Lin Yuan’s first recruitment of white-clothed followers was also considered to have ended.","He had only recruited Zhou Luo this time, and Zhou Luo’s strength was still very weak. However, after his Iron Bone Iguana absorbed the pure fire-element energy from the elemental pearls to complete its mutation, it would get a huge boost.","When the sarcoma on its neck completely mutated and grew a new head, Zhou Luo could completely rely on the resources earned by the Iron Bone Iguana to raise the Dark Snake Dragon Lizard without having Lin Yuan worry anymore.","Lin Yuan turned and said to Liu Jie, “Big Brother Liu, Zhou Luo will be the first warrior under you from now on.”","Upon hearing that, Liu Jie replied solemnly, “Leave it to me!”","During this period, it could be said that Liu Jie had been watching everyone in the mansion and was constantly busy with Sky City, but only he had nothing to do. He could now finally take up the responsibility to do his part for Sky City and Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan turned his gaze to Freezing Cold and said, “We’re leaving. Do you still want to stroll around in this store?”","As he spoke, Lin Yuan opened the entry access of his Star Web store.","Just as Freezing Cold was a little embarrassed and wanted to speak, he noticed that a lot of people suddenly came into the store, and he knew two of them. These two people were the true bigwigs.","Lin Yuan didn’t expect that when he opened the entry access, over 30 people would come in at once. Among these 30 people, he found that almost all of them were from the fan club.","He immediately knew that the violent-tempered woman should have told the fan club she had seen him in front of the store.","Lin Yuan lurked as much as possible in his Purchase With No Loss store’s fan club, but he didn’t expect over 30 bigwigs would come into his Star Web store.","Zhou Luo, who was caught in surprise and excitement, was ready to log off Star Web and go to the Royal Capital as agreed.","Unexpectedly, when he recovered from the pleasant surprise, he was a little confused at the sudden appearance of so many people.","Had he lost his memory from being too pleasantly surprised?","At that moment, Zhou Luo heard a kind voice. “I can’t believe I saw you again after a day, kid.”","Upon hearing this voice, Zhou Luo turned. He was first surprised before he hurriedly gave a salute and replied, “Master Duan Li, I didn’t expect to meet you here.”","The old woman, who was called Master Duan Li, also looked at Zhou Luo with some surprise. She seemed to be guessing why Zhou Luo would appear in this Purchase With No Loss store.","She had found Zhou Luo’s presence when she entered the store. Did he have any connections with this store?","Immediately after that, Master Duan Li dismissed this thought. If Zhou Luo really had connections with this Star Web store, his main fey wouldn’t be such an Iron Bone Iguana.","Zhou Luo felt goosebumps as Master Duan Li sized him up.","When did he deserve to have an intermediate Class 4 Creation Master spending so many thoughts on him?","Zhou Luo hurriedly found a topic and said, “Thank you, Master Duan Li, for letting your retainer knight give me some advice.”","Master Duan Li kindly patted Zhou Luo’s shoulder and replied, “Your fey affinity is toward lizard-species feys, and most of them are better at attacking.","“You might as well find and contract a Bronze/Flawless power offense-type lizard-species fey first and nurture more new feys later on when you have resources.”","Zhou Luo glanced at Master Duan Li gratefully. He knew that she wanted to tell him to stop nurturing his Iron Bone Iguana. As long as it didn’t complete its mutation, not only would it not have the slightest potential, but it would also affect its combat power.","However, since the Iron Bone Iguana’s mutation had been resolved, Zhou Luo looked at the youth wearing a strange mask, who was surrounded by the crowd not far away, for a long time before he said to Master Duan Li, “Master, my Iron Bone Iguana’s mutation problem has been solved.”","A touch of shock flashed across Master Duan Li’s benevolent face. She also looked into the distance along with Zhou Luo’s gaze and landed her eyes on the youth wearing the strange mask.","Yesterday, Zhou Luo had just learned about his Iron Bone Iguana’s mutation problem, but it had now been solved, and it was in this small store. The reason for this was self-explanatory.","Lin Yuan felt he was simply going to be emptied by these bigwigs. The number of Flower Brocade Pearls they wanted to buy added up to 200, and there was still a new group of bigwigs applying to trade with him over and over again.","Among them, Lin Yuan found that the one who needed the most number of Flower Brocade Pearls were not Creation Masters.","This meant that these Creation Masters that needed a lot of Brocade Pearls either had a huge faction behind them, or they purely wanted to store up a batch of goods, sell them at a high price when they were in demand in the market, and become a middleman happily earning the price difference.","Lin Yuan didn’t promise to trade the Flower Brocade Pearls that these people needed. Since he wanted to solidify the strength of the fan club’s connections, the best way was to conduct an auction of group welfare every once in a while.","Rare things were dear. Satisfying one person at a time was the best option for dealing with these tight resources.","Lin Yuan winked at Liu Jie, who was at the side, indicating that Liu Jie would leave with him later. Then he spoke to this group of bigwigs besides him."]},{"number":425,"title":"Chapter 425: Eight Pages Council","paragraphs":["“Everyone can @ me or send me a private message in the group if there’s anything. There’ll be group welfare every once in a while. I hope everyone will bid sensibly.”","At that moment, a tall woman standing beside Lin Yuan said flirtatiously, “Master admin, you don’t intend for your group welfare to always be Flower Brocade Pearls, right? That would be very boring~!”","As this woman spoke, the bigwigs, including Lin Yuan, got goosebumps.","Lin Yuan thought, Oh my goodness! Is this the legendary acting coy to overcome toughness?","Lin Yuan cleared his throat and answered sternly, “Since you think it’s boring, we’ll change into something else. The next group welfare will be 10 heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls produced from the Scorching Elemental Shellfish.”","After saying that, Lin Yuan and Liu Jie looked at each other and left the Star Web store together.","A hint of dismay appeared on the face of that flamboyant and tall woman.","Have I been made fun of?","How dare someone do that!?","I’m a woman who has killed 32 husbands, 16 boyfriends, 27 male besties, and 81 men with ambiguous relationships!","Lin Yuan’s words sent the bigwigs in the Purchase With No Loss store into an uproar. The next group welfare turned out to be 10 heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls!","Although these 10 heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls were all fire-type elemental pearls produced by the Scorching Elemental Shellfish, any type of elemental pearls of the same purity could be exchanged. As long as the news was posted on Star Web, it would be very easy to find the next home for it.","The heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls and the Flower Brocade Pearls were not on the same level.","There were actually such unexpected benefits for trapping the group admin inside the Star Web store this time.","It seemed that doing it more often greatly benefited the group welfare.","At the same time, many people thought of what Lin Yuan had said about bidding sensibly, and they cursed, That’s easy for you to say!","One heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearl is enough to cause people to go crazy. How can we be sensible if you take out 10 of them at once?","If we can be sensible in the face of 10 heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, then it’s really too irrational!","Not long after, when the bigwigs in Lin Yuan’s Star Web store left, they were all eager, obviously determined to get those ten heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","Only Freezing Cold was left in the store, shivering weakly, pathetically, and helplessly.","After Lin Yuan logged off Star Web, he pondered.","Given the Purchase With No Loss store’s current popularity, it’s a bit hard to carry out the plan of white-clothed followers and recruit king-class experts.","This was also why Lin Yuan was willing to take out 10 heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls for the group welfare auction.","He had done so in order to let this matter spread to Star Web and increase his Purchase With No Loss store’s popularity.","Lin Yuan was also unwilling to sell the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls on Star Web through the blind trade like the Flower Brocade Pearls.","For him, the blind trade was now a threshold to enter his Purchase With No Loss store’s fan club. After all, he had to reap the better benefits so that he could enjoy them!","...","On a huge island struck by the waves, a radiant light rose even in the day that came from the land on the island, where it was full of various gemstones.","Eight different lofty towers stood tall on this land with various gemstones. In front of each sharp tower were 32 Chanters kneeling on the ground as they chanted softly, with a Lead Chanter in front of them leading a pious song.","A bridge was erected on top of the eight different sharp towers, with a floating garden in the air where the eight bridges converged.","The floating garden had a variety of strange-shaped wax figures that were incomplete and even a little badly damaged. Some wax figures were even completely damaged.","However, these wax figures seemed to contain some kind of laws.","Most of the wax figures were some feys, and there were also a few humans, of course.","Each wax figure had a small fountain next to it. The clear water spraying from the fountain landed on the wax figure, making the color of the wax statue more vivid, causing the aura of that law to become stronger.","The law in the wax figure was only stronger for a moment, as if the aura of these laws was stripped from these wax figures into the clear water splashes.","These clear water splashes landed on the fountain and the cycle repeated.","In the middle of the floating garden was a huge round table with eight seats in pairs placed beside it, and they were on equal footing. A figure was sitting on each seat at the moment, and these eight figures were different, all with monstrous power.","But now, the power of the other seven was focused on one of them. The person they pointed to had long blond hair to the shoulders with eyes tightly closed and a solemn look.","This woman with long blond hair suddenly opened her eyes and revealed her golden pupils. There seemed to be a war after war in progress in her golden pupils.","The radiance and tragic defeat of the war didn’t stir up the emotions in her eyes.","Her golden pupils glanced at the other seven figures without the slightest emotion, and a pitying and mocking voice sounded.","“The decision that you’ve made together is nothing but my plan to implement the Tower of War.","“Speaking of Cheng Wu, this mole in the Radiance Federation was buried by Third Page Eternal Sin.","“Not only did he serve no purpose at all, but he also alerted them and foiled my plans.”","Just as Seventh Page War said that several peals of yandere laughter sounded.","“Seventh Page War, Cheng Wu revealing his identity has nothing to do with me. Don’t bring me into this.”","The short-haired woman with hollow eyes spoke. However, the occasional light in her empty eyes seemed to contain all the evil in the world.","Seventh Page War glanced at this short-haired woman and ignored her words before saying, “I’ll immediately go and get back that sacred source lifeform from the Radiance Federation.”","Just as the hollow-eyed short-haired woman was about to say something, a pleasant, cute prepubescent young boy’s voice sounded. However, the voice was coming from a huge mass of strange flesh.","“Sister Third Page, you have a filthy mouth! I can smell it from here. Would it kill you if you didn’t target others?”","This most innocent voice spoke the mean words as if they were like the truth, allowing one to feel convinced.","The evil light in the short-haired woman’s hollow eyes flickered constantly, and she spoke with a delicate laugh."]},{"number":426,"title":"Chapter 426: Why Are You Spying on Me Studying Again!","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“Fifth Page Truth, you’re always in a layer of rotten meat all day long. Can you even smell the stench? Why don’t you let me make this rotten meat into a small black house that will trap you forever?”","The short-haired woman’s face had a grim expression as she spoke, making her delicate features terrifying.","At that moment, a light cough made Third Page Eternal Sin and Fifth Page Truth immediately stern.","A young girl wearing thick lenses and looking like a girl-next-door stood up and said as if chanting, “The beings parasitized by the seeds of my Gardener Konjac in the Radiance Federation can act in cooperation with Seventh Page War.”","A hint of disgust colored the voice of Seventh Page War that contained pity and mockery. “Second Page Revival, I don’t need you to cooperate with my actions.”","The girl-next-door-like girl glanced at Seventh Page War with some aggravation, and her chanting tone suddenly changed as if she was chanting a dirge. “I’m also afraid that Seventh Page War’s War Knell and Radiance War Chariot will be cracked by the Moon Empress again.”","Speaking of this, the girl-next-door-like girl seemed to have a sudden realization.","“By the way, I forgot! Seventh Page War’s sacred source lifeform, the War Knell and Radiance War Chariot, have already advanced. Seventh Page War will take back that sacred source lifeform from the Radiance Federation alone.”","After saying that, Second Page Revival changed the topic and said to the gloomy man sitting in a twisted snake-like posture next to Third Page Eternal Sin, “The laws in those 300 wax figures in the sky garden are already going to be cleaned by the Cleansing Spring. The materials for the new batch of wax figures are prepared. Eighth Page Apoptosis, you should get the new batch of wax figures done as soon as possible!”","The gloomy man who sat twisted like a snake shrugged, and a nervous smile crept on his face. However, he didn’t let out any laughter. His mouth opened wide, and he replied silently with an “Okay”.","...","Lin Yuan was currently sitting on the water rhinoceros leather sofa in the hall while going through his cell phone, ready to log onto Star Web to check his gains from the blind trade a while later, as well as the auction of the 30 Flower Brocade Pearls for the group welfare.","He opened the offline forum on his cell phone that he hadn’t been on for a while and found that the foolish online friend who had been bitten by the Ghost Shadow Bristled Spider had sent him a message.","“People like you will certainly fail Fey Observation and Spiritual Ingredient Analysis exams!”","When Lin Yuan saw this message, he curled his lips.","What message did I send last time? Why did I get such a vicious curse!?","Lin Yuan thought back for a while and found that he couldn’t remember at all. However, he was unresigned at her saying he would fail them.","When he had taken the Creation Master’s exam, he had scored 100 marks for both Fey Observation and Spiritual Ingredient Analysis.","Although he had relied on Genius at that time, he often wore its Tool Transformation mask and shared the knowledge it learned. He had vaguely integrated that knowledge. Therefore, he couldn’t fail those two.","During this period, he was also frantically learning some knowledge that a high-class Creation Master required. He deliberately cultivated the habit of studying, and even if he was busy, he had to learn something new every day.","This was because when the knowledge learned was placed in his head for a long time, it would become an experience.","After thinking for a while, Lin Yuan replied to this online friend, “I can pass even if I know nothing about Spiritual Ingredient Analysis and Fey Observation.”","Lin Yuan found that in just a moment’s time, this online friend answered back.","“How’s that possible? You guess all of them?”","When Lin Yuan saw this reply, he replied to her, “Anyway, whether it’s Spiritual Ingredient Analysis or Fey Observation, the multiple-choice questions are 60 marks. Also, I have good listening skills, so I can hear the answers of other people’s multiple-choice questions.”","“???","“Then how did you hear the answers to the multiple-choice questions? How do you choose between ABCD?”","Lin Yuan answered without even thinking, “A is three strokes, C is one stroke, while B and D are two strokes. However, D is written faster than B.”","After Lin Yuan replied, he noticed that this online friend, who had been bitten by the Ghost Shadow Bristled Spider, had sent six points and replied, “I’ll try it on the next exam.”","After writing that, she ignored him.","Lin Yuan was a little dumbfounded that someone would believe such words.","If you can hear the sound of a specific person writing in the examination room among so many people writing, then you’re simply a god!","Even if you can hear it clearly, if the person in front of you has all the wrong answers for the multiple-choice questions, that’s really a human tragedy.","Lin Yuan could imagine this online friend would curse him later, so he decided to blacklist this online friend. He felt he was simply too smart to take precautions!","At present, in a large mansion, a short-haired girl was holding a pen, writing in a small book: ‘A is three strokes, C is one stroke, B and D are two strokes, and D is written faster than B.’","After she finished writing, she felt that the Spiritual Ingredient Analysis course and Fey Observation course that she had been reviewing seriously were a bit of an eyesore.","At that moment, there was a knock on the door. Just as the short-haired girl was about to open the door, she found a head poking in, and she immediately said indignantly, “Dad, why did you come to spy on me studying again!?”","The middle-aged man, who was holding a few pieces of clothes in his hand, replied with some aggravation, “Darling, your mother asked me to take you out for a meal. How could I possibly spy on you studying?","“Spying on your studies is your mother’s job. I’m only responsible for earning and supporting the family.”","The short-haired girl couldn’t help but roll her eyes. “I have to be told off 800 times a year by my mother, and there were at least 750 times that you snitched.”","The middle-aged man hurriedly answered righteously, “Don’t be ridiculous. Out of the 800 times you were told off, there were 60 times it was because you didn’t wear your hat in front of your mother.","“That’s not me snitching.”","As soon as the short-haired girl saw the small bumblebee hat in the middle-aged man’s hand, she immediately became furious and pointed at her short hair before saying, “Dad, the Ghost Shadow Bristled Spider’s toxins have long been removed. My hair has also grown out, and I’m not bald! Don’t give me a hat anymore!”","The short-haired girl suddenly said mysteriously, “Dad, don’t you need heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls? I can get them, but you have to promise me never to snitch on me to mom again.”","When the middle-aged man heard this, he couldn’t help but smile. “Darling is the best. I’m happy that you have this thought.”","The short-haired girl only felt helpless.","“Dad, I’m 16 years old. I’m no longer a child.”","The middle-aged man lovingly packed up the books on the table and said, “Darling has grown up. You know how to make dad happy.”","The short-haired girl only felt how good it would be to be bitten to death by the Ghost Shadow Bristled Spider back then so that she wouldn’t have to suffer from this anger."]},{"number":427,"title":"Chapter 427: Regardless of Whether It’s a Dragon’s Lair or Tiger’s Den","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan logged onto Star Web and checked the gains from the blind trade of 10 Flower Brocade Pearls. At first glance, even though he had already had expectations in his heart, he was still taken aback. The number of mid-grade strange flames he obtained had reached as many as 440.","Previously, he had used 10 Flower Brocade Pearls to exchange for 100 mid-grade strange flames, and the price itself was higher than the market price.","However, the auctioned Flower Brocade Pearls’ price was actually four times higher than the previous market price, which gave Lin Yuan a feeling of getting ginseng from cutting leeks.","Lin Yuan had deliberately spread the news that the next fan club welfare would be 10 heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls in his Star Web store.","At that time, the blind trade had just begun. It was unknown how many of these 440 mid-grade strange flames were drawn by the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","After the end of this blind trade, it brought in 10 more bigwigs into Lin Yuan’s fan club. The addition of new members made the fan club even more lively.","The 30 Flower Brocade Pearls in the group welfare also allowed Lin Yuan to gain a lot of rare materials.","The resources that Lin Yuan needed to build his own faction, the Sky City, couldn’t be that simple. Thanks to the resources he obtained through the group welfare auction, he could get more rare resources.","Each time the bigwigs of the group raised the price, it was equivalent to a screening. After several rounds of increasing the price, it could ensure that the resources Lin Yuan got in his hands were absolutely high quality.","Lin Yuan intended to put these resources in the Platinum fey storage box to accumulate. He would save it in preparation for building Sky City on the Floating Island Whale’s back after it hatched in June this year.","Lin Yuan silently put 10 heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls produced from the Scorching Elemental Shellfish into his fan club for display. He intended to choose a time afterward to auction off the 10 heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls on display as group welfare. It was also a fulfillment of his promise.","Then Lin Yuan logged off Star Web and wore Genius’ Tool Transformation glasses as usual.","He started to read the books about Creation Masters, and by wearing Genius’ Tool Transformation glasses to read them, Lin Yuan could very clearly imprint the knowledge into his mind.","Although Lin Yuan couldn’t reach Genius’ retentive memory with its Tool Transformation glasses, he could generally remember it as long as he read it three times.","As he read, it was as though an epiphany became clearer and clearer in his mind, as if all the knowledge was closely connected.","However, as this epiphany became clearer and clearer, Lin Yuan found that there was a vague layer of fuzziness.","No matter how Lin Yuan tried, he couldn’t point it out bluntly. Instead of being sad about it, he was very happy.","Based on the epiphany that was now becoming clearer and clearer in his heart, Lin Yuan knew that if it condensed into a Willpower Rune, it should be related to knowledge. In other words, this Willpower Rune would most likely be suitable for Genius.","For several days in a row, Lin Yuan kept himself locked up in his room and pored over books. However, the epiphany remained stagnant, which made him give up his intention to continue to bury his head in the books.","He couldn’t help but sigh. Willpower Runes can’t be forced!","In the past few days, the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s online resources had all been plundered by the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce and had utterly turned into an empty shelf.","Listen was still not anxious to carry out any huge actions. Instead, he was ready to accumulate some more objects made of completely jade-textured powder and reshape the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s path of business.","At the same time, Listen was also using Fei Qianqiong as a mole to secretly devour the online and offline resources bit by bit that the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce had given up.","The best way for a chamber of commerce to develop to the extreme was to have a presence in every kind of field and form a huge business empire in all interlocking fields.","Zhou Luo had also arrived in the Royal Capital in the past few days, sworn an allegiance oath to Lin Yuan with a Willpower Rune, and become his servant.","At the same time, after Lin Yuan gave him five heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, the second fire-type head of Zhou Luo’s Iron Bone Iguana finally grew.","This newly grown head activated the fire-type energy in the earth-type Iron Bone Iguana’s body, and the fire-type and earth-type energy fused and turned into searing hot lava. The Iron Bone Iguana also mutated into Lava Iguana under such a fusion of elements.","Lin Yuan had also let Zhou Luo contract the Bronze/Epic lizard-species fey, Dark Snake Dragon Lizard, which had its dragon-species bloodline activated.","There were now only a few days left before the active period of the dimensional rift. Therefore, Lin Yuan felt that it was time to go to Indigo Azure City. He wanted to check the situation of the offshore coastal resources that the Zheng family wanted to seize from the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","At first, he didn’t intend to let Endless Summer follow him to Indigo Azure City this time. He only intended to bring Liu Jie, the Mother of Bloodbath, the recruited Zhou Luo, and Listen to explore a bit.","However, when Lin Yuan learned that Endless Summer had killed a pinnacle king-class expert while protecting Listen, he decided that it would be safer to bring Endless Summer along in addition to his own Path Protector, the Mother of Bloodbath, on this trip to Indigo Azure City.","After all, Indigo Azure City was the stronghold of the Zheng family’s faction.","The next morning, Lin Yuan booked a Platinum flying fey, the Long-Backed Swan. He actually wanted to book a Divine Travel Black Swallow, which was a very painful flight but much faster than the Long-Backed Swan, after all.","The Divine Travel Black Swallow was a small flying fey and could at most only take two people. Lin Yuan’s party of six people needed a larger flying fey, so he chose the Long-Backed Swan, which balanced speed and comfort.","Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, the Mother of Bloodbath, Endless Summer, and Listen were in a lotus position on the Long-Backed Swan’s back. Meanwhile, Zhou Luo was respectfully standing at the side, guarding them like a guard.","Listen told Lin Yuan about the recent news that he had about Indigo Azure City,","“I recently got someone to take a good look at the shallow near-shore sea in Indigo Azure City, which I had not been concerned about before. As a result, I lost contact with the two experts I sent there.”","Upon hearing that, Lin Yuan frowned slightly and asked, “How strong were the two experts you sent out?”","Listen gave a bitter laugh and replied, “At present, Fei Qianqiong has the strongest combat power in the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, but I don’t want to casually use him since he’s a mole.","“Thus, I sent out two experts with Platinum feys from the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce. After sending them out, they only reported to me once before there was no more news from them.","“I presume they should have died.”","From what Listen said, Lin Yuan knew that the shallow sea controlled by the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce in Indigo Azure City was not safe.","If he didn’t use his trump cards, his strength shouldn’t be much different from the two spirit qi professionals with Platinum feys that Listen had sent out.","If they had gone to the shore of the shallow sea to scout for information and had not gone deep into the sea, it would have been impossible for them to be attacked by marine feys.","Hence, these two spirit qi professionals had very likely died at the hands of other spirit qi professionals.","At that moment, Listen said, “Young Master, the first message they reported back was that there were damaged corpses of Gold water world dimensional lifeforms along the coast. I think there should be a water world dimensional rift nearby this offshore coast.”","Lin Yuan needed the Gold water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh, but he wasn’t the least happy after this piece of information. Instead, his brow furrowed even more.","Lin Yuan said in a deep voice, “Regardless of whether this shallow near-shore sea is a dragon’s lair or a tiger’s den, or if someone is coveting it, I have to see what kind of foul play is hidden in it.”"]},{"number":428,"title":"Chapter 428: Enemies in the Dark","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan was currently puzzled. How could the damaged corpses of Gold water world dimensional lifeforms appear on this shore?","After they died, their flesh would soon rot and sink to the bottom of the sea. The marine feys in the ocean consist of animal-species, plant-species, and insect-species marine feys. After the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh rot, the fishy smell would also become highly toxic.","Most of the animal-species feys among the marine feys didn’t like to eat it. However, the flesh of these dead and rotten water world dimensional lifeforms was a feast for the plant and insect-species feys among the marine feys.","Therefore, it was unusual that the flesh of Gold water world dimensional lifeforms would be found on the shore.","The only possibility Lin Yuan could think of was that the Gold water world dimensional lifeforms had been blasted to death at a location very close to the shore.","The sudden blast must have made the flesh still carry the strong cell vitality when it was detached from the Gold water world dimensional lifeforms’ bodies.","When the Gold water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh with strong cellular activity was washed to the shore by the waves, it had also happened to be discovered by the two spirit qi professionals with Platinum feys that Listen had sent out.","At the time of discovery, the cellular activity in these Gold water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh was considered to have completely disappeared. The rotting must have begun to take place, just not yet fully rotten.","Lin Yuan had seen with his own eyes the rotting speed of the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh.","When the two spirit qi professionals Listen had sent out had seen the Gold water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh at the shore, the dimensional lifeform should’ve just died.","The marine feys distributed in the coasted shallow sea were weak, so it was hard to completely block the opened water world dimensional rift. Hence, the water world dimensional lifeforms would attack the cities on the shore.","This required the spirit qi professionals living close to the shallow sea near the shore to step in to fight against the water world dimensional lifeforms that wreaked havoc on the shore.","However, what puzzled Lin Yuan the most was that Indigo Azure City’s residents were not even aware of the water world dimensional rift.","Lin Yuan pondered for a moment and asked Listen, “Are there many feys in this shallow near-shore sea under the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s control that can effectively resist the water world dimensional rift?","“Have there been any cases of water world dimensional lifeforms attacking the shore?”","Listen immediately answered, “Back then, my grandfather and father had chosen to use the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s entire resources to take control of this shallow near-shore sea because there were extremely many shellfish feys in it.","“The shells, meat, and pearls these shellfish feys contain are all high-quality resources. The shellfish feys’ attacking ability is not strong. Due to their numbers, they are the plankton’s predators.","“Therefore, most marine feys rely on shellfish feys to survive.","“The Beak-Billed Spiny Fish and the Shellfish-Eating Armored Turtles have more numbers than the rest marine feys.","“Although the Beak-Billed Spiny Fish and Shellfish-Eating Armored Turtles are ferocious when it comes to the shellfish feys, they are the water world dimensional lifeforms’ prey.","“However, due to the numerous Beak-Billed Spiny Fish, there’s also a large group of Tail-Cutting Shadow Sharks that feed on them in this sea.”","When Lin Yuan heard this, he knew that this shallow near-shore sea was very dangerous.","Unfortunately, the local marine feys were destined to be unable to effectively resist the feys that emerged from the water world dimensional rift.","The Tail-Cutting Shadow Sharks were a group of very special ferocious feys in the sea. Their existence meant that there wouldn’t be large predators in this sea.","The school of Tail-Cutting Shadow Sharks would be the first to remove any threats to their own lives in their territory.","If large predators existed in this sea, it would mean that they had killed the school of Tail-Cutting Shadow Sharks.","There was only one school of Tail-Cutting Shadow Sharks in the sea, even if they were extremely strong individually.","Due to the limited numbers, their suppressive power against the numerous water world dimensional lifeforms was too small.","Even if these Tail-Cutting Shadow Sharks were to madly kill, they could not wipe out a small half of the water world dimensional lifeforms.","At that moment, Listen added, “In the earlier years, this shallow near-shore sea would be invaded by water world dimensional lifeforms once or twice almost every month. As long as the water world dimensional rift remains open, it will not be peaceful.”","Listen’s tone became extremely grave.","“However, three years ago, the invasion of the water world dimensional lifeforms never happened.”","Lin Yuan felt that everything became more bizarre. He thought for a long time but still couldn’t make sense of it. It seemed that he still needed to explore the shallow near-shore sea under the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s control to unravel the truth.","Lin Yuan glanced at the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer and said, “Endless Summer, Mother of Bloodbath, you two hide in the shadows first when we arrive at Indigo Azure City. If no one’s life is in danger, you need not make a move.”","After learning that the two spirit qi professionals Listen had sent out had died, Lin Yuan started feeling that the Zheng family was not the only one coveting the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s shallow near-shore sea.","Since a pinnacle king-class expert from the Zheng family had come to the Royal Capital and made a move on the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, attempting to kill Listen, this meant that the Zheng family was determined to get this shallow near-shore sea.","The Zheng family did not need to kill these two spirit qi professionals who were scouting at the shallow near-shore sea.","These two spirit qi professionals with Platinum feys had most likely found a secret that absolutely couldn’t be divulged.","If they wanted to kill these two spirit qi professionals and not let them have a chance to convey the message back to Listen, that person must be at least at the level of Fei Qianqiong.","The Zheng family was in the light, while Lin Yuan was in the dark. Although the Zheng family was strong, they were a visible enemy to Lin Yuan. Often, the enemy in the dark was the most terrifying.","It was just like Young Master Zheng in the Royal Capital, who had learned he had lost a pinnacle king-class expert. He would probably not be able to sleep peacefully during this period.","What made Lin Yuan feel a little troubled was that if other people were coveting the shallow near-shore sea in the dark beside the Zheng family, then these enemies in the dark were an unknown hidden danger.","After the Zheng family had made a move on the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, this faction in the dark still coveted the shallow near-shore sea. In other words, this faction certainly had the power to fight against the Zheng family.","The Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s shallow near-shore sea didn’t have legs and wouldn’t run. If there was no absolute support of power, they simply couldn’t snatch it from the Zheng family."]},{"number":429,"title":"Chapter 429: How Would Young Master Zheng Feel?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The Mother of Bloodbath replied upon receiving Lin Yuan’s order, “If we encounter a sneak attack from an emperor-class expert, it’s hard to stop it at once if we’re hidden in the dark.","“Sister Summer is not good at concealment, so she’ll hide in the shadows.","“Although the law I control is blood, my species and exclusive skills are extremely good at concealment.","“Even an emperor-class expert will not notice me if I’m by your side.”","Endless Summer fiddled with the bell on its bracelet that was hidden in the pink-purple embroidered-ball-shaped flower and said, “Sister Blood and I are both near and far, respectively. While Sister Blood protects your safety closely, I will keep an eye on you guys from a distance. I’ll also see how many pairs of eyes are watching you from the shadows.”","Lin Yuan nodded in response.","When the Mother of Bloodbath saw Lin Yuan nod, the corners of its mouth on its expressionless face curved up into a pleasant arc.","It relied on the Path Protector contract between it and Lin Yuan and spoke in his mind in a voice that only he could hear.","“I’m your Path Protector. Your safety must come first.”","Lin Yuan’s heart warmed up upon hearing that. In fact, during the time Lin Yuan had been spending time with the Mother of Bloodbath, he had almost forgotten that it was his Path Protector.","However, the Mother of Bloodbath had been silently performing its duties as a Path Protector.","At that moment, a scarlet luster flickered around the Mother of Bloodbath that was on the Long-Backed Swan’s back. This scarlet luster made one feel as if they saw a sticky blood pool. Everyone could obviously feel the Long-Backed Swan’s body trembling faintly, obviously scared.","If Endless Summer and the Mother of Bloodbath hadn’t used their aura to control the Long-Backed Swan when they transformed, the Long-Backed Swan would have been frightened by the Mother of Bloodbath’s aura and fallen to the ground.","The Mother of Bloodbath was a bird-catching spider. Besides its quality’s mightiness, it also possessed its species’ intimidation trait.","The Mother of Bloodbath shrunk to the size of a centimeter, just as when it had first become Lin Yuan’s Path Protector.","However, the Mother of Bloodbath didn’t land on the leaf-shaped fey storage box hanging on Lin Yuan’s chest. Instead, it landed on his hair and hid between it.","Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, Endless Summer, and Listen had long known that the Mother of Bloodbath was a Suzerain/Myth Breed fey.","Only Zhou Luo, who was on the back of the Long-Backed Swan, didn’t know about the Mother of Bloodbath’s identity.","When Zhou Luo now saw the Mother of Bloodbath change from human form to a scarlet spider, hidden between Lin Yuan’s hair, his eyes immediately widened. He gulped wildly and sighed in his heart. How lucky am I to be able to have an opportunity to join such a strong faction!?","This legendary Suzerain/Myth II fey was actually next to him, and based on the conversation just now between the woman who had turned into a spider and that abnormally gentle-looking woman, although Zhou Luo wasn’t sure if the latter was a fey, the latter must have a strength of an emperor-class expert.","Just as Zhou Luo was shocked, Lin Yuan called him out.","“After we arrive at Indigo Azure City, you don’t need to move with us first.”","When Zhou Luo heard Lin Yuan’s words, he immediately suppressed his shock and was ready to receive his orders. At the same time, Zhou Luo was already prepared to face the danger. When making the servant oath, Zhou Luo knew that his life no longer belonged to him while he obtained resources.","Unexpectedly, Lin Yuan’s following words gave Zhou Luo an indescribable feeling.","“Your Iron Bone Iguana grew a second head and mutated into a Lava Iguana after using five heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls produced by the Scorching Elemental Shellfish.","“When it mutated into a Lava Iguana, it was promoted from Platinum IX to Platinum X.","“I see that the Lava Iguana is only one Flawless Dragon’s Mouth Orchid flower away from the stimulation of its dragon-species bloodline.","“I have one here for you to do that.”","Lin Yuan had two Flawless Dragon’s Mouth Orchid flowers from the resources he had exchanged with the 30 Flower Brocade Pearls in his Purchase With No Loss store’s fan club.","Flawless Dragon’s Mouth Orchid flowers were not considered very rare in the market and could be auctioned for nearly 1,000,000 Radiance dollars on the Rare Lifeform Pavilion.","When the Lava Iguana stimulated the dragon-species bloodline in its body, it had a high chance of breaking through the limit of its grade and advancing from Platinum X to Diamond I.","This huge increase in its grade would allow the Lava Iguana to become a Diamond/Fantasy Breed fey.","It was the same as saying that it allowed Zhou Luo to step up from the bottom level of a king-class expert to the level of a mid-level one. As a result, he would also be able to complete his mission better.","However, if Lin Yuan only had that one Epic Dragon’s Mouth Orchid flower, he wouldn’t have given it to Zhou Luo to use.","The Epic Dragon’s Mouth Orchid flower was the most top-notch Dragon’s Mouth Orchid flower that had ever appeared on the market. Such things were not something that could be bought with Radiance dollars.","Lin Yuan preferred to let the white-clothed followers he nurtured get their own resources. He couldn’t afford to pour in all the resources to improve his white-clothed followers’ strength.","If that were the case, Lin Yuan might as well change his name from Lin Yuan to Big Head Lin. He wouldn’t do such a disproportional give and take.","However, the Flawless Dragon’s Mouth Orchid would be harmless. Despite this, it could allow Zhou Luo to feel moved from the bottom of his heart.","Although Zhou Luo had been grateful to Lin Yuan for investing a Bronze/Epic Dark Snake Dragon Lizard and five heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls on him, he hadn’t been moved. This was because such a resource had been exchanged with Zhou Luo’s servant oath.","However, the Flawless Dragon’s Mouth Orchid was not. If it was before, Zhou Luo would need to accumulate resources for two years to get his hands on the Flawless Dragon’s Mouth Orchid.","Even if the Iron Bone Iguana had mutated into a Lava Iguana, and Zhou Luo’s strength had been boosted, in his opinion, he would now need at least eight months to earn money for the Flawless Dragon’s Mouth Orchid.","The faction to which he had dedicated all his loyalty had given him such a gift before he had made any contribution during his first mission. This made the emotions of gratitude in Zhou Luo’s heart churn even more.","At that moment, Lin Yuan glanced at Listen and said, “Listen, what do you think the Zheng family’s Young Master Zheng will feel if he learns that you’ve suddenly returned to the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s old mansion?”"]},{"number":430,"title":"Chapter 430: Indigo Azure Sea Market","paragraphs":["When Listen heard Lin Yuan’s words, he frowned slightly and pondered.","After pondering for a long time, Listen suddenly smiled and said, “The Zheng family is a veteran faction. As one of the three major factions in Indigo Azure City, they could be said to be supreme.","“If I were the Zheng family’s Young Master Zheng and I suddenly found that the target I want to kill returned to Indigo Azure City from the Royal Capital alive, even if the Zheng family could determine that the pinnacle king-class expert sent out has died, they would at most only suspect that the death is related to me but can’t confirm it.","“The shallow near-shore sea is imperative to the Zheng family. I think the Zheng family will send experts to kill me again.”","When Lin Yuan heard Listen’s words, he asked, “Then what kind of expert do you think the Zheng family will send to attack you?”","In Lin Yuan’s opinion, the Zheng family would definitely send an expert to attack Listen, but the main purpose of that would not necessarily be for Listen to die immediately.","Rather, it was to prove whether or not the death of the pinnacle king-class expert that they had sent had anything to do with Listen. This was frankly a test.","Someone who could silently kill a pinnacle king-class expert with Diamond X/Fantasy IV fey at least had emperor-class strength. No veteran faction would casually use an emperor-class expert.","Before the Zheng family was sure how strong the emperor-class expert that had killed the pinnacle king-class expert really was, they would never let their own emperor-class experts easily take risks.","The loss of a pinnacle king-class expert must have been very painful for the Zheng family. Thus, in Lin Yuan’s opinion, the Zheng family’s king-class expert shouldn’t be too strong and was at most at Fei Qianqiong’s level. The Zheng family must have been ready to lose a king-class expert for this scouting attempt.","Listen answered Lin Yuan’s question, “I can’t say what kind of expert the Zheng family will send. It should be either a king-class or emperor-class expert. The king-class expert is more likely.”","Listen paused for a moment and then added, “But I know Young Master won’t let the Zheng family kill me.”","Lin Yuan raised his eyebrows and replied, “That’s for sure.”","Besides the resources that Lin Yuan could invest in Listen, if the Zheng family killed listen, Lin Yuan would have made ducks and drakes of his previous effort.","In addition, Listen had issued an allegiance oath to Lin Yuan and was a part of Lin Yuan’s private faction, Sky City. Lin Yuan wouldn’t let the Zheng family lay hands on the members of his own faction.","“Listen, since you’ve returned to Indigo Azure City from the Royal Capital, you naturally have to return to the old mansion.”","After Lin Yuan finished speaking to Listen, he turned to Endless Summer, who was sitting beside him in a lotus position, and said, “Endless Summer, when Listen returns to the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s old mansion, protect him in the dark just like you did in the Royal Capital.”","Endless Summer nodded at his words. Then Endless Summer lifted its pale hands and shook the Diamond fey storage box hanging at the wrist and replied, “There are still the corpses of two high-grade dark-type feys in here. When the time comes, Sister Blood will divide the spiritual materials in their bodies properly.”","When Lin Yuan heard Endless Summer say that, he recalled the time when the Mother of Bloodbath had split the corpse of that pinnacle Suzerain/Myth II crow without any waste.","The Mother of Bloodbath pondered for a moment and said, “Since they’re two high-grade dark-type Fantasy Breed feys, their willpower should both be relatively strong.","“I’ll carefully divide when we return to the Royal Capital to see if I can control the blood with the Blood Law and stimulate their cellular activity to preserve the willpower in their minds to the maximum.”","As they went on their journey, they were getting closer and closer to the Indigo Azure City. Lin Yuan felt that the surrounding temperature was significantly higher than when he was in the Royal Capital. The air above the sea also faintly carried a salty sea breeze.","On the back of the Platinum Long-Backed Swan, Lin Yuan could already faintly see the outline of Indigo Azure City. This city by the sea was too huge.","Even when Lin Yuan was high in the sky, the area within his sight could only encompass 1/10 or 2/10 of this huge city.","A light-blue Dragon’s Mouth Orchid only half the size of a palm appeared in Lin Yuan’s hand. He handed it to Zhou Luo and said, “Let your Lava Iguana evolve first and wait for me to contact you.”","After saying that, Lin Yuan thought for a moment and took out another tube of dark-gold blood and added, “Take this tube of Diamond dragon blood as well. If the Flawless Dragon’s Mouth Orchid can’t stimulate the dragon-species bloodline in the Lava Iguana’s body, this tube of blood should be able to provide a supplementary effect.”","Some unknown variations would occasionally accompany the stimulation of the dragon-species bloodline in a fey, so Lin Yuan provided a tube of Diamond dragon-species fey’s blood for Zhou Luo, which was considered being prepared.","Zhou Luo took Lin Yuan’s gift and said, “Young Master, one day is enough time for the Lava Iguana to awaken the dragon-species bloodline in its body and advance its grade.","“If you don’t contact me after that, I’ll go to that shallow near-shore sea of the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce to inquire about any news.”","Lin Yuan suddenly noticed that a determined emotion had appeared in Zhou Luo’s eyes during this moment. Zhou Luo had also taken the initiative to undertake the mission after knowing the purpose of his trip. This situation indicated that Zhou Luo had somehow started to devote more than just loyalty to himself.","“Okay. But since someone is secretly watching that shallow near-shore sea, you shouldn’t put yourself in danger by going there.","“There is a Guild Alliance branch near that shallow near-shore sea. You should be able to gain something by going there to investigate.”","Besides the fact that true top-notch factions had their own news intelligence connections, the Guild Alliance’s news was undoubtedly considered being the most comprehensive.","After all, the Guild Alliance was filled with spirit qi professionals, and many of them were from Indigo Azure City. These spirit qi professionals lived in Indigo Azure City all year round, so someone might know some useful information.","At that moment, Listen suddenly thought of something and said, “Young Master, there’ll be a grand Indigo Azure Sea Market in Indigo Azure City before the riotous period of the dimensional rift every decade.","“Almost all the local factions and individuals in Indigo Azure City will sell spiritual materials and feys they have collected in the sea during these ten years at this sea market.","“Many of the sea spiritual materials and feys there are rare and odd things. There are always people who buy them, but there are times when even Class 4 Creation Masters misjudge.”"]},{"number":431,"title":"Chapter 431: Showing Itself","paragraphs":["Listen paused for a moment and said, “I think we should be able to find the flesh of the high-grade marine dimensional lifeform you wanted before in this sea market.”","Upon hearing that, Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up. He took a mask engraved with the pattern of the majestic sky city out of the Diamond fey storage box and put it on his face before saying, “The Zheng family should make a move on you on the night you return.","“Big Brother Liu and I will visit you early the next morning at the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s old mansion, and you’ll take us to the Indigo Azure Sea Market.”","As soon as Lin Yuan said that, the Mother of Bloodbath, Endless Summer, and Liu Jie all put a strange mask engraved with the pattern of clouds on their faces.","At that moment, the eyes behind Lin Yuan’s mask displayed a sharpness that had never been shown before.","It was time for the Sky City, which had never shown itself before, to appear in the ears of the major factions.","...","In a study room with various Platinum feys and plants, a middle-aged man with sinister eyes was standing in front of the table.","All of a sudden, he viciously kicked at the youth who was kneeling on the ground with the same sinister eyes as him and snarled, “How did I, Zheng Jiangliu, have a son as stupid as you!”","The youth who the middle-aged man had kicked lowered his head, not daring to say anything.","At that moment, an old man standing beside the middle-aged man heartbreakingly glanced at the youth and said, “Master, Wenbo already knows his mistake. Besides, an expert who can kill Elder Niu without any surge is at least an emperor-class one. It’s useless for you to blame Wenbo.”","The old man’s back was straight, and he spoke with a cedar-like aura.","When the youth on the ground heard the old man’s words, he hurriedly said, “Father, listen to what Grandpa Jiao said. If an emperor-class expert really attacked Elder Niu, what could I have done?","“Besides, I told Elder Niu to attack Listen because you said that you have Second Young Master’s support on your side, and I wanted to quickly complete the mission you gave me.","“This is so that our third lineage’s hard work can finally be paid for after so many years!”","When the sinister-eyed middle-aged man, Zheng Jiangliu, heard that his son was able to talk so much and find so many excuses, he actually wanted to send another kick. Nonetheless, he held back when he heard the later part.","The Zheng family’s third lineage had constantly been collecting the near-shore coastal resources for several years but had not dared to really develop the resources.","This had also led to the suppression of the Zheng family’s third lineage by the other three lineages.","The reason that his son had let Elder Niu attack Listen was to allow the third lineage to have complete control over Indigo Azure City’s near-shore coastal resources as soon as possible. He would also have done the same himself.","However, Elder Niu’s death had caused the third lineage to have one less pinnacle king-class expert. Moreover, Elder Niu was also good at scouting among the pinnacle king-class experts. Such an ability was very useful to a faction.","Such a loss was more heartbreaking to Zheng Jiangliu than simply losing a peak king-class expert.","Zheng Jiangliu glanced at his son on the ground with a lowered head and asked with a snort, “Do you have an understanding of the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s background?”","Zheng Wenbo froze for a moment when he heard his father’s question but shook his head and answered, “The Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce has no background. If it did, how could it have been played by the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce?","“Their online and offline resources have been devoured without any ground to fight back.”","Even after thinking all the way back to Indigo Azure City from the Royal Capital, Zheng Wenbo didn’t think that Elder Niu had died at the hands of the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","Although Zheng Wenbo vaguely remembered that Bi Chenghu and Bi Chengxiong of the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce had told him that the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce had found a backer, he felt that the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce was lying.","Otherwise, Bi Chenghu and Bi Chengxiong would have suffered a calamity long ago, and it wouldn’t have been Elder Niu’s turn.","When Zheng Jiangliu heard his son’s words, he knew that his son had done nothing on the trip to the Royal Capital.","The pinnacle king-class expert by his side had died, yet he didn’t even know who he had offended. Elder Niu had really died in vain!","“Listen has returned to Indigo Azure City from the Royal Capital. He’s now in the former old mansion of the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","“The person I sent there three hours ago has not returned yet.","“Listen, however, is still alive and well!”","Zheng Jiangliu’s words made Zheng Wenbo’s pupils shrink.","So Elder Niu had actually died at the hands of the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","However, no matter how Zheng Wenbo thought about it, he couldn’t understand how the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce had such ability. Why did they have to endure the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce’s trampling?","However, all the facts were there, and Zheng Wenbo had to believe them.","The old man with a straight back suddenly said, “Master, why don’t you let me test how strong this Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce is?”","As he spoke, the old man’s cedar-like aura became even stronger, and it carried an indefinable sense of sharpness that was extremely difficult to distinguish.","Zheng Jiangliu hurriedly replied, “Uncle Jiao, there’s no need to trouble you. Your main fey, the Cold Snow Pine, is now faintly about to break through to Myth II and take its human form.","“Don’t let these trivial matters delay your main fey from going to endure the upcoming World Cleansing.”","As Zheng Jiangliu spoke, he had a more sinister look in his eyes.","The old man with a straight back responded, “Master, if we can’t take down the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s shallow near-shore sea before the dimensional rift’s revolt, I’m afraid we won’t be able to explain it to Second Young Master.”","When Zheng Jiangliu heard the word ‘Second Young Master’, his sinister gaze revealed scruples and plans.","Zheng Jiangliu answered in a deep voice, “Since Second Young Master’s side wants to have 50% of our third lineage’s shallow near-shore sea, I think Second Young Master won’t stay by and do nothing if I have difficulties.”","...","Lin Yuan was currently sitting side by side with Liu Jie in a special guesthouse and eating the special barbecued seafood.","At that moment, a message notification appeared on Lin Yuan’s cell phone. Lin Yuan took a look at his cell phone and found that it was as he had expected.","The Zheng family had sent another king-class expert to assassinate Listen.","There were just less than five days from the next dimensional rift riot period, leaving Lin Yuan not much time to explore the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s shallow near-shore sea.","For Lin Yuan, the easiest way to explore the shallow near-shore sea was to have Red Thorn spread the sea of flowers underwater.","The sea of flowers spread by Red Thorn’s ortet was equivalent to a part of Red Thorn’s body. Lin Yuan could completely use it as his eyes to explore the shallow near-shore sea."]},{"number":432,"title":"Chapter 432: Wind Speech Sparrow","paragraphs":["Before he could spread Red Thorn’s sea of flowers underwater to uncover the secrets of this shallow near-shore sea, Red Thorn undoubtedly needed to devour more flesh of Gold water world dimensional lifeforms so that its water-type exhalation ability could be inherited from the ortet to the child ramet.","This all depended on whether he could purchase the flesh of Gold water world dimensional lifeforms at tomorrow’s Indigo Azure Sea Market. Lin Yuan was looking forward to the Indigo Azure Sea Market the next day.","He needed to gather the resources that he needed to use before going to bed.","Each Indigo Azure Sea Market was the accumulation of ten years of Indigo Azure City, a giant city by the sea. Therefore, if there were any precious feys or rare spiritual materials in the Indigo Azure Sea Market and he couldn’t get any bargaining chips, it would be embarrassing for Lin Yuan.","At that moment, he noticed Liu Jie, who was eating the charcoal-grilled octopus balls, frowning more and more. After chewing the last octopus ball on the stick and swallowing it, the corner of Liu Jie’s mouth twitched, revealing a hint of disdain.","Upon seeing that, Lin Yuan hurriedly asked, “Big Brother Liu, is there any problem?”","Liu Jie first nodded and then shook his head. Immediately afterward, Liu Jie replied, “The store owner added some seaweed to this octopus ball. If the seaweed was boiled in water, it’d taste better after dipped in sauce.","“But apart from the octopus fat in this octopus ball, the store owner also added some lard, which makes the freshness of the seaweed fishy.","“Furthermore, the octopus tentacles in the octopus balls are too shredded. It’s not al dente when chewing.","“Also, in the honey sauce of the barbecue brush, there’s obviously too much water added to the Flower Spot Bee’s honey, resulting in the honey sauce not becoming mellow enough.”","Lin Yuan froze as he heard Liu Jie say so much. This special guesthouse was very famous in Indigo Azure City, and the special barbecued seafood was even its signature dish.","Although it didn’t feel as good as the meat skewers Liu Jie grilled inside the mansion, it was still okay.","Liu Jie was a great chef, after all. He could find so many shortcomings in the octopus balls with just a casual tasting—what a good tongue.","At that moment, Lin Yuan noticed the hand of the lady boss, who was standing near his table and pouring snow-clam soup to the customers on another table, had frozen. Apparently, this lady boss had overheard their discussion, and the warm smile on her face had frozen a bit.","Lin Yuan didn’t think there was anything wrong with the taste of these octopus balls. But after listening to Liu Jie’s review and then tasting the octopus balls, Lin Yuan instead tasted the taste of lard within.","Based on Lin Yuan’s experience of eating Black Back Mountain Boar all year round, the lard inside the octopus balls obviously came from the Black Back Mountain Boar.","This made Lin Yuan couldn’t help but feel that these octopus balls were more delicious.","After eating the special barbecue in the guesthouse Lin Yuan and Liu Jie hurriedly soaked in the hot spring and left the lady boss’ sight.","The lady boss had been squinting her eyes and smiling like a weasel. Her smile was kind of treacherous.","Lin Yuan couldn’t help but think of a saying, “Those with squinting eyes are either bigwigs or monsters.”","Lin Yuan and Liu Jie each returned to their rooms, and after the former returned to his room, he entered his Spirit Lock spatial zone.","As soon as he did that, Lin Yuan felt that he was almost blinded by the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree leaves.","Nearly 600 leaves sealed with the mid-grade strange flames were glowing with bright flames, causing the Spirit Lock spatial zone to be reflected as if it existed in an illusionary realm of aurora.","Chimey was sleeping on the bird’s nest surrounded by the branches and leaves of the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree. The speed at which it was absorbing the energy in the nest was obviously much faster than before.","The energy transmitted by the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree made Chimey’s pale-blue feathers dyed with a layer of beautiful light.","Just like Chimey, Gray was eating or sleeping on the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus for the whole day.","At that moment, a trace of gray feathers disappeared from Gray’s body. It had white feathers attached to its wings and a smear of red on the top of its head.","This red was more splendid than the flowers that the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus bloomed. However, this red was very light, obviously not fully developed yet.","Lin Yuan couldn’t help but sigh, It’s almost the end for Gray’s genetic model and secondary development.","It now looks very graceful.","I wonder what it will look like after its genetic model is fully developed.","After sorting out in his Spirit Lock spatial zone, Lin Yuan found that rare resources he could take out were actually completely jade-textured wood and the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls. He didn’t plan to trade out the source-type items that he had gotten before again.","Lin Yuan had previously given all the completely jade-textured wood to Hu Quan. It would take a few days for the new batch of completely jade-textured wood to mature.","Thus, what he was able to spend at will now were the two large brocade boxes of fire-type heavenly-maiden-grade pearls that he had collected recently.","He stored them in his amber-button-shaped Diamond fey storage box and took out five feys, which he had previously gathered in the Endless Forest’s depths.","Most of the people that peddled supplies in the Indigo Azure Sea Market were the spirit qi professionals living in Indigo Azure City. They lived with the sea, and their flying feys and aquatic feys were the most precious to them.","While wild harvesting in the Endless Forest, Lin Yuan had not obtained any aquatic feys, but he had a lot of flying feys. The five flying feys he took out were exactly five of the same species, the Wind Speech Sparrows.","He had saved these five young birds from the mouth of a Giant Tree-Resting Viper. While doing so, he had also collected the Giant Tree-Resting Viper.","When he had saved those five young Wind Speech Sparrows, they were obviously dying of hunger. This meant that their parents had not returned to the nest for at least two days.","When the Wind Speech Sparrows were nurturing their young, they would never leave too far away from the nest.","This showed that these two adult Wind Speech Sparrows had become food for other predators while foraging for food.","After these five young Wind Speech Sparrows saw Lin Yuan, they immediately rejoiced and then manipulated the wind element to simulate human-like sounds.","It was just like how Lin Yuan heard ‘Hello dad’ five times now.","Upon hearing that, Lin Yuan touched the five little bird’s heads affectionately and said, “Daddy will promote your grade and quality and sell you five little guys at a good price.”"]},{"number":433,"title":"Chapter 433: Creation Breed","paragraphs":["It wasn’t easy for feys to interact with humans. Many feys wanted to interact with humans normally and even had to be promoted to Suzerain to do so.","It was a rare thing for Wind Speech Sparrows to use the wind to simulate sound to communicate with humans when they were at Normal.","Furthermore, after the Wind Speech Sparrows reached Bronze, they would evolve into Wind Chain Sparrows.","The Wind Chain Sparrows could manipulate the wind element to form chains to bind and pull on the target. It was considered a kind of support-type fey with stronger control abilities.","High-grade Wind Chain Sparrows’ Wind Chains could even help the contractor catch feys or spiritual materials at the bottom of the sea.","For spirit qi professionals who made a living at the seaside, it was a rare fey.","Even if Lin Yuan could raise these five Wind Speech Sparrows to Bronze/Epic, it couldn’t help them grow better.","Therefore, finding five good owners and five suitable Willpower Runes for them was also a way to find the best future for these five Wind Speech Sparrows.","Lin Yuan channeled his spiritual power and injected a large amount of spirit qi into their bodies. When these five Wind Speech Sparrows’ grades constantly rose until they reached Elite/Epic, Lin Yuan found that his palm was obviously a bit crowded when he held up these five little guys.","Their feathers were not really gorgeous. All of them had a light-greenish hue, with a black line on their back.","When Lin Yuan broke through these five Wind Speech Sparrows’ grades from Elite to Bronze, they underwent a rapid metamorphosis.","Lin Yuan saw that the four of the five little guys on his palm were still light green, but the feathers on their bodies became as strong as bone plates. Their sharp beak and claws also became sharper.","The black line on their backs grew a row of feathers that could greatly enhance their speed like the edge of a knife.","However, one of the Wind Speech Sparrows’ bodies suddenly turned white when it reached Bronze, while the rest of its body was not much different from the other four Wind Chain Sparrows. Lin Yuan knew that this Wind Speech Sparrow had mutated when it had been promoted.","He raised these five little fellows’ grades and quality to Bronze X/Epic and used Morbius’ True Data to check the white Wind Chain Sparrow’s attribute.","[Fey Name]: Wind Net Sparrow","[Fey Species]: Ploceidae/Sparrow","[Fey Grade]: Bronze (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Wind","[Fey Quality]: Epic","After checking the attributes, Lin Yuan realized that the Wind Chain Sparrow had mutated into a Wind Net Sparrow.","In his opinion, he wasn’t sure whether such a mutation should be described as good or bad. However, its benefits should outweigh the disadvantages.","According to its grade, the Wind Chain Sparrow could usually make a varying number of wind chains according to its grade to control and attack. However, the Wind Net Sparrow could throw out a wind net made up of wind chains.","Despite the large area of the wind net, it was less powerful than the wind chain. Nonetheless, the Wind Net Sparrow was undoubtedly more practical than the Wind Chain Sparrow for catching feys in the sea.","Lin Yuan chose the most suitable exclusive skill out of the three that had appeared for these four Wind Chain Sparrow and one Wind Net Sparrow.","Then he dragged his hand, and these five little guys flew into the sky. Lin Yuan found that they flew in the same way, with wings flapping so fast his eyes could only see a cloud of shadows, and he noticed something that dumbfounded him.","The five little guys were quarreling in the sky by using the wind element to simulate the human voice. Lin Yuan was a little dizzy. Where did they learn to curse? Was it maternal genetics?","He hurriedly stored them in the Diamond fey storage box. He originally wanted to find the same buyer for these five little ones so that they wouldn’t be separated, but now it seemed that he was simply thinking too much.","These five little guys didn’t have a deep relationship!","How many grudges had they accumulated in the nest over food!?","If Lin Yuan hadn’t stopped it quickly, these five little fellows would probably have started a big fight.","When Lin Yuan left the Spirit Lock spatial zone, he found that the sun had risen in the sky of Indigo Azure City. He could clearly feel the humidity within this Indigo Azure City’s guesthouse. However, there was a salty taste of the sea that was unique to the seaside city.","Just as Lin Yuan was about to find Liu Jie, he found that Liu Jie was standing at the door fully dressed like a guard.","When he saw Lin Yuan come out, Liu Jie handed over the cup of milkshake he was holding and said, “This milkshake is made with the antelope milk of the Gold fey, Mountain Leaping Antelope, with snow rice added inside. It’s nutritious and filling.","“It’s much better than the seafood porridge in the guesthouse. I just saw that the oyster meat of the seafood porridge was at the very least taken out last night and is no longer fresh.”","While Liu Jie was talking, Lin Yuan noticed that the squinting lady boss and the squinting boss exchanged glances.","When the squinting lady boss poured the congee for a customer, she deliberately poured a few extra pieces of oyster meat. This made Lin Yuan feel a little weird.","After hurriedly leaving the guesthouse with Liu Jie, Lin Yuan and Liu Jie headed to the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s old mansion by a flying fey.","They were both wearing Hu Quan’s strange masks made of completely jade-textured wood silk threads. The completely jade-textured wood silk thread processed from the Wood Weaving House Centipede’s body had become somewhat different from the properties of completely jade-textured wood.","The completely jade-textured wood would emit a faint jade-textured luster even without spirit qi. In contrast, the completely jade-textured silk threads produced in the Wood Weaving House Centipede’s body would not change significantly in a low concentration of spirit qi.","When it came to a high concentration of spirit qi, the completely jade-textured silk threads produced from the Wood Weaving House Centipede’s body had a stronger jade-textured luster than the completely jade-textured wood itself.","At that moment, Lin Yuan suddenly heard the Mother of Bloodbath’s peculiar yet pleasant voice.","“Help me buy more spiritual materials that contain blood energy in the Indigo Azure Sea Market. I’m going to advance to Myth III as soon as possible.”","Upon hearing that, Lin Yuan replied without the slightest hesitation, “Okay. Tell me if you fancy any in the Indigo Azure Sea Market.”","He naturally wouldn’t refuse the Mother of Bloodbath’s request. He remembered that not much time had passed since it had broken through to Myth II.","In such a short period, the Mother of Bloodbath was actually preparing to reach Myth III.","Wasn’t this a little too fast?","The Mother of Bloodbath lurked between Lin Yuan’s hair and made a decision. As Lin Yuan began to form his private faction, the Mother of Bloodbath discovered that it was still a little too weak.","There was a clear distinction between Myth II and Myth III. It could only be killed if it faced a Myth III enemy. However, as Lin Yuan constantly developed his faction, there might be a day all the enemies were pinnacle emperor-class experts!","At that time, if it was still at this level, it couldn’t help Lin Yuan or perform the duties as a Path Protector.","The Mother of Bloodbath had always had a secret—it could enhance its strength by infinitely devouring blood energy!","It was for this reason that the Mother of Bloodbath had not remained a Diamond/Fantasy V for long and reached Myth I directly. Such a progression had almost caused it to perish under the World Cleansing.","This painful lesson had made the Mother of Bloodbath’s grade that was higher than Endless Summer fall behind.","Now that Endless Summer was at Myth III, it might have a chance to see if it could pass the World Cleansing with Endless Summer’s help and advance to Myth III.","If it succeeded in reaching Myth III, it could become a pinnacle Myth Breed fey by quickly devouring blood qi energy. That was also the degree of a pinnacle emperor-class expert.","At that time, it would be qualified to nurture the blood law into a small world of blood.","With the body of a Myth Breed, it would get its hands on Creation!","It would become a Creation Breed!"]},{"number":434,"title":"Chapter 434: The Hornless Dragon Bloodline","paragraphs":["Early in the morning in the Indigo Azure Sea Market...","Lin Yuan was wearing a set of moon-white spirit qi clothing that looked very simple, with only a few subtle designs highlighting its uniqueness.","Under a closer look, he found this moon-white spirit qi clothing strung with many moon-white rice beads. These rice beads were coiled together to form five kinds of fortune patterns.","When Lin Yuan had previously given Hu Quan the completely jade-textured spiritual materials, that earliest batch had a long strip of white sandalwood that was simply too small. Hu Quan could only do a pair of chopsticks. Thus, this completely jade-textured white sandalwood had been left behind.","Wen Yu had seen the evolution of the Dragon-Phoenix Landscape Carp into the Mountain River Eternal Life Carp some time ago and had perhaps found some inspiration.","She had taken the remaining completely jade-textured white sandalwood and warm silk and had chosen five of the six fortune patterns on the Dragon-Phoenix Landscape Carp to make this set of moon-white spirit qi clothes.","It looked unusually low-key on Lin Yuan. At the same time, it made his youthfulness graceful.","Lin Yuan looked at the many stalls and in front of him and couldn’t help but sigh a little. There were simply too many stalls in the Indigo Azure Sea Market!","These stalls were like a maze, all clumped together. It would take an unknown amount of time to walk out of this sea market.","Lin Yuan had thought that the Indigo Azure Sea Market would be like most trading markets, which were dirty and noisy. However, this Indigo Azure Sea Market not only looked clean, but it also didn’t have any strange smell.","Although he smelled nothing strange, Genius that Lin Yuan held in his arms scrunched its nose and said cutely, “Yuan, the fishy smell here is so strong. I can’t breathe!”","Lin Yuan hurriedly took a mint leaf out of the Diamond fey storage box, used his finger to whisk out its juice, and put it on Genius’ nose.","When Listen heard Genius’ words and saw that Lin Yuan was twitching his nose as if he was distinguishing the fishy smell Genius was talking about, he explained, “The Indigo Azure Sea Market is the biggest official event of Indigo Azure City every decade. Thus, the Indigo Azure Guards will set up the venue in advance and let the Shellfish Vapor Corals release shellfish vapor before it opens.","“This affects the spirit qi professionals who buy, sell, and trade in the Indigo Azure Sea Market and allow them not to smell any odor.","“Most feys have a more developed sense of smell than spirit qi professionals and have stronger immunity against the Shellfish Vapor Corals’ shellfish vapor, so they can smell what’s in the market.”","After listening to Listen’s explanation, Lin Yuan felt that the Indigo Azure City’s officials were really talented.","However, what was the difference between this and being afraid of smelling in a shithole without using one’s nose to breathe but mouth?","Lin Yuan looked at Genius’s sickly appearance and stored it back into the Spirit Lock spatial zone. He didn’t understand. Genius was clearly a cat-species fey but had never liked to eat fish. It would hide far away whenever it smelled the smell of fish. On the contrary, it loved the meat of a Black Back Mountain Boar.","At that moment, he suddenly heard several violent hissing sounds. The source was not far away from his ears.","Lin Yuan looked in the sound direction and saw three blood-red snake-species feys locked in an iron cage. They were furiously hitting the iron cage with their bodies.","However, when doing so, although the sound was loud, the iron cage was not damaged at all.","The vendor of the three blood-red snake-species feys hurriedly picked up the stone bowl at the side and sprinkled the yellow powder in it on the feys.","Upon feeling this yellow powder, the three blood-red snake-species feys were immediately worn out, and their hissing sounds were weakened a lot.","Liu Jie said with a sigh, “He actually used realgar to sprinkle on these three Red Water Blood Snakes. Such feys like them that rely on blood energy to live are most afraid of realgar.","“A large amount of realgar powder can vaguely damage the Red Water Blood Snakes’ roots in a moment.","“If he sprinkles such a large amount of realgar three times, I’m afraid these three young Red Water Blood Snakes will die.”","Lin Yuan frowned. The realgar would enter through the Red Water Blood Snakes’ scales into their blood. They were feys that lived on blood, and the fusion of the realgar into their blood might only have a suppressive effect on other snake feys, but it was fatal to the Red Water Blood Snake.","Obviously, this vendor was not a Creation Master and didn’t know much about such feys like the Red Water Blood Snake.","The vendor had probably just happened to catch them in the wild and was just in time for the Indigo Azure Sea Market. As a result, he sold them at the Indigo Azure Sea Market.","Although the Red Water Blood Snake was very rare, few spirit qi professionals would be willing to contract them. After nurturing them to become stronger, the surface of their scales would carry a layer of strong blood-clotting toxin.","It might not be harmful to the contractor, but it would affect the other contracted feys. Hence, the spirit qi professionals who contracted the Red Water Blood Snake couldn’t contract other species of feys.","At that moment, the Mother of Bloodbath’s peculiar yet pleasant voice sounded.","“Lin Yuan, these three Red Water Blood Snakes actually have a faint trace of hornless dragon bloodline. Quickly help me buy them!”","The Mother of Bloodbath clearly sounded urgent.","Lin Yuan didn’t react to the Mother of Bloodbath’s meaning when he heard that. If these three Red Water Blood Snakes had the hornless dragon bloodline, buying them would be a great bargain.","If the Mother of Bloodbath hadn’t comprehended the Blood Law Rune, even if there were other Myth Breed feys of a higher grade than the Mother of Bloodbath here, they also probably couldn’t sense the hornless dragon bloodline of these three snakes, just like the Mother of Bloodbath.","If the Mother of Bloodbath wanted to break through to Myth III, it undoubtedly would need a large amount of blood qi energy.","The blood energy in these three Red Water Blood Snakes was simply too scarce and undoubtedly not the least bit useful to the Mother of Bloodbath.","Did the Mother of Bloodbath want to buy these three Mother of Bloodbath and treat them as spicy sticks?","As if the Mother of Bloodbath had sensed Lin Yuan’s strange expression, its peculiar yet pleasant voice explained with a trace of helplessness, “I don’t want their blood energy. I want to nurture them.”","Upon hearing that, a strange thought suddenly flashed through his mind!","The Mother of Bloodbath wasn’t going to carry out the plan of nurturing three bad husbands at the same time, right!?"]},{"number":435,"title":"Chapter 435: Mother of Bloodbath Under True Data","paragraphs":["These three Red Water Blood Snakes would not take a short time to nurture, and their genders were unknown. What if she raised her husbands into sisters?","God damn it! This is simply a big loss!","At that moment, Lin Yuan heard the Mother of Bloodbath say, “I can finally use the exclusive skill that I comprehended after becoming a Myth Breed.”","This was now Lin Yuan’s second time hearing the Mother of Bloodbath mention its exclusive skill.","He had previously heard it mention its exclusive skill on the Long-Backed Swan’s back.","At that time, the Mother of Bloodbath had said that it was good at stealth with its exclusive skills.","Lin Yuan had not used Morbius’ True Data to check the Mother of Bloodbath’s exclusive skills.","This time, he couldn’t resist his curiosity and used it!","[Fey Name]: Mother of Bloodbath","[Fey Species]: Tarantulas/Chelicerata","[Fey Grade]: Suzerain (7/10)","[Fey Type]: Blood","[Fey Quality]: Myth II (Blood Law)","Abilities:","[Execution Sting]: Through the eight sharp chelicerae, the blood energy is injected into the target to control the target’s blood.","[Eyes of Senluo]: The spider eyes look directly at the core of the blood inside the target and anticipate the target’s next movements based on the blood flow.","[Eight Direction Blood]: Shock and solidify the blood inside the target’s body and damage the target’s body using the change of blood form while controlling the blood to flow of the target’s body through its eight apertures.","[Spider Form Attachment]: Condense its own blood energy into a blood core, which can overload the attacks from the outside world.","[Blood Grip]: When manipulating the blood in the target’s body, it can briefly control the target’s body for movement through the blood flow.","[Blood Embrace]: The surrounding blood energy will be devoured into its own body. It will briefly improve its strength and slowly recover from injuries through blood energy.","Exclusive Skill:","[Desire Spider Form]: Increase its affinity for blood energy so that its body will not reject excessive blood energy but will transform it into a new sac to store the blood energy. After devouring the blood energy for purification, the blood energy can be absorbed directly into its body.","[Concealed Spider Shadow]: Stop the flow of its own blood energy, conceal its aura, and transform into the form of ‘nothing’.","[External Blood Bone]: The chelicerae will be fused into other young feys’ bodies so that the feys can become its own blood bones. The strength of the external blood bone cannot be higher than its own strength.","After Lin Yuan saw the Mother of Bloodbath’s attributes, he didn’t know what to say for a moment.","Lin Yuan knew that when feys became Myth Breeds, the Willpower Runes would turn into Law Runes, and the power of the law would be added onto the fey’s abilities.","Therefore, the abilities the fey had previously comprehended fused with the law it had comprehended to produce a qualitative change.","After looking at the Mother of Bloodbath’s True Data, Lin Yuan knew that the red crystal spider that it had given him before was the blood core condensed from its ability, the Spider Form Attachment.","Lin Yuan seemed to understand why the Mother of Bloodbath was qualified to say it could reach Myth III when it had just reached Myth II.","Although the Blood Embrace ability that the Mother of Bloodbath had comprehended at Diamond was an enhancing and recovery ability, after it was combined with Desire Spider Form, the Mother of Bloodbath could constantly devour blood energy and let the blood energy become its own strength without hindrance.","This was Lin Yuan’s first time seeing the True Data of a Myth Breed fey.","After really seeing that, based on the abilities and exclusive skills, he knew how powerful Myth Breed feys were.","Those three Red Water Blood Snakes should be the feys that the Mother of Bloodbath was going to use to nurture into its external blood bones.","The Mother of Bloodbath’s Myth Breed exclusive skill, the External Blood Bone, needed its chelicerae.","Spider feys would shed their chelicerae about once every 100 years. The Mother of Bloodbath needed three Red Water Blood Snakes, which meant that it was at least 300 years old now.","It was extremely rare for wild feys to reach Suzerain/Myth II in 300 years. This showed the Mother of Bloodbath’s great potential.","Lin Yuan went straight up to the vendor and asked, “Boss, these three snake feys hissed loudly just now. They look quite energetic. How much are you selling them?”","The vendor’s eyes lit up when he heard Lin Yuan’s words. He hadn’t opened his business until now.","The vendor hurriedly pointed to the large water tank next to the iron cage containing the Red Water Blood Snakes and said, “I mainly sell deep-sea Butterfly Shells. Look how big these Butterfly Shells are. The pearls inside must be of good quality.","“After these pearls are dug out, these two Butterfly Shells can be polished and hung on water-type feys to increase their speed of advancement.”","Lin Yuan had long noticed the large water tank. However, he was not interested in the deep-sea Butterfly Shells and the pearls they produced.","The quality of the deep-sea Butterfly Shells in this tank wasn’t as good as the ones he fed to Blackie. The deep-sea Butterfly Shells could increase the advancement speed of water-type feys because the Butterfly Shells had a weak ability to gather water elements. But this speed was simply too slow, and it was better than nothing.","Lin Yuan shook his head and still pointed to the three Red Water Blood Snakes before saying, “Boss, I want these three little snakes.”","The stall vendor’s face sank and replied, “These three snake feys are all Bronze. They’re not worth it. If you want to buy them, buy five deep-sea Butterfly Shells in this tank, and I’ll give you these three snake feys for free.”","When Lin Yuan had previously seen this vendor sprinkle the realgar on the three Red Water Blood Snakes, he thought that this vendor shouldn’t know about the Red Water Blood Snakes.","This vendor was supposed to do business. No matter how cruel he was, he would not be willing to let the feys he was selling be damaged.","Now it seemed that this vendor really didn’t know about the Red Water Blood Snakes.","Although people rarely needed the Red Water Blood Snakes due to the blood-clotting toxin in their bodies, their price on Star Web was about 70 Radiance dollars.","Lin Yuan originally intended to buy these three Red Water Blood Snakes with 200 Radiance dollars. However, this stall vendor said that as long as he bought five deep-sea Butterfly Shells from the tank, he would give him the three of them.","This vendor was really making a loss!","Lin Yuan looked at the deep-sea Butterfly Shells in the tank and felt he needed to cheat with True Data!"]},{"number":436,"title":"Chapter 436: Black-Hearted Or Stupid?","paragraphs":["At that moment, Lin Yuan heard this vendor knock on the tank and say, “Take a look at the price of these deep-sea Butterfly Shells first before you decide. You’ll have to pay first at my stall.”","Lin Yuan only saw a small blackboard attached to this large tank with the words: 10 Radiance dollars for one deep-water Butterfly Shell. No bargaining. Any bargainers will have their rice pot explode!","Lin Yuan blinked when he saw the price. This vendor was also too ruthless. How could people suffer from their rice pot exploding!","It was fine if it was smothered rice that exploded, but if it was cooked porridge, that would be akin to receiving a rice scalding plastic surgery service.","This vendor’s deep-sea Butterfly Shells were just the most common ones, and they were sold for 5 Radiance dollars on Star Web at most.","Such an item was actually sold at double the price in the Indigo Azure Sea Market than on Star Web.","This vendor was really not ambiguous about its price!","It was a gamble to purchase the deep-sea Butterfly Shells. If the pearls’ quality was good, one could get their capital back and earn money.","After Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to check the over 30 deep-sea Butterfly Shells in this large water tank, he found that they were actually substandard shells without pearls.","Furthermore, these 30 deep-sea Butterfly Shells had been severely corroded in the deep sea. They could no longer be polished into Butterfly Shell flowers for feys to eat and slowly stimulate the dragon-species bloodline within their body.","At most, they would be polished into shell powder and sprinkled in the water to improve the water environment.","The substandard shells in the water tank should be the worst batch of Butterfly Shells left after rounds of screening. However, they were faked by the vendor through some means.","This vendor had clever counterfeiting methods. If Lin Yuan hadn’t used True Data to check those deep-sea Butterfly Shells, he would really have misjudged.","He didn’t expect that someone would openly sell such a quality of substandard shells that were worth less than 1 Radiance dollars on Star Web.","The price of Radiance dollars spent by this vendor for counterfeiting was higher than that of the deep-sea Butterfly Shells.","He was really so black-hearted doing such a business!","Lin Yuan naturally wouldn’t buy such deep-sea Butterfly Shells. There was no difference between buying such substandard shells and spending 50 Radiance dollars to buy a pile of trash.","The vendor looked at the masked youth glancing at the deep-sea Butterfly Shells in the water tank. He was observing them seriously as if he was thinking about which one to buy.","He couldn’t help but hum a song,","It’s natural to counterfeit, and the technology is at its peak.","Effortless success by the pitfalls of deception.","Painstakingly for the transmission of skills.","It seems to be selling one’s soul for gain and self-improvement.","Even if heaven strikes, I will still do my best.","Just when this vendor was getting excited, the masked youth pointed at the small cages next to the large water tank of deep-sea Butterfly Shells and said, “Boss, I see that you’re selling some marine feys apart from the deep-sea Butterfly Shells.","“That Gold Green Oxygen Sea Anemone looks good to me. Why don’t I buy that, and you give me the three snake feys?”","When the vendor heard Lin Yuan’s words, he hurriedly sized him up.","It was as if he was looking at the strange-masked youth to find out whether he had found any flaws with these deep-sea Butterfly Shells.","This vendor noticed that the eyes behind the strange mask were gazing at him, with a hint of a smile at the corners of his mouth.","As a result, this vendor’s excitement turned into a little panic.","Indigo Azure City hosted the Indigo Azure Sea Market, and the Indigo Azure Guards were solely responsible for managing it, but they were said to be very strict.","Although his counterfeiting action was not so bad, if anyone found out, even if the Indigo Azure Guards did not expel him from the Indigo Azure Sea Market if the stall vendors next to him learned about it and made his methods known, what could he gain from this Indigo Azure Sea Market?","Wasn’t the reason he was working so hard on the art of counterfeiting because he wanted to be able to lie at home every day during this ten-year period before the next Indigo Azure Sea Market?","I, Qin Wala, will not work part-time!","The vendor hurriedly changed the subject and said, “I actually intended to trade off the Green Oxygen Sea Anemones. You’re my first customer today, and we hit off. I’ll sell it to you for 4,000 Radiance dollars.”","Lin Yuan was a bit speechless. Why did it sound like we’re good brothers, but I took advantage of you?","At that moment, Listen, who was standing in line with Lin Yuan, said to this vendor, “Boss, the Indigo Azure Sea Market is only open for a total of three days. You can’t sell so many feys. This Green Oxygen Sea Anemone Green Oxygen Sea Anemones’ tentacles are already a bit curled. You can’t sell them if you don’t do so quickly.”","The stall vendor looked at the Gold Green Oxygen Sea Anemones, which had some cured tentacles.","He hurriedly grabbed a bucket of seawater with energy ore powder and poured it on the Green Oxygen Sea Anemones’ bodies. However, it could only maintain the Green Oxygen Sea Anemone’s state but couldn’t make its condition better.","Marine feys were sold on the land, and after they left the water, their conditions would greatly deteriorate. Over time, it would even affect their roots.","The vendor looked at the condition of the Green Oxygen Sea Anemone and scolded indignantly, “This is really a losing deal. Give me some reaction to this water! Why are you half-dead!”","Lin Yuan looked at the vendor handling these feys in a flurry.","He couldn’t help but wonder why some people were so stupid apart from being black-hearted when running a business!","Although aquatic feys’ condition would deteriorate after leaving the water, if one put a fey that released spirit qi next to these aquatic feys for them to absorb, these aquatic feys could hold on even after leaving the water for three days.","Even feys that were very sensitive to spirit qi like the deep-sea Butterfly Shells left the sea to be raised in the water tank. They could grow rapidly with spirit qi.","Those stalls beside had feys that could release spirit qi, and the most common feys were the Spirit-Siphon Goldfish, but this vendor was not prepared at all. If he learned from the other stalls, he would not have been as panicked as now.","“Boss, have you noticed that the feys at the other stalls are more alive and that feys like the Green Oxygen Sea Anemone don’t need the seawater blended with energy ore powder?”"]},{"number":437,"title":"Chapter 437: Lin Yuan Is a Devil","paragraphs":["When the vendor heard Lin Yuan’s words, his suppressed anger was instantly ignited.","He kicked on the iron cage containing the three Red Water Blood Snakes and cursed, “These three trash snakes ate all three of my Spirit-Siphon Goldfish. What a big loss!”","At that moment, the vendor looked at the blackboard on the water tank with the words: 10 Radiance dollars for one deep-water Butterfly Shell. No bargaining. Any bargainers will have their rice pot explode!","He felt it should be changed into: One deep-sea Butterfly Shell for 12 Radiance dollars! No bargaining! Any bargainers will have their teeth explode!","The Indigo Azure Sea Market vendors were not allowed to go out once they came in.","If they went out, it would be akin to giving up the right to set up a stall in the Indigo Azure Sea Market.","He had bought a three-day stall card for a full 150 Radiance dollars. If he went out halfway, he would lose all the 150 Radiance dollars.","After the Indigo Azure Sea Market started, supplies were not allowed to be transported inside through Ostrich Logistics. There was nothing he could do to buy a Spirit-Siphon Goldfish.","When Lin Yuan saw the vendor’s reaction, he chuckled and summoned a Bronze I/Elite Spirit-Siphon Goldfish from the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","After he summoned it out, rich spirit qi immediately spread and made the masks made of completely jade-textured silk thread that Lin Yuan and Liu Jie wore on their faces, and the completely jade-textured white sandalwood rice beads embroidered on Lin Yuan’s moon-white spirit qi clothes to light up with a hazy jade-textured luster.","However, the concentration of spirit qi released by this Bronze Spirit-Siphon Goldfish was not too high.","Therefore, the luster emitted by Lin Yuan’s and Liu Jie’s masks was not obvious under the clear sun. However, the luster from Lin Yuan’s completely jade-textured white sandalwood rice beads made the five kinds of blessing patterns become distinct, causing Lin Yuan to look very worldly.","The vendor looked at the bright rice beads on Lin Yuan’s body curiously and asked, “Brother, isn’t the fluorite on your body heavy?”","Then his eyes never left the palm-sized Five Fortune Ranchu in Lin Yuan’s palm. His gaze was full of hidden desire.","When Listen, who was at the side, heard the vendor’s words, he blinked with some dismay. This vendor was really insightful to recognize the completely jade-textured white sandalwood as fluorite. Fluorite, which emitted a luster in daylight, was generally used to make stone sculptures, and even tacky people wouldn’t wear them as an accessory.","Lin Yuan ignored the vendor’s words and asked, “Boss, are you interested in this Bronze I/Elite Five Fortune Ranchu? It has reached Elite at Bronze I and has a high possibility of breaking through to Flawless or Epic at Bronze X!”","When the vendor heard Lin Yuan’s words, he gulped and asked, “You want to trade this Spirit-Siphon Goldfish with the Green Oxygen Sea Anemone? I’m willing to give you all the deep-sea Butterfly Shells in this water tank!”","The corner of Lin Yuan’s mouth couldn’t help but twitch a little. Why was this vendor always thinking of cheating him?","“There are more than 600 deep-sea Butterfly Shells in this water tank. I’ll give you the Star Web price of five Radiance dollars each. If you give me 3,000 Radiance dollars, I’ll give you this Bronze I/Elite Spirit-Siphon Goldfish.”","The Spirit-Siphon Goldfish could be sold for around 60 Radiance dollars at Elite I/Elite.","If a fey like the Spirit-Siphon Goldfish, which was extremely difficult to advance, reached Bronze I/Elite and was traded, the price should be around 2,500 Radiance dollars.","The price of the Five Fortune Ranchus was a little more than double that of an ordinary Spirit-Siphon Goldfish because it was auspicious. It was around 5,500 Radiance dollars.","Lin Yuan wanted to exchange it for the Gold Green Oxygen Sea Anemone because it could constantly filter out oxygen in the seawater, just like a natural oxygen bottle that could constantly supply oxygen.","The Green Oxygen Sea Anemone was very common in Indigo Azure City, a city by the sea.","The Green Oxygen Sea Anemone, which was in poor condition just now, was worth around 300 Radiance dollars.","Lin Yuan had asked the vendor to give him an extra 3,000 Radiance dollars because he clearly intended to earn 500 Radiance dollars from the vendor who always wanted to make a profit from him.","The vendor obviously hesitated when he heard Lin Yuan’s offer. If he took out the Gold Green Oxygen Sea Anemone and 3,000 Radiance dollars to exchange for the Spirit-Siphon Goldfish, if he didn’t make a large sum of money from selling everything at the Indigo Azure Sea Market, then he wouldn’t be able to spend his days lying down but asking to work for other people for the next decade!","At that moment, Lin Yuan said to the vendor, “The Spirit-Siphon Goldfish is considered a good product and is very marketable.","“Even if you want to sell this after the sea market, you can still easily do so.","“Furthermore, as long as the Bronze I/Elite Spirit-Siphon Goldfish successfully advance to Flawless, its price can be increased by more than ten times in the blink of an eye.”","The vendor felt that the youth in front of him who was luring him to buy the Spirit-Siphon Goldfish was like a devil.","He was luring himself to the cliff edge with a big cheese and then kicked. For some reason, the vendor suddenly had a sense of crisis! However, it was soon suppressed by desire. This big chunk of cheese smelled too good!","The vendor gnashed his teeth, slapped his thigh fiercely, and replied, “Brother, I’ll buy it.”","Lin Yuan then exchanged with this vendor. At that moment, Lin Yuan had the three Red Water Blood Snakes with the horned dragon bloodline and the Gold Green Oxygen Sea Anemone that the Mother of Bloodbath required.","A very gentle voice sounded not far away at this moment.","“Brother, are you willing to part with these three Red Water Blood Snakes? I’m willing to pay 100 Radiance dollars for each.”","This gentle voice made the eyes of the vendor, who had been in love with the Five Fortune Ranchu in his hands, widen.","At that moment, the vendor thought, This person isn’t trying to act along with this strange-masked youth, right!?","But immediately after, the vendor replied, “F*ck!”","He seemed to be giving away the three trash snake feys for free just now. Why was the person paying 100 Radiance dollars each?","Lin Yuan turned around and saw a thin youth sitting in a wheelchair with an elegant scholarly aura. However, he used a fleece blanket to cover his legs, so he must have some leg problems.","Upon seeing the youth’s thin appearance, Lin Yuan felt that his legs were not injured but had been disabled for many years.","Lin Yuan said, “I’m very interested in these three Red Water Blood Snakes, so I really can’t part with them.”"]},{"number":438,"title":"Chapter 438: In a Flurry","paragraphs":["After saying that, Lin Yuan stored the cage containing the three Red Water Blood Snakes and the Gold Green Oxygen Sea Anemone into the Diamond fey storage box.","At that moment, he felt several sharp aura sweeping toward him and heard a middle-aged man with three scars on his face standing behind this thin youth say in a deep voice, “Why don’t I talk to our Young Master? The Red Water Blood Snake is only about 70 Radiance dollars. You—”","Before he could finish, he froze. The thin youth frowned, glanced behind at him, and said, “Uncle Fu, it’s not the same outside as being at home. Control your temper.”","The thin youth turned and nodded apologetically at Lin Yuan, but Lin Yuan didn’t care.","When he was about to leave with Liu Jie and Listen, Lin Yuan saw the vendor show a smile that was worse than crying.","“You knew before that those three snake feys were some kind of Red Water Blood Snake?”","Lin Yuan nodded at his words and thought, Not only did I know that these three snake feys are Red Water Blood Snakes, but I also know that they have the horned dragon bloodline.","If he told this vendor, Lin Yuan was really afraid that he would start wailing.","Despite thinking so, Lin Yuan said, “Boss, we’re leaving. You should nurture that Bronze I/Elite Spirit-Siphon Goldfish well.”","Upon hearing that, the vendor stomped his feet in anger. However, when he saw the indistinct smile on Lin Yuan’s face, this vendor’s hair stood up.","Then the vendor felt an unusual headache. He had actually wanted to make a big sum of money, but he earned nothing in the end and even lost 300 Radiance dollars.","If he hadn’t complied and given the three Red Water Blood Snakes, he could have earned 300 Radiance dollars from them!","He might also have been able to use these three Red Water Blood Snakes to sell the deep-sea Butterfly Shells to the little cripple on the wheelchair.","The more he thought about it, the more this vendor’s heart ached. He carefully placed the Spirit-Siphon Goldfish in the tank where the deep-sea Butterfly Shells were kept.","Only when he felt that the condition of his aquatic feys had improved did he feel much better.","He was waiting in the middle of the stall for cash cows to come.","Lin Yuan was communicating with the Mother of Bloodbath.","“Why do you have an evil smile on your face? Is there something wrong with the Spirit-Siphon Goldfish you gave that vendor?”","Upon hearing that, Lin Yuan hurriedly shook his head and answered, “Don’t wrong me. This Spirit-Siphon Goldfish is healthy and has a good exclusive skill.”","The Mother of Bloodbath had not carefully observed the Spirit-Siphon Goldfish that Lin Yuan had traded out. However, seeing the strange smile on Lin Yuan’s face, the Mother of Bloodbath knew that there must be something wrong with them. It just didn’t know where the problem lay.","Lin Yuan felt that the next time he saw this vendor, this vendor would definitely hit him.","The exclusive skill that those Spirit-Siphon Goldfish had was Dirt Removal. It could remove the dirt on the other feys within the range.","The substandard shells were coated with a layer of artificial glaze that was almost indistinguishable from the superior-class Butterfly Shells. With this exclusive skill, he believed that the glaze attached to the surface of the substandard shells would be stripped off in less than two hours.","Lin Yuan had specially picked the Spirit-Siphon Goldfish with Dirt Removal from the school of fish in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","He felt that Indigo Azure City should send him a banner printed with ‘cheater killer’ on it.","Lin Yuan felt the condition of the three Red Water Blood Snakes in the amber-button-shaped Diamond fey storage box, and they were significantly better than before when they had just been sprinkled with realgar.","He turned to the Mother of Bloodbath and asked, “Mother of Bloodbath, do you have any requirements for the quality of those three Red Water Blood Snakes?”","The Mother of Bloodbath answered with some melancholy, “These three Red Water Blood Snakes have the hornless dragon bloodline and are fantastically gifted.","“The best way is for them to awaken the hornless dragon bloodline at Bronze and reach Epic.","“My nurturing of the three Red Water Blood Snakes is actually similar to you humans nurturing feys.","“However, they don’t need to comprehend the Willpower Rune but can instead share my Blood Law.”","Hearing the Mother of Bloodbath’s words, Lin Yuan said, “Leave these three Red Water Blood Snakes with me first and also awakening their bloodline and enhancing their quality.”","The Mother of Bloodbath was silent for a moment and then gently replied, “Okay.”","It thought that the youth that needed its protection back then in Millstone Town had now begun to help take on a big burden, which was something difficult for itself to do. In just six months, the youth had long grown up without realizing it.","The skinny youth sitting in a wheelchair in front of the stall noticed that the person behind him did not move and asked, “Uncle Fu, since we’re rarely outside for once, push me to the front.”","The thin youth’s words seemed to have woken up the middle-aged man with three scars on his face.","When the middle-aged man was awakened, he subconsciously pushed the wheelchair with force, causing the thin youth sitting in the wheelchair to bump.","The middle-aged man with three scars on his face hurriedly said, “I lost focus and have disturbed Third Young Master.”","The thin youth didn’t care and asked with some curiosity, “I remember that even though Uncle Fu’s Ice Heart Lionfish has not yet become a Myth Breed, it has already broken through to Suzerain. Why did you lose focus?”","The middle-aged man with three scars on his face answered with a grim expression, “When I oppressed that masked youth with my aura just now, the blood in my body went out of my control in a flash.","“The blood flooded into my brain and heart, causing me to lose focus.”","The eyes of the thin youth that was called Third Young Master lit up. An evil and unrestrained smile hung on his scholarly, gentle face.","“Blood flowing backward and losing focus? How interesting!”","...","Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, and Listen had bought a lot of things in the few hours in Indigo Azure Sea Market. Liu Jie and Listen watched Lin Yuan purchase a lot of feys and spiritual materials that grew in the sea.","He only bought the marine feys that were of special quality or have mutated. Lin Yuan had mostly purchased all kinds of rare spiritual materials that were only produced in the sea.","After purchasing a large amount of resources, Lin Yuan had a rich harvest. Even though Listen and Liu Jie had long known how deep Lin Yuan’s foundation was, they couldn’t help but have a new perception of it again and again at this moment."]},{"number":439,"title":"Chapter 439: Mutual Harm!","paragraphs":["When Lin Yuan purchased the feys and spiritual materials, Listen noticed the difference between Lin Yuan and those other young masters of the major factions.","Lin Yuan had a deep foundation, yet he didn’t squander it in the slightest. When he was purchasing those, he had a good grasp of the price and did not let himself be at the losing end.","It could be said that although he looked like he was buying a lot of goods in a large number, each transaction was a steal at a closer look.","In the eyes of Listen, Lin Yuan was earning resources while spending money.","Through the purchase of feys and spiritual materials, the snowball of the resources he could control was rolling bigger and bigger.","Such a vision and ability made Listen feel very admirable.","At this moment, Lin Yuan said to the old man in front of the stall, “Boss, the Blood Coral Crystals you sell here are now mine.”","The old man who traded with Lin Yuan looked at the Blood Coral Crystal heartbreakingly. Then he looked at the two pieces of completely jade-textured agarwood that were like black crystals and said with a big wave of his hand and some heartache, “You lucked out with the Blood Coral Crystals.”","Lin Yuan chuckled and replied, “Boss, you’re refined. Otherwise, you wouldn’t have preferred this agarwood with a subtle and imperceptible scent and could calm the mind.”","Hearing Lin Yuan’s words, the old man at the stall was visibly flabbergasted and asked, “I love the completely jade-textured agarwood. What does it have to do with its smell?”","It was Lin Yuan’s turn to be stunned.","“Boss, don’t you want this completely jade-textured agarwood for burning?”","The old man looked at Lin Yuan with dumbfounded eyes and shouted with trembling lips, “Don’t pretend after the transaction! Only a fool would be willing to burn this completely jade-textured agarwood. Making it into a large thumb ring is the best use of it.”","The old man in the stall only felt that the more he looked at the masked youth in front of him, the more he felt stuffy in his heart.","You’re tactful about the money!","Burning the agarwood? You’re so impressive, so why don’t you raise a few Legend feys at home!","When Lin Yuan heard the old man’s words, he took the Blood Coral Crystals he had exchanged and pulled Listen and Liu Jie to leave.","When they reached the depths of the Indigo Azure Sea Market, most of the feys and spiritual materials sold by the vendors were good stuff that was hard to find outside.","Such good stuff was naturally not sold casually but used by the stall vendors to exchange for the spiritual materials or feys they needed.","This old man wanted to exchange for completely jade-textured agarwood, and Lin Yuan fancied the Blood Coral Crystals that contained a lot of blood energy.","These Blood Coral Crystals contained extremely majestic blood energy, which was exactly what the Mother of Bloodbath needed, so Lin Yuan made the exchange.","Lin Yuan originally thought that he had met an enthusiast who liked the same agarwood as himself. This enthusiast was actually so unrefined that he wanted to make the agarwood into a large thumb ring.","He might as well crush the completely jade-textured agarwood into ink to practice calligraphy.","At this time, Liu Jie pointed to a distant stall and said, “Lin Yuan, there’s really someone selling water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh.","“However, it’s at an outrageous price. He actually goes as far as using the flesh of dimensional lifeforms of the same level from the abyss dimensional rift in exchange for the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh with a 1:10 ratio.","“Quite a few parts from the demons in the abyss dimensional rift are not cheap.","“The flesh of the water world dimensional lifeforms corrode directly in the air and emit a foul gas, which can be completely defined as a disgusting biochemical weapon.”","In Liu Jie’s opinion, taking the flesh of the demons in the abyss dimensional rift in exchange for the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh was inappropriate, even if it was a ratio of 1:100.","When Lin Yuan heard Liu Jie’s words, he looked into the distance, and his eyes lit up.","Lin Yuan had been looking for vendors selling the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh on this journey, but he hadn’t found a single stall.","He knew that the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh was too invaluable, and few people would keep it.","However, he didn’t expect to not find a vendor selling it in the Indigo Azure Sea Market, a place that specialized in marine resources, that happened once every decade in Indigo Azure City. Fortunately, he found one now.","Liu Jie glanced at the surrounding stalls and said to Listen and Liu Jie, “Big Brother Liu, Listen, you two also wander around. If you come across any spiritual materials that contain a huge amount of blood energy, help me buy them.","“And you guys can also buy any suitable resources you find.”","After saying that, Lin Yuan gave each Listen and Liu Jie a golden silk brocade pouch that was fully stuffed.","Then, Lin Yuan went toward the vendor who wanted to exchange the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh for the abyss dimensional rift lifeforms’ flesh.","Liu Jie and Listen glanced at the pouch Lin Yuan handed over, and they almost dropped it on the ground.","The two brocade pouches were filled with 30 fire-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls produced by the Scorching Elemental Shellfish. This was a huge fortune.","Liu Jie saw that Lin Yuan had already walked to the stall and said to Listen, “You go to the left side, and I’ll go to the right. We’ll both exchange for resources on each side.”","Upon hearing that, Listen suddenly smiled mysteriously and replied, “Big Brother Liu, why don’t we compete to see who can exchange more resources with these 30 heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls in the pouch?”","Liu Jie smiled straightforwardly and answered with a grin, “Sure. I lost the bet last time, and you made me eat 30 lemons!","“We’ll bet this time, and whoever loses will have to eat 50 Gold chili peppers!”","Listen felt his mouth begin to become numb as if his cheeks had swollen up, hot and painful.","Listen hurriedly said, “Big Brother Liu, 50 Gold chili peppers will kill someone! Why don’t we change it into Bronze ones?”","Liu Jie glanced at him and snorted.","“Since we have to gamble, we have to gamble on something exciting. If you think the Gold chili peppers are too much for you, we’ll change it into Silver ones.”","Liu Jie’s compromise excited Listen, and he clapped his hands.","“Since we pursue excitement, we’ll do it all the way! I request to change the 50 Gold chili peppers into one Platinum ghost pepper. Big Brother Liu, do you dare to do it?”","Liu Jie was now full of only one thought. Wouldn’t he have to sleep on his back for at least a month after eating a Platinum ghost pepper! This was simply mutual harm!","However, Listen, who was afraid to eat spicy food, was not afraid. Why did he have to be scared?","“We’ll do it! You’re not allowed to drink milk an hour after eating!”","Listen didn’t expect Liu Jie to be so daring and had actually thought of not letting him drink milk. Listen had an idea and added another one.","“Not drinking milk is nothing! If you have the guts, drink iced cola immediately after eating the Platinum ghost pepper!”"]},{"number":440,"title":"Chapter 440: Increased Endurance","paragraphs":["Liu Jie and Listen glanced at each other, and both felt that the other was a ruthless person, but once they remembered the taste of the Platinum ghost pepper, they hurriedly set off in both directions and used the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls produced by the Scorching Elemental Shellfish in the golden silk brocade pouch to exchange for resources.","The old man, who had thought Lin Yuan was pretentious, once again doubted life. He had thought that these two youths who had just bet in front of his stall were just two childish people. He didn’t expect that they actually suddenly became ruthless!","The combination of these three people was one pretentious person! And two ruthless people!","It was simply too strange!","Lin Yuan had already reached the Indigo Azure Sea Market’s core area. Most of the feys and spiritual materials sold at the border of the Indigo Azure Sea Market were relatively ordinary, and very few were eye-catching.","However, the more he walked to the core area of the Indigo Azure Sea Market, the rarer and better the quality of the spiritual materials and feys he could exchange.","Previously, there was only one way to the outer area of the Indigo Azure Sea Market, but the roads to the core area had become more. This made Lin Yuan increasingly feel that this Indigo Azure Sea Market was like a huge maze.","In Lin Yuan’s opinion, the layout of the core area was not friendly to those with a bad sense of direction!","This large stall was the coldest in front of the middle-aged man who exchanged water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh for abyssal world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh.","This middle-aged man was also happy and sized up the stalls around, just like a patroller patrolling a territory.","Several Platinum fey storage boxes were placed beside him, and he saw Lin Yuan walk over.","The middle-aged man hurriedly stood up and asked, “Do you want to exchange for the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh?”","Lin Yuan nodded and replied, “Uncle, you should’ve flesh of Class 3 water world dimensional lifeforms that are equivalent to Gold feys, right?”","As soon as the middle-aged man heard Lin Yuan’s words, he raised his hands, and Lin Yuan saw he was wearing two exaggerating rings on his hands.","The middle-aged man chuckled and said, “I have two Diamond fey storage boxes of water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh, from Class 2 to Class 5.","“However, I’ll have to say this beforehand. If you exchange for the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh without a Diamond fey storage box, you have to buy these Platinum fey storage boxes in front of me.","“I don’t want to be driven out by my own people.”","When Lin Yuan heard this middle-aged man’s words, he nodded in deep understanding. Lin Yuan had smelled the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh, and this smell couldn’t be covered even by the Shellfish Vapor Coral’s shellfish vapor.","If he took out the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh, the spirit qi professionals in this Indigo Azure Sea Market would experience a chain reaction of dissolved materials in the stomach.","At the same time, Lin Yuan also learned this middle-aged man’s identity from his words. This middle-aged man had said that he didn’t want to be driven away by his own people, which meant that he should be one of the Indigo Azure Guards.","The Indigo Azure Guards managed the Indigo Azure Sea Market. At the same time, it could also explain why this middle-aged man had two Diamond fey storage boxes full of high-class water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh.","As long as an opened water world dimensional rift appeared in the sea near the Indigo Azure City, and the water world dimensional lifeforms that gushed out from it threatened the safety of the residents on the shore of Indigo Azure City, the Indigo Azure Guards would have to exterminate these rebellious water world dimensional lifeforms.","This middle-aged man should also represent the entire Indigo Azure Guards. He wanted to take advantage of this Indigo Azure Sea Market to see if he could exchange the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh that had been accumulated during this decade for some relatively useful resources.”","“Uncle, I have the fey storage box that contains the abyssal demons’ flesh. The amount I want may be a bit more.”","The middle-aged man was happy to hear that and replied cheerfully, “As long as you don’t take the Gold dimensional lifeforms’ flesh for land reclamation, I have enough here!”","Lin Yuan took a Platinum fey storage box out of the amber-button-shaped Diamond fey storage box and started to put the Gold abyssal demons’ flesh from the leaf-shaped Diamond fey storage box into the Platinum fey storage box.","He filled it with half of the remaining 3,000 Class 3 demons’ flesh from his leaf-shaped Diamond fey storage box and handed the Platinum fey storage box filled with 1,500 demons’ flesh to the middle-aged man in front of him.","This middle-aged man took a look at it and coughed. Then he asked with some surprise, “You’re exchanging so much Class 3 demons’ flesh for Class 3 water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh?”","Lin Yuan nodded. It was the most suitable for Red Thorn to devour Class 3 dimensional lifeforms’ flesh to raise its grade and quality at Silver/Fantasy Breed.","It was not a picky eater and absorbed the flesh energy from the dimensional lifeforms’ flesh. Therefore, there was not much difference in nature eating the demon dimensional lifeforms’ flesh and the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh.","Red Thorn had devoured a large amount of the unique acidic and withering inherited of the demons’ flesh and had a grasp on it. It could also be inherited from the child ramets and ramets produced by Spore Growth.","Thus, eating the Class 3 demons’ flesh only served to digest the blood energy for Red Thorn.","During this period, Lin Yuan discovered in his observation of Red Thorn that it had previously devoured the flesh of nearly 100 Gold water world dimensional lifeforms.","In addition to making the twelve one-meter useless petals of Red Thorn mutate into gill-shaped petals, it also vaguely controlled the decaying characteristics of the water world dimensional lifeform.","This decaying characteristic didn’t mean that Red Thorn would cause the target to decay after striking it.","Rather, after death, the child ramets and ramets summoned by Red Thorn would quickly decay and become nutrients for other living child ramets and ramets to absorb.","Although Red Thorn’s endurance had been greatly enhanced with Eye of Relinquish, if it completely mastered the water world dimensional lifeforms’ decaying characteristics, then there was no doubt that Red Thorn could again increase its endurance.","The endurance was a guarantee that Red Thorn spawned a lush and stable sea of flowers, so naturally, the more, the better.","Lin Yuan and this middle-aged man finished exchanging this large batch of water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh in a short while.","After the exchange, besides giving Lin Yuan 15,000 Gold water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh, this middle-aged man also gave him an additional 500 Gold water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh.","After pondering for a moment, Lin Yuan asked this middle-aged man, “Uncle, I wonder if we can exchange contact numbers? I may need more water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh in the future, so it’ll be convenient for us to trade again then.”"]},{"number":441,"title":"Chapter 441: A New Heaven and Earth Fey","paragraphs":["The middle-aged man was naturally very happy to hear that and said with a cheerful laugh, “It’s a deal. You can use any kind of dimensional lifeforms’ flesh in exchange for the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh here.","“But if you take the flesh of alien insects and water world dimensional lifeforms, the exchange ratio won’t be as large as the abyssal dimensional lifeforms.”","Lin Yuan was indifferent. As long as he could exchange for the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh, Lin Yuan would gain no matter what the ratio was.","He couldn’t help but have the idea of exchanging all the dimensional lifeforms’ flesh in the leaf-shaped Diamond fey storage box for water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh.","But immediately after that, he dispelled that thought. Anyway, he could contact this middle-aged man in the future. Even if he left the Indigo Azure Sea Market, there were still plenty of opportunities to make the exchange through Ostrich Logistics.",",500 Gold water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh was enough for Red Thorn to digest and devour for a long time.","Lin Yuan left this middle-aged man’s stall before heading toward the different areas where Liu Jie and Listen went. Along the way, he purchased nothing.","There were extremely many treasures in this world. At the core area of the Indigo Azure Sea Market, even Lin Yuan had to spend a lot to buy the rare spiritual materials and feys. Therefore, he would have one less bargaining chip in his hand each time he bought something.","It was likely that he might not be able to get the capital to compete on prices with others when he encountered feys or spiritual materials he really needed.","Lin Yuan saw many buyers were competing on prices for the same fey or spiritual material in front of many stalls.","Even if the price competition between the two buyers offered spiritual materials of the same value and were equally good, there were always feys and spiritual materials suitable for the stall owner. The final exchange, in the end, would have to be decided by the stall owner.","As Lin Yuan walked, the Mother of Bloodbath’s peculiar and pleasant voice was filled with urgency.","“Lin Yuan, there is extremely dense blood energy ahead, which is tremendous and pure. It will be of great use to me.”","Lin Yuan hurriedly followed the Mother of Bloodbath’s directions and reached a stall. He noticed that a man and a woman were standing in front of the stall. The short-haired young woman was carefully looking at a long crimson vine.","He saw many pentagonal leaves grown on the crimson vine. The leaves were dark green, with many scarlet veins like blood vessels. There was an opening on the upper branch of the vine, and the crimson sap condensed on the surface of the vine opening, just like a solidified blood scab.","Lin Yuan recognized at a glance that this vine-like fey was not an ordinary one. Rather, it was a Heaven and Earth Fey, the Blood Brew Grapevine.","This blood scab should be the wound from cutting off the bunch of Blood Brew Grapes in advance when the stall owner came to the Indigo Azure Sea Market to trade this Blood Brew Grapevine.","The short-haired woman in front of this stall was bargaining with the stall owner, only to hear him say, “I only exchange the Blood Brew Grapevine for three items. A Heaven and Earth Fey of the similar grade to this Blood Brew Grapevine, a Bronze/Epic fey, or a strategic-class resource.","“Although your three Broil Fire Worker Ants are Bronze/Epic, such fire-type feys are of little use in Indigo Azure City.","“In other cities, these three Broil Fire Worker Ants’ exclusive skills are not considered outstanding, so don’t be unconvinced, little girl.","“Even if you take out seven of them, I would still hesitate to exchange them with you, let alone the fact that you only took out three of them.”","The stall owner was clearly impatient as he spoke.","The short-haired woman hesitated slightly before taking out three more source-type lifeforms. “Source-type lifeforms are also considered source-type reserves in a sense, so I’ll add these three source-type lifeforms in exchange for this Blood Brew Grapevine.”","The stall owner waved his hand.","“Three source-type items are at most equal to half a Bronze/Epic Broil Fire Worker Ant.","“I’ll trade with you if you take out another eight source-type lifeforms in addition to these three Bronze/Epic Broil Fire Worker Ants.”","The short-haired woman replied with an ugly expression, “I don’t have eight source-type lifeforms, only six—”","Before she could finish her words, the stall owner interrupted rudely, “I’m too lazy to bargain. The offer I’ve given you is already the best. If not because I didn’t want to raise the second bunch of Blood Brew Grapes after the first bunch, I wouldn’t exchange with source-type lifeforms.”","The man beside the short-haired woman was a little unhappy by the old man’s impatient tone. He said to the short-haired woman, “Shan Liang, how about I lend you two source-type lifeforms, and you exchange this Blood Brew Grapevine first?”","The short-haired woman called Shan Liang’s face immediately turned ugly. She replied to the youth beside her, who had dyed his hair purple, “Wei Dabao, I told you I’m materialistic, and I don’t like you. You started not to pester me, but what’s the matter with you thinking about loaning me things all day long?","“Even if I, Shan Liang, starve to death, I won’t let you, Wei Dabao, lend me a penny again.”","Wei Dabao, whose hair was bleached and dyed purple, immediately became somewhat aggrieved.","“Shan Liang, do you have a conscience? I’m still willing to lend you despite knowing you’re materialistic. Doesn’t that show how much I love you?”","Upon hearing that, Shan Liang felt bad gas rush forth from her stomach and let out a long burp. She said indignantly, “I’m lucky to be in the same class as you. Leave your things for someone else! Do you think you’re the bank of heaven and earth? The interest rate is unbearable!”","Lin Yuan looked at the man and woman in front of him, and for some reason, he instantly thought of Xin Ying and Zhang Xiaobai.","At the same time, he could feel the extreme desire of the Mother of Bloodbath for this Heaven and Earth Fey, the Blood Brew Grapevine.","This was because the Mother of Bloodbath had been in a state of frenzied exuberance from the moment it saw the Blood Brew Grapevine.","Although the Blood Brew Grapevine was inferior to the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree and Twin Red Pagoda in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, it was similar to the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus that parasitized on the Cinnabar Osmanthus Haworthia.","The Blood Brew Grapevine and Cinnabar Osmanthus Haworthia also produced fruits. However, the latter’s fruit enhanced spiritual energy, while the Blood Brew Grapes from the Blood Brew Grapevine could increase the qi and blood of the target.","It also made the cells in the body of the one that consumed it abnormally active in a short period and created a lot of blood."]},{"number":442,"title":"Chapter 442: The Troubleseeker Is Here","paragraphs":["The Blood Brew Grapevine might not be very valuable among the Heaven and Earth Feys, but it was definitely useful to the Mother of Bloodbath.","Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to check on the Blood Brew Grapevine.","[Fey Name]: Blood Brew Grapevine","[Fey Species]: Grape genus/Twin leaf genus","[Fey Grade]: Platinum (4/10)","[Fey Type]: Blood","[Fey Quality]: Epic","This Blood Brew Grapevine wasn’t just Platinum, but even its quality was at Epic.","Lin Yuan couldn’t help nodding with satisfaction as this Blood Brew Grapevine was already a matured Heaven and Earth Fey.","Once this Blood Brew Grapevine was purchased, it would grow Blood Brew Grapes as long as massive amounts of blood were supplied to it.","It didn’t need Lin Yuan to spend time and effort to nurture it.","Lin Yuan had already heard the resources required to make the trade earlier. As for the three Heaven and Earth Feys in Lin Yuan’s Spirit Lock spatial zone, he naturally wouldn’t use them in the trade.","As for the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, they would be considered strategic-class resources that the stall owner wanted for the trade.","However, Lin Yuan planned to use strategic-class resources like the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls only if it was the last resort. After all, Lin Yuan wasn’t certain if he would encounter any spiritual ingredients or feys that he or the Mother of Bloodbath would need in this Indigo Azure Sea Market.","All of a sudden, Lin Yuan recalled that he had recently enhanced those four Bronze/Epic Wind Chain Sparrows and the Bronze/Epic Wind Net Sparrow.","Lin Yuan immediately took two steps forward and summoned the four Wind Chain Sparrows and one Wind Net Sparrow.","He then lifted the five little sparrows and asked the stall owner, “Boss, are you willing to trade five of my Bronze/Epic feys with your Blood Brew Grapevine?”","The elder’s eyes narrowed slightly when Lin Yuan summoned the five palm-sized sparrows.","Seeing that the elder was able to instantly identify the poor exclusive skills of the three Broil Fire Worker Ants with a rough glance, Lin Yuan knew that this elder should be a Creation Master.","This elder was currently squinting his eyes and was probably trying to analyze the exclusive skills of the Wind Chain Sparrows and Wind Net Sparrow that Lin Yuan enhanced.","When Lin Yuan enhanced feys to Bronze/Epic, he always had a good habit. That would be to raise the fey’s quality to Epic when evolving to Elite grade. That way, Lin Yuan would be able to choose out of three exclusive skills when it evolved to Bronze.","As such, be it the four Wind Chain Sparrows or the Wind Net Sparrow, they all had rather exceptional exclusive skills. They were exclusive skills that could strengthen the combat capabilities of the Wind Chain Sparrows and the Wind Net Sparrow.","Lin Yuan immediately brought out extreme sincerity for this trade and didn’t wish to negotiate with the elder. It was due to the great importance this Blood Brew Grapevine was to the Mother of Bloodbath. Lin Yuan was afraid that the trade might just fall out.","After all, there were two others by the side. One was a woman who called herself green tea[1] and there was another flamboyant man with purple-dyed hair that was coveting the Blood Brew Grapevine.","Once the elder finished analyzing Lin Yuan’s feys, he slammed on the stall and said in a forthright manner, “Deal! This Blood Brew Grapevine is yours.”","Once the elder finished his statement, Lin Yuan revealed a smile. At the same time, Lin Yuan was silently praising how quick-witted he was.","After enhancing the five sparrows, Lin Yuan had spent close to two hours educating them so that they wouldn’t use the voice-like wind to quarrel with vulgarity.","Otherwise, once no one was overseeing the five sparrows, they would simply set up a stage to curse each other’s ancestors. What else could he do if the stall owner didn’t want to trade for these five sparrows?","Once Lin Yuan completed the trade, the short-haired woman named Shan Liang was rather disappointed. She involuntarily bit on her lips and was obviously unhappy.","All of a sudden, Lin Yuan heard the purple-haired youth yelling out. However, the yelling wasn’t targeted at Lin Yuan. It was obviously targeting the rather disappointed woman, Shan Liang.","“Shan Liang, I didn’t believe it when you said you are green tea earlier. But I believe it now.","“Based on your reaction and expression, do you wish to entice me to make a move and snatch that Blood Brew Grapevine from the masked brother for you?”","When Lin Yuan heard the statement, he couldn’t help blinking his eyes behind the mask.","What kind of shocking assumption was that?","As long as it was a human, if the trade wasn’t a success, there would definitely be disappointment, right?","Shan Liang’s expression immediately turned black like the bottom of a pot. She then pinched on the purple-haired youth’s ear and yelled, “Wei Dabao, had it not been for your father who came to the school and got me demerit points after I beat you up harshly previously, I would definitely make you crawl on the floor now!”","Shan Liang twisted Wei Dabao’s ear by nearly half a round before letting go.","Wei Dabao’s ear didn’t turn too red. Instead, it was his face that turned red first as he mumbled, “Shan Liang, this is what I like about you. You are just like the catfish in the water canal, forceful!”","Shan Liang immediately responded by reaching out her hands to pinch on Wei Dabao’s cheeks before giving two hard slaps on his neck. She then said, “See if my Soul Snatching Pinch can pinch you to death or if my Fickle Palm can slap you to death!”","Wei Dabao might be pleading for mercy due to Shan Liang’s attack, but his eyes were growing brighter.","At present, Lin Yuan couldn’t tell if Shan Liang and Wei Dabao were showing their love or trying to show their grudge?","They were truly a pair of old enemies and sweethearts!","Just as Lin Yuan was preparing to leave, he heard a rather sinister voice that echoed behind him.","“Kid, don’t be in a hurry to leave. I think your mask looks rather good, and I am very interested. Why don’t you sell it to me?”","Lin Yuan didn’t turn around after hearing the question, neither did he look at the person who spoke to him. However, Lin Yuan’s brows raised slightly.","Just from this statement, Lin Yuan knew that this person was specifically here to seek trouble.","Lin Yuan’s mouth revealed an arc.","Finally here!","Too slow!","When Lin Yuan had asked Listen to visit the Indigo Azure Sea Market together, he knew that someone would certainly look for him. However, he didn’t think that this person would take such a long time!","Lin Yuan really liked to see the Zheng family, one of the three prestigious families of Indigo Azure City, and what kind of methods they would use to deal with him.","[1] description of a woman who looks gentle on the outside but treacherous on the inside"]},{"number":443,"title":"Chapter 443: Still Buying?","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan knew that the Zheng family would look for him. To be frank, the Zheng family simply wanted to find out his status.","After calling for the assassinations on Listen, the Zheng family had already consecutively lost two king-class experts. One of them was even a pinnacle king-class expert.","The loss of the pinnacle king-class expert was already enough for the Zheng family to be apprehensive toward Listen. Therefore, before the Zheng family was able to find out the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s backer, they wouldn’t make a move on Listen first.","Since a pinnacle king-class expert was already dead, they would need to mobilize an emperor-class expert if they had to make another move.","The battle between emperor-class experts would involve Law Runes and power of law. It wasn’t like the battle between king-class experts which could be controlled.","If an emperor-class expert was to make a move recklessly, things might go overboard.","At this sensitive period, Lin Yuan had appeared beside Listen. Therefore, the Zheng family was obviously trying to ensure the relationship between Lin Yuan and Listen.","Lin Yuan was also waiting for this opportunity as he wanted to know if it was the Zheng family’s main family or the third lineage that had been targeting the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","Before Lin Yuan could turn around to talk, Wei Dabao, who had been on the receiving end of Shan Liang’s frenzied attacks, whistled and said, “Zheng Wenbo, didn’t you just receive a beating from your lineage’s brothers? I heard that your father transferred you to study in the Royal Capital?”","“Instead of staying in the Royal Capital, why did you bring your annoying shoehorn face here?” Shan Liang looked at Zheng Wenbo, her eyes filled with contempt and disgust.","The sinister-eyed Zheng Wenbo had already noticed Wei Dabao and Shan Liang, who stood beside them. However, Zheng Wenbo didn’t bother about Wei Dabao’s words as though he didn’t hear him.","However, Zheng Wenbo, whose expression was already sinister, had turned even darker.","When Lin Yuan turned around, Zheng Wenbo extended his hand and pointed at Lin Yuan before saying, “It is just a mask, give it to me, and maybe I’ll let you be my friend.”","Seeing Zheng Wenbo ignore him, Wei Dabao immediately said in a loud tone, “Oh!? It has just been a few months, Wenbo. You know how to act arrogant now, huh?","“People who don’t know you might think your Zheng family’s third lineage has become the main family, and you, Zheng Wenbo, have become the official Young Master Zheng!","“Isn’t that right? Shan Liang?”","When Shan Liang heard Wei Dabao mentioning her, she snorted and said, “Don’t talk to me. Talk to me again, and I will hammer you to death.”","Wei Dabao’s mouth twitched, but his eyes flashed with vague expectations.","Zheng Wenbo’s sinister face instantly turned so gloomy because of Wei Dabao’s words that it seemed like droplets would drip down. However, Zheng Wenbo’s attention was still on Lin Yuan as he thought of his father’s mission.","Zheng Wenbo had a certain level of understanding toward Wei Dabao. Wei Dabao was a collateral descendant of the Wei family, one of the three prestigious families in Indigo Azure City. Therefore, Wei Dabao wasn’t that easy to deal with.","If Wei Dabao managed to pester Zheng Wenbo, the objective of this mission might not be achieved.","Lin Yuan shook his head gently as he saw how Zheng Wenbo glared at him. Lin Yuan said in a clear voice, “If you are talking about being friends, then forget it. I don’t make friends with just anyone.”","“But if you are interested in my mask, I can be generous enough to sell it to you.”","After speaking, Lin Yuan circulated the spiritual power in his body.","As soon as the spiritual power was circulated, the moon-white robes, which were embedded with completely jade-textured beads, instantly lit up. It gave Lin Yuan an indescribable noble aura. At the same time, Hu Quan’s mask with completely jade-textured threads was emitting a gentle and jade-like halo under the afternoon sun.","The halo wasn’t dazzling, but it gave off a seven-colored jade luster. However, it was too eye-catching and didn’t outshine the afternoon sun’s radiance.","As the spirit qi was circulated around the completely jade-textured mask, it emitted an image of a grand city. It felt like a grand city hidden in the clouds and was indistinct.","The moment Lin Yuan’s mask lit up, everyone’s attention was attracted by the seven-colored jade luster.","Wei Dabao was surprised when he saw Lin Yuan’s mask and thought, Holy shit!","Wei Dabao then looked at Zheng Wenbo with a teasing expression.","Lin Yuan only circulated his spirit qi for a moment and stopped. He then looked at the sinister-looking youth and asked, “Still buying?”","Zheng Wenbo didn’t know how to answer Lin Yuan’s question. This was the Indigo Azure Sea Market, and if he said he wanted to buy it, he would need to bring out something equivalent in value.","Zheng Wenbo would be willing to take the resources out of his vault to exchange for rare spiritual ingredients and feys. However, if he bought this jade-textured mask, it was the same as buying a luxury item with no practical value.","From the jade luster of the mask, it seemed like the jade-textured wood thread was already five times the weight of normal wood. It had already reached the level of jade-textured wood that was of absolute grade.","Furthermore, given the weaving method of the mask, only a Class 5 Spirit Craftsman with a Fantasy Breed Wood Weaving House Centipede could do it.","Zheng Wenbo hadn’t planned to trade for any resources in the Indigo Azure Sea Market, so he hadn’t brought many resources with him.","He was the one that looked for trouble first but was now forced to be suspended in mid-air, making things very awkward. However, Zheng Wenbo didn’t understand how this jade-textured mask would emit a seven-colored jade luster.","Lin Yuan spoke again. “The value of my mask isn’t easy to estimate. There is at least a mix of a few dozen kinds of completely jade-textured wood threads in it. If you really like it, then show me your sincerity.”","Lin Yuan wasn’t a high-profile person. He was doing this to show the Zheng family’s third lineage his foundation. He was trying to tell them that he shouldn’t be trifled with.","At the same time, Lin Yuan wanted to find out the true objective of the Zheng family’s third lineage toward the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","Seeing that Zheng Wenbo didn’t have a way to step down, Wei Dabao let out a light cough. He stroked his purple hair and gave a comment. “Zheng Wenbo, I know you don’t have money. Stop pretending!","“But don’t be afraid even if you don’t have money. Who knew you would meet me here? Since we had been classmates for two hours. I can give you a loan!”","Zheng Wenbo’s sinister expression immediately broke open as he shouted, “Wei Dabao, can your mouth stop talking like the cotton pants of an old grandma!?”"]},{"number":444,"title":"Chapter 444: Don’t Strive So Much Until You Break Your Legs","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","When Wei Dabao heard Zheng Wenbo berating him, Wei Dabao’s face revealed a vaguely excited expression.","But immediately after, Wei Dabao realized that Shan Liang had already left. As such, Wei Dabao didn’t bother about Zheng Wenbo, whose expression had cracked open. Wei Dabao flung his purple hair flirtatiously and chased after Shan Liang.","At that moment, the Mother of Bloodbath’s strange and pleasant voice echoed in Lin Yuan’s mind. “Lin Yuan, the elder behind the youth, possesses Myth Breed feys, and he has more than one.”","Lin Yuan cast a glance at the elder standing behind Zheng Wenbo. The elder had a straight back and was giving off a cedar-like aura.","Lin Yuan’s eyes turned a little solemn. It seemed like this elder should be the emperor-class expert from the Zheng family’s third lineage.","From the standing position of the elder, one could see that this elder wasn’t from the Zheng family’s main family. If he was from the main family, he wouldn’t be standing behind the young master of the Zheng family’s third lineage.","Since the Zheng family’s third lineage had found him, they might have also looked for Liu Jie and Listen!","However, Lin Yuan wasn’t worried about Listen and Liu Jie’s safety.","With Endless Summer protecting them in the dark, there was probably no one in the Indigo Azure Sea Market that could harm them.","However, the appearance of this elder in front of Lin Yuan meant that the Zheng family’s third lineage was willing to mobilize an emperor-class expert in order to take over the coastal sea in the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s control.","This virtually expressed the attitude of the Zheng family’s third lineage. It made Lin Yuan even more curious about the Zheng family’s third lineage’s passion toward this coastal sea.","Lin Yuan quietly looked at this Young Master Zheng with an amused expression. After hearing what the purple-haired youth said earlier, this sinister-looking youth should be the person backing the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce in the Royal Capital.","The pinnacle king-class expert that Endless Summer had killed had probably been sent by this sinister-looking youth too.","Under Lin Yuan’s attention, Zheng Wenbo’s expression looked increasingly unpleasant.","This is simply too shameful! I originally wanted to use the method of seeking trouble to test the foundation of this youth in the strange mask. But I just had to mention the mask. Now that Wei Dabao knows, everyone within my circle will probably know too. This is the same as letting myself die in society.","Just as Zheng Wenbo was about to speak, Lin Yuan spoke. “Since you are feeling bashful, then I shall not force you to buy it.","“If you wish to buy something in the Indigo Azure Sea Market, you better check your capability in order not to shame yourself.","“Of course, it is the same logic for anything else.”","After speaking, Lin Yuan kept the Blood Brew Grapevine into the amber button-shaped fey storage box and turned away.","Zheng Wenbo’s eyes turned serious after hearing Lin Yuan’s statement. He could feel an attitude from the statement. It felt as though Lin Yuan never put Zheng Wenbo in his eyes, and it sounded like a warning too.","Zheng Wenbo might be born in the Zheng family’s third lineage, but he was still a young master of the Zheng family. When outside, everyone would address him as Young Master Zheng.","Zheng Wenbo’s anger surged as Lin Yuan provoked him.","The elder with the straight back and cedar-like aura looked in the direction where Lin Yuan left and placed his hand on Zheng Wenbo’s shoulder. “Wenbo, you have already done well for the mission Master gave you. Why are you unhappy?”","Zheng Wenbo took a deep breath. His face might not be angry anymore, but his eyes were like a vulture looking at rotten flesh.","“Grandpa Jiao, did you feel any presence of experts beside him?”","The elder patted on Zheng Wenbo’s shoulder and said, “I didn’t feel any powerful presence at all. Unless... the enemy is stronger than me and is purposely concealing their presence.","“Let’s go and report back to Master. See what Master asks us to do next.”","Zheng Wenbo revealed a sinister grin and said, “He doesn’t have any expert’s protection and dares to talk so arrogantly? Given my understanding toward my father, Grandpa Jiao might be troubled to make another trip tonight.”","The elder with the straight back smiled and said, “No trouble. It just so happens that the Cold Snow Pine will be breaking through tonight.”","Once Zheng Wenbo left with the elder, a youth in a wheelchair appeared. His evil smile brightened further.","A man with three scars on his face stood behind the crippled youth. “Third Young Master, we have been outside for a long time. Let’s go back.”","The skinny and frail crippled youth didn’t respond to the scarred man. He looked to be in high spirits as he said, “I heard that Second Brother is standing on the third lineage’s side. Seems like Second Brother is truly striving hard, huh? I can’t even walk.”","The scarred man’s back was drenched in a cold sweat when he heard the Third Young Master’s words. He quickly lowered his head and didn’t dare to reply. He even tried his best to slow down his breathing.","The frail youth in the wheelchair continued. “I can’t even walk, but Second Brother is striving so hard. Hehe! He is really my good Second Brother!”","The scarred man suddenly felt his bones chilling up when the Third Young Master said, ‘good Second Brother’.","At this moment, the frail youth’s evil smile suddenly withdrew. “I have to make the Second Brother strive on my behalf too.”","The frail youth’s eyes flashed with ruthlessness and cruelty. He then extended his hand with six fingers and looked at his palm.","“Earlier on, you said when you released qi prowess against that person, your blood vessels flowed in reverse, and your mind was disrupted. I wonder if such an iron plate is enough for my Second Brother to strive so hard that he breaks his legs!”","Suddenly, a breeze of sea wind blew into the Indigo Azure Sea Market.","Because of the sea wind, the frail youth suddenly coughed. When coughing, his ruthless eyes turned mild like jade.","“The wind is here. Push me to grandfather’s place. It has been a long time since I played chess with my grandfather.”","The scarred man lowered his head while sweat gathered at the tip of his nose before dripping on the ground and making a small splash.","After receiving the Third Young Master’s command, he quickly responded, “Yes, Third Young Master.”","Just as Lin Yuan was preparing to explore the Indigo Azure Sea Market, he suddenly saw Liu Jie and Liu Jie running toward him. They looked to be rather anxious."]},{"number":445,"title":"Chapter 445: Iron Bucket Sister Plan 3.0—Launched!","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan saw Liu Jie and Listen running toward him, and he rushed forward to meet them and thought, Did the people from the Zheng family’s third lineage really went to find trouble with Liu Jie and Listen?","Just as Lin Yuan was about to ask, Liu Jie said with some urgency, “Lin Yuan, come with us. There is a piece of Mountain-Containing Embryo.”","When he heard that, his pupils fiercely shrank, and his eyes were full of joy.","Lin Yuan now had a total of four Fantasy Breed feys—the Source Sand, Jasmine Lily, Red Thorn, and Chimey. Chimey’s quality had improved after metamorphosing into a Fantasy Breed fey, so Lin Yuan didn’t need to worry about it anymore.","As long as Lin Yuan could provide enough strange flames for his Heaven and Earth Fey, the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree, it was possible to raise Chimey to Fantasy V.","Lin Yuan also didn’t have to worry about Red Thorn. As long as Red Thorn kept eating, it could be promoted from Fantasy I sooner or later.","However, after Jasmine Lily and the Source Sand became a Fantasy Breed, Lin Yuan didn’t do much in terms of quality improvement.","Lin Yuan had been stuck at the C-rank spirit qi professional rank. He wanted to rely on the spiritual power of a C-rank spirit qi professional to promote a Fantasy Breed fey’s quality but to no avail.","He had tried thinking of a way, but these treasures to enhance the quality of Fantasy Breeds were too rare. Lin Yuan had not been able to find them, even if he tried to do so.","The Mountain-Containing Embryo that Liu Jie had mentioned was a kind of treasure that could enhance earth-type Fantasy Breed feys and source-type lifeforms and was considered a rare strategic-class resource.","Although the Source Sand was of the sand element, it was also considered a variant of the earth element and belonged to the same element.","Of course, strategic-class resources like the Mountain-Containing Embryo did not only enhance the quality of earth-type Fantasy Breed feys and source-type items.","However, in Lin Yuan’s mind, this Mountain-Containing Embryo’s greatest use on him was to promote the Source Sand from Fantasy I.","Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, and Listen quickly headed toward the stall where the Mountain-Containing Embryo appeared. Before he reached the stall, Lin Yuan noticed many people gathered around it.","Seeing this situation, Lin Yuan was a little anxious. He saw that most people were watching the fun. He, Liu Jie, and Listen pushed aside the crowd to squeeze inside. He emerged from the crowd and arrived at the transaction location next to the stall.","At that moment, Lin Yuan noticed an old man looking through an eyepiece and carefully examining a brownish-yellow spherical object that was half the size of a fist.","This brownish-yellow spherical object was very inconspicuous, like a potato. It was slowly beating in the old man’s hands like an embryo with life.","The stall owner was fat. When he saw Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, and Listen emerge from the crowd to the trading area in front of his stall, he reminded them, “If you plan to trade, you can check out these three items at my stall. I only exchange strategic-class treasures, feys, spiritual materials, and source-type lifeforms.","“But listen up, only strategic-class ones!”","When Lin Yuan heard the boss’ reminder, he responded, “I heard that you have a piece of Mountain-Containing Embryo. It’s something I desperately need, so I came here to take a look.”","Upon hearing that, this fatty stall owner made a gesture for them to go ahead and replied with a smile, “Then you’ll wait for Master Jing Liu to finish viewing this Mountain-Containing Embryo before you do so.","“The other two objects are not as rare as the Mountain-Containing Embryo, but they are also good. You can check them out yourself.”","As he spoke, the fatty stall owner sized up Lin Yuan. His gaze deliberately lingered on the mask Lin Yuan was wearing on his face for a few seconds before he moved his eyes away.","Lin Yuan lowered his head and skimmed the other two items on the stall. He did not pay much attention. However, he saw the old man, Master Jing Liu, had no sign of finishing observing the Mountain-Containing Embryo.","Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to check the three items on the stall, and they attracted his gaze.","His attention was not on the Mountain-Containing Embryo, which could allow the Source Sand to metamorphose into a Fantasy Breed and have its quality raised. Rather, it was the fairy-like spherical source-type lifeform.","It was only the size of a thumb and not conspicuous at all. However, Lin Yuan didn’t expect that it would actually be a fairy source-type lifeform as rare as an elemental source-type lifeform.","Lin Yuan was also an experienced person and wouldn’t be so attracted to ordinary fairy source-type lifeforms.","Liu Jie’s contracted Insect Queen was just a fairy source-type lifeform. Although Lin Yuan had only seen the Insect Queen’s true form when it entered a battle, he already had sufficient understanding of fairy source-type lifeforms.","This fairy source-type lifeform in front of him had attracted his attention because it was simply too suitable for Chu Ci. It was simply a source-type lifeform for his Iron Bucket Sister Plan 3.0. He could officially launch that plan with this fairy source-type lifeform.","This fairy source-type lifeform might have harsher contract conditions, but it was no effort at all for Lin Yuan.","When the boss saw Lin Yuan constantly staring at the fairy spherical source-type lifeform, he also ignored Lin Yuan and didn’t introduce the item to him.","He just sat there calmly, with a posture of ‘I have good stuff, and I’m not worried about being unable to sell them’.","Lin Yuan naturally wouldn’t let go of such a suitable source-type lifeform for Chu Ci since he had found one. He said to the fat boss, who had a satisfied face, “Boss, quote a price for this item in the middle.”","The fat boss patted his big belly and answered, “I refuse to bargain. Since you want to trade for the item in the middle, you should also know what it is, so you should also know the approximate price.”","After saying this, the fat boss chuckled and smiled unusually politely. He added another sentence, which made Lin Yuan choke a little.","“You can only quote a price once. I’ll trade it with you if I’m satisfied with it. Otherwise, you’re not fated with this item.”","Regardless of whether it was the usual transactions or release of the trading news in his Purchase With No Loss store, Lin Yuan was like a boss. Thus, he didn’t think he would be treated like this right now."]},{"number":446,"title":"Chapter 446: Burning Sunflower","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan now finally understood why most people in front of the fat boss’ stall were watching the fun but didn’t come forward to trade.","If their offer didn’t go through with the fat boss, they wouldn’t even have the chance to continue to talk further.","“Boss, this fairy source-type lifeform’s contract condition is too difficult. If we can’t find a pinnacle Class 4 Creation Master to help with this source-type lifeform, it’ll also be defective even if we can contract it.”","The fat boss rolled his eyes when he heard Lin Yuan say that.","“If it weren’t for the contract conditions, I wouldn’t have taken this fairy source-type lifeform out for trade. But even if you can’t find a pinnacle Class 4 Creation Master, you can contract this fairy source-type lifeform by finding a Class 4 Creation Master with some effort.”","Liu Jie and Listen, who were standing beside Lin Yuan, were at a loss. They didn’t understand what was going on between Lin Yuan and this stall owner.","When Lin Yuan heard this fat boss’ words, he shook his head and didn’t approve his statement. Under True Data, the contract condition of this fairy source-type lifeform, Burning Sunflower, was very special.","It could not be contracted directly by a spirit qi professional and had to be nurtured like a normal fey first.","When it was nurtured to Bronze/Legend, it could grow fully, but only when it reached Bronze/Epic spirit qi professionals could contract it, which was a kind of method of wasting its potential.","If the contractor chose to contract it, after the contract, the black-green fairy ball-like Burning Sunflower would bloom a flame-like flower, from which a Burning Sunflower Spirit would grow.","The Burning Sunflower would crystallize and become a resting place for the Burning Sunflower Spirit. At the same time, the Burning Sunflower Spirit would reach Normal I/Normal.","However, if the spirit qi professional contracted the Burning Sunflower at its full state at Bronze/Legend, the Burning Sunflower would grow two flame-like flowers that would then grow two identical Normal I/Normal Burning Sunflower Spirits.","These two identical Burning Sunflower Spirits shared the same grade and Willpower Rune and cast abilities together.","It could be said there was a tremendous difference when the contractor chose to contract the Burning Sunflower at Bronze/Legend and at Bronze/Epic.","In Lin Yuan’s opinion, no matter how suitable this Burning Sunflower was for Chu Ci, he would give up if he couldn’t let it reach its complete state before letting Chu Ci contract it.","Instead of making a compromise like this, it would be better to choose another one that could fully unleash its strength.","Lin Yuan weighed the value of this fairy source-type lifeform, the Burning Sunflower, and was about to make an offer.","The old man, who had been crouching down to check this Mountain-Containing Embryo, stood up and said with admiration, “This Mountain-Containing Embryo is really worthy of being good stuff that can only be produced from a Class 4 subterranean dimensional rift.","“I’ll offer two young Elemental Shellfish, which have a slightly higher price than this Mountain-Containing Embryo.”","The fat boss’ face revealed happiness. Meanwhile, Lin Yuan found that things were bad.","He didn’t expect this old man, who had crouched on the ground to look at the Mountain-Containing Embryo, would make an offer after standing up.","His offer was obviously slightly higher than the price of the Mountain-Containing Embryo itself. In this case, if he didn’t speak up quickly, Lin Yuan probably would not be fated with this Mountain-Containing Embryo.","“Boss, do you accept elemental pearls?”","When the fat boss heard Lin Yuan’s words, he immediately turned to glance at him and asked in surprise, “You want to exchange elemental pearls for this fairy source-type lifeform?”","Although the value of a single elemental pearl was far less than that of a fairy source-type lifeform, compared to the source-type lifeform, the status of the elemental pearl was obviously higher among the foundational resources.","After all, a single source-type lifeform had great limitations and was only valuable to a very small number of people. But most of the world’s feys had natural properties.","In addition to a few spiritual-type, blood-type, and poison-type feys, most feys use elemental pearls at the juncture of evolution, and there was a large degree of possibility to enhance their natural attributes and even help with their evolution.","It could be said that the versatility and functionality of elemental pearls were not at all comparable to a single source-type lifeform that had great limitations.","The old man who was called Master Jing Liu by the fat boss frowned slightly, as his speech was interrupted, but didn’t utter a word. Immediately after that, Lin Yuan’s words made Master Jing Liu frown even more.","“I’m not exchanging elemental pearls for this fairy source-type lifeform.”","Just as Lin Yuan spoke with a slight pause, the fat boss didn’t react in time.","If you’re not exchanging the elemental pearls for this fairy source-type lifeform, why did you ask me whether I accept elemental pearls?","The fat boss heard Lin Yuan’s words and was between a rock and a hard place.","“I’m going to use the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls to exchange for this Mountain-Containing Embryo of yours.”","Lin Yuan’s words caused the surrounding onlookers to cry out in shock.","The elemental pearls produced by the Elemental Shellfish needed highly pure spirit qi. Through concocting the spirit fluid and inducing the spirit qi, Creation Masters above Class 3 could help the Elemental Shellfish produce the elemental pearls.","However, the speed of Class 3 Creation Masters doing so was simply too slow, and only Creation Masters above Class 3 could induce the elemental pearls normally.","It was not a big deal to take out the elemental pearls, but heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls were different. This was the patent of Class 4 and above Creation Masters.","A Mountain-Containing Embryo definitely required a lot of heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls in exchange, which could indicate that the masked youth must have a powerful Creation Master behind him.","The fat boss glanced at Master Jing Liu and noticed that he was frowning badly, and","understood the situation was bad.","Master Jing Liu was an advanced Class 4 Creation Master. If Master Jing Liu had a bad opinion of himself, that would be a loss.","But compared to the Elemental Shellfish, the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls were a little more attractive to the fat boss.","This was because even if he had the Elemental Shellfish, he could only at most induce elemental pearls, and the prerequisite of inducing elemental pearls was that he needed the investment of a Creation Master."]},{"number":447,"title":"Chapter 447: Lin Yuan Who Takes It All","paragraphs":["Even if these Creation Masters were not used to nurture the elemental pearls to enhance feys and their quality, the benefit was not at all inferior to the value of using the elemental pearls produced by Elemental Shellfish.","Therefore, the fat boss was still more inclined to exchange the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls with Lin Yuan.","Unfortunately, this would inevitably offend Master Jing Liu, whose temper was not good and was known for his well-defined likes and dislikes.","Those people approved by Master Jing Liu could be treated as a family by him, but Master Jing Liu would never go soft on revenge against those he felt disgusted with.","The fat boss’ eyes turned, and a thought came to mind.","If he traded this Mountain-Containing Embryo to this masked youth in exchange for the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, Master Jing Liu might think badly of himself.","However, if he could make Master Jing Liu have the least opinion on him and transfer the hatred to this masked youth, then it would be worthwhile to exchange for the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","This masked youth was willing to exchange the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls for the Mountain-Containing Embryo, which meant that the Mountain-Containing Embryo was very important to him.","The fat boss didn’t answer Lin Yuan directly but looked at him and blinked twice. Lin Yuan saw the fat boss blink at him and understood what he meant.","When Master Jing Liu stood up earlier, Lin Yuan had seen the Class 4 Creation Master crest on Master Jing Liu’s chest.","The second star rose high, which meant that Master Jing Liu was an advanced Class 4 Creation Master. However, even if Master Jing Liu was an advanced Class 4, he wouldn’t give up on the Mountain-Containing Embryo, which was hard to find. Instead, he was bent on getting it in his hands.","At the same time, Lin Yuan couldn’t help but put his mind on the two young Elemental Shellfish in Master Jing Liu’s hands and thought, If I could get the two young Elemental Shellfish in Master Jing Liu’s hands, after inducing their mutation in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, they could produce a large number of heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","At that time, the resources that I can use will increase greatly.","Lin Yuan pondered for a moment and said to the fat boss, “I’m willing to take out 200 fire-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls produced by the Scorching Elemental Shellfish to exchange for this Mountain-Containing Embryo.”","The expression on the fat boss immediately appeared full of surprise when he heard that. However, the fat boss hurriedly concealed the joyful expression on his face and secretly looked at Master Jing Liu.","He noticed that Master Jing Liu didn’t look at him and was relieved. Master Jing Liu glanced at Lin Yuan for a long time, sighed, and said, “Little friend, how about you let me have this Mountain-Containing Embryo, and I’ll help you raise the source-type lifeform, Burning Sunflower, to Bronze/Epic after the trade?”","Master Jing Liu’s words caused the crowd to go into an uproar.","“F*ck! What’s happening? Is this a deal between big brothers? What kind of divine operation is it to earn a chance to raise the quality of a source-type lifeform to Bronze/Epic for nothing with a single bid?","“He’s worthy of an advanced Class 4 Creation Master. He offered a chance to raise a source-type lifeform to Bronze/Epic.","“Why aren’t the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls taken out! What if there aren’t any?”","As soon as this woman’s voice sounded, the surrounding people looked at her like she was an idiot.","In front of an advanced Class 4 Creation Master, was there really someone in the world who dared to lie and swindle an advanced Class 4 Creation Master?","When Lin Yuan heard Master Jing Liu’s words, he shook his head and said, “Master Jing Liu, the Mountain-Containing Embryo is related to my strength.","“Given your identity, you naturally know how unattainable the Mountain-Containing Embryo is. Since I’ve seen it, I naturally have to fight for it and not let it go.”","After saying that, Lin Yuan bowed to Master Jing Liu with cupped fists and expressed his apologies. Upon hearing that, Master Jing Liu sighed, and his expression became more complicated as he gazed at Lin Yuan.","Master Jing Liu actually felt quite an antipathy toward this youth who caused a sudden disruption and wanted to snatch the Mountain-Containing Embryo that he was about to get his hands on.","However, this bidding trade was a competition of only who would take out something better.","In Master Jing Liu’s opinion, if it were his own choice, even if two young Elemental Shellfish and 200 heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls were of equal value, he would not hesitate to choose the latter rather than the former.","Thus, Master Jing Liu had offered to raise the Burning Sunflower to Bronze/Epic.","After hearing the rejection, a fire surged up in Master Jing Liu’s heart. However, seeing this masked youth’s courteous and respectful attitude toward him, Master Jing Liu could not vent this anger.","It had to be said that Lin Yuan’s attitude had given Master Jing Liu a bit of a good impression. Nonetheless, his antipathy was a little more than this good impression, so Master Jing Liu looked at Lin Yuan with displeasure.","“Forget it. I want this Mountain-Containing Embryo for its pure majestic earth energy and the aura of the ley line roots.","“Since I’m not fated with it, I’ll go back and induce the two young Elemental Shellfish to mutate into Thick Earth Shellfish and nurture the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","“I’ll think of a way for the aura of the ley line roots. I don’t have to have the Mountain-Containing Embryo.”","When Lin Yuan heard Master Jing Liu’s words, he suddenly felt that he was a little cute. At the same time, he noticed that Master Jing Liu seemed to be a hidden chatterer, as he was speaking a long string of words.","The meaning of his last words was quite like borrowing comic books from a classmate at school, but the classmate wouldn’t lend.","One clearly wanted to read a comic book, yet said that they had a novel to read and didn’t care about reading comic books!","What an old and arrogant person!","Lin Yuan was still thinking of the two young Elemental Shellfish in Master Jing Liu’s hands!","Upon hearing Master Jing Liu say that he wanted to cultivate the earth-type elemental pearls, Lin Yuan hurriedly said, “Master Jing Liu, I have some heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls. How about I take out 200 of them to exchange for two of your young Elemental Shellfish?","“It’s also my apology.”","Master Jing Liu, who was still somewhat upset with Lin Yuan, was frozen upon hearing this.","What did this masked youth mean? He actually wants to exchange with me!?"]},{"number":448,"title":"Chapter 448: The Surplus Is Called Foundation","paragraphs":["After snatching the Mountain-Containing Embryo from me, he is now coveting my infant-stage Elemental Shellfish? Isn’t it too much!?","Master Jing Liu’s heart might show resistance in his heart, but his body was absolutely willing.","Even though he was an advanced Class 4 Creation Master, it would take him great effort and a very long period to produce 200 heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls from the Thick Earth Elemental Shellfish.","Furthermore, Lin Yuan was expressing his apology to him by using 200 heavenly-maiden-grade pearls to exchange for his two infant-stage Elemental Shellfish.","It was simply too sincere!","Master Jing Liu said straightforwardly, “This old one has a good impression of you. Since that is the case, I agree to trade with you, and I will still help you to enhance this Burning Sunflower to Bronze/Epic.","Lin Yuan quickly cupped his hands and bowed. “Many thanks for the master’s kindness. But I shouldn’t trouble the master for such small matters. If the master still needs heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, you can look for this junior directly.”","After finishing the statement, Lin Yuan flipped his hand, brought a big brocade box out of the button-shaped fey storage box, and handed it to Master Jing Liu.","Master Jing Liu opened the box to look and closed it before even counting them. He then smiled and said, “The pearl light is reserved and overflowing from within. The color is mild yet clear. The fire elements have filled up the color pores.","“These heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls that you handed over are considered superior among other heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.”","After saying that, Master Jing Liu took out his mobile phone and took the initiative to ask for Lin Yuan’s phone number. He then placed the two infant-stage Elemental Shellfish in a Platinum fey storage box before handing them to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan didn’t even check the Elemental Shellfish inside the fey storage box and simply stored them inside his button-shaped fey storage box.","Master Jing Liu laughed heartily and said, “You are a good kid. This old one likes you.”","After speaking, Master Jing Liu turned and left the stall.","At that moment, Lin Yuan realized that all the spectators and the fat boss of the stall, including Listen and Liu Jie, were all looking at him as though he was some immortal.","Lin Yuan was rather helpless as he simply took out another brocade box which was also filled with 200 heavenly maiden-grade elemental pearls.","Lin Yuan handed the brocade box to the fat boss. He then looked at the Burning Sunflower at the stall and asked the fat boss, “Boss, I wonder what resources I can use to trade for this source-type lifeform with you.”","When speaking, Lin Yuan reached up and rubbed the back of his head. After trading for two infant-stage Elemental Shellfish and the Mountain-Containing Embryo, Lin Yuan realized that he was now a pauper.","All of the heavenly-maiden-grade fire elemental pearls he had collected in the Spirit Lock spatial zone were those that the Twin Red Pagoda didn’t absorb. Excluding the 60 additional pearls that he had given to Liu Jie and Listen, he had spent another 400 pearls, leaving him with nothing.","Lin Yuan might have used 400 heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls to trade for plenty of strategic-class resources. Still, even if Lin Yuan had to die of hunger, he wouldn’t want to trade away these strategic-class resources.","Lin Yuan realized that his tendency to hoard was getting severe when he had control of more resources.","When something good was in his hand, Lin Yuan wouldn’t feel the heartache to give them to his companions. However, if Lin Yuan were to trade them away, he would feel the same as though someone was slicing his flesh.","The fat boss no longer had the expression as though nothing mattered. He quickly and passionately received the brocade box from Lin Yuan. He then slowly opened the cover of the brocade box before starting to count the heavenly maiden-grade elemental pearls inside.","After finishing the count, the fat boss rubbed the tip of his fingers as though he was reminiscing the texture of the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls that he had just touched.","The fat boss let out a radiant smile, however, he immediately felt a pinch by the idea that he had just thought of.","“Young Brother, this source-type fairy shall be given to you as a gift. I wonder if I can also exchange contacts with you? If I obtain any other good things in the future, I wish to trade for more heavenly maiden-grade elemental pearls with you.”","Lin Yuan didn’t think that he would encounter such a good scenario. When did his phone number become so valuable? An exchange of contact information actually allowed him to trade for a source-type fairy.","Lin Yuan had obtained two more infant stage Elemental Shellfish and could mutate them to produce more heavenly maiden-grade elemental pearls inside the Spirit Lock spatial zone. Those elemental pearls would then become the reserve of his strategic-class resources.","In the eyes of others, Lin Yuan might not be profiting and was actually incurring a small loss. However, Lin Yuan felt that once he nurtured those infant-stage Elemental Shellfish and placed them in the Spirit Lock Spatial zone for a few days, he would earn back everything.","Lin Yuan was planning to nurture the two infant-stage Elemental Shellfish into Thick Earth Elemental Shellfish and store up a portion of the produced elemental pearls. He was going to feed them to his contracted source-type lifeform, the Source Sand.","Actually, for Lin Yuan to upgrade the Source Sand’s quality to Fantasy Breed, he didn’t have to use the Mountain-Containing Embryo either. There were plenty of precious spiritual ingredients that could upgrade the Source Sand into a Fantasy Breed and continue to upgrade further.","However, the Mountain-Containing Embryo was a strategic-class treasure formed after many years of transformation in the underground. They could only be found in Class 4 subterranean dimensional rifts, where the earth devoured mountain ranges. The Mountain-Containing Embryo contained the transformation ability of mountain ranges. This transformation ability was very compatible with the Source Sand’s two Willpower Runes. It could be slowly comprehended and absorbed by the Source Sand.","Lin Yuan wanted to make use of the Mountain-Containing Embryo to enhance the Source Sand’s transformation ability once it was upgraded to Fantasy I.","Even though a massive amount of resources would be required, Lin Yuan felt that the cost would be worth it if it was to increase his fey’s strength.","After Lin Yuan exchanged phone numbers with the fat boss, the latter didn’t feel the pinch of giving away a source-type lifeform anymore.","In the fat boss’ opinion, if this masked youth was able to bring out 400 heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls in front of his stall, it meant that this youth had an immense background. After all, one’s background could be seen by how many resources could be utilized.","There was a saying, “When a bowl is filled with water, the surplus is called foundation.”","If this masked youth could casually trade 400 heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, it meant that the surplus portion of the masked youth’s resources could be used as he desired.","Forming a relationship with such a person was naturally going to be a great advantage. Even if there wasn’t any actual help, just having a stable channel to trade for heavenly maiden-grade elemental pearls would be a great profit."]},{"number":449,"title":"Chapter 449: Is Wen Yu’s Cooking Not Nice?","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan was in a great mood after the trade. He was now finally able to start upgrading the Source Sand’s quality. At the same time, Lin Yuan could feel Red Thorn inside the leaf-shaped fey storage box devouring the Gold water world dimensional lifeforms. Lin Yuan didn’t think he could look at the scene directly.","Lin Yuan suddenly reflected on his thoughts. Am I really a good father to let Red Thorn eat such smelly things?","Liu Jie and Listen were conversing with their eyes. When Liu Jie saw how Listen was giving him eye signals, Liu Jie said, “I will come clean. I didn’t get to trade for anything.”","After speaking, he took out the gold-threaded bag, which contained 30 heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls. In response, Listen did the same and said, “It is the same for me.”","Upon seeing that, Lin Yuan asked, “There weren’t any suitable resources for trade?”","Liu Jie and Listen nodded and shook their heads. Listen was the first to speak. “Heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls are considered rather valuable strategic-class resources. Even if I wanted to trade, I am only able to trade for resources of the same value. I feel that it wouldn’t be a profit.”","Liu Jie agreed. “I have the same feeling. As compared to those strategic-class resources, the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls are more convenient to use in trades. It would be more worth it to keep these elemental pearls at hand.”","When Lin Yuan heard the replies from Liu Jie and Listen, he finally understood the problem.","He had never given great importance to the heavenly-maiden-grade pearls and would use them to exchange for strategic-class resources of the same value. It was due to the fact that he knew how easy it was to obtain these pearls.","He just had to sleep on his bed for a night and would be able to pick up quite a few pearls in the Spirit Lock spatial zone on the next day.","However, Listen, and Liu Jie stood in the angle of a regular person to see the value of the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","When having such a comparison, Lin Yuan felt that he was really a squanderer.","Immediately after, Lin Yuan realized that the conversation between Listen and Liu Jie sounded rather bizarre. It seemed like they had a hard time speaking.","Liu Jie said in a muffled voice, “If this is the case since both of us didn’t trade for anything, it is a draw.”","When hearing Liu Jie’s statement, Listen heaved a sigh of relief. However, Listen started to cough after hearing Liu Jie’s subsequent statement.","“Since we both failed, we both lost.”","Listen looked at Liu Jie with a dumbfounded expression and asked, “Big Brother Liu, why don’t you think that we both won?”","Liu Jie shook his head and said in a deep voice, “Since we didn’t get to trade for anything, it means we lost. Since we lost, we need to receive the punishment together.”","Listen looked at Liu Jie suspiciously and asked, “Big Brother Liu, do you like to eat spicy food? Therefore, you want someone like me who prefers sour food to eat spicy food with you?”","Liu Jie replied in an unpleasant tone, “Even if I do like eating spicy food, I wouldn’t just eat a Platinum Ghost Pepper, right!?","“This way then... We will split the Platinum Ghost Pepper.”","After hearing Liu Jie’s response, Listen had a feeling that Liu Jie was waiting for him to ask for mercy. Therefore, Listen ground his teeth and said, “Since Big Brother Liu is so fair and just, then we need to keep to our promise of not drinking milk and to drink cold cola after eating the Ghost Pepper!”","Although Lin Yuan did not know the exact conditions of the bet, he inferred from their conversation that the duo had made a bet, and their wager was a Platinum Ghost Pepper.","Lin Yuan felt that Listen and Liu Jie were truly brave warriors!","Lin Yuan was rather good at eating spicy food too, but if he ate something too spicy, his entire body would be sweating profusely while his stomach would feel as though it was on fire.","Once the Platinum Ghost Pepper entered the stomach, even if it was split in two, their stomachs would probably feel a volcano eruption.","Furthermore, the most miserable thing would happen the next morning when one would probably feel like a rocket launching in the toilet.","During the previous bet, Liu Jie and Listen had made the wager to eat 30 sour lemons. It was so sour that the victim had to eat congee for several days.","Therefore, Lin Yuan naturally had to persuade the duo. However, after seeing their determined faces, Lin Yuan helplessly thought of a good idea.","“Once we return, why don’t I ask Wen Yu to extract the juice of the Platinum Ghost Pepper and mix it with honey before making it into lollipops? The sweet taste might be able to neutralize some of the spicy taste.”","Listen and Liu Jie looked at Liu Jie and felt that he was a demon.","If they were to swallow half of a Ghost Pepper at once, they would be giving their mouths a quick execution. If it was made into lollipops, they would need to keep it in their mouths for over a dozen minutes. Their mouths would probably swell up and become bigger than their heads.","By then, they would have to lower their heads when they walked and would still have to be cautious that their swollen lips might make them fall over.","Liu Jie and Listen exchanged looks. They gave up their impartiality and integrity.","“I feel that since it is a draw, it should be a win-win situation.”","“That’s right, I feel so too.”","Lin Yuan raised his brows as he thought, Do they think that Wen Yu’s lollipops aren’t good?","Lin Yuan scratched his head in confusion. When he ate her meal previously, it was rather nice!","Since Lin Yuan was now a pauper, he naturally didn’t have the intention to continue shopping in the Indigo Azure Sea Market. Otherwise, if he found something he wanted and couldn’t buy it, he would be torturing himself for no reason.","Lin Yuan thought for a moment and said, “It is still early. Why don’t we take a look at the coastal sea? Let’s see if the coastal sea has any secrets that can capture the attention of the Zheng Family’s third lineage.”","Listen was shocked when he heard Lin Yuan’s words.","There was probably no one else that wished to know the secrets of the coastal sea more than Listen. He had been trying to find out if the deaths of his family were related to the secrets of the coastal sea!","After sensing the change of Listen’s expression, Liu Jie patted him on the shoulder and said, “Earlier on, in the Radiance Hundred group chat, they mentioned that a few Class 5 Scholars studied the active period of the dimensional rifts and realized that it would happen one or two days earlier than expected.","“Therefore, it is best to investigate the coastal sea within these two days. Otherwise, there might be mishaps during the active period of the dimensional rifts.”","When Lin Yuan heard that piece of information, he felt fortunate that a Radiance Hundred Sequence member was by his side. It was truly convenient to find out such information in advance.","He was also feeling unfortunate that he didn’t have a lot of time.","With Listen as the guide, Lin Yuan and Liu Jie arrived at the coastal sea near the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","Once they arrived at the shore of the coastal sea, Lin Yuan’s expression immediately turned stern.","After using his nose to smell, Lin Yuan realized that the coastal sea under the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s control wasn’t normal."]},{"number":450,"title":"Chapter 450: The True Insect Swarm Commander","paragraphs":["There was actually such a fishy smell in this shallow coastal sea. Lin Yuan was simply too familiar with such a unique fishy smell. It was exactly the smell given off by the decaying flesh of the water world dimensional lifeforms.","The sea breeze along the shore was very strong, so any smell would be instantly carried hundreds of meters away and then disappear without a trace.","However, the sea breeze couldn’t cover up the smell of decaying flesh of the water world dimensional lifeforms on the shore. This meant that a large number of water world dimensional lifeforms were decaying.","Just as Lin Yuan’s expression became more and more serious, Liu Jie said with a frown, “Could there be a water world dimensional rift that just opened on the shore? How else could there be so much water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh decaying?”","As he spoke, Liu Jie glanced at the calm sea not far away and frowned even more.","The clear waves on the sea surface surged. There were clearly no large-scale massacres of feys and water world dimensional lifeforms at this moment in the sea.","Listen pondered for a moment before saying, “I was here at this sea area before I went to the Royal Capital. There was no abnormality at that time.”","Listen was also wondering how much water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh was decaying together in such a wide space that made them, who were standing with their backs to the breeze, smell a fishy and pungent smell.","Listen hurriedly took three light-blue wax slices out of his Diamond fey storage box, handed them to Lin Yuan and Liu Jie, and said, “These are the fragments from the Shellfish Vapor Corals. Put it in your hand and cover your nose. The fragment’s shellfish vapor can cover up the decaying smell of the water world dimensional lifeforms.”","At that moment, Lin Yuan waved his hand and replied, “Smell. The decaying smell of the water world dimensional lifeforms is becoming fainter and fainter.","“Let’s wait a little longer. If this smell becomes fainter or disappears, we’ll go forward and take a look.”","Lin Yuan thought, If the smell becomes faint, it means that a large batch of water world dimensional lifeforms have been killed and then rolled along with the current to the shore.","The Source Sand that was on the amber-button-shaped Diamond fey storage box on Lin Yuan’s cuff landed on the sandy shore at his feet and turned into gravel that drilled into the sandy shore.","Liu Jie noticed Lin Yuan’s action and channeled his spiritual energy to summon the Insect Queen.","After the Insect Queen was summoned, a small humanoid fairy emerged out of the beating purple flesh cocoon. It was the Insect Queen’s original body.","The Insect Queen had a combination of moth wings and transparent dragonfly wings on its body.","After flying out of the purple flesh cocoon, the Insect Queen hugged Liu Jie’s neck, relying on its little face to rub it.","Liu Jie used his palm to hold the petite Insect Queen to his face and said, “Elegance, we’re going to battle. Go and spread the sea of insects according to Formation A.”","Under Liu Jie’s instruction, the Insect Queen, Elegance, turned into a stream of light and drilled into the purple flesh cocoon.","The purple flesh cocoon landed and swelled to three meters, with many sac-like ducts unique to insect-species feys on its body.","These sac-like ducts pulsated, and it was as if something in the ducts was rapidly flowing. The Insect Queen’s form after transformation was like an insect queen nest.","When the Insect Queen transformed, the insect queen nest produced Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects quickly. Then the thick armored Shield Ladybugs and blue-purple Plasma Caterpillars with spiky hair swarmed out.","After being produced, these Shield Ladybugs consciously guarded Liu Jie, Lin Yuan, and Listen behind them. The two thick armors on their backs bloomed, forming an airtight wall. Under Liu Jie’s instruction, they advanced toward the coast step by step.","Those Plasma Caterpillars consciously followed the Shield Ladybugs and were ready to deploy the plasma in their bodies.","Those large amounts of Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects that covered half of the sandy shore scurried underneath the sand.","Lin Yuan manipulated the Source Sand and could sense that every single Flesh-Mincing Blade Insect under the sand was in an attacking posture, ready to strike. They would launch a swift and fierce attack according to Liu Jie’s instruction at any time.","Then, the insect queen nest trembled violently as if it was stuck. When the insect queen nest stopped trembling, nearly 100 Lightning Gathering Moths and Hurricane Owlet Moths flew out of the open hole.","The Lightning Gathering Moths were only half the size of a palm, but the moths had a purple tentacle on their heads that was about the same length as their bodies.","The Hurricane Owlet Moth was more than twice as big as the Lightning Gathering Moth, and its blue butterfly wings had fine black lines.","The black lines seemed to be able to absorb the bright light displaced in the world, seemingly making it as if the Hurricane Owlet Moths were always flying at night.","The moment the Lightning Gathering Moths appeared, the Plasma Caterpillars seemed to have found their main backbone and ejected the accumulated plasma from their bodies.","The Lightning Gathering Moths absorbed the electric plasma, and blue-purple jumping lightning arcs surrounded them.","The arcs jumped, and the light-purple color on their bodies turned dark purple.","The dark-purple wings vaguely brought up a layer of silver luster with the increasingly fine electric arcs. This layer of silver luster was precisely the unique characteristics when the thunder energy reached saturation in the Lightning Gathering Moths’ bodies.","Liu Jie’s Insect Queen completed the formation in less than a minute.","If the swarm was compared to a war machine, then each insect unit produced by the Insect Queen was like a small part of this huge war machine.","These small parts were in their positions, each with their own responsibilities, operating the sea insects that were like the war machine with the fastest and most accurate efficiency.","Liu Jie, who was beside Lin Yuan, was the heart of the swarm and its sole commander.","After laying this sea of insects, the insect queen nest once again shrunk into a purple flesh cocoon.","Liu Jie took a Gold Protein Silkworm Chrysalis out of the Diamond fey storage box and fed it to Elegance, allowing it to replenish the energy it had consumed in creating the swarm.","Elegance received Liu Jie’s Protein Silkworm Chrysalis and flew up, giving him a gentle peck on his face.","Then it glanced at Lin Yuan and Listen and burrowed into the purple flesh cocoon as if afraid to see strangers. It began to enjoy the Gold Protein Silkworm Chrysalis alone.","Lin Yuan had learned how shy Elegance was back at the mansion. Lin Yuan’s mind suddenly gave birth to a strange idea upon sensing the Flesh-Mincing Blade Insect lurking underground."]},{"number":451,"title":"Chapter 451: Lin Yuan, Fish Meat, Delicious","paragraphs":["Apart from energy, how much protein was required to produce so many insect-species fey?","Liu Jie could really afford to support it.","At the same time, Lin Yuan’s Source Sand was not idle. This was the shore. Although there were many reefs, the sandy beach at his feet was mostly sea sand. Therefore, it was very easy for the Source Sand to create sand.","However, Lin Yuan found that the sand on the shore was wet. After being soaked in seawater, the sand would become heavier. Thus, controlling the wet sand was far less comfortable than when controlling dry sand.","At this time, Zhou Luo, who Lin Yuan had informed earlier, had also arrived.","The Shield Ladybugs that Liu Jie’s Insect Queen had spawned had now gathered at the shore and erected their back armor to form a solid wall. Only a few of them still remained around for protection.","When Zhou Luo saw the large group of insect-species feys at the shore, particularly the combination of the Shield Ladybugs, Lightning Gathering Moths, and Plasma Caterpillars, he immediately thought of a person—Liu Jie, the ‘Heart of Insect Swarm’, who had just returned to the Radiance Hundred Sequence and ranked #30 just a short while ago.","At first, when Zhou Luo had been interacting with Liu Jie, Liu Jie would wear a strange mask.","After that, although he had seen Liu Jie’s true appearance, Zhou Luo, an inferior king-class expert who was always running around in order to improve his feys, rarely had time to be immersed on Star Web.","At first, Zhou Luo only felt that Liu Jie looked familiar as if he had seen him somewhere before. He only thought that Liu Jie might look familiar and didn’t think much about it. But now, he didn’t expect that Liu Jie was the Radiance Hundred Sequence #30 prodigy.","Zhou Luo had been afraid of attracting too much attention by riding on a flying fey to this shallow coastal sea and people keeping an eye on him.","The Guild Alliance branch that Zhou Luo had visited to ask for information was near this coastal sea, so he had jogged all the way over here.","Lin Yuan looked at Zhou Luo and asked, “Has the Lava Iguana been promoted to Diamond?”","Upon hearing that, Zhou Luo’s eyes were filled with gratitude, and he answered, “Young Master, the Lava Iguana has now evolved into a Lava Dragon Lizard thanks to your Flawless Dragon’s Mouth Orchid flowers and that tube of Diamond dragon-species blood.","“At the same time, it successfully promoted to Diamond with the energy of this bloodline awakening.”","Zhou Luo then summoned the evolved Lava Dragon Lizard. It actually belonged to the Varanus genius and evolved from the six-meter-long Lava Iguana.","At present, the Lava Dragon Lizard was nearly 12 meters long. Even though it wasn’t a very large lizard-species fey among the Varanus genus, it could be ranked in the upper class.","The Lava Dragon Lizard had two heads, one of the earth attribute, while the other of the fire attribute.","However, when the energy of the two heads clashed and the earth and fire attributes fused, it could turn into churning lava.","The Lava Dragon Lizard’s intelligence was not low, and it knew that it could be where it was today thanks to its contractor and the grace of someone, so it lowered its two heads in front of Lin Yuan.","Feys with their dragon-species bloodline had always been proud, and the Lava Dragon Lizard’s situation was not common.","Upon seeing the situation, Zhou Luo rubbed the Lava Dragon Lizard’s two necks with both hands like a feather duster.","After watching his former partner, the Lava Iguana, mutate all the way into the current Lava Dragon Lizard, Zhou Luo couldn’t help but think of Freezing Cold, who had insulted him in the Purchase With No Loss store.","Time had changed, and only less than ten days had passed. Zhou Luo’s talent could now completely exceed Freezing Cold’s.","Among the two lizard-species fey that had awakened their dragon-species bloodline, the Dark Snake Dragon Lizard had awakened its dragon-species bloodline at Bronze.","As long as there was enough time to grow and promote the grade of the Lava Dragon Lizard and the Dark Snake Dragon Lizard, he could go from the low-rank king-class expert to a high-rank one.","Lin Yuan could completely understand Zhou Luo’s joy. He was also someone who had risen from the bottom, so he could feel the joy the metamorphosis had brought to Zhou Luo.","At that moment, the joy on Zhou Luo’s face was replaced by a grim expression. “I managed to pry quite a lot of information without much effort in the Guild Alliance regarding this coastal sea.","“It’s rumored to be a forbidden place in the Guild Alliance as quite a few spirit qi professionals have disappeared near this place.","“Since it’ll soon be the dimensional rifts’ active period, the Guild Alliance temporarily did not notify the Spirit Guards to deal with it.","“Instead, it intended to wait until after the active period before letting the Spirit Guards investigate this.","“The Guild Alliance has informed the spirit qi professionals not to come here to undertake missions.”","Lin Yuan asked, “Did you inquire about the news regarding the frequent appearance of the decaying flesh of water world dimensional lifeforms at this coastal sea in the Guild Alliance?”","Zhou Luo organized what he had heard in the Guild Alliance branch and replied, “I heard from some adventurers that water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh would occasionally appear here, and many spirit qi professionals thought otherwise.","“But in the recent two months, more and more flesh of water world dimensional lifeforms has been appearing on the shore.","“Many people are speculating if there are some powerful feys in the sea or if it’s related to the upcoming active period.”","Lin Yuan dismissed the first guess.","If there were powerful feys in this water, would they frequently come to the shore and attack spirit qi professionals?","On the other hand, Lin Yuan felt it was reasonable that it was related to the dimensional rift’s active period.","The breeze no longer carried the smell of decaying flesh of water world dimensional lifeforms.","Lin Yuan took the lead and headed to the shore. After walking to the shore, Lin Yuan saw many black rotting marks in many areas of the sandy beach that were precisely caused by the decaying flesh of the high-class water world dimensional lifeforms.","Lin Yuan pondered for a moment and summoned Red Thorn that was having a feast in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Red Thorn was unusually elated after Lin Yuan summoned it. Its huge flowers with partial gill-like petals produced the sound, “Lin Yuan, fish meat, delicious.”","Lin Yuan was slightly stunned to hear Red Thorn’s sound. He knew that it could rely on his huge flower to create the sound of his name. Although its grade and quality hadn’t been promoted, its voice simulation ability had become stronger.","Was it related to the gilled petals in Red Thorn’s flower? Lin Yuan realized what Red Thorn had meant immediately after that."]},{"number":452,"title":"Chapter 452: The Bottom of the Sea Where Life Is Cut Off","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan revealed a puzzled expression. As its father, he had to explain to Red Thorn what real fish meat was.","How could such smelly things like the Gold water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh be called fish meat?","Immediately afterward, Lin Yuan recalled that Red Thorn had seemed to have devoured the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh of its own accord in the Spirit Lock spatial zone back then.","Apparently, Red Thorn’s subconsciously found the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh more to its taste.","Lin Yuan scratched his head. Did Red Thorn like to eat something more, the more smelly it was?","He saw that the red ribbon on its vines was a little dirty, so he untied it and replaced it with a new red ribbon specially made by Wen Yu, tying it into a delicate double bow.","Red Thorn was so happy that its 12 red flowers immediately moved. It was just like the sound of a naughty child playing on the keyboard. It seemed Red Thorn should interact with Chimey more to enhance its musical talent.","At that moment, the Acid Corrosion Queen Bee flew out of Red Thorn’s Mouth of Relinquish. Just as it was going to land on Lin Yuan’s shoulder, Red Thorn’s vine squashed it onto the ground.","After being squashed, the Acid Corrosion Queen Bee hurriedly went far away from Lin Yuan. It landed on Red Thorn’s corrosive cavity that had metamorphosed into a sac with an obedient look.","Previously, when Lin Yuan had summoned Red Thorn, Zhou Luo and Listen had felt that the fey he had summoned looked very strange.","However, after the Acid Corrosion Queen Bee flew out of its Mouth of Relinquish, and seeing what the Acid Corrosion Queen Bee looked like, their jaws almost dropped to the ground in surprise.","Wasn’t this bee-like fey one of Black’s many feys that were the hottest on Star Web?","If so, wasn’t this strange plant fey Black’s fey that could spread a sea of flowers? The very one the many Scholars could not come up with a specific conclusion?","This strange plant fey seemed to have evolved and was completely different from its image on Star Web.","The mysterious Black on Star Web was none other than Lin Yuan!","Listen and Zhou Luo only knew that Lin Yuan was the Purchase With No Loss store owner, a powerful faction was backing him, and emperor-class experts surrounded him.","His outstanding foundation had made them ignore Lin Yuan’s strength, and Lin Yuan had never taken the initiative to show it.","Now that they discovered Lin Yuan was the most mysterious, heroic youth Black on Star Web, the image of Lin Yuan in their mind changed. Not only was his foundation deep, but he was also powerful!","He didn’t only win back-to-back on the Celestial Stairway with no defeats. It could be said that he had vaguely reached the standard of the Radiance Hundred Sequence in terms of combat power.","This sudden discovery of the secret mesmerized Listen and Zhou Luo.","At that moment, Lin Yuan gazed at the coast and commanded Red Thorn, “Red Thorn, spread the sea of flowers all over this sea.”","After receiving Lin Yuan’s command, Red Thorn sprinkled its spores toward the coast through the huge spore cavity on its Mouth of Relinquish.","The spores didn’t grow vines but instead grew several child ramets that were like spore cavities. These child ramets constantly sprinkled spores.","Suddenly, several blinking Eyes of Relinquish on Red Thorn closed. The Eyes of Relinquish were channeled into the child ramets through the roots connected to these child ramets.","Then Red Thorn sprinkled a large number of spores into the sea with the child ramets.","Vines emerged on the shore one after another, growing toward the sea. They would use their sharp teeth to absorb seawater and inject the spore cavity’s spores in the mud and sand at the bottom of the sea through the vines.","The sea of flowers composed of vines spread out in all directions at the bottom of the sea with these methods.","Lin Yuan sensed the speed Red Thorn was spreading the sea of flowers and couldn’t help but frown slightly.","Red Thorn’s spores were small and light to facilitate the dispersion in the air, but this had become a flaw in the seawater.","The turbulent waves would instantly sweep away the small and light spores. Even with the aid of the vines, the speed of spreading out was still slow. After all, the vines could only grab a small amount of the spores.","Lin Yuan thought, It seems that if I want to increase the ability of Red Thorn to fight under the sea, its spore cavity has to be enhanced again so that the spores can be divided into two states—one suitable for dispersing in the air, while the other in the seawater.","Red Thorn developed part of its spores into child ramets that were like spore cavities.","However, these child ramets were also releasing spores, and the spores were swept to the surface due to the surging currents at the bottom of the sea.","Since Red Thorn had yet to devour enough Gold water world dimensional lifeforms to impart the ability to breathe underwater well to the child ramets, the sea of flowers it spread in the sea was not as powerful as on land.","Nonetheless, the sea of flowers served as Lin Yuan’s eyes and was undoubtedly enough.","Since this was a seemingly dangerous sea, Lin Yuan naturally wouldn’t easily go into the water before he completely explored the sea.","In the sea of flowers that constantly spread, he was surprised to find that there was not the slightest bit of life in this shallow near-shore sea.","Red Thorn’s sea of flowers range was not small, but Lin Yuan didn’t see any traces of the shellfish feys, the Beak-Billed Spiny Fish, or the Shellfish-Eating Armored Turtles that Listen had mentioned.","Since he didn’t even find the Beak-Billed Spiny Fish, then the Tail-Cutting Shadow Sharks that ate them could not stay in this sea.","However, he didn’t know whether the school of Tail-Cutting Shadow Sharks left because there were no Beak-Billed Spiny Fish to feed on in this sea or some other thing had expelled or killed them in this sea.","Lin Yuan asked Listen, who was standing beside him with a shocked expression, “When you came to check on the coastal sea before you left, did you go into the sea to check the shellfish feys?”","Listen didn’t understand why Lin Yuan asked him that. Was there something wrong with this sea?","“I caught the two Poisonous Water Sea Eels, which I brought to the Royal Capital for you to enhance, before leaving Indigo Azure City in this sea.”"]},{"number":453,"title":"Chapter 453: The Retreating Vines","paragraphs":["Listen calendar and said once again, “There were many shellfish feys at that time. Those two Poisonous Water Sea Eels scampered into the large shellfish feys to hide their forms. Thus, when I sent people to capture them, it wasn’t much effort at all.”","When Lin Yuan heard Listen’s words, he could determine that the life in this sea had been cut off, and it had happened within these three months.","Lin Yuan had always felt that Red Thorn’s Eyes of Relinquish consumed too much. At first, he thought it was the normal consumption of spreading its sea of flowers in the sea. After all, he had never commanded Red Thorn to launch an attack in the sea before.","After sensing the state of the bottom of the sea through the sea of flowers, Lin Yuan suddenly discovered that the vine ramets were rooted at the bottom of the sea. Therefore, only those very close to the shore could draw energy from the bottom of the sea.","The further they were away from the shore, the less energy the vine ramets could absorb in the sea.","The energy at the bottom of the sea seemed to have been exploited thousands of kilometers away from the shore without a trace left, causing the entire sea bottom to become unusually barren.","Lin Yuan pondered while letting Red Thorn continue using its Eyes of Relinquish release spores in this sea. Its Eyes of Relinquish had gradually been used.","But one part of its sea of flowers had already exceeded the range of the coastal sea of the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce. Lin Yuan’s perception became extremely poor for this distant sea range.","However, he could sense Red Thorn’s other vine ramets had absorbed some faint flesh energy in other seas. That faint flesh energy feedback could have been that the vine ramets captured a fish fey.","This meant that there were lives in the other seas, and there was no life just in the sea where the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce was located.","The Zheng family had suddenly started to take action against the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce three months ago.","The Zheng family, one of the three major affluent families in Indigo Azure City, would naturally investigate this coastal sea since they valued it so much.","Therefore, it was impossible for the Zheng family’s third lineage not to know that there were no more abundant shellfish feys in the coastal sea of the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","Since the Zheng family was so imperative to get this coastal sea that was completely barren and had no more shellfish feys, it meant that the third lineage must have a grasp of the secret of why it had become so barren.","Before Lin Yuan could think about it, he suddenly sensed a dramatic change of Red Thorn’s sea of flowers at the distant sea, seemingly twined by a large number of things in a flash.","It was unknown what these things were. But, the moment the sea of flowers made of vine ramets were twined, Lin Yuan could sense a large amount of flesh energy being plundered by those things. He was a little horrified at the speed of the plundering of vitality.","Lin Yuan looked at Liu Jie, who was at his side and nodded at him with a very grim expression. Liu Jie commanded the Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects lurking in the sand, and they emerged one after another.","Under Liu Jie’s commands, these Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects seemed to be heading home, happily lining up to walk into Red Thorn’s Mouth of Relinquish. They were like a group of sows lined up to jump into the gutter, neat and orderly.","Red Thorn welcomed it, and its Tongue of Relinquish secreted a lot of acids to digest the flesh of the alien insects to help its Mouth of Relinquish digest these Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects before quickly extracting energy from their flesh.","Just like this, as the eyelids of Zhou Luo and Listen jumped wildly, Lin Yuan prompted the sea of flowers to counterattack through the energy obtained from digesting the Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects.","However, the more it counterattacked, the grimmer Lin Yuan’s eyes became. Red Thorn’s sea of flowers that had always been unbeatable was clearly not a match. Lin Yuan could feel that the things twining with Red Thorn were increasing.","However, he found that these things that were fighting with Red Thorn didn’t seem to move or were very clumsy.","Red Thorn kept receiving attacks, and the flesh energy in the sea of flowers was also absorbed by those things more quickly.","The energy absorption of the sea of flowers from this unknown lifeform had affected Red Thorn’s ortets connected to the child ramets.","Lin Yuan hurriedly let Red Thorn withdraw the remaining energy in the sea of flowers. Immediately afterward, he closed his eyes and pondered.","Through the perception of the sea of flowers at the bottom of the sea, there seemed to be countless thorns pierced into each vine ramets in the previous struggle.","Through these thorns, the flesh energy in the vines was rapidly and heavily plundered, and the counterattack of the vines didn’t seem to have the slightest use. Lin Yuan didn’t feel the vines absorb any flesh energy during the counterattack.","Lin Yuan thought, Could there be a large group of unknown lifeforms far from the shore, causing this coastal sea to become so barren?","But if this is the case, since this coastal sea has been so barren, why don’t those unknown lifeforms migrate but remain in the depths of this coastal sea?","Lin Yuan could be sure that this group of unknown lifeforms’ thorn attack was not considered strong through the fight just now. What was really powerful was the speed at which they devoured energy.","The level of this thorn attack shouldn’t be able to beat the Tail-Cutting Shadow Sharks, and even the spines of the Beak-Billed Spiny Fish that fed on the shellfish feys could not be pierced.","Looking at the expression on Lin Yuan’s face, Liu Jie asked with some concern, “Lin Yuan, did you discover something bad?”","Lin Yuan opened his eyes and first shook his head, then nodded his head again. The discovery through the sea of flowers at the bottom of the sea could not be called a bad discovery.","This was because those things that had devoured the energy from the vines should have nothing to do with the appearance of the flesh of high-class water world dimensional lifeforms on the shore.","However, the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s coastal sea destruction was definitely not some good news.","Suddenly, Lin Yuan thought of the speed at which those lifeforms plundered energy, the sea bottom becoming barren, and that lifeform’s inability to move. He thought of a possibility.","If this possibility was really as he thought, he could only say that he was really the reincarnation of the God of Fortune. He had really encountered a true blessing this time.","Liu Jie was a little confused by Lin Yuan shaking his head and then nodding his head.","Immediately afterward, Liu Jie heard Lin Yuan say, “Big Brother Liu, let your Hurricane Owlet Moth take me to the sea 3,000 meters away from the shore to have a look.”","The place where Red Thorn’s sea of flowers had been attacked was exactly the location 3,000 meters from the shore. So whether it was a blessing or danger, Lin Yuan felt that he needed to go down to the sea to have a look to be sure."]},{"number":454,"title":"Chapter 454: Water from Eight Directions Gather","paragraphs":["Anyway, Lin Yuan knew that he was protected by the Mother of Bloodbath and had his Master’s Extreme Token. Even if he was in danger, he could react at once.","This danger 3,000 meters away from the shore wouldn’t be more powerful than the Suzerain/Myth II Mother of Bloodbath, right?","While speaking to Liu Jie, Lin Yuan was also slightly embarrassed. He, Liu Jie, Listen, and Zhou Luo seemed to have no flying feys that they could ride on.","He instead had to rely on the moths produced by Liu Jie’s Insect Queen when he needed the flying ability now.","Although he could fly with the four Day and Night Spirit Silver wings, flying would rely on the Day and Night Spirit Silver’s weightlessness as long as the four wings played a defensive role.","The sea breeze was currently very strong. Given Lin Yuan’s spiritual power as a C-rank spirit qi professional, using the four wings would likely cause him to become a kite with broken strings thanks to the sea breeze.","The Insect Queen’s Hurricane Owlet Moths could manipulate the wind and wouldn’t be affected by flying in the great sea breeze at all. The sea breeze would even speed up the Hurricane Owlet Moths’ flight.","The chaotic sea breeze was also one of the reasons why, in addition to the fear of attacks by marine feys, many spirit qi professionals with flying feys still didn’t dare to fly above the sea.","Lin Yuan wanted the Hurricane Owlet Moths to take him over the sea because this coastal sea had been explored. It was also due to the protection of an expert like the Mother of Bloodbath.","After hearing Lin Yuan’s request, Liu Jie did not ask any questions. Instead, he commanded the four Hurricane Owlet Moths to fly toward Lin Yuan.","Liu Jie knew that Lin Yuan was not a rash person. Lin Yuan must have discovered something with such a request.","Two Hurricane Owlet Moths grabbed Lin Yuan’s shoulder, while the other two grabbed both sides of his waist. According to Lin Yuan’s instructions, they took him into the air and headed in the designated direction.","When Lin Yuan was flying above the sea with the four Hurricane Owlet Moths manipulating the wind energy to take him into the air, he looked at the vast sea and was suddenly intoxicated by the blueness of the sea.","Lin Yuan could see the bottom of the sea that was 100 meters under the sea surface. The barren sea at the bottom was particularly vast. The silence of no life in this sea contained the beauty of vastness.","A hundred rivers flow east to the sea, and when will they flow back to the west?","The sea is vast, the rivers flow from all directions, and the water is gathered from eight directions.","At that moment, Lin Yuan seemed to have the feeling he had when he had first ridden on a flying fey and flown in the clouds all the way from the Xia Region to Redbud City.","All of a sudden, a glimpse of enlightenment appeared in his mind. It revealed a sense of inclusion and convergence.","It was just like how the water in the sea never flew back to the rivers. Even if the water would eventually return to the rivers, it was through other means.","When he returned to his senses, Lin Yuan couldn’t help but shake his head.","Previously, there was a sense of enlightenment in his head when he was reading a book. However, it was stuck at a critical point, and he had been unable to figure it out.","Before he could fully understand the previous enlightenment, he had new enlightenment that was completely different. If he could fully understand both, that would mean two Willpower Runes.","In Lin Yuan’s opinion, although he had two kinds of enlightenment, he couldn’t understand any of them.","Rather than that, he would rather sacrifice one of the enlightenments and completely understand the other enlightenment to condense a Willpower Rune and not have both enlightenments divided and be unable to understand them.","At that moment, the Mother of Bloodbath’s peculiar yet pleasant voice sounded next to Lin Yuan’s ears.","“Congratulations, you have just entered a state of epiphany.”","A bitter smile hung on Lin Yuan’s mouth. He was just entering a state of epiphany and gaining a new understanding, not a Willpower Rune. What was there to congratulate him?","It was really sweet distress to be stuck with two enlightenments.","The Mother of Bloodbath sensed Lin Yuan’s bitter smile and couldn’t help but feel a little speechless.","“You’re not taking this state of entering epiphany seriously!","“Some people don’t get such an opportunity even once in their lifetimes.","“Those spirit qi professionals have Diamond/Legend feys, but there are a few cases where they have been unable to promote their feys into Fantasy Breeds because they can’t comprehend the Willpower Rune.","“They just lack entering a state of epiphany like this.”","Upon hearing the Mother of Bloodbath’s words, Lin Yuan was somewhat thankful that he hadn’t spoken the true thoughts. Otherwise, the Mother of Bloodbath would probably transform into the Mother of Sarcasm again and make sarcastic remarks.","Lin Yuan retracted his thoughts, no longer thinking about the two kinds of enlightenment. “Mother of Bloodbath, I need your help when I get to the sea later.”","The Mother of Bloodbath’s peculiar yet pleasant voice replied, “If you need anything, just ask. My combat ability in the water is not much worse than on land.","“When I was still at Gold, it rained continuously for three years in the Endless Forest. All the bird feys disappeared, and the forest turned into a swamp.","“I sank into the swamp to catch fish, and I found that these fish feys were dumb and much better to catch than birds!","“But the taste of fish is not as good as the finger-licking chicken a few days ago!","“Of course, the birds I ate before were also raw and not as delicious as cooked finger-licking chicken!”","The Mother of Bloodbath obviously had some flashbacks when it talked about the finger-licking chicken.","When Lin Yuan heard the Mother of Bloodbath talk about what happened when it was at Gold, he thought it was long in the past.","Although the Mother of Bloodbath had talked about it very easily, the three years of heavy rain must have made it suffer a lot at Gold.","If it wasn’t for the extreme lack of food, how would a bird-catching spider change the diet engraved in its genes and go underwater to catch fish?","The Mother of Bloodbath had never spoken before about what had happened to it when it was at low grade, and it happened to mention it to Lin Yuan this time.","Those memories that were left behind slowly surfaced before the eyes of the Mother of Bloodbath.","The Mother of Bloodbath remembered how it had suffered before taking its form and then recalled every bit about how it had now transformed into human form and was living in the mansion.","The red stingers on its spider legs couldn’t help but tremble with happiness twice.","If the Mother of Bloodbath wasn’t on Lin Yuan’s head but a coconut, it would use its spider legs to crack the coconut shell to express the happiness in it."]},{"number":455,"title":"Chapter 455: Sea Burial Lotus Flower","paragraphs":["The four Hurricane Owlet Moths stopped flying as soon as they brought Lin Yuan to the designation location, but he did not rush to go into the sea.","Instead, he summoned the Gold Green Oxygen Sea Anemone that he had purchased earlier from the amber-button-shaped Diamond fey storage box.","Lin Yuan had stored this Green Oxygen Sea Anemone in the Spirit Lock spatial zone and nourished it for nearly half an hour with the high concentration of spirit qi before putting it back into the amber-button-shaped Diamond fey storage box.","At this moment, the Green Oxygen Sea Anemone was in very good condition and lively as it constantly stretched its short light-green tentacles.","It buckled on his mouth and nose while being upside down, and Lin Yuan immediately felt the uniquely fresh smell of a marine plant.","Lin Yuan couldn’t breathe under the sea, so he instructed this Gold Green Oxygen Sea Anemone to create oxygen in the water.","He took a deep breath and plunged into the sea. The cold seawater soaked Lin Yuan, causing him to shiver. Then he felt the Gold Green Oxygen Sea Anemone’s powerful oxygen-producing function.","The large amount of oxygen it produced completely isolated the seawater from his mouth and nose, and he sniffed the oxygen that had the unique marine plant fragrance.","He felt that the Gold Green Oxygen Sea Anemone’s oxygen seemed to be slightly more than the usual oxygen content in the air.","Higher-grade Green Oxygen Sea Anemone could probably be treated as an oxygen cylinder that released pure oxygen in the sea.","Lin Yuan looked down at the bottom of the sea. If not for the Gold Green Oxygen Sea Anemone protecting his nose and mouth after entering the sea, his coughing action could cause him to choke on a large amount of seawater and die.","When he was on the sea surface previously, due to the fine waves of the sea, Lin Yuan could only see that the barren sea bottom was almost the same color. However, he couldn’t look closely at what was at the sea bottom.","When he looked at the sea bottom, he felt his scalp numb. He saw the sea bottom were endless bone-carved lotus flowers.","These lotus flowers were not the white color of ordinary bones but like the gray-white dead coral at the sea bottom.","The Bone Lotus Flowers were stacked layer upon layer and bloomed. Those at the top were whiter.","The Bone Lotus Flowers were endless, and this sea bottom seemed like a barren, beautiful bone lotus hell. The strange beauty of this bone lotus hell made Lin Yuan have goosebumps all over in the cold seawater. This strange natural scenery was beautiful.","Lin Yuan couldn’t feel the presence of any living creatures in the endless sea at this moment. It was silent, and only these Bone Lotus Flowers were gently opening and closing in the sea.","The hearts of the Bone Lotus Flowers contained a cold flare. They must be the thorns that had pierced the vines in his perception.","Lin Yuan observed the endless Bone Lotus Flowers and understood why Red Thorn’s sea of flowers hadn’t absorbed the slightest flesh energy during the struggle.","Lin Yuan was currently feeling ecstatic. It seemed that he was really the reincarnation of the God of Fortune. He had actually guessed what was in this sea region correctly.","However, he needed Morbius’ True Data to confirm it, so he used True Data to check the endless lotus flowers at the sea bottom.","[Fey Name]: Sea Burial Lotus Flower (Derivative)","[Fey Species]: Water Willow/Water Bone Lotus","[Fey Grade]: Silver (4/10)","[Fey Type]: Wood","[Fey Quality]: Elite","Morbius’ True Data showed that these Bone Lotus Flowers were really the Sea Burial Lotus Flower. However, these endless Bone Lotus Flowers were not the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s original body. They were just the ramets the Sea Burial Lotus Flower used to extract the energy from the sea bottom.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower was a famous carcinoma fey in the sea. The Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s original body was extremely good at hiding and should be hidden among the endless Bone Lotus Flowers at the sea bottom.","Lin Yuan had heard from the Moon Empress that the Sea Burial Lotus Flower had appeared in the sea depths the last time.","At that time, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower had extracted all the energy at the sea bottom, turning the deep sea into a forbidden ground where no marine feys could live.","Thanks to the Bone Lotus Flowers’ continuous expansion, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower had finally reached a large whale-fall area of a whale beast.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower had not been polite at all. It had madly extracted the energy from this large whale fall area. As a result, four of the hatching Island Whale crystal eggs couldn’t hatch due to the whale-fall area’s energy loss.","This had angered many Suzerain/Myth Breed marine feys in the deep sea, causing them to attack and kill the Bone Lotus Flowers.","After clearing the Bone Lotus Flowers within 5,000 kilometers, many Suzerain/Myth Breed marine feys had finally found the original body of the Sea Burial Lotus Flower.","They had extracted the Sobbing Sea Crystal condensed by the energy of the large whale fall from the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s roots and returned it to the four crystal eggs and the barren sea bottom.","Under the Sobbing Sea Crystal effect, 5,000 kilometers of the deep sea had soon been revived.","Those four crystal eggs with the Floating Island Whales had also used the energy in the Sobbing Sea Crystal to successfully hatch.","Back then, the Radiance Federation had brought out very valuable treasures, showing their sincerity. They had wanted to make an exchange with the high-grade marine feys in the deep sea for the carcinoma fey, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower, which the Spirit Guards would take.","However, the high-grade marine feys had rejected them and annihilated the Sea Burial Lotus Flower, which was absolutely harmful to the sea, in front of the experts from the Radiance Federation that had gone to negotiate it.","They had jointly expressed the marine feys’ attitude to the Sea Burial Lotus Flower.","Although the Sea Burial Lotus Flower was exceptionally harmful to the sea, it also produced the indescribably rare Sobbing Sea Crystal.","At that moment, the Mother of Bloodbath jumped out of Lin Yuan’s hair in the sea and turned into its human form.","The Mother of Bloodbath, which was unusually calm and composed, couldn’t help but swear, “Damn! It’s actually the Sea Burial Lotus Flower! Your providence and luck are too amazing!”","Lin Yuan was just about to speak when he recalled that he was still in the sea at this time.","The Mother of Bloodbath, a Myth Breed fey, could breathe and speak freely in the sea, unlike him. He had to rely on the Gold Green Oxygen Sea Anemone.","Therefore, he stretched out his hand to give the Mother of Bloodbath a thumbs-up with a smile on his face."]},{"number":456,"title":"Chapter 456: The Lotus Flower’s Original Body","paragraphs":["The Mother of Bloodbath couldn’t help but roll its eyes as it saw Lin Yuan’s smug appearance. Nonetheless, it immediately started to help Lin Yuan search for the true body of the carcinoma fey, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower.","Lin Yuan couldn’t help but feel a little thankful at this point.","Fortunately, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower had appeared in the coastal sea, and its resources were far less than in the deep sea, resulting in the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s Bone Lotus Flowers’ slow-spreading speed.","Furthermore, the coastal sea’s resources weren’t enough to help the Sea Burial Lotus Flower quickly spread its Bone Lotus Flowers to other sea regions. As a result, the Bone Lotus Flowers were hunted in other sea regions.","Since the Sea Burial Lotus Flower appeared in the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s coastal sea, and Listen chose to come to the Royal Capital to pay allegiance to Lin Yuan, the latter had the opportunity to find the Sea Burial Lotus Flower and have it for himself.","The feys living at the sea bottom, like the corals, marine plants, and shellfish feys, would suffer due to the Bone Lotus Flowers.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower would empty the energy in the sea, and these corals, marine plants, and shellfish feys, which lived at the sea bottom and could not move around, would be devoured by the Bone Lotus Flowers.","Then the Bone Lotus Flowers would transfer the energy to the Sea Burial Lotus Flower, which would turn the energy into Sobbing Sea Crystal.","When the energy at the sea bottom had been emptied and all life had been cut off, the feys that could move would naturally flee this barren sea region and not stay there.","As Lin Yuan watched the Mother of Bloodbath constantly unleash blood energy at the sea bottom to destroy the Bone Lotus Flowers, his eyelids jumped wildly, and he hurriedly told it to stop.","As a carcinoma fey, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower wreaked havoc in the sea, but its original body was very weak.","If the Mother of Bloodbath’s blood energy spread, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s original body would probably die.","Compared to the Sobbing Sea Crystal condensed from the energy of this coastal sea, Lin Yuan wanted the Sea Burial Lotus Flower more.","The energy the Sea Burial Lotus Flower extracted from the sea was not actually water-element energy. It was the sea bottom’s flesh energy and the ley line spirit-qi deposit deep under the sea.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower would absorb all the energy and condense the Sobbing Sea Crystal.","The Silver IV/Elite Sea Burial Lotus Flower was wood-type, so the Sobbing Sea Crystal it condensed was also wood-type.","The wood-type Sobbing Sea Crystal was a sacred item that could nourish wood-type feys but was life-threatening poison to other types of feys.","When feys of other types used the Sobbing Sea Crystal, its energy would burst in the fey’s body. One could imagine the horror of the energy exploding in a fey’s body.","However, when the Silver IV/Elite Sea Burial Lotus Flower reached Gold, it would get another attribute, which would broaden the uses of the Sobbing Sea Crystal.","The deep-sea Sobbing Sea Crystal that the Moon Empress had mentioned should be of the water-type and wood-type. Otherwise, it wouldn’t have prevented the four Island Whales in slumber from hatching out of their energy eggshells.","In Lin Yuan’s opinion, the most suitable place for the Sea Burial Lotus Flower to survive was his Spirit Lock spatial zone’s spirit pool. His spirit pool had a never-ending abundance of spirit qi.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower only needed to absorb the abundant spirit qi constantly and didn’t have to plunder energy from the Bone Lotus Flowers.","It just needed to produce and condense the Sobbing Sea Crystal at ease. Thus, Lin Yuan didn’t want the Sea Burial Lotus Flower to suffer the slightest damage.","When the Mother of Bloodbath heard Lin Yuan tell it to stop, it gazed at him in confusion.","The area covered by the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s ramets was extremely wide. If he didn’t search within a certain range, it would not be easy to find the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s body that was very good at hiding.","Lin Yuan had been using Morbius’ True Data.","Although True Data didn’t have the function of locating and searching, Lin Yuan could rely on it to scan a large area of Bone Lotus Flowers while relying on the data to find the hidden Sea Burial Lotus Flower.","After Lin Yuan swam toward the sea surface and emerged, he waved at the four Hurricane Owlet Moths. They manipulated the wind energy to bring Lin Yuan back to mid-air and then blew dry his moon-white spirit qi clothes.","Lin Yuan observed the four Hurricane Owlet Moths’ actions and confirmed that this was not their intelligence. Rather, Liu Jie had allowed the Insect Queen to impart its intelligence to the Hurricane Owlet Moths and control them to cooperate better with his actions, .","The Mother of Bloodbath surfaced from the sea, and Lin Yuan said to it, “I’ll let the Hurricane Owlet Moths fly me around the sea twice and look for the location of the Sea Burial Lotus Flower from the surface.”","When the Mother of Bloodbath heard Lin Yuan’s words, it only felt like giving Lin Yuan some fruits and feeding him a few big hawthorns and jujube.","If Lin Yuan could find the Sea Burial Lotus Flower hidden among the Bone Lotus Flowers at the bottom of the sea, it would rather not eat the finger-licking chicken in the future!","Lin Yuan ordered the Hurricane Owlet Moths to slow down as they carried him in circles to search.","He found that looking at the vast blue sea with the sea breeze blowing while flying over the sea felt good. The dead silence of the sea seemed to carry a different kind of romance under this blue sky and breeze.","After searching for a long time, Lin Yuan locked on his target, and a happy smile emerged on his face.","Lin Yuan said to the distant Mother of Bloodbath with a wave of his hand, “Mother of Bloodbath, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower is just below this location!”","After saying that, Lin Yuan took the lead and jumped into the sea.","The Mother of Bloodbath rolled its eyes again, thinking that Lin Yuan wasn’t really smart at this point. However, it also jumped into the sea.","The Mother of Bloodbath subconsciously explored the sea bottom. Although the Mother of Bloodbath was doubtful about Lin Yuan’s words, it still subconsciously believed him.","In the middle of the search, the Mother of Bloodbath fixed its gaze on Lin Yuan like looking at an immortal, and thought, This is really something! You can see the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s body hidden so deep at the sea bottom from above the surface.","Are your eyes magnets that are specially made for attracting the Sea Burial Lotus Flower?","But right after that, the Mother of Bloodbath raged in its heart, Damn! Lin Yuan really found the Sea Burial Lotus Flower. Does that mean that I can’t eat the finger-licking chicken anymore!?"]},{"number":457,"title":"Chapter 457 - 10,000 Times More Disgusting!","paragraphs":["While the Mother of Bloodbath was raging in its heart, it didn’t hesitate with its actions. Three intersecting crimson blood-colored waves of energy blasted at the sea bottom full of Bone Lotus Flowers.","The bottom of the sea where Lin Yuan’s gaze reached was blasted by these three crimson blood-colored waves of energy, forming extremely deep ravines.","The Bone Lotus Flowers turned into white shreds, and the pale-white powder drifted in the seawater like extremely cold snow in the sea.","The Mother of Bloodbath happened to enclose the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s body at the center of the three intersected blood-colored waves of energy. This disconnected it from the vast majority of the Bone Lotus Flowers.","Lin Yuan then saw a strange movement in that small area. The Bone Lotus Flowers suddenly danced at the sea bottom like spirit snakes that probed out in search of the enemy that had just attacked them.","Lin Yuan knew that carcinoma feys like the Sea Burial Lotus Flower were not intelligent. A lifeform like it only possessed the instinct of avoiding harm.","Its reaction was exactly the subconscious emergency response of a lifeform in the face of danger.","The Silver IV Sea Burial Lotus Flower couldn’t do anything with a Myth Breed fey like the Mother of Bloodbath around.","The Mother of Bloodbath flew into those dancing Bone Lotus Flowers and ignored the attack from the Bone Lotus Flowers’ center.","It stretched out its hand and pushed aside from inside the Bone Lotus Flowers.","Lin Yuan saw the Mother of Bloodbath grab a delicate lotus flower from the Bone Lotus Flowers. It was white in color, including its stem and leaves.","This white did not have a deathly pale feeling like the Bone Lotus Flowers. Rather, there was a glistening sense of sacredness, causing people to have reverent thoughts.","It was really hard to imagine that such a small thing would be the devil that swallowed the sea and made it barren.","What was under the sacred-like white lotus flowers were not the lotus roots but a green crystal smaller than Lin Yuan’s thumb on the rhizome.","This green crystal must have relied on all the energy in this sea to nurture the wood-type Sobbing Sea Crystal that simply had too many uses.","Lin Yuan suddenly thought of the Jasmine Lily, but it was a bit too extravagant to give Jasmine Lily the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s Sobbing Sea Crystal to raise its quality. That’s right. This was extravagant even in the eyes of people like Lin Yuan, who wouldn’t hesitate to spend more resources to become stronger.","He still needed to think about how to use this wood-type Sobbing Sea Crystal.","After all, the Jasmine Lily could improve its quality from Fantasy I with many spiritual materials. It was not necessary to have this wood-type Sobbing Sea Crystal.","The Mother of Bloodbath flashed to Lin Yuan’s side, with its hair dancing in the seawater. Its usually expressionless face betrayed a rare and obvious hint of joy.","“Lin Yuan, the energy contained in the wood-type Sobbing Sea Crystal is truly a sacred item for wood-type feys. This Sea Burial Lotus Flower can be considered the rarest item I’ve seen other than a sacred source lifeform.”","The Mother of Bloodbath could not help but exclaim.","When the Mother of Bloodbath mentioned the sacred source lifeform, Lin Yuan became a little curious and asked, “Mother of Bloodbath, you’ve seen a sacred source lifeform? How powerful is that?”","Lin Yuan had heard the Moon Empress talk about the sacred source lifeforms. Although he had learned about the sacred source lifeforms’ origin, he never had the chance to see them.","So far, the sacred source lifeform that Lin Yuan knew was Ostrich Logistics’ Spatial Mother Shellfish.","Upon hearing that, the Mother of Bloodbath’s eyes flashed with longing.","“The sacred source lifeforms’ true power never lies in their attack ability, but in the functionality of absolute authority.","“I also don’t know if I’ll have the chance to be promoted from Myth Breed to Creation Breed or obtain a sacred source lifeform to contract after becoming a Creation Breed.”","The Mother of Bloodbath added, “Although the power of a sacred source lifeform never lies in their attack ability, none of them is weak at attacking.”","Lin Yuan could feel the Mother of Bloodbath’s longing for the sacred source lifeform.","Moreover, when the Mother of Bloodbath became a Creation Breed, it could contract a sacred source lifeform.","Lin Yuan asked softly, “Since feys can contract a sacred source lifeform when they reach Creation Breed and above, can they contract source-type lifeforms?”","The Mother of Bloodbath shoved the Sea Burial Lotus Flower in its hand to him, rolled its eyes, and said, “Feys naturally cannot contract source-type lifeforms, but both humans and feys can contract sacred source lifeforms.","“I mentioned striving to contract a sacred source lifeform after ascending to a Creation Breed because it’s impossible to get a sacred source lifeform with Myth Breed strength.”","The Mother of Bloodbath felt that Lin Yuan was getting less intelligent. How could he forget such common sense that feys couldn’t contract source-type lifeforms?","Looking at the Mother of Bloodbath rolling its eyes madly, Lin Yuan touched the back of his head with some embarrassment.","When he was about to speak, Lin Yuan suddenly felt an energy fluctuation coming from the space not far above his head.","He and the Mother of Bloodbath looked up at the fluctuating space not far away, and he thought, Is a water world dimensional rift going to open before the active period of the dimensional rift?","But immediately after, Lin Yuan discarded this thought.","The spatial fluctuation in front of him was simply too weak. Even the energy fluctuation when the Class 1 water world dimensional rift opened was much stronger than the spatial fluctuation above his head at this moment. Therefore, this spatial fluctuation should have nothing to do with the dimensional rift.","Lin Yuan and the Mother of Bloodbath headed to the spatial energy fluctuation, ready for some reconnaissance. Unexpectedly, the spatial fluctuations suddenly became stronger when they got closer.","At that moment, numerous water world dimensional lifeforms’ carcasses were spat out of this rift at Lin Yuan’s face.","If the Mother of Bloodbath hadn’t immediately pulled Lin Yuan out of the seawater and floated in mid-air, he would have fainted from the smell of the large batch of high-grade water world dimensional lifeforms’ carcasses.","Lin Yuan had lingering fears.","If the smell had attacked his face, it would be no different than being pushed into a shithole. It might even be 10,000 times more disgusting!"]},{"number":458,"title":"Chapter 458: Must Not Be Left Alive","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan finally discovered where the massive quantity of high-grade water world dimensional lifeforms came from.","This place was around 5,000 meters away from the shore. The water world dimensional lifeforms that were below the Gold grade would start to rot and submerge before reaching the shore. Only those above the Gold grade would have the chance to reach the shore through the wave before rotting on the shore.","Lin Yuan looked at the carcinoma fey, Sea Burial Lotus Flower, and understood why its ramets had appeared in this place.","It seemed like it was due to the massive quantity of water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh, which allowed the Sea Burial Lotus Flower to have a feast at the bottom of the seabed. Due to the problem with its mobility, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower had chosen to hide and lay roots in this place.","This scene was definitely a great discovery for Lin Yuan.","The Mother of Bloodbath’s expression had turned serious too. She could sense a spatial wave that vanished after all the high-grade water world dimensional lifeforms were unloaded into the sea. She frowned and was contemplating the reason.","After a moment, once there weren’t any other water world dimensional lifeform carcasses, Lin Yuan summoned the Ethereal Jellyfish.","As a spatial-type lifeform, the Ethereal Jellyfish could feel spatial nodes even from 1,000 miles away. It had a naturally high sensitivity toward spatial movements.","Lin Yuan was planning to scout with the Ethereal Jellyfish and find out how the spatial wave appeared and unloaded all the water world dimensional lifeforms earlier.","After summoning the Ethereal Jellyfish, it shifted between the spatial zones as it appeared and vanished from time to time.","Just as it wanted to land on Lin Yuan’s head, it recalled Lin Yuan’s stern warning. The Ethereal Jellyfish then quickly shifted down and landed on Lin Yuan’s neck and was particularly satisfied.","When the Mother of Bloodbath saw the Ethereal Jellyfish, she immediately gulped down her saliva. She couldn’t help thinking of the cold dish Liu Jie had previously prepared and that wonderful taste of the jellyfish skin and tentacle.","Lin Yuan said, “Ethereal Jellyfish, go and check on all the spatial energy waves in the sea and report to me.”","Once the Ethereal Jellyfish received Lin Yuan’s order, it immediately flickered on Lin Yuan’s neck and produced an image as though it had broken through multiple dimensions as it vanished.","The Ethereal Jellyfish had already appeared in the sea before Lin Yuan and was vibrating the newly grown tentacle to sense the spatial energy waves hidden in the sea.","Lin Yuan used this moment to start handling the Sea Burial Lotus Flower. Lin Yuan didn’t harvest the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s wood-type Sobbing Sea Crystals.","The grade of the Sea Burial Lotus Flower was actually determined by the energy contained within the Sobbing Sea Crystals.","If Lin Yuan were to harvest them now, then the Sea Burial Lotus Flower would immediately drop from the current Silver IV/Elite to Normal I/Normal.","Carcinoma fey might also be contracted by spirit qi professionals like regular feys and could even be spirit-locked by Morbius’ exclusive skill, Spirit Lock. However, in Lin Yuan’s opinion, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower wasn’t suitable to be contracted and used for battle.","It was more suitable to be a production fey like the Elemental Shellfish.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower didn’t have intelligence and was only moving through instincts. Thus, Lin Yuan wanted to nurture it in the Spirit Lock spatial zone and restrict it.","The best method to restrict the Sea Burial Lotus Flower was to make it develop a reliance on Lin Yuan’s resources.","After leaving the water, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower would constantly weaken. The Sea Burial Lotus Flower wasn’t strong to begin with and was actually very frail. If it left the water for too long, it would start to wither, leaving behind the roots that wrapped around the Sobbing Sea Crystals and falling into a narcolepsy state.","Lin Yuan circulated his spiritual power at suitable timings to allow the Sea Burial Lotus Flower to absorb the pure spirit qi from his palm. Each time, Lin Yuan only released a small trace of pure spirit qi before he quickly withdrew it.","Before the Sea Burial Lotus Flower could taste the pleasure, it would immediately lose the pure spirit qi that was just like honey.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower could absorb all sorts of energy at the seabed, but Lin Yuan’s pure spirit qi was definitely an intoxicating attraction for the Sea Burial Lotus Flower.","Every time Lin Yuan stopped circulating the spiritual power in his body, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower would shake its sacred branches and leaves to show its sadness.","It threw tantrums and seemed to be telling Lin Yuan, “You are so bad, I want more spirit qi!”","Lin Yuan was acting just like the ultimate scumbag, causing the Sea Burial Lotus Flower to develop a reliance toward his spirit qi. He was using a withdrawing and giving method to make the Sea Burial Lotus Flower rely on him even more.","After a few repetitions, Lin Yuan placed the Sea Burial Lotus Flower into the Spirit Lock spatial zone’s spirit pool.","After entering the spirit pool, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower looked as though it was drunk. It obsessively absorbed the pure and ample spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Due to the inexhaustible spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower didn’t have to produce any Bone Lotus Flowers to help it absorb energy.","Lin Yuan asked the Gold Wind Speed Rapid Antelope to keep watch by the spirit pool. Once the Sea Burial Lotus Flower had any ideas of producing Bone Lotus Flowers, the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope would immediately use wind energy to disturb their production process.","Inside the spirit pool was the Spirit-Drawing Ichthyosaur, Blackie. It was only Bronze X/Legend and still unable to produce an absolute pressure toward the Silver IV/Elite Sea Burial Lotus Flower.","Once Blackie became a Fantasy Breed, it would be enough to have absolute control over the Sea Burial Lotus Flower.","All of a sudden, the spatial zone beside Lin Yuan shook gently. The Ethereal Jellyfish emerged from the spatial zone and appeared in front of Lin Yuan.","It handed over a black fist-sized ore to Lin Yuan. It felt as though the Ethereal Jellyfish was handing over a treasure as it was using its tentacle to gently stroke the black ore and was obviously fond of it.","Lin Yuan could feel the black ore’s spatial energy. As soon as the Ethereal Jellyfish excavated the black ore from the seabed with its two strong and thick tentacles, the Mother of Bloodbath saw something in the sea that caused its eyes to turn still.","The Mother of Bloodbath said in a deep voice, “Someone actually used the Spatial Magnets to set up a magnetic field to hide a spatial zone!","“The Spatial Magnet is something that only other continents can produce. Why is it here, the sea region governed by the Radiance Federation?”","After hearing the Mother of Bloodbath mentioning other continents, it was unknown why Lin Yuan immediately related it with the pinnacle Myth II crow fey that Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer had killed together.","Once the Ethereal Jellyfish handed over the Spatial Magnet, it shook its tentacle toward Lin Yuan to transmit some hazy information.","According to the information, Lin Yuan found out that there were plenty of Spatial Magnets in this sea region.","Lin Yuan said to the Mother of Bloodbath, “Why don’t we let the Ethereal Jellyfish dig out all of the Spatial Magnets in this sea region? We will then be able to see what this magnetic field is trying to hide.”","The Mother of Bloodbath nodded and said in a cold voice, “Since someone came to set up a magnetic field to hide a spatial zone in the Radiance Federation, they can be considered terrorists no matter what intentions they have.","“Such a person must not be left alive!”"]},{"number":459,"title":"Chapter 459: Support Our Third Lineage","paragraphs":["As the Ethereal Jellyfish searched through the sea in detail, Lin Yuan’s collection of Spatial Magnets increased and was already close to 100.","At present, Lin Yuan and the Mother of Bloodbath realized that the range of the magnetic field was truly too wide. As Lin Yuan followed the Ethereal Jellyfish in the air, they were getting further away from the shore.","Soon after, Lin Yuan saw an island that was around 4,000 to 5,000 square meters in size.","The island was abnormally barren, just like the seabed that the Sea Burial Lotus Flower ravaged.","Lin Yuan had heard Listen mention about this barren island before. It was already out of the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s territory.","Lin Yuan realized that the Ethereal Jellyfish found an extreme number of Spatial Magnets in the vicinity of the island. Lin Yuan then said to the Mother of Bloodbath, “Why don’t we use this island as a checkpoint? I will ask Liu Jie, Listen, and Zhou Luo to come over too.”","The Mother of Bloodbath responded. “When coming over to the shore, there were plenty of eyes that were staring at you. You have already been searching on the sea for almost four hours now. I believe that those people with motives wouldn’t be able to sit still after finding out you went out to the sea, right?”","Lin Yuan narrowed his eyes and let out a smile. “If they cannot sit still, they will naturally reveal themselves. We shall respond to them by remaining calm.”","...","A tall and skinny man was using a cloth made with spirit beast pelt to wipe the chess pieces that had distinct white and black color.","There was a black and white sable on the Creation Master robe of the tall and skinny man. The sable was drooling as it looked at the chess pieces in the man’s hand. Its eyes were twisting and turning as it was abnormally spirited.","Zheng Jiangliu looked at the sinister-looking youth beside him and said with an impatient tone, “Wenbo, what are you saying? Is your Grandpa Jiao someone you can command as you please?”","Zheng Wenbo looked like a frozen eggplant. Zheng Wenbo’s sinister eyes and vicious eyes would nearly ooze out as soon as he recalled what had happened during the day at the Indigo Azure Sea Market.","The elder with the straight back and cedar aura used his hand to rub on Zheng Wenbo’s head and said, “I have watched Wenbo grow up from a baby, and I understand his temperament. If he hadn’t suffered a great embarrassment, he would never have talked like that.”","Zheng Jiangliu asked softly, “Uncle Jiao, are you sure that there isn’t any emperor-class expert with the youth and Listen?”","Zheng Jiangliu was abnormally friendly and didn’t act as sternly as he acted toward Zheng Wenbo.","The elder then said with a composed expression, “I didn’t feel any powerful presence beside that youth. Unless the opposition’s strength is significantly higher than mine, I will not be able to sense their presence.","“Even if my Cold Snow Pine isn’t adept at sensing among the support-type feys, its exclusive skill has a certain level of detection. Therefore, my senses are normally correct.”","Zheng Jiangliu was still a little apprehensive and was hesitating on how he should make his decision.","According to what Elder Jiao had said earlier, the youth with the mask wasn’t someone simple. The mask he wore was made with threads of completely jade-textured wood.","But after thinking that Zheng Wenbo had actually had the intention to hide the opposition’s foundation while asking him to send out people to kill the opposition to take revenge for his embarrassment, Zheng Jiangliu was a little anxious.","Why do I have an incompetent son that only knows how to act with his emotions?","When recalling the loss of Elder Niu, Zheng Jiangliu felt the rage building up in his heart.","Zheng Jiangliu turned to look at the tall and skinny man as he asked with a smile, “Second Young Master, I wonder if you think I shall make a move on the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s Listen now and kill their group.","“I can then take control of all the coastal sea resources in Indigo Azure City and quickly give the 50% profit to Second Young Master.”","The skinny youth didn’t even look up as he was still wiping the chess pieces. He replied without answering the question, “Third Uncle, the chess pieces you brought me this time have some nice patterns. They’re rather good.”","When Zheng Jiangliu heard the reply, his smile froze. However, the skinny youth spoke again. “Since Third Uncle is so willing to split 50% of the coastal sea’s profit with me, then I cannot sit by the side without giving ideas while watching Third Uncle fretting.","“Actually, I feel that Wenbo is a good child and cannot be embarrassed like that.”","While speaking, the skinny youth noticed the sable drooling as it looked at the chess piece in his hand. He then let out a gentle smile as before and tossed the chess piece to the sable. “This little fellow, you are already hungry in less than two hours? I just fed you before we came, and you are already looking for snacks. Aren’t you afraid of getting fat?”","When Zheng Jiangliu saw the skinny youth tossing the completely jade-textured chess piece to the fey, his face twitched twice. After all, he had painstakingly obtained those chess pieces. At the same time, thoughts were rapidly flying through his mind.","The Second Young Master’s meaning was clear—he should make the move. However, the Second Young Master had only said to make the move, but he hadn’t said he would help.","At present, Zheng Jiangliu only had one emperor-class expert, Uncle Jiao, who he could mobilize.","Zheng Jiangliu was still worried about making Uncle Jiao move out alone as there might be risks.","After all, the death of Elder Niu, a pinnacle king-class expert, was already a strong warning. If Second Young Master could send an expert to move along with Uncle Jiao, it would be good.","The skinny youth looked up and saw Zheng Jiangliu’s serious expression. He raised his brows as though it was nothing.","Just as he was about to speak, there was a knocking sound at the door.","When Zheng Jiangliu heard the knocking sound, he yelled, “Elder Feng, Second Young Master is here, and you dare to knock and disturb? What are you doing!?”","While speaking, Zheng Jiangliu was a little puzzled. The housekeeper, Elder Feng, had been working with him for at least 20 years. Why would he knock on the door to disturb him now? Something important must have happened.","As expected, Elder Feng’s anxious and hurried voice echoed. “Master, there is really something important to report.”","Immediately after, Zheng Jiangliu turned to look at the skinny youth seated beside him. The skinny youth took up another white chess piece to feed his sable as he said indifferently, “Third Uncle, please go ahead.”","After receiving the skinny youth’s permission, Zheng Jiangliu yelled toward the door. “Enter!”","After opening the door, the anxious-looking Elder Feng bowed to the Second Young Master first before he quickly walked beside Zheng Jiangliu and whispered in an extremely soft voice. “After the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s Listen left with the two masked youths, they headed for the coastal sea under the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s control.","“Our spies just came back to report that they have already visited the barren island that is at the coastal sea’s outer borders.”","Zheng Jiangliu’s eyes widened.","Zheng Jiangliu turned around with an abnormally determined expression that had some anxiety.","Unlike the earlier hesitation, he was now like a changed person. “Second Young Master, if my third lineage moves out alone, there might be risks. I wonder if Second Young Master can send an emperor-class expert to support us in the dark.”"]},{"number":460,"title":"Chapter 460: Nightmare VI","paragraphs":["The tall and thin man ignored the sudden change in Zheng Jiangliu’s attitude. He seemed to be a little sleepy, so he reached out to cover his mouth and yawn. “I can send someone to do it. I want 60% of the coastal sea resources that the third lineage controls, and you take 40%.”","Upon hearing that, Zheng Jiangliu’s eyes became increasingly gloomy, but he promised very quickly.","“We’ll do as Second Young Master says!”","The tall and thin man chuckled and stood up to pick up the black-and-white sable before saying, “Since Third Uncle is so enlightened, I, Zheng Kaiyuan, am not a stingy person.”","He then clapped his palm twice.","With that, a humanoid figure covered in a cloak suddenly appeared by Zheng Jiangliu’s side, startling Zheng Jiangliu.","Zheng Kaiyuan said, “Nightmare VI, please go with Third Uncle.”","The voice of Nightmare VI, who was clad in a black robe, was unusually hoarse as if he was speaking with a mouthful of sand.","“Yes, Second Young Master.”","After saying that, he hid once again. It was as if he had never appeared before.","Zheng Kaiyuan raised his eyes and looked at Zheng Jiangliu as he stretched.","“Third Uncle, I’ll be waiting for a constant stream of income from your side of the coastal sea. I hope Third Uncle won’t have so many more accidents. What I, Zheng Kaiyuan, hate the most is accidents.”","After saying that, Zheng Kaiyuan left.","After he left, Zheng Jiangliu scanned the space in the house and felt appalled. Zheng Kaiyuan had called the cloak-wearing figure that had just appeared Nightmare VI.","Could he be a member of the Nightmare Squad that the Zheng family had spent half of its resources to nurture to protect its direct descendants?","Rumor had it that the Nightmare Squad had a total of nine members. They all had emperor-class strength, each with superior abilities.","I to III protected the Eldest Young Master, IV to VI, and VII to IX protected the Second Young Master and Third Young Master, respectively.","He didn’t expect that Zheng Kaiyuan would actually use a member of the Nightmare Squad to provide support to the third lineage.","At this moment, Zheng Jiangliu felt greatly settled and didn’t have the slightest worry.","However, at the thought of the extra 10% of coastal sea resources that Zheng Kaiyuan wanted after the development, Zheng Jiangliu felt that his heart, liver, spleen, lungs, and kidneys all hurt.","...","Liu Jie, Listen, and Zhou Luo arrived on this deserted island all the way from the sea. When they passed by the sea, they naturally felt its desolation.","Be it Liu Jie, Listen, or Zhou Luo, none of them knew what had happened in the sea that had caused it to be so desolate.","After the Mother of Bloodbath had removed and taken the Sea Burial Lotus Flower out of the water, the Bone Lotus Flowers that spread across the sea bottom had all withered and turned into a dead frost and snow that offered their final elegy for the creatures of the sea bottom.","Although Liu Jie was a Radiance Hundred Sequence member and could go to the Radiance Sacred Hall to go through information from time to time, he didn’t have much understanding of carcinoma feys.","If Lin Yuan hadn’t happened to hear the Moon Empress mention the Sea Burial Lotus Flower, he wouldn’t have guessed that he might have encountered a Sea Burial Lotus Flower from a single encounter between Red Thorn’s vine ramets and the Bone Lotus Flowers.","It had to be said that he had a master with extraordinary insight and knew everything, which really allowed him to widen his horizon.","If the Moon Empress, who was far away in the Radiant Moon Palace, heard Lin Yuan’s thoughts at this moment, she would definitely be rendered speechless and say to him, “Disciple, compared to insight and knowledge, I’m powerful and rich.","“So can you stop being so independent!","“Isn’t it good to rely on your Master?”","At present, the Ethereal Jellyfish was happily working hard at the sea bottom. However, it didn’t give the Spatial Magnets to Lin Yuan immediately after finding one.","Instead, it piled all of them in a specific location on the sea bottom.","As the Ethereal Jellyfish dug out more and more Spatial Magnets, the magnetic force field became weaker and weaker. It was more difficult for the Ethereal Jellyfish to discover the Spatial Magnets buried at the sea bottom.","Fortunately, the Spatial Magnets could attract each other, and the large number of Spatial Magnets piled at the sea bottom could help the Ethereal Jellyfish dig for other Spatial Magnets. This made the Ethereal Jellyfish’s search for Spatial Magnets more efficient.","Zhou Luo commanded his Diamond I/Fantasy I Lava Dragon Lizard, trying to get it to go in the water. When the Lava Dragon Lizard had been a Lava Iguana, it used to find water repulsive because it had been an earth-type fey.","Furthermore, it had not been good at fighting in the sea. However, it had awakened its dragon-species bloodline and turned into a Lava Dragon Lizard.","All dragon-species feys were amphibious feys that could deal with fighting in the water and on land at the same time.","The Lava Dragon Lizard clumsily descended into the sea under Zhou Luo’s command and was somewhat reluctant at first. It lowered its head and also whipped the ground with its tail from time to time, just like using a hammer on a burly man, but Zhou Luo hurriedly coaxed it.","“Good boy. Don’t wheedle. Dive into the sea. You should be very skilled.”","After being forced to dive into the sea, the Lava Dragon Lizard was obviously a little panicked. After all, it was its first time diving into the sea. However, it found that the sea was so much fun after a few swimming attempts.","It was unwilling to go to the shore after playing in the sea. The Lava Dragon Lizard’s change stunned Zhou Luo.","Liu Jie was about to let the Insect Queen set up the insect swarm on the desolate island, but Lin Yuan stopped him.","The Insect Queen’s sea of insects was not good at fighting in the sea. Its core unit was the Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects, which would drown in the seawater within a few minutes and was completely unable to survive in it.","It could be said that Liu Jie was a non-swimmer and was only suitable for land combat. Previously, Liu Jie had created a lot of Lightning Gathering Moths and Hurricane Owlet Moths, which he had also brought over when he came to this island. These Lightning Gathering Moths and the Hurricane Owlet Moths were enough.","When Listen saw Zhou Luo let the Lava Dragon Lizard play in the sea and recalled that there were no living creatures in this sea, meaning there wouldn’t be any danger, he summoned his two contracted feys.","Lin Yuan saw the Bronze X Pain Illusory Fox that he had previously exchanged with Listen had reached Silver VII/Fantasy I. In addition to the Pain Illusory Fox, Listen actually had a Silver III/Fantasy I Three-Tailed Crimson Fox.","The Three-Tailed Crimson Fox’s aptitude was actually better than the Pain Illusory Fox’s.","It would grow a new tail with every huge promotion in its grade and was considered to have an extremely noble bloodline among the fox feys.","Lin Yuan realized Listen’s aptitude could really be called excellent. Moreover, Listen was only 24 years old this year and was a dazzling presence in the younger generation.","Lin Yuan couldn’t help but think about recruiting Listen into his new Dome guild club. After all, the guild club’s main team for the S Tournament consisted of only him and Liu Jie.","At that moment, the wind suddenly picked up above the sea. The freezing sea breeze blew Lin Yuan’s moon-white spirit qi clothes, and an eagle cry suddenly resounded above the sea."]},{"number":461,"title":"Chapter 461: Do You Understand This Reasoning?","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan only saw a giant hawk with a wingspan of nearly 40 meters flying from the shore. It had dark-brown feathers with a sharp metallic sheen. The color of its back feathers was darker, almost black.","Instead, the color of its abdominal feathers was lighter, showing a coffee color. However, the giant hawk’s head had golden plumes that were as sharp as a sword and created the sound of a sword piercing the air in flight.","The sword feathers on both cheeks were erected, with a pair of sharp hawk’s eyes, making this giant hawk with a wingspan of 40 meters look heroic and extraordinary.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check this giant hawk’s attributes.","[Fey Name]: Sword Plume Sea Hawk","[Fey Species]: Long-Feathered Hawk/Sea Hawk","[Fey Grade]: Diamond (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Metal/Wind","[Fey Quality]: Fantasy V","Lin Yuan couldn’t help but raise his eyebrows. It seemed that this Sword Plume Sea Hawk should have reached the barrier of breaking through to Suzerain. It should be long before it broke through.","Looking at the Sword Plume Sea Hawk flying toward him and the others, Lin Yuan knew that what should come finally came.","The Sword Plume Sea Hawk withdrew its wings and landed on the desolate island where everyone was. The gusts of wind caused dozens of Lightning Gathering Moths to be blown hundreds of meters away before they were able to stabilize themselves.","Zhou Luo immediately commanded the Lava Dragon Lizard to go onto the shore and block before Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, and Listen. He fulfilled his duties as a white-clothed follower and also a servant.","An old man and a middle-aged man dressed in half armor jumped down from the outstanding Sword Plume Sea Hawk’s back.","When Lin Yuan saw this old man, an indistinct smile spread across his face.","Wasn’t this old man the same old man with a cedar aura following Young Master Zheng back in the Indigo Azure Sea Market?","He scanned the other middle-aged man wearing half-body armor and thought, Did the Zheng family’s third lineage send two emperor-class experts at once with the intention of attacking me?","How much did they want me to die?","At this moment, the old man with a cedar aura had a straight back and an indifferent expression. His tone was gentle as if he was talking to his own grandson.","“Not bad. All three of you are here. I don’t have to bother with more work.”","After saying that, the old man with a straight back and a cedar aura glanced at the Lava Dragon Lizard that was roaring violently and said with some regret, “A Diamond I/Fantasy I lizard. It’s somewhat weak.”","When Zhou Luo saw the Sword Plume Sea Hawk earlier and sensed its mightiness, he knew that the strength of this group of people was far from his own. However, he looked unwilling to be outdone.","Zhou Luo knew that Lin Yuan had two Myth Breed feys that could take human form hidden in the shadows.","What else was there to worry about when there were two Suzerain/Myth Breed feys that could take human form and were at least Myth II protecting them in the dark?","Therefore, Zhou Luo said to the old man with the cedar aura without the slightest concern, “Old man, your hair is white, your beard is white, your eyebrows are white, and you’re a bit old.”","The old man with a straight back and a cedar aura did not react for a long time. It seemed that he didn’t expect someone to speak to him like that.","However, the middle-aged man in half armor besides the old man frowned and responded. “You dare talk back? Quickly leave this deserted island. Otherwise, don’t blame me for not warning you beforehand when you lose your life.”","Zhou Luo was about to retort when Lin Yuan put his hand on his shoulder and patted twice. He stopped talking and immediately commanded the Lava Dragon Lizard to retreat while he still blocked Lin Yuan’s side.","Lin Yuan was a little surprised at this point as the middle-aged man wearing half armor wanted to drive them away, not directly kill them.","Lin Yuan was puzzled. Was the middle-aged man in half armor not from the third lineage of the Zheng family?","Immediately after that, he heard the old man with a straight back and cedar aura say, “Duan He, there’s no hurry. You don’t have to rush to drive them away. I still have something to say to them.”","The middle-aged in half armor clearly looked impatient and stored the Sword Plume Sea Hawk into his spiritual spatial zone with a wave of his hand.","Lin Yuan took a step forward and asked with a smile on his face, “Does your Young Master Zheng want the mask on my face so badly that he rushed to send you to make another deal with me?”","A gentle smile appeared on the old man’s face, but instead of answering his question, he asked, “This huge Indigo Azure City has only ever had three trees that rise to the sky.","“Whether it’s a dragon or snake, they can only coil on the branches of the trees in Indigo Azure City. Do you understand this principle?”","Lin Yuan smiled even brighter and replied, “Of course, I understand that. Which place does not have a tree that rises to the sky, and which tree doesn’t have dragons or snakes?","“Self-righteous trees always forget to look at the top and think they are big trees when, in fact, they’re actually covered by larger trees.”","Lin Yuan paused before saying, “Are the large trees that rise to the sky the Zheng family’s main family or the third lineage?","“If it’s the latter, the main family of the Zheng family won’t be happy to know that the few branches that parasitize on the tree roots actually have the intention of growing into a big tree.”","The old man with a straight back and cedar turned solemn, and his voice seemed to be synchronized with the coldness of the cedar.","“You have a tongue that will kill you at such a young age.”","Lin Yuan shook the wind-blown moon-white spirit qi clothes and asked instead, “Will I not attract a fatal disaster without this tongue?”","At that moment, the middle-aged man in half armor knitted his brows, looked at the old man beside him, and asked, “Jiao Hanzhong, what’s going on? Didn’t you ask me to help your fey bear the World Cleansing?”","The old man with a straight back and a cedar aura looked at him apologetically and answered, “Duan He, this is Master’s personal matter.","“Wait for a moment, and I’ll instantly resolve this big personal matter. We can’t taint this good place for World Cleansing.”","The middle-aged snorted, walked a few steps away, and spoke."]},{"number":462,"title":"Chapter 462: Go, Mother of Bloodbath","paragraphs":["The middle-aged man in half armor made no attempt to mince his words or hide his displeasure.","“Jian Hanzhong, I only came to repay my debt. I have no intention of partaking in the matters of the Zheng family’s third lineage.”","Duan He turned his attention back to Lin Yuan and the rest.","Something serious must have happened. Otherwise, they would not have been pressed to dispatch Jian Hanzhong.","As a mere collateral branch of the main family, the third lineage of the Zheng family would never send out their only emperor-class expert under normal circumstances.","However, no matter how carefully Duan He scanned the group of young people standing in the near distance, he could not figure out in what way they would pose a large enough threat to warrant Jian Hanzhong stepping up.","Jian Hanzhong was right. Despite the Lava Dragon Lizard’s exceptional skills, it ultimately lacked strength.","The third lineage of the Zheng family had several king-class members.","A single king-class expert should be sufficient to handle this group of people.","Lin Yuan did not expect that Duan He was not actually part of the Zheng family.","He had only come to aid the man known as Jian Hanzhong, who had the aroma of cedarwood wafting around him. He was going to assist Jian Hanzhong’s contracted fey in undergoing its World Cleansing.","Lin Yuan asked Duan He upfront, “Senior Duan He, you are emperor-class yourself. If you really aren’t part of the Zheng family, I hope you won’t meddle in affairs which do not concern you.”","Duan He could not believe that the masked youth would call him out.","Duan He replayed the young man’s words in his mind. He was certain that he had sensed a veiled threat within the ostensibly polite statement.","Duan He furrowed his brow and asked, “So what if I choose to interfere?”","Lin Yuan regarded Duan He with a stony expression and punctuated each word as he replied, “Then you are making yourself an enemy of Sky City.”","At the mention of Sky City, the gears in Duan He’s head started to turn.","He realized that he had never heard of a faction called Sky City.","However, he had no interest in participating in such inter-faction fights. If he was, he would not have made his stance clear to Jian Hanzhong from the very beginning.","Jian Hanzhong heaved a sigh and began to circulate his spiritual power.","The spiritual power took the form of a cyclone, which materialized in front of Jian Hanzhong. The cyclone increased in magnitude as more spiritual power was released.","Suddenly, it turned into an enormous vortex of spiritual power, consuming all the free-flowing spiritual power of heaven and earth.","As Lin Yuan observed Jian Hanzhong, he found that he was an S-rank spirit qi professional.","S-rank spirit qi professionals demonstrated their battle prowess by exhibiting how their cyclone of spiritual power could swallow all the free-flowing spiritual power in the air, thereby allowing them to manipulate it at will.","This showed that S-rank spirit qi professionals had transcended beyond only utilizing the spiritual power inside of their bodies.","They possessed the power to harness the energy of the natural world.","At that moment, a 70-meter-tall fey covered with icy blue leaves descended upon the island. Its rough branches resembled ice sculptures that were carved with intricate designs.","Every light blue leaf was dotted with a single hanging frozen droplet.","As the lush blue leaves danced in the air, numerous branches swayed in tandem.","Yet, the main branch of this massive tree remained unusually straight.","Winter in Indigo Azure City did not reach frigid levels, and the temperature mostly stayed around the same level as that of late autumn in the Royal Capital.","However, the second that this 70-meter-tall, blue-leafed fey appeared, Lin Yuan noticed a coat of snow appearing on his white clothes.","Each breath he drew stung his lungs with needles of frost.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the 70-meter-tall, blue-leafed fey.","[Fey Name]: Ultimate Ice","[Fey Species]: Advanced","[Fey Grade]: Diamond (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Ice","[Fey Quality]: Fantasy V","Lin Yuan realized that this Fantasy V Ultimate Ice held comparable power to the Golden-Feathered Sea Eagle.","Both were almost Suzerains.","True Data did not reveal anything particularly special about Ultimate Ice. It possessed the average skills of any ice-type fey.","The only special skill it had was that it could condense the elemental skill of its opponents.","This skill would greatly affect feys that used their elemental skill for offense, greatly elevating the Ultimate Ice’s fighting ability.","But no matter how effective this skill was, it could only be used on feys of the same grade.","It would also affect feys of a slightly higher level, namely ones that just become Suzerain but had not undergone World Cleansing.","Feys like the Mother of Bloodbath, whose Willpower Rune had already morphed into a Law Rune, were already leagues above Ultimate Ice. Thus, the Ultimate Ice’s power was limited against the Mother of Bloodbath.","Jian Hanzhong looked at Lin Yuan before shooting a look at Listen.","“Hand over the item you found near the coastal sea. If I’m in a good mood, I might be willing to freeze your hearts instantly and give you a painless death.” Jian Hanzhong said in a low voice.","Zhou Luo was in the middle of controlling the Lava Dragon Lizard’s Maroon Fire Forehead Launcher ability. He blanketed the crowd with Lava Shield.","The Lava Shield helped Lin Yuan counter the extreme cold emanating from the Ultimate Ice.","Unfortunately, due to the sizable difference in ability between the Lava Dragon Lizard and Ultimate Ice, Lin Yuan could still feel the immense pressure from the Diamond/ Fantasy V fey.","Lin Yuan could feel the danger looming over him.","The feeling reminded him of the time Cheng Wu had hunted him in the wilderness outside the Royal Capital.","Lin Yuan could no longer be bothered to continue engaging Jian Hanzhong in discourse.","He originally planned to extract information regarding the Zheng family’s third lineage from Jian Hanzhong.","However, he gave up the notion.","Lin Yuan said softly, “Go, Mother of Bloodbath.”","Lin Yuan’s voice was barely a whisper. It was easily overpowered by the whipping gusts of the ocean breeze.","At that moment, a terrifyingly powerful pressure, stronger than that of Ultimate Ice, appeared.","The stench of malice and blood accompanied it.","At the same time that the pressure appeared, a crimson red streak shot out of Lin Yuan’s head and headed straight for the Ultimate Ice."]},{"number":463,"title":"Chapter 463: Murderer and Loser","paragraphs":["The moment the intense pressure and metallic odor of blood manifested, Jian Hanzhong’s expression completely changed.","He drew out the spiritual power within him and a beautiful bonsai sprouted from the center of his palm.","At the same moment when the exquisite cedar bonsai sprouted from Jian Hanzhong’s palm, the originally undisturbed surface of the sea surged.","A gigantic glacier rose from its depths.","The air around the cedar bonsai turned to ivory frost the moment that the cedar bonsai radiated the chilling aura.","Jian Hanzhong pumped a large amount of spiritual power into the cedar bonsai and bellowed, “Cold Snow Pine, Pine Needle Shield! Ultimate Ice, Ice Leaves Scatter!”","The cedar bonsai in Jian Hanzhong’s hand shed its needles.","The falling needles melded together on the Ultimate Ice’s branches, forming a hard shell.","However, the Ultimate Ice was built too sturdily and was colossal in size.","The Cold Snow Pine was unable to wholly sweep over its branches to provide it with full-coverage protection.","When the Ultimate Ice received Jian Hanzhong’s command, its dense blue foliage churned up a tornado of leaves.","The droplets hanging off the leaves transformed into needles that burst forth toward the electric streak of scarlet light headed toward the fey.","Alas, the tornado of icy blue leaves was no match for the electric streak of scarlet light.","As the crimson light closed in, the Ultimate Ice’s branches bowed and reached inward, starting from the point where the needles were absent.","The Ultimate Ice’s branches were blasted open, leaving a large crater in the aftermath.","When the crimson light blasted another hole adjacent to the first one, it transformed into an enchanting girl. She had flame-red hair, red eyes to match, and was dressed in ruby armor.","A light blue tree core was nestled in the girl’s hand.","The Mother of Bloodbath languidly tossed the light blue tree core up and down. It even tossed it so that it made a complete circle in the air and intersected each throw with a complex trick.","An enraged roar ripped from Jian Hanzhong’s throat. “No!”","The Mother of Bloodbath’s strange yet melodious voice chimed in, its tone one of scornful derision. “No? Old man! Your voice pissed me off from the beginning! How dare you threaten to freeze the hearts of the people from Sky City? Dream on!","“If you had used the Suzerain Peak Snow Chill to attack me, I might have been slightly injured. But you chose to use the Snow Pine Chill to protect the Ultimate Ice instead. How stupid. I have to admit, you’re quite powerful for an old guy. I’ll also say that Ultimate Ice’s tree core is not bad. It’ll be great for cooling down my room on sweltering summer days.”","The moment that the Mother of Bloodbath showed herself, Duan He, who had not participated up till then, jumped. His pupils contracted instantaneously.","His rugged features betrayed fright and incredulity. He could not shake the feeling that a comedic performance of sorts had just taken place.","Jian Hanzhong, who initially held the advantage, suffered a loss as his contracted fey lost its tree core.","One look at the feeble Ultimate Ice and its decimated state was enough for Duan He to know that the Ultimate Ice was about to meet its end.","An advanced Class 4 Creation Master could only save the Ultimate Ice.","However, it was unlikely that the red-haired girl would give the Ultimate Ice such an opportunity.","The Mother of Bloodbath’s residual blood-red energy was still devouring the Ultimate Ice’s branches.","The edges of the crater in Ultimate Ice’s body were already starting to wither.","Duan He knew that the red-haired girl had to be a Suzerain/ Myth Breed fey that could change into human form.","Only one question remained in Duan He’s mind.","Why was I unaware that Sky City possessed power?","No rising faction would already have a Myth Breed fey that could take human form.","I’ve never heard of Sky City being mentioned amongst the veteran factions before. Could they be one of the rare hidden factions?","When Jian Hanzhong realized the true extent of the Ultimate Ice’s situation, his ramrod-straight posture sagged.","Tears welled up in his eyes, and his hoarse voice croaked. “How dare you take my Ultimate Ice’s tree core? I’ll make you pay even if it’s the last thing I’ll do!”","The Mother of Bloodbath made a yawning gesture as it ignored Jian Hanzhong.","It raised the Ultimate Ice’s tree core to its lips and took a bite out of it.","The Mother of Bloodbath chomped down the entire tree core in a few mouthfuls.","When it was done, it made a show of opening her mouth wide and spitting the chewed-up tree core out on the ground.","Its voice dripped with haughtiness. “A tree core that hasn’t reached Suzerain just doesn’t sit well with me. You’ve been lazy, old man! However, the chives growing out of your hand look pretty tasty. I think I’ll dig it out of your hand and make a dish out of it.”","The Mother of Bloodbath’s words caused Lin Yuan’s eyelids to twitch.","Its forked tongue was just as effective of a weapon as its actual abilities.","It launched a sneak attack, then went for the heart before finally going for the lethal blow.","Jian Hanzhong stood no chance against its murderous intent.","The Ultimate Ice’s Diamond/Fantasy V tree core would definitely fetch a source-type item on the market.","What a loser!","Jian Hanzhong’s anger erupted when he saw the Mother of Bloodbath take a bite out of the Ultimate Ice’s tree core. He spluttered and coughed in rage.","He also clutched his heaving chest as he coughed.","“You—”","The Mother of Bloodbath cut in again before he could finish.","“What? Just stop struggling already. I’ll carve the chives out of your hand soon! When you die, the third lineage of the Zheng family who is still waiting for your good news will probably explode into laughter. Don’t worry though. You won’t be lonely after your death. I’ll bury your ashes on this island and open a big disco here. That way, I’ll be able to relive the happiness of today over and over again.”","Jian Hanzhong arched his back, looked up into the sky, and released an ear-shattering howl. “Nightmare VI, please help me! Please return the tree core to me!”","The second that Jian Hanzhong wailed toward the sky, a person clad in a black cloak materialized next to him."]},{"number":464,"title":"Chapter 464: Older Sister and Younger Sister Can","paragraphs":["With one wave, an oily black mass attached itself to the scarlet energy that was rotting the Ultimate Ice’s branches.","The black oily mass countered the Mother of Bloodbath’s blood energy. It also weaved together the hole in the Ultimate Ice’s branches and effectively slowed the rate of rotting.","Despite having negated the Mother of Bloodbath’s energy, the Ultimate Ice would continue to wither from the hole outward without its tree core.","The black-cloaked person spoke with a deep and grating voice.","“By attacking the Zheng family’s third lineage, you have offended the Zheng family. You shall pay for your actions with your life.”","The Mother of Bloodbath kept the Ultimate Ice’s tree core in the red crystal cluster Diamond fey storage box hanging off its ear.","Its tone and attitude remained playful.","“Don’t hide behind the mask. I smelled the stench of a bat-species fey on you from the start.”","Although its tone was impish, its expression was completely serious.","The scarlet glow in its hand flashed. The light streaked toward where Lin Yuan’s group was standing and separated to form four crimson crystal spiders.","Lin Yuan knew that the Mother of Bloodbath was using its Gold ability, Spider Incubation, to protect him and the rest.","Four shields in the shape of the Mother of Bloodbath’s back armor covered the Lava Dragon Lizard’s Lava Shield.","When the Mother of Bloodbath’s armor-shaped shield engulfed the Lava Shield, Lin Yuan felt the crushing barrier restricted outside.","The shield’s interior felt as though it had been sanitized.","At the same time that it launched the crimson crystal spiders, the Mother of Bloodbath’s body was suddenly awash with a blinding scarlet light.","Blood Law Runes appeared and released their maximum power.","The initially calm sea simultaneously transformed into sticky coagulation of blood that extended endlessly.","A ferocious red spider, the size of a small mountain, appeared at the spot previously occupied by the Mother of Bloodbath.","The spider was swathed in blood energy. Other than its back, its entire body was covered with a terrifying fur of stingers.","The stingers gleamed shocking red.","The moment that the Mother of Bloodbath transformed, it charged toward the man in black.","Nightmare VI morphed into a plume of black smoke at the same time that the Mother of Bloodbath charged at him, deftly dodging her attack.","The Mother of Bloodbath was unfazed, and it immediately changed directions.","Two scarlet stinger-covered spider legs raised and stabbed, penetrating the still weak Ultimate Ice.","About two meters long each, two gashes were left on the branches of the already helpless Ultimate Ice.","The gashes almost sliced the Ultimate Ice’s branches into thirds.","At that moment, Nightmare VI, which had transformed into black smoke, appeared behind the Mother of Bloodbath.","Nightmare VI transformed from human form into an enormous black bat. Its obsidian body was lined with metal.","The bat flapped its wings, sweeping up mounds of grey dust.","The roiling dust was thick, obscuring the vision of the people present. It seemed to transport them to a whole other world.","The enormous bat crossed its wings, forming hooks, and slashed down toward the weak spot of the Mother of Bloodbath’s spider body.","The grating voice exclaimed, “Dead Dream Law, Devour Dream Hook.”","The Mother of Bloodbath anticipated the attack and leaped into the air.","The eye that grew on the Mother of Bloodbath’s back armor had noticed Nightmare VI’s movements early on and had formed a strategy to counter Nightmare VI’s abilities using All-Seeing Eye.","Nevertheless, Nightmare VI’s two soul eater hooks were too quick and managed to land a blow on one of the Mother of Bloodbath’s legs.","The attack was inflicted on the Mother of Bloodbath while it was leaping into the air.","The Mother of Bloodbath’s strange yet pleasant voice shrieked viciously. “Blood Law, Blood Control!”","The Mother of Bloodbath’s Blood Control ability could manipulate the enemy’s movements through controlling their blood.","Although both Nightmare VI and the Mother of Bloodbath were Myth II feys, Nightmare VI’s power was at the peak of Myth II.","As such, the Mother of Bloodbath could not control Nightmare VI for long.","Nonetheless, that short window was enough.","While Blood Control was manipulating Nightmare VI’s body, three light purple flower buds the size of small balls appeared behind it.","The purple flowers bloomed and shed, transforming into a rain of purple petals.","One flower petal elongated to become a light-purple spear.","After the transformation of the first petal, the rest of the petals swiftly followed, each one of them turning into light-purple spears.","When Listen caught sight of the razor-sharp light-purple spears, he immediately recognized them. They were the same ones that had slain the king-class experts that had tried to assassinate him in the Royal Capital.","A gentle and caring voice cried out. “Shooting Spears of Summer, Three Thousand Spears of Summer!”","The Three Thousand Spears of Summer sailed through the air, and half of them embedded themselves in the enormous bat.","Nightmare VI’s metal back burst open at the point of contact, and a fountain of inky blood gushed out.","Unfortunately, the spears did not manage to fully penetrate Nightmare VI’s body. They merely punctured it.","By the time the other half of the spears were flying toward the giant bat, Nightmare VI had already escaped the Mother of Bloodbath’s Blood Control.","Nightmare VI morphed into a cloud of smoke and resumed its human form. Its once pristine black cloak was now tattered and torn. Its features were twisted into a sinister expression.","Its eyes turned into slits, and only the whites could be seen. Its skin had an unhealthy ashy color, and two sharp incisors grew out of the corners of its mouth.","Nightmare VI spat out a mass of black blood before its grave voice carried threatening undertones.","“Do you know the consequences of opposing the Zheng family?”","The rain of light-purple petals continued to dance in the wind as Endless Summer appeared next to Lin Yuan.","It noticed the human manifestation of the Mother of Bloodbath standing nearby. Despite its relaxed expression, its leg had completely deformed.","Endless Summer studied the Mother of Bloodbath’s deformed leg for a while, its brow furrowing tighter and tighter.","Its kind gaze was laced with ferocity as it fixed its eyes on Nightmare VI.","“Another dark-type fey. I sure am fated with dark-type feys,” said Endless Summer.","“Since the Zheng family has sent out assassins, it means that you’re aware of the consequences of making enemies of Sky City.”","Endless Summer’s eyes landed on the Mother of Bloodbath.","“Leave this Dream-Eating Bat to me. You take care of that old man and the two stalks of chives.”","Endless Summer snapped its fingers, and runes swirled around its fingertips as it whispered, “Older Sister can!”","The Mother of Bloodbath snapped to attention at its words.","“Younger Sister can too!”","Lin Yuan rubbed his forehead.","Is this really how Older Sister and Younger Sister Can should be used!?"]},{"number":465,"title":"Chapter 465: You’ve Comprehended Law Runes!","paragraphs":["The Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer had only recently learned about Star Web. Did they already master it in such a short time!?","I’ll have to ensure that my feys don’t learn too much about Star Web!","Lin Yuan thought about Chimey.","My Chimey is so lovely and obedient! Although Genius often buys books from Star Web, Chimey is always by its side. I’ve never noticed Chimey becoming obsessed with Star Web and picking up strange things from there. How lovely!","When Nightmare VI heard Endless Summer’s words, it immediately summoned its Law Rune.","The moment Nightmare VI’s Law Rune was summoned, intermittent cries of happiness sounded out from a distance away.","Nightmare VI’s hands entered Law Rune’s mass of grey fog.","Nightmare VI’s hands immediately started to decay, but its finger joints started to glow long and slender.","Black nails that were longer than Nightmare VI’s hands sprouted from the finger joints, inciting a sharp surge of energy in the air around.","Nightmare VI watched as the nails grew from its withered fingers. It made the gesture of slitting its throat.","“Both of us are Suzerain/Myth II. But I have already reached the peak of Suzerain/Myth II and discovered several secrets to modify my body into a weapon. Do you two really think that you can kill me? I’ll show you the true power of a Myth II utilizing the partial power of a Myth III.”","Endless Summer did not acknowledge Nightmare VI. It stood statuesque.","Shortly after, Endless Summer spoke gently.","“Time’s up.”","The energy around Endless Summer suddenly rose, greatly surpassing its initial level—the energy shot toward Nightmare VI.","Endless Summer pointed at Nightmare VI and emphasized each word. “I heard that you like to spout nonsense. How annoying.”","Endless Summer did not even try to hide its disdain for dark-type feys.","Nightmare VI’s confident expression disappeared, and its grave voice carried a tinge of incredulity. “You’re actually Myth III. Why did you reduce yourself to Myth II?”","A smile played on Endless Summer’s lips. Its sweet voice dripped with malevolence.","“Moron. It’s because we were after the Law Crystal in your head from the start! The Dream-Eating Bats’ escaping capabilities are unparalleled. Moreover, you possess the Dead Dream Law. Both of them together are amazing. The Mother of Bloodbath braved its injury for the sake of keeping you here. Putting on a small act is the least I could do for its efforts.”","Nightmare VI got goosebumps.","It was a Suzerain/Myth II fey. Yet, the enemy coveted its Law Crystal the second it revealed itself.","Nightmare VI started to circulate the energy in its body.","The Dead Dream Law’s grey fog absorbed all the energy in Nightmare VI’s body. The sounds of crying in the Law Rune rose in volume.","Nightmare VI plunged the black nails into its heart. Black blood spurted from the wound, which was absorbed by the nails.","Bat wings sprouted from Nightmare VI’s back. The ten black nails, which had absorbed a substantial amount of blood, fell from the withered hands.","The fallen black nails landed on Nightmare VI’s metal wings and turned into bones that supported the bat’s structure.","The bat wings were enveloped with dark energy, almost completely obscuring Nightmare VI’s figure.","One flap of its wings and Nightmare VI could disperse the fog all around.","“You might be Myth III, but you won’t be able to stop me if I want to leave!”","The light-purple Enlightenment Law Runes around Endless Summer’s fingertips glowed brighter.","“Enlightenment Law, Second Summer Jail.”","The wound on Nightmare VI’s body that had been inflicted by Shooting Spears of Summer had stopped bleeding. In fact, it had healed somewhat thanks to the Suzerain feys’ regeneration abilities.","However, numerous flowers protruded from Nightmare VI’s wound.","The flowers bloomed, growing layers of fresh leaves, and light-purple buds were nestled amongst the leaves.","The lush leaves pierced through Nightmare VI. From a distance, it looked as though Nightmare VI had been pinned to a blossoming flower tree.","When the flowers bloomed from Nightmare VI’s wound, it realized that although it could still think clearly, its mind could not control its body’s actions.","Lin Yuan, who was watching from afar, suddenly came to a realization—Endless Summer and the Mother of Bloodbath’s styles were on the opposite ends of the spectrum.","For example, when the Mother of Bloodbath had been fighting with the Ultimate Ice Cedar, it could have dominated the battle using a frontal attack. Yet, it had chosen to use sneak attacks.","However, Lin Yuan could understand it. He even admired it.","As a wild fey that had to fend for itself for as long as it could remember, the difficult life had molded Mother of Bloodbath’s thinking. It would always go for the move that created the greatest turn in the tide during a battle.","Endless Summer and the Mother of Bloodbath had planned for how to deal with Nightmare VI from the beginning.","It had started when Nightmare VI made its move, and the Mother of Bloodbath had used Blood Law to activate its manipulation ability.","Since then, Nightmare VI had fallen into their trap.","When Endless Summer used Shooting Spears of Summer, Lin Yuan could not help but use Morbius to check Endless Summer’s characteristics.","Lin Yuan found out that physical attacks were the weakest ability of Shooting Spears of Summer.","Rather, physical attacks were just the byproduct of the Shooting Spears of Summer’s abilities.","When Shooting Spears of Summer pierced its target, the tip would leave a flower seed. Each flower seed would germinate swiftly and turn into a lock that confined the target’s abilities in its mind.","Half of the 3,000 Shooting Spears of Summer had penetrated Nightmare VI’s body. Ergo, more than 1,000 locks were keeping Nightmare VI’s abilities at bay.","The thoughts that were imprisoned in the mind could not send the signals needed to move the body. It was left vulnerable.","Lin Yuan unconsciously used Mobius’ True Data to check the Suzerain/Myth II Dream-Eating Bat’s characteristics.","[Fey Name]: Dream-Eating Bat","[Fey Species]: Horseshoe Bat Species/Toothed Bat Species","[Fey Grade]: Suzerain (8/10)","[Fey Type]: Dark","[Fey Quality]: Myth II (Dead Dream Law)","...","Lin Yuan knitted his brow.","Soon after, Lin Yuan shouted at Endless Summer."]},{"number":466,"title":"Chapter 466: Spirit Return! End of Summer!","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan’s voice was loud, and it immediately reached the ears of everyone on the battlefield.","“Its exclusive skill, Dark Night Tribute, allows it to burn its Law Rune and energy as a tribute to its fake body before upgrading into a Fantasy Breed. It can then abandon the current body and reincarnate into the fake body where no one knows where it is hidden.”","After hearing Lin Yuan’s words, a question mark involuntarily appeared in everyone’s heart.","For a wild fey, especially a Myth Breed fey, its abilities, and exclusive skills were its trump cards to save its life or for absolute kills. They naturally wouldn’t let anyone know the abilities and exclusive skills easily.","Even if a Class 2 Creation Master was able to know clearly about a Normal fey’s ability and exclusive skill, once a fey became a Fantasy Breed, not even a Class 3 Creation Master could see through its abilities and exclusive skills.","As the grade of the Fantasy Breed fey got higher, even a Class 4 Creation Master wouldn’t be able to do a complete investigation of the fey’s abilities and exclusive skills.","Once the Fantasy Breed fey became a Myth Breed one, the fey could hide its abilities and exclusive skills without letting anyone else know.","Nightmare VI was only having one thought in its mind now. How did someone else know of my exclusive skill!?","Nightmare VI felt that the masked youth was getting increasingly bizarre.","Endless Summer found it a little unbelievable, but she would never suspect Lin Yuan’s words. After all, she knew that Lin Yuan wasn’t a person who would speak off the cuff. Therefore, whatever he said must be true.","As soon as Lin Yuan’s statement ended, Nightmare VI started burning with black flames in the lush branches. It was melting just like a candle.","Endless Summer turned abnormally stern and looked at Nightmare VI as she said in a deep voice, “Earlier on, you said something wrong. You said that a pinnacle Myth II might be able to emulate but will never truly achieve Body Weaponization.”","At that moment, Endless Summer had this particularly serious look as though she was going to do something sacred.","Endless Summer took off the pink-purple flower ball bracelet that she had been wearing. She then enveloped the bracelet in pink-purple Law Rune that was in a gaseous state and said in a pious manner, “Spirit Return!”","As soon as Endless Summer said the words ‘Spirit Return’, it felt as though the entire world had turned silent. The surface of the sea suddenly bloomed with countless flowers. Within the sea of flowers, gigantic wooden pillars were rising up into the clouds.","The gigantic pillars were upholding a verdant divine wood that was almost connecting heaven and earth. The verdant wood had branches that were filled with pink-purple embroidered ball-shaped flowers.","A sky-shaking aura allowed the divine wood that was already close to the sky to climb up limitlessly.","The aura brought upon an energy wave that had extended toward Indigo Azure City that was far away.","After using Spirit Return, Endless Summer reverted by the time she just transformed into a human and was wearing a pink-purple palace dress.","Her long pink-purple hair suddenly became illusory, and her palace dress was covered in flowers.","The pink-purple strands of hair were just like the verdant divine wood and were floating toward the horizon.","One pink eye and one purple eye suddenly opened. At that moment, it felt like the world, and all beings were receiving great enlightenment.","All of the aura had returned to serenity in an instant. The sea of flowers and the gigantic wood that lifted the divine wood looked as though they were bestowed with wisdom and were alive.","Lin Yuan realized that Endless Summer gave off a feeling that she was no longer a simple fey. It seemed like Endless Summer’s body had already fused her body and the Enlightenment Law into the world.","Endless Summer’s body was already a small world with the law. She extended a finger and pointed at Nightmare VI, which was still constantly melting. She then chanted, “End of Summer, all things shall go into long solitude!”","The flowers and the gigantic wood instantly withered and fused toward the finger. The attack immediately caused Nightmare VI to lower its head. It felt as though it was in a slumber, and there was no longer any vitality.","At that moment, a dark hole opened up in the sky. The horizon was covered in layers of dark clouds.","The dark clouds pressed down but were still unable to affect the verdant divine wood. However, the dark clouds were getting denser.","Endless Summer quickly withdrew her prowess and went back beside Lin Yuan.","Jiao Hanzhong, who had been non-existent, was letting out a frenzied expression. He was looking at the Diamond X/Fantasy V Ultimate Ice Cedar, and his eyes were filled with apology and sorrow.","The Ultimate Ice Cedar had already turned into a withered wood that didn’t have any vitality. The Mother of Bloodbath had severely injured the 70-meter tree, and once it collapsed, it would become a pile of wood ash.","Lin Yuan looked at Jiao Hanzhong with eyes of delight. Furthermore, the delight was getting increasingly intense.","Lin Yuan felt that Jiao Hanzhong was truly an ambitious old ‘youth’ who had ideals and aspirations.","Lin Yuan had been waiting for Jiao Hanzhong to fall in despair and call forth the World Cleansing to destroy both himself and his enemies.","Before Lin Yuan could give any guidance, before the Mother of Bloodbath could use her words to infuriate him, Jiao Hanzhong had already taken the initiative.","Lin Yuan felt that if Jiao Hanzhong wasn’t the enemy, he would ask Endless Summer to bring him a hair dye to express gratitude.","Lin Yuan didn’t wish to help Jiao Hanzhong endure the World Cleansing, allowing his Suzerain/Myth I Cold Snow Pine to upgrade into Myth II, allowing for the extracted tree core to have greater value.","Lin Yuan was coveting the World Grace that would descend after the Cold Snow Pine endured the World Cleansing.","Normally, after a Myth Breed fey endured the World Cleansing, the World Grace that descended could be plundered. However, the effects of the plundered World Grace would be faint. In fact, it wouldn’t even be 1% of the World Grace’s entire energy.","% of the World Grace that didn’t belong to the fey would be scattered into the air.","Only that Crow that had wanted to upgrade its quality in exchange for its life would try to plunder Endless Summer’s tree core and World Grace. It would allow it to fight for a chance to upgrade from Myth II to Myth III.","However, back when Lin Yuan had used Morbius’ Pure Land of Bliss to help the Mother of Bloodbath to endure the World Cleansing, he had unintentionally realized that just a trace of the overflowing World Grace was enough to immediately condense 20 over spirit qi crystals.","It could be said that Morbius’ Pure Land of Bliss could completely absorb the scattered World Grace’s energy and turn it into spirit qi crystals.","Therefore, when Lin Yuan heard that Jiao Hanzhong’s fey was going to go through the World Cleansing, he had already started coveting it."]},{"number":467,"title":"Chapter 467: Lord Guard Envoy","paragraphs":["The layers of dark clouds in the sky suddenly released snow powder. As they fell, they gradually turned into goose feathers.","As soon as the goose feather-shaped snow fell onto the sea’s surface, it turned the sea surface into ice. While the snow fell, the air in the surrounding became so icy cold that it transformed into pale white flames of ice.","It looked just like fireworks in the middle of an ice storm.","Jiao Hanzhong watched as the snow fell toward the pot of Cold Snow Pine in his hand. As he experienced this beautiful scene, he suddenly felt that this was rather ironic.","This was the day of the World Cleansing that he had been waiting for days and nights. However, this day had actually become the day of his funeral.","Jiao Hanzhong said to Lin Yuan in a deep tone, “I will perish today, but you have killed a member of the Zheng main family’s Nightmare Squad, just for the thunderous revenge from the Zheng main family!”","When Lin Yuan heard Jiao Hanzhong’s words, he felt that it was rather sad for this emperor-class expert. Jiao Hanzhong was already at the emperor-class and possessed Myth Breed feys, but he still felt that the Zheng main family was the eternal support even at his demise.","Lin Yuan said in a cold voice, “If the Zheng main family wants revenge, my Sky City shall accept it.”","Once Lin Yuan finished his statement, a shout came from the horizon. “Who is causing trouble at Indigo Azure City’s sea region!?”","The spatial zone shook intensively, and a crevice was ripped open. The crevice then turned into a door.","Three men walked out of the door.","One of them was wearing Indigo Azure Guards’ azure-colored armor, but it had many additional bright silver patterns that were like waves.","Just based on the bright silver patterns, Lin Yuan could see that this man should be the Indigo Azure Guard Captain. He was the person aside from the Indigo Azure City Lord who had the most authority in Indigo Azure City.","The two other men were wearing Spirit Guard uniforms.","The man in the Indigo Azure Guard armor assessed the situation of the barren island. Once he saw the World Cleansing that was descending from the sky, he frowned slightly and bowed to the two Spirit Guards. “My lords, I hope that you can help this emperor-class expert from the Zheng family to endure this tribulation.”","As the Indigo Azure Guard captain, the middle-aged man had obviously recognized Jiao Hanzhong’s identity. Seeing that Jiao Hanzhong’s Cold Snow Pine was facing the World Cleansing, he quickly asked for help from the two Spirit Guards.","The two Spirit Guards didn’t summon any fey. One of them waved the hand and produced a spatial energy shield to protect the Cold Snow Pine, temporarily helping Cold Snow Pine to isolate the icy snow that was falling.","The other Spirit Guard looked at the sky that was producing the World Cleansing and sent out fire-elemental energy.","The two moves had been controlled delicately and weren’t considered too strong. However, it was enough to help the current Cold Snow Pine to go through the World Cleansing and successfully upgrade.","Lin Yuan was silently shocked by the prowess of the two Spirit Guards who casually made their moves.","These two individuals were obviously S-rank experts and possessed Myth Breed feys. They might not have summoned any feys, but their casual moves were already at the same strength level as the Mother of Bloodbath.","If these two Spirit Guards were to summon their feys, they would be at the level of Suzerain/Myth III and were at Endless Summer’s strength level.","Receiving help from others was supposed to be a good thing, but Jiao Hanzhong was flabbergasted.","He was originally planning to wait until the harshest moment of the World Cleansing before he tossed the Cold Snow Pine over and executed its exclusive skill at full power. This would be considered his strongest attack before his death.","However, now that the Indigo Azure Guard Captain and the two Spirit Guard experts were here, Jiao Hanzhong wouldn’t be able to execute his plan.","At the same time, Jiao Hanzhong’s eyes flashed with hope.","If this was purely a personal feud, the Indigo Azure Guard Captain and the two Spirit Guards wouldn’t help him. However, if he changed his method of explanation, the Spirit Guards wouldn’t allow Lin Yuan to kill him now.","In fact, it would cause the Spirit Guards to investigate Lin Yuan.","As such, Jiao Hanzhong shouted to the Indigo Azure Guard Captain and the two Spirit Guards with resolution, “Lord Spirit Guards, they have a carcinoma fey.","“My lords, don’t you see that this sea region has no life at all? It is because they placed the Sea Burial Lotus Flower in the sea.”","After hearing Jiao Hanzhong mention the carcinoma fey, the two Spirit Guards turned stern. But once they heard that someone used the entire sea region to nurture the carcinoma fey, Sea Burial Lotus Flower, the two Spirit Guards frowned even more intensively.","They immediately turned to look at Endless Summer and Mother of Bloodbath, who were the strongest.","Lin Yuan responded by stepping forward and bowing to the Spirit Guards.","Just as Lin Yuan was going to speak, one of the Spirit Guards asked first, “We are the Guard Envoys that will be overseeing the Indigo Azure City during the active period of the dimensional rifts. Do you people really have the carcinoma fey? Is it really as he mentioned, that you are using the vitality of the entire sea region to nurture the Sea Burial Lotus Flower?”","Guard Envoys were merely one rank lower than the Chief Guard. A Guard Envoy needed to work in the Spirit Guards for at least ten years, and the Guard Envoy’s strength had to be of a certain level in order to apply for the role.","Every time during the time of crisis like the active period of the dimensional rifts, the Guard Envoys would be the ones to lead the members of the Spirit Guards to solve the problems.","Lin Yuan naturally wouldn’t lie to these experts who protected the Radiance Federation. As such, he took the actual body of the Sea Burial Lotus Flower out of the Spirit Lock spatial zone and said, “It is true that I found this Sea Burial Lotus Flower in the coastal sea. However, I wasn’t the one that placed it here. I wouldn’t turn the entire sea region into a dead region just for one Sobbing Sea Crystal.”","One of the Guard Envoys revealed a contemplating expression as he looked at the Sea Burial Lotus Flower in Lin Yuan’s hand and took another look at the coastal sea.","The Indigo Azure Guard Captain looked at Duan He, who was standing there with a flabbergasted expression.","Even if there is any confusion, Duan He wouldn’t be dumbfounded? What is going on? Does he not have enough sleep?","The Indigo Azure Guard Captain was preparing to find out more about the situation here through Duan He, so he went over toward Duan He.","It was obvious that the Indigo Azure Guard Captain would be more familiar with Duan He as compared to Jiao Hanzhong.","Liu Jie walked near Lin Yuan from behind and pointed at his own mask, signaling that he was going to take it off. As a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence, Liu Jie could be a witness for this incident and explain to the two Spirit Guard Envoys.","Lin Yuan shook his head and casually handed a brocade box to Liu Jie.","The brocade box looked dull and ordinary in appearance, but when Liu Jie held it, he realized that the surface was extremely soft and smooth. It was white in color, but when the sunlight reflected off it, it felt like there was a moon radiance that should only be seen at night.","Lin Yuan said to Liu Jie, “Brother Liu, help me to hand this brocade box to the two Lord Guard Envoys.”","Liu Jie was rather confused as he walked toward the two Guard Envoys with the brocade box.","When the two Guard Envoys saw the material of the brocade box, their eyes widened. They exchanged looks and saw the expression of shock and disbelief on each other’s faces."]},{"number":468,"title":"Chapter 468: Moon Empress’ Disciple","paragraphs":["As the Indigo Azure Guard Captain was conversing with Duan He, the Indigo Azure Guard Captain had been paying attention to the expressions on the two Spirit Guard Envoys.","When he saw the sudden change in their expressions, the Indigo Azure Guard Captain got a shock too.","He had a serious expression as he looked at the youth wearing the strange cloud-patterned mask and the silver light armor who was walking toward the two Guard Envoys. As he looked in that direction, the Indigo Azure Guard Captain fixed his eyes on the white brocade box in Liu Jie’s hands.","But no matter how he looked, the Indigo Azure Guard Captain couldn’t see anything special about this white brocade box.","Liu Jie was currently in front of the two Guard Envoys and immediately handed the brocade box to the two Guard Envoys.","Liu Jie was thinking, I wonder what is contained within Lin Yuan’s brocade box? If it isn’t useful, then I will take off my mask to show my identity as a Radiance Hundred Sequence member. That will be the best solution to the current situation.","Liu Jie didn’t think that Jiao Hanzhong would be so shameless to lie to the Guard Envoys and implicate the matter of the carcinoma fey with them. Liu Jie didn’t know what the Sea Burial Lotus Flower was, but according to what Jiao Hanzhong had said, the anomaly in this sea region was probably related to the so-called Sea Burial Lotus Flower.","The Spirit Guards would normally capture and contain the carcinoma feys that appeared in the wild. They also allowed the possession of a carcinoma fey by a private faction or an individual. However, the prerequisite was for the carcinoma fey owner not to use the carcinoma fey to cause destruction.","Now that the coastal sea region outside the Indigo Azure City had been turned into a dead region, it wasn’t a small matter. These two Spirit Guard Envoys would certainly investigate thoroughly.","Just as Liu Jie’s mind was rapidly thinking, the two Spirit Guard Envoys received the white brocade box that was radiating moonlight.","As soon as the two Spirit Guard Envoys made a small opening, they had an instant change of expression when they saw the item within and became abnormally respectful.","They immediately circulated their spiritual power and poured it into the four crests inside the brocade box.","Three of the crests with crescent moons suddenly emitted a gentle moon color. The two Spirit Guard Envoys quickly closed the white brocade box and handed it back to Liu Jie before looking at Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan didn’t think that the Creation Master crests that the Moon Empress had prepared for him would actually be of use in this situation.","Inside the white brocade box were four crests—two were Class 2 Creation Master crests, and the other two were Class 2 Creation Master’s retainer crests.","One of the two Class 2 Creation Master crests was the ordinary crest issued by the Creation Master Association. The Moon Empress had given the other Class 2 Creation Master crest with the crescent moon when Lin Yuan became her disciple.","The two other retainer crests with the shield also had the crescent moon. However, Lin Yuan had never told Liu Jie that he was the Moon Empress’ disciple, as well as the Radiant Moon Palace’s Young Lord.","Therefore, Lin Yuan had never given this Class 2 Creation Master’s retainer crest with the crescent moon to Liu Jie. Liu Jie was still wearing the retainer crest that Lin Yuan had given back in the Xia Region.","When Lin Yuan visited the Indigo Azure Sea Market, he didn’t wear the Class 2 Creation Master crest, so there were four crests inside the white brocade box.","Seeing the Spirit Guard Envoys’ looks, Lin Yuan quickly bowed again. As Lin Yuan bowed, the Spirit Guard Envoys felt their mouths involuntarily twitching.","They would never have expected to encounter the Moon Empress’ disciple when they were in preparation to oversee Indigo Azure City for the active period of the dimensional rifts. Furthermore, the Moon Empress’ disciple was actually bowing to them. If this news made it out...","When thinking until this point, the two emperor-class Spirit Guard Envoys’ eyelids were constantly twitching.","Due to both the twitches in both the eyelids, their eyes were obviously turning dry.","Lin Yuan said softly, “Lord Guard Envoys, this junior has been obstructed and was nearly killed here. It just so happens that this junior has some life-saving methods.","“This junior is truly ashamed to disturb the Lord Guard Envoys for this private matter.”","As soon as Lin Yuan finished his statement, the two Spirit Guard Envoys only wished they could leave this place as soon as possible.","These two Spirit Guard Envoys who could calmly face the dimensional lifeforms truly didn’t wish to hear this youth calling them lord and calling himself a junior.","Lord? Who? You are the lord, okay!? If you call yourself junior, wouldn’t we be equally ranked with the Moon Empress? Our lives are going to end prematurely!","But after hearing that Lin Yuan was attacked, the Spirit Guard Envoys’ eyes turned into sharp swords. Their eyes shot toward the Cold Snow Pine that was still struggling to survive and the contractor, Jiao Hanzhong.","Earlier on, they had heard the Indigo Azure Guard Captain mentioning that this Jiao Hanzhong was an emperor-class expert of the Zheng family.","Is the Zheng family tired of living? How dare they attack the disciple of the Moon Empress!? THIS IS THE DISCIPLE OF THE MOON EMPRESS!","Jiao Hanzhong felt a little strange at the sword-like glares from the two Guard Envoys.","Could it be that the two Guard Envoys have exposed my lie just like that? Impossible! Or did they hear the accidental fart I made earlier when I commanded the Cold Snow Pine to resist the World Cleansing? An elderly man doesn’t have a good stomach, but I am already very careful.","The younger Guard Envoy said, “Lor—”","Before he could finish the word ‘lord’, the younger Guard Envoy recalled how the Moon Empress’ disciple handed over the brocade box instead of revealing the crests in an open manner to show his identity.","It meant that the Moon Empress’ disciple didn’t wish for his identity to be exposed apart to the two of them.","Therefore, the younger Guard Envoy paused for a moment before saying, “Do you require any help from the two of us?”","When the younger Guard Envoy spoke, apart from Lin Yuan and the other Guard Envoy, everyone here was stunned. Including Listen, Liu Jie, the Mother of Bloodbath, and Endless Summer.","The Mother of Bloodbath took a glance at Lin Yuan and quickly let out a smile.","For such a change of events to happen, there was only one possibility. It meant that Lin Yuan had used a kind of strength he had never used before. It was the strength of his identity!","The Mother of Bloodbath always felt that Lin Yuan was rather inflexible. But from the looks of it now, Lin Yuan was just like a vein who insisted on his own path of life.","The Mother of Bloodbath looked at Lin Yuan with eyes of approval.","Lin Yuan is really an exceptional child. He can easily get 100 points!","But the Mother of Bloodbath thought for a moment. It is a pity that Lin Yuan doesn’t know how to cook. Minus 150 points. He can only have -50 points."]},{"number":469,"title":"Chapter 469: Surplus of Spirit Qi Crystals","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan responded with a cupped fist while the two Guard Envoys’ mouths and eyes were twitching violently. “Many thanks to the two seniors. This junior can handle the matters here.","“I hope that the two seniors can help this junior to keep a secret of what you saw today.”","While speaking, the pinnacle Suzerain/Myth I Cold Snow Pine was already at the final juncture of the World Cleansing. The goose feather-like snow was already at the final wave too.","The senior Guard Envoy watched the heavy snowfall and said, “Don’t worry, the snow can make the world purer and can also conceal a lot of secrets.”","Upon hearing that, Lin Yuan smiled faintly. “The two seniors don’t have to fret. The ones to conceal the secret are never the snow, but the humans.”","While speaking, Lin Yuan looked at the Indigo Azure Guard Captain. The latter immediately bowed with a cupped fist in return to Lin Yuan while having a stunned expression.","The two Guard Envoys let out a hearty peal of laughter and said, “The active period of the dimensional rifts will happen in less than two days. It is best not to stay on the sea. Several Class 5 Scholars predicted that this year’s dimensional rift wave is said to be the strongest among the ten dimensional rift waves that happened in the recent century.”","After speaking, the senior Guard Envoy shook his hand and summoned a silkworm-like fey. The silkworm fey wriggled in the air and climbed up as though it treated the air like a tree. It then quickly spun a massive amount of threads while chewing out a door-like shape in the spatial zone.","The glistening threads then weaved a crooked door handle on the door. The senior Guard Envoy then opened the spatial door before calling out to the Indigo Azure Guard Captain and nodding to Lin Yuan before leaving.","Duan He, who was originally having a conversation with the Indigo Azure Guard Captain, had slowly regained his senses but was now in an astonished state again.","What is happening to this world? I do not have any insomnia, and I always have quality sleep that doesn’t have dreams, nor do I snore. Why am I having such a twisted and ridiculous dream this time?","After Duan He regained his senses again, he was repeatedly looking and sizing up Lin Yuan.","Subsequently, he looked at Jiao Hanzhong, who had just commanded the Cold Snow Pine to endure the World Cleansing. However, Jiao Hanzhong felt as though he had grown older by ten years and had this look of despair.","While Duan He looked at Jiao Hanzhong, he felt an itch on his gums. Jiao Hanzhong, this old man is really evil! He looked for me to help the Cold Snow Pine so that it can successfully endure the World Cleansing and upgrade into Myth II.","He nearly dragged me into the drain! Had I not been cautious and always refrain from getting involved with conflicts between factions, wouldn’t I have the same outcome as Jiao Hanzhong?","While thinking until here, Duan He sneaked a glance at the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer.","He pursed his lips secretly and thought to himself, They look so beautiful but are so ruthless. Women are truly pork trotters!","Shortly after, Duan He realized that when he looked at that woman wearing the pink-purple palace dress, she also looked at him and even winked at him, revealing a benevolent and gentle expression.","When seeing this scene, Duan He involuntarily recalled his birth mother, who had remarried when he was 8 years old and had never seen her again.","The goose feather snow had stopped, but the black hole in the sky had yet to vanish.","Jiao Hanzhong might have an ash-white expression of despair, but the Cold Snow Pine in his hands had already broken through the bottleneck of Myth I and upgraded to Myth II.","Due to the fact that it had just endured the World Cleansing, all of the energy within its body had already been wiped out. It would need to absorb the World Grace that would descend later in order to stabilize its new upgrade.","During the World Cleansing, the Cold Snow Pine’s leaves and branches had all fallen due to the burning ice. The newly grown branches and leaves gave off a chilling cold aura as compared to before.","Now that it had just stepped into Myth II, the Cold Snow Pine’s body was burning with ice flames. The azure, white flames were an ice flame effect when the extremely cold pine needles made contact with air. It made the Cold Snow Pine look like a pot of burning tree.","When a plant-type fey became Myth II, it might not be able to transform to its human form like animal-type feys, but just like Endless Summer before, it could form a human image in the original body’s vicinity.","The Cold Snow Pine immediately flew out of Jiao Hanzhong’s hand and welcomed the World Grace that was about to descend from the black hole in the sky.","But just at that moment, Endless Summer grabbed the Cold Snow Pine when it was about to fly upwards.","While Endless Summer extended her hands, the pink-purple flower bracelet that was originally in the Body Weaponization state formed a prison with flower petals.","Because of the prison, the Cold Snow Pine couldn’t absorb the World Grace, so it was still unable to form the image outside of its body.","Lin Yuan made use of this opportunity to use Morbius’ exclusive skill, Pure Land of Bliss.","In an instant, the barren island appeared with a patch of pure white sand.","When the World Grace fell onto the Pure Land of Bliss, it was immediately absorbed by the white sand.","At that moment, the limestone bowl inside the Spirit Lock spatial zone was constantly producing spirit qi crystals.","Due to the excessive number of spirit qi crystals being produced, it soon overflowed out of the bowl and started to drop on the ground with clinking sounds.","There were even a few spirit qi crystals that rolled to the side of the spirit pool.","When the carcinoma fey, Sea Burial Lotus Flower, sensed the massive and pure spirit qi from the spirit qi crystals, it instinctively produced the Bone Lotus Flowers in an attempt to grab the spirit qi crystals.","At that moment, the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope, the Spirit Lock spatial zone’s housekeeper, used its strength as a Gold fey to produce a violent storm of wind to stir up the Bone Lotus Flowers.","It then grumbled and complained as it collected the spirit qi crystals that dropped on the ground before stacking them tidily beside the limestone bowl.","Seeing the situation, Lin Yuan couldn’t help giving the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope a thumbs up.","At the same time, Lin Yuan was thinking that he should give the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope some reward for being so sensible and diligent.","To the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope, the best reward was to find a spirit qi professional with a Willpower Rune, allowing it to upgrade into a Fantasy Breed.","However, the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope was no longer a Bronze fey. Therefore, its potential was limited.","Lin Yuan felt that the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope was just like a daughter in his family that was waiting to get married. However, this sensible and diligent daughter was already a ‘Leftover Queen’ that couldn’t be married out.","For this daughter that couldn’t be married, Lin Yuan could only nurture it like a wild fey and make it so that it would become an existence that no one could marry even if they wanted to.","While the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope was fulfilling its duties in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, it didn’t know that Lin Yuan was already preparing great rewards for it. However, these rewards were tossed so high and had yet to drop down.","It was at this moment, the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope’s job as the housekeeper of the Spirit Lock spatial zone had become an ‘iron bowl'[1] job.","[1] A job that will never be terminated"]},{"number":470,"title":"Chapter 470: The Possibility of the Mother of Bloodbath Becoming A Creation Breed","paragraphs":["Suddenly, Lin Yuan felt the enveloping grace of the Pure Land of Bliss. Intense disgust rose within him.","It felt wrong, like a child in the arms of the wrong mother.","After the Pure Land of Bliss completed the Cold Snow Pine’s World Cleansing, it absorbed about 10% of World Grace.","However, Lin Yuan immediately sensed that the Cold Snow Pine was unable to absorb the grace provided for it.","Lin Yuan was now unsure if they were dealing with the entirety of World Grace.","Morbius could only absorb a maximum of about 10%.","If it was true, then Morbius’s Pure Land of Bliss would be able to achieve the absorption of World Grace.","It would be ten times the absorption rate of other feys who were trying to obtain World Grace.","The Cold Snow Pine was left with 90% of World Grace. Naturally, Lin Yuan would do all that it took to make it his.","Lin Yuan shot a look at Endless Summer.","Endless Summer ripped apart the prison of petals that was keeping the Cold Snow Pine confined.","Unfortunately, the Cold Snow Pine’s mind had been frozen by Endless Summer’s Enlightenment Law Rune.","It entered the Cold Snow Pine’s body along with the remaining 90% of World Grace.","Just as the Cold Snow Pine was about to morph into human form, a light purple spear from Endless Summer’s Shooting Spears of Summer appeared in Endless Summer’s hand.","This time, the spear seemed much sharper than the ones it had used before.","Endless Summer punctured the Cold Snow Pine through its branches with the spear, and its tree core was gouged out with one swift motion.","A few more strikes followed, allowing Endless Summer to dig out the Law Crystal hidden at the top of the Cold Snow Pine’s bows.","Endless Summer fiddled with the Cold Snow Pine’s Law Crystal. A gentle smile spread across its face as it addressed Lin Yuan. “The Cold Snow Pine’s Law Crystal is unorthodox and not one of the pure ice-type laws. It’s a complete Myth II Law Crystal, nonetheless.”","Lin Yuan gave a thumbs up.","He was thoroughly impressed by Endless Summer and Mother of Bloodbath.","Endless Summer’s Enlightenment Law Rune had the ability to freeze minds. Any fey below Endless Summer’s grade would become its soldier after it extended its control over them.","After the death of the fey, the Law Rune would crystallize into a complete Law Crystal.","The memory of the Mother of Bloodbath splitting itself into crows was still etched in Lin Yuan’s mind.","Lin Yuan almost wanted to change the Mother of Bloodbath’s name to Mother of Chefs.","She had absolutely perfected the technique.","The Mother of Bloodbath whispered to Lin Yuan, “Should I take care of that old man?”","Lin Yuan nodded without hesitation.","A scarlet light flashed. The Zheng family’s third lineage’s emperor-class expert, Jian Hanzhong, came into view.","The smell of a fresh ocean breeze wafted into Lin Yuan’s nose, and the trauma of being hunted by Cheng Wu dissipated.","When Cheng Wu had been hunting him, Lin Yuan had had no means of defending himself. Despite his best efforts, he had been merely Cheng Wu’s plaything.","That had been the moment when Lin Yuan had become aware of the importance of power.","If he was hunted down by a strong expert again today, he would still lack power. Fortunately, he could rely on the might of Sky City, which he helped build from the ground up.","He would not be a sitting duck even when facing off against two emperor-class experts.","He could now fight back.","Nightmare VI’s appearance made Lin Yuan aware that his pool of enemies was wider than just the Zheng family’s third lineage.","It also included the Zheng family’s main family.","One must remain steadfast in the face of tribulations and magnanimous when the winds were favorable.","Nonetheless, whether it was to the Zheng family’s third lineage or main branch, Lin Yuan only had one thing to say—every problem has a solution!","Lin Yuan thought about the recent clashes against emperor-class experts. The Suzerain/Myth II crow, Jian Hanzhong, and Nightmare VI all seemed to be after me. Yet in the end, they all became my faithful messengers. Fate is hard, truly hard, to come by! How generous!","The Mother of Bloodbath returned to Lin Yuan’s side and handed a Diamond fey storage box.","“Here you go, this came from the old guy,” said the Mother of Bloodbath.","Lin Yuan did not immediately take the Diamond fey storage box.","Instead, he looked at the Mother of Bloodbath’s previously injured deformed leg.","As a Myth Breed, the Mother of Bloodbath possessed exceptional healing capabilities.","Now, as it stood next to Lin Yuan in human form, its leg already looked good as new.","Lin Yuan knew that the Mother of Bloodbath had sustained a blow from the more powerful Nightmare VI in order to exhibit Blood Control.","It must have been grievously injured.","When Lin Yuan had bought the Heaven and Earth Fey Blood Brew Grapevine, he had already figured out a way to cultivate the Blood Brew Grapevine.","The Blood Brew Grapevine needed fresh blood to grow Blood Brew Grapes, and Lin Yuan’s Red Thorn was the same.","Other than being able to use its Mouth of Relinquish to absorb blood, Red Thorn could also store excess blood.","The excess blood was stored in the Eye of Relinquish that grew on the Mouth of Relinquish.","In other words, the purest essence lay in the Eye of Relinquish.","Lin Yuan started pondering. Can I use Red Thorn to cultivate the Blood Brew Grapevine? If so, it’ll be a piece of cake to grow the Blood Brew Grapes.","The Mother of Bloodbath had the exclusive skills Blood Embrace and Desire Spider Form.","Everything was ready to promote it to Myth III soon.","With Endless Summer’s help, it was highly possible for the Mother of Bloodbath to successfully undergo the Myth III World Cleansing.","At Myth III, Mother of Bloodbath would be able to activate Body Weaponization.","After witnessing the power of Endless Summer’s Body Weaponization and subsequent Spirit Return, Lin Yuan came to understand the power discrepancy between Myth II and Myth III feys.","If the Mother of Bloodbath could elevate itself to Myth III, Lin Yuan could tap into a higher level of fighting abilities.","Lin Yuan started thinking. The Mother of Bloodbath mentioned the Creation Breed, which is one league above Myth Breed. I know nothing about them. But if I can use Red Thorn to produce Eyes of Relinquish and cultivate the Blood Brew Grapevine, I will be able to nurture the Mother of Bloodbath. It could push it to the Creation Breed quality quickly. This seems feasible!"]},{"number":471,"title":"Chapter 471: Mother Spider’s Sixth Sense?","paragraphs":["The Mother of Bloodbath noticed Lin Yuan eyeing its injury. Its emotionless countenance was replaced with a warm smile.","The Mother of Bloodbath placed Jian Hanzhong’s Diamond fey storage box in Lin Yuan’s hand and said, “Nightmare VI isn’t dead yet. Its mind is just in pieces because of Sister Summer’s attack.”","Lin Yuan looked suspicious. The Mother of Bloodbath explained, “You can take Nightmare VI’s current condition to be similar to that of a vegetative state in human terms.”","The Mother of Bloodbath started to gesture as it continued. “I’m going to help Sister Summer with the Cold Snow Pine. The Cold Snow Pine’s pine needles are rather valuable. I’ll dissect the Nightmare VI later when I’ve regained my maximum power.”","The Mother of Bloodbath saw that Lin Yuan’s expression had shifted.","Lin Yuan had placed half his attention on the Ethereal Jellyfish and sensed it digging continuously on the ocean floor.","At that moment, he sensed that the Ethereal Jellyfish had already dug out all the Spatial Magnets in the ocean floor.","When added to the 100 pieces he already owned, the Ethereal Jellyfish had managed to dig up 500 Spatial Magnets.","However, what caused Lin Yuan to frown was not the large quantity of Spatial Magnets.","It was because there was something hidden behind the Spatial Magnets’ magnetic field.","There was another more complex hidden technique underneath it.","Compared to the more complex hidden technique, the 500 Spatial Magnets were peanuts.","The Mother of Bloodbath saw Lin Yuan’s tightly drawn together brows and asked, “Is something wrong?”","Lin Yuan relaxed his brows and responded, “I tasked the Ethereal Jellyfish with searching for Spatial Magnets in the ocean floor. It dug up a total of 500 pieces. However, below the Spatial Magnets lies an enormous net made of Floating Silver Strands. ”","The Mother of Bloodbath fell silent.","Who would go through the immense trouble of setting up such a project in the coastal sea so close to Indigo Azure City?","Floating Silver could definitely count as one of the extremely valuable spiritual materials. It had spatial characteristics, which were rare in metal spiritual ingredients.","Whoever had put the Floating Silver Strands in place had to have done so very early on.","At the very least, it had to be done before the carcinoma fey, Sea Burial Lotus Flower, appeared.","Otherwise, whoever had set up the Spatial Magnets and Floating Silver would have captured something as precious as the Sea Burial Lotus Flower.","Lin Yuan analyzed the chain of events.","If we didn’t come to the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s coastal sea to investigate, we would not have stumbled upon the Sea Burial Lotus Flower. I would not have dove underwater and coincidentally experienced the unusual spatial tremors when the water world dimensional lifeform was spat out. It was after the unusual spatial tremors that I released the Ethereal Jellyfish to investigate. Soon after, the Ethereal Jellyfish found the first Spatial Magnet and discovered the complex hidden techniques below.","The Mother of Bloodbath was quiet for a while before speaking. “Floating Silver can perfectly divide spatial tremors, giving it countless applications. Who knows what lies under the net of Floating Silver Strands. Although we are only two days away from the dimensional rift, I think we should tear it down. With me and Sister Summer around, despite the dimensional rift, the losses will be minimized.”","The Mother of Bloodbath kept a thought to itself.","The Radiance Federation did not produce the 500 Spatial Magnets. The fact that their origins are unknown is cause for concern. If not looked into thoroughly, there could be untold dangers.","The Mother of Bloodbath had a feeling that a prodigious secret was being kept underneath the net of Floating Silver Strands.","It shook its head, forcing the thought out of its mind.","As a Suzerain/Myth II fey, it was accustomed to using strength to establish the pecking order.","When did it start to become disillusioned by the Mother Spider’s sixth sense?","The space beside Lin Yuan’s started to distort vigorously. The Ethereal Jellyfish’s silhouette started to glow bright red.","The Ethereal Jellyfish’s silhouette solidified and landed expertly on Lin Yuan’s neck.","It extended two strong feelers, waving them around.","The Mother of Bloodbath could not help but giggle at the sight.","The bright red Ethereal Jellyfish was hanging off Lin Yuan’s neck, with its two feelers dangling and twirling.","It looked like two braids were protruding from Lin Yuan’s head, dancing in the wind.","The braid was red, which used to be Endless Summer’s favorite.","Lin Yuan hastily plucked the Ethereal Jellyfish from his neck.","Lin Yuan was already made aware of the conundrum the Ethereal Jellyfish had encountered when it tried to clear the Floating Silver Strands.","Due to the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s casual extraction of the energy from the ocean floor, the structure of the seafloor had undergone foundational changes.","As a result, a large volume of Floating Silver Strands was stuck in the rock crevices in the seafloor.","It could not pull out the Floating Silver Strands from the rock crevices even when using its two strong feelers.","The Ethereal Jellyfish would need help in order to clean out the Floating Silver Strands from the ocean floor.","Zhou Luo’s contracted fey, Lava Dragon Lizard, would be the most suitable.","Lin Yuan instructed Zhou Luo, who was standing next to him.","Zhou Luo ordered the Lava Dragon Lizard to go underwater and randomly stomp around on the ocean floor, damaging the rocks which were holding the Floating Silver Strands down.","This greatly expedited the rate at which the Ethereal Jellyfish collected the Floating Silver Strands.","According to Lin Yuan’s calculations, after the dimensional rift in two days, the collection of the Floating Silver Strands should have been completed.","It was then that they would find out what unsavory secrets lay under the complicated web.","The Ethereal Jellyfish needed constant assistance with the Floating Silver Strands. Moreover, the newly Suzerain/Myth II Snow Pine Chill and Nightmare VI, which was already at the peak of Suzerain/Myth II, had not been taken care of. The most optimal option was to stay on the island for two days.","Lin Yuan would be able to use the two days to rest.","Only after nurturing his sister into an iron bucket would the Vajra Butterfly and Obsidian Iron Wild Bull be able to establish a perfect connection.","He was going to start tempering the fairy source-type item Burning Sunflower he had traded."]},{"number":472,"title":"Chapter 472: I Miss Him","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","South of Flame City, at the Scorching Volcano District...","Even in winter, the temperatures never dipped below 40 degrees here.","Temperatures could climb up to about 50 degrees in the summer.","It was comparable to the temperatures in the Class-2 abyss dimensional rift.","The difference was that the number of plants in Flame City’s Scorching Volcano District trumped that of the Class-2 abyss dimensional rift manifold.","Numerous plants that thrived in hot weather took root here.","A large number of plant feys leeched spirit qi from the constant flow out of the magma.","Thus, the spirit qi in the area was much thicker than in other places.","This resulted in many wood-type plant feys, which originated from other areas, evolving into wood-type and fire-type after spending time in the Scorching Volcano.","These wood-type and fire-type plant feys became Flame City’s specialties.","A young girl wearing a Redbud Intermediate Spirit Qi Academy uniform stood next to a massive sienna-colored rock.","She was commandeering an all-black, metal-lined wild bull that was charging amongst a group of Silver Fire-Spotted Wolves.","The Fire-Spotted Wolves were covered with brown fur that was messier and sparser than other wolf-type feys.","After all, a thick coat of fur was disadvantageous to feys who lived in such a high-temperature environment.","Flecks of red were dotted all over the brown fur, and they emanated fire energy.","Suddenly, a Fire-Spotted Wolf larger than the rest howled.","Other than the Fire-Spotted Wolf, which had its head smashed in by the black rampaging bull, the red spots on the rest of the Fire-Spotted Wolves lit up simultaneously.","The scarlet flames jetted out of the Fire-Spotted Wolves’ jaws toward the wild black bull.","The young girl dressed in the Redbud Intermediate Spirit Qi Academy uniform was Chu Ci.","When she saw the flames closing in on the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull, her eyes lit up, and she exclaimed, “Obsidian Iron Wild Bull, use Pain Buffer.”","The Obsidian Iron Wild Bull’s originally black body radiated a gem-like luminescence—the legendary rainbow black color.","The Fire-Spotted Wolves’ flames descended upon the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull but failed to burn it. Instead, it seemed to be subsumed by the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull’s glowing skin.","The Fire-Spotted Wolves’ attack caused the ground around the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull to sizzle.","However, the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull appeared totally unaffected.","Flames wrapped around the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull as it charged toward the Fire-Spotted Wolves, whose red spots had dulled.","The Fire Spotted Wolves flew into a state of panic, having not expected their attack to fail.","Faced with the fire-covered Obsidian Iron Wild Bull, the Fire-Spotted Wolves knew they were in trouble.","The head of the pack bolted off in fright, despite the injury to its hind legs.","The ferocious Obsidian Iron Wild Bull suddenly let out a pained roar.","After the gem-like luminescence around the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull disappeared, the flames quickly started to consume its body.","When the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull was being burned, dots of green lights full of vitality appeared all over its body.","Chu Ci, who was standing off to the side, scrunched her face with worry and heartache.","The Vajra Butterfly that was on Chu Ci’s shoulder fluttered its wings.","At that moment, a pair of white marble-like hands patted Chu Ci’s shoulders.","A frost-covered woman carrying an air of immortality gently spoke to Chu Ci. “Don’t worry. The ability Pain Buffer, which your Bronze/Fantasy Breed Obsidian Iron Wild Bull advanced to Silver, is equipped with Pain Absorption. It is more than capable of taking this amount of damage. Besides, because it often feeds on metal spiritual ingredients, it allowed it to build its tolerance against flames like this and increased its body’s durability.”","Chu Ci’s worries seemed to be significantly alleviated. However, the same could not be said about the heartache she felt.","“The Obsidian Iron Wild Bull has already reached Silver/Fantasy I. I think my fighting abilities have improved considerably and will not be increasing anytime soon. It’s about time for us to go back,” said Chu Ci.","Cold Moon looked at Chu Ci in admiration.","In the beginning, she had only come to Redbud City because of the Moon Empress’ order.","Cold Moon had long become resigned to the fact that Lin Yuan was Moon Empress’s disciple.","Chu Ci was only riding on Lin Yuan’s coattails.","However, after spending time with her, Cold Moon had realized that the ostensibly docile girl was actually extremely determined.","When she made her mind up about something, she was willing to put in more effort than anyone else in order to see it through.","She possessed a resilience well beyond her age of 15 years.","Cold Moon initially intended to take Chu Ci out on a training excursion during the holidays.","However, Cold Moon realized that when she trained Chu Ci, she was merely performing the responsibility of a guardian.","Chu Ci took care of every other aspect, even wilderness survival. She would even prepare Cold Moon’s share.","Cold Moon thought back to when she had first glimpsed Lin Yuan’s information, which included a section on Chu Ci.","The siblings support each other and remain steadfast despite the trials they undergo. It’s heartbreaking to watch them.","Cold Moon reached out her arm and gently pressed down the two stray hairs on Chu Ci’s head as she asked, “Do you miss your brother?”","Chu Ci answered honestly, “It’s been four months since I last saw Lin Yuan. I miss him.”","Cold Moon felt a pang in her heart. She could feel the deep sibling bond in Chu Ci’s words. It was sincere and warm."]},{"number":473,"title":"Chapter 473: Chu Ci’s Master","paragraphs":["The fire enveloping the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull had nearly dissipated.","Although the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull had managed to sustain the damage, its entire body had been charred black. It was clearly severely injured.","The Obsidian Iron Wild Bull snorted and stood its ground. It watched as the Fire-Spotted Wolves in the distance changed to a crimson red color.","A strong wave of energy shot out of the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull’s eyes toward the Fire-Spotted Wolves.","The fleeing Fire-Spotted Wolves’ heads exploded, and they collapsed on the ground, dead.","Cold Moon gasped in awe.","“The Obsidian Iron Wild Bull might only be Silver/Fantasy I, but after it takes enough damage, its exclusive skill Annihilation Gaze will be able to attain power comparable to a Gold/Fantasy Breed.","“Amazing!”","If there was someone around who recognized Cold Moon, their jaws would drop for sure.","Cold Moon was infamous for her arrogance. She even had the courage to speak her mind in front of the Moon Empress.","Obviously, Cold Moon greatly admired the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull.","Cold Moon could not help but be curious.","Where did Lin Yuan find such a treasure for his sister? It’s so sturdy and strong. It’s capable of handling a lot of hits and possesses impressive defensive abilities. Its abilities will exponentially boost Chu Ci’s power once it improves its strength. All the Fantasy Breed feys counteract each other in terms of their differing talent, bloodline, abilities, and exclusive characteristics. This results in larger differences in their power. There are very few feys amongst Fantasy Breeds that can distinguish themselves.","The Obsidian Iron Wild Bull’s exclusive skill, Pain Absorption, strengthened its other exclusive skill, Annihilation Gaze. The ability Pain Buffer, which the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull learned during Silver grade, requires it to get hurt.","However, during the time when the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull starts to buffer the damage, it can use the pain to strengthen itself.","When paired with Iron Horn, it combines the damage that the Obsidian Wild Bull is about to receive with its innate attacking power and focuses it on its target.","The Obsidian Iron Wild Bull does not seem like a regular defense-type fey. Although Pain Buffer is definitely a defensive ability, it turns into a whole new beast when utilized by the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull. Especially when directed by Chu Ci, its power becomes out of this world!","Cold Moon’s praise elicited a wide beam from Chu Ci, who said, “Lin Yuan is the one who gave me the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull.”","Cold Moon could feel Chu Ci’s pride and joy from her words.","“Since we’re here at the Scorching Volcano District, why don’t I mine some Shining Ores for your Obsidian Iron Wild Bull? It might help the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull promote its grade,” said Cold Moon.","She went on to explain, “Shining Ores only have efficacy when freshly mined from the Scorching Volcano. Once it cools, it turns into an ordinary ore and loses the ability to promote the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull’s grade. It takes about two days to mine Shining Ore and promote the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull’s grade. We can go back after two days.”","Chu Ci knew that this opportunity was rare. If they did not mine the Shining Ores now, they would need to return at a later date if they ever wanted to do so.","However, Chu Ci also had her doubts.","Using spiritual ingredients to improve a Fantasy Breed fey’s grade required the help of a Creation Master.","It was because the elevation of Fantasy Breed feys’ grade also needed pure spirit qi, which only a Creation Master could produce.","Could Cold Moon also be a Creation Master?","Cold Moon noted the conflict and quizzical expression on Chu Ci’s face. Her frost-covered face split into a gentle smile.","Cold Moon usually could not be bothered to give others the time of day, but she was exceptionally patient with Chu Ci.","“Yes, I’m a Creation Master. Why don’t you become my disciple?”","A blush bloomed across Cold Moon’s cheeks.","Her face tensed as her expression grew cold.","Cold Moon was slightly embarrassed. Why did she spill her honest thoughts all of a sudden?","As someone who was not adept at expressing herself, she felt as anxious as someone with acrophobia that had just sat through a three-day cable car ride.","Cold Moon did not expect herself to become so nervous after blurting her true feelings.","Chu Ci smiled warmly as she took on an oddly serious demeanor and said, “Greetings, Master.”","Cold Moon was instantly stunned!","Not once had she revealed her identity to Chu Ci, nor had she demonstrated her power as a pinnacle Class 4 Creation Master.","Although she did use her powers once in front of Chu Ci, she merely exhibited Platinum-level power to scare off the cheetahs from the field of fire.","Yet, Chu Ci agreed to become her disciple without hesitation.","Cold Moon was surprised and touched. She suddenly realized why the Moon Empress had taken Lin Yuan as her disciple.","She instantly felt like a different person. The urge to cook rose within her.","At that moment, Cold Moon was even willing to hand-make the pot.","Cold Moon solemnly but gently asked Chu Ci, “Why?”","Chu Ci’s eyes shone.","“Because you’re the only person in this world besides my brother, who I regard as family.”","Cold Moon hung her head and was silent for a while.","When Cold Moon lifted her head, her eyes shone with the same brightness that was in Chu Ci’s eyes.","When they arrived at the Scorching Volcano’s entrance, Cold Moon waved.","Moments later, along with the flowing magma and intense heat, a layer of chilling frost covered the entire Scorching Volcano District.","Then a 100-meter-long enormous dragon emerged from the sky.","The gigantic dragon did not roar. But its silence carried the majesty and ferocity unique to dragon-species feys.","Cold Moon instructed the dragon, “Icy King Dragon, you stay here and protect my precious disciple.”","The Icy King Dragon was visibly stunned for a second before it transformed into a young man wearing a light blue robe.","The young man had breathtaking features. His eyes resembled that of Cold Moon’s.","Cold Moon leaped into the air and flew toward the Scorching Volcano’s entrance.","Cold Moon suddenly realized something.","Now that both the Moon Empress and myself have disciples, isn’t Mystic Moon the only one left without one? I’ll have to share with her how wonderful it feels to have a precious disciple when I return."]},{"number":474,"title":"Chapter 474: Specialty Suona","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan, who was on the deserted island, felt the weight of the two small crystals resting in the center of his palm. A wave of distress washed over him.","It would be a waste if I did not make use of such a treasure.","Lin Yuan held up one of the crystals.","Flickers of azure swam inside blinding ivory, while flames of ice seemed to jump within the crystal.","The crystal’s interior seemed to coalesce and dissipate continuously. Despite the enthusiastic leaping of the icy flames, it emanated a strange frigidness.","Two subtle streaks of gold revealed the identity of the crystal.","While the Mother of Bloodbath was busy handling the Cold Snow Pine, Endless Summer listlessly plucked pine needles nearby. It spotted Lin Yuan staring at the Icy Flames Law Crystal with a troubled brooding look.","Endless Summer could not help but say, “Lin Yuan, the Icy Flames Law Crystal might have laws, but it’s only an unorthodox ice-type law. Yet, it contains a wisp of fire. It’s the best plaything of fire- and ice-type Myth Breed feys.”","Endless Summer whistled in approval.","It had mastered Enlightenment Law, so whether it was the Cold Snow Pine’s Icy Flames Law Crystal or the Dead Dream Law Crystal, they were all useless.","Nonetheless, it could use the power of its own Law Crystal to commence melding and absorption to bolster its Enlightenment Law.","Although the discrepancy between Myth Breeds and Creation Breeds seemed similar to that between Fantasy Breeds and Myth Breeds, they were actually leagues asunder.","The distance between Myth Breeds and Creation Breeds was much further.","A Fantasy Breed would be close to death during their World Cleansing to become a Myth Breed.","Many seemingly all-powerful feys were reduced to ash during their struggle to rise from Fantasy V to Myth Breed.","Fantasy Breed feys could seek aid from others during their World Cleansing to increase their chances of surviving the process.","Unfortunately, when Myth Breed feys tried to elevate to Creation Breed feys, they needed to continuously strengthen their Law Runes.","Their Law Runes needed to be strong enough to create a genuine world of law using only the power of law.","Ergo, it was 100 times more dangerous for Myth Breeds as they had to go through the Trial of World Creation rather than World Cleansing.","The accumulation of the power of law required an unspeakable amount of power and training and usually took Myth III feys years to accomplish.","Class 5 Creation Masters’ most enviable asset was their ability to activate a portion of the power of law from Law Crystals. This granted them the ability to make adjustments so that any Law Runes could absorb the pure law energy.","Despite this ability, they mostly used it to elevate the power of their contracted feys and source-type lifeforms.","Why would they bless someone else with something so precious?","The Mother of Bloodbath was swiftly tearing away the Cold Snow Pine’s bark.","It also took out a crystal bottle and squeezed out the essence of the Cold Snow Pine’s branches.","When it heard Endless Summer speak, the Mother of Bloodbath raised its head and said to Lin Yuan, “The Cold Snow Pine’s Law Crystal might not be particularly impressive, but its tree sap is valuable. If you still have the fire heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, their pure fire energy can be used to roast the Cold Snow Pine’s tree sap. The tree sap will turn into rosin. But only the fire heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls can be used. If the fire energy isn’t pure enough, the tree sap will turn into incense instead. The Cold Snow Pine’s rosin has warming properties that can heal injured souls. Its incense will only be able to replenish energy.”","The Mother of Bloodbath spoke with a strange seriousness. It valued the Cold Snow Pine’s tree sap much more than its Law Crystal.","Lin Yuan was momentarily dazed. He did not expect Cold Snow Pine’s rosin to have such effects.","He had heard from the Moon Empress about items that could heal souls. She had mentioned that they were counted as prized strategic-class resources.","There was an abundance of spiritual ingredients that could restore energy, but few had qualities that could really affect the soul.","Lin Yuan carefully noted down the Mother of Bloodbath’s words.","Nevertheless, even the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls did not possess fire energy as pure as that produced by the Twin Red Pagoda’s Lifeform Sacrificial Fire.","“Would we get a better result if we used Lifeform Sacrificial Fire to calcify the tree sap instead?” Lin Yuan asked.","The Mother of Bloodbath firmly replied, “Of course. If Lifeform Sacrificial Fire is used to burn the tree branches, we’ll be able to preserve most of the properties of the tree sap. We’ll even be able to bring out the immense live-giving qualities of the Cold Snow Pine’s tree sap. Rosin made from the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire will be far stronger than that of the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.”","At the mention of Lifeform Sacrificial Fire, Endless Summer gently placed a hand over its heart.","In order to save it, Lin Yuan had placed the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire inside of it, which had become a tree core inside its body.","Endless Summer had re-absorbed its original tree core, which had been dug out.","Thus, Endless Summer now had two tree cores.","It was both an opportunity of a lifetime and a drastic change to possess two tree cores.","Endless Summer felt that it was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity for Lin Yuan to have even one piece of something as valuable as Lifeform Sacrificial Fire.","Now that Lin Yuan no longer had any Lifeform Sacrificial Fire, Endless Summer felt rather guilty.","Gratefulness surged in the depths of Endless Summer’s heart.","Meanwhile, Lin Yuan was mentally calculating.","It’s best if we can use Lifeform Sacrificial Fire to calcify the Cold Snow Pine. Then I’ll be able to wait until the Spirit Lock spatial zone for the Twin Red Pagoda’s main flower to mature in order to use its Lifeform Sacrificial Fire to calcify the Cold Snow Pine’s tree sap.","Zhou Luo, who was standing nearby directing the Lava Dragon Lizard, heard the exchange between Lin Yuan, the Mother of Bloodbath, and Endless Summer and suddenly felt as though his master was too cruel.","His master and the Mother of Bloodbath talked about wanting to build a disco on this deserted island, but who knew when the plan could come to fruition?","The deserted island’s scenery was beautiful. They could also build a theater along with the disco.","When the time comes, I’ll be able to whip out my specialty suona again."]},{"number":475,"title":"Chapter 475: Glad Wen Yu Did Not Come","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan looked at the Dead Dream Law Crystal in his other hand. It was slightly larger and ashy black in color, with two gold streaks cutting through it.","The Dead Dream Law Crystal looked to be containing a mercurial dream realm. The foggy dream realm carried the strange feeling of joy intermixed with pain.","Lin Yuan’s hand quivered, and he fished out the black Law Crystal he had obtained from the Night Calamity Crow in Endless Forest.","Lin Yuan suddenly came to the realization that he was fated with dark-type feys.","Two of the three Law Crystals in his hands came from dark-type feys.","However, between those two dark-type Law Crystals, the one from the Night Calamity Crow was clearly better than the one from the Dream-Eating Bat.","Whether it was the laws in the crystal or the appearance of the Law Crystal itself, the Night Calamity Crow’s Law Crystal came out a winner.","It was probably due to the fact that Nightmare VI had used its exclusive skill, Dark Night Tribute, causing the originally complete law crystal to break.","However, the Dead Dream Law Crystal was much darker than the black crystal.","As he fiddled with the three Law Crystals, Lin Yuan’s concerns intensified.","Lin Yuan would never trade something like Law Crystals. As such, they would continue staying with Lin Yuan.","However, Lin Yuan was currently unable to use the Law Crystals. Due to the fundamental differences between the laws, not even Endless Summer or the Mother of Bloodbath would be able to absorb these Law Crystals.","There was a sort of sweet dilemma behind it all.","If Lin Yuan’s thoughts were revealed to the members of the veteran factions, they would launch two slaps across his face.","They would then scream at Lin Yuan, “Wake up, you fool! How can this be a sweet dilemma? It should be a sweet delight!”","Liu Jie was standing to the side, feeding a Silver Protein Silkworm Chrysalis to the Insect Queen.","Liu Jie, who only had one contracted fey, made sure to replenish the Insect Queen’s strength after every battle by feeding it source-type lifeforms.","When he was done, Liu Jie looked at the sky and commented, “It’s getting dark. Since we’re going to be on the deserted island these two days, why don’t I head to Indigo Azure City and get the materials to build a temporary campsite? Later, I’ll gather some metal spirit ingredients to make pots so I can cook up some seafood.”","The Mother of Bloodbath’s eyes lit up.","However, it was not the one that voiced out.","When Lin Yuan heard Liu Jie’s suggestion, he fished several quick-building tents out of his button-sized Diamond fey storage box.","These tents had been added as a precaution when Wen Yu was helping Lin Yuan organize the fey storage box.","Lin Yuan had not had the chance to use them up until now.","Finally, they could be of use.","The Mother of Bloodbath saw Lin Yuan take out some fruit from the fey storage box as well.","Its sharp eyes also caught sight of some rations sandwiched between the fruits.","The Mother of Bloodbath hopped to its feet, raised its hand, and exclaimed, “I agree with Liu Jie’s suggestion! Sister Summer will separate the Cold Snow Pine’s component parts into spirit ingredients. I will go check out Indigo Azure City’s fresh produce market with Liu Jie. According to Star Web, grilled soft-bone grouper is especially delicious.”","The Mother of Bloodbath felt that Lin Yuan was practically a monster.","It was a magnificent and battle-worn spider!","How could he expect it to be satisfied with rations and fruits?","It needed to feast on a griddle of seafood!","When Lin Yuan heard the Mother of Bloodbath mention soft-boned grouper, his eyelids immediately started to twitch.","Which fairy on Star Web had said that grilled soft-bone grouper was tasty?","Did they try to use some high-level fire to grill the soft-bone grouper?","Soft-bone groupers were 4 meters in length when they were young.","Mature ones could grow up to 18 meters long.","It would take months to finish eating such a giant fish!","Despite this, Lin Yuan agreed to the idea.","It was because his stomach started to grumble the second that Liu Jie mentioned grilling seafood.","Grilled seafood was Liu Jie’s specialty.","Liu Jie was capable of cooking a wide list of dishes, so he did not grill seafood often.","Lin Yuan suddenly sensed the Mother of Bloodbath looking at him with an accusatory glare.","Lin Yuan was instantly on edge. He glanced at the fruits he had taken out and hastily bent down to store them back in the fey storage box.","The ‘Global Champion of Eating’ Mother of Bloodbath sure got angry easily!","Lin Yuan had only taken out the fruits to use as sauces on the seafood. The bag of rations had just fallen out accidentally.","The corners of Listen’s lips tugged upward, and he struggled to quench his sniggers. He quickly said, “There’s a lot of seafood in Indigo Azure City that’s indigenous to the area. Some of the shrimps and scallops species are very suitable for charcoal grilling. I’m more familiar with the area and can act as a guide. I’ll also pick up the basic rations we’ll need for the next two days.”","After the Mother of Bloodbath, Liu Jie, and Listen departed, Lin Yuan started juicing fruits.","He made sure to juice fruits according to each person’s favorite.","Since he did not know what Zhou Luo fancied, he made extra of each type so Zhou Luo would be able to have his pick.","When he was done, Lin Yuan stored the juices in a crystal bottle and placed it in the cool ocean to maintain their freshness.","As night approached, the Mother of Bloodbath, Endless Summer, Lin Yuan, Listen, and Zhou Luo had filled their stomachs to the brim.","Zhou Luo’s Lava Dragon Lizard had also snagged quite a few pieces of grilled fish.","Liu Jie was a masculine man that had managed to hold off the insect tide in Cold Frost City for half an hour all by himself, but he currently did not even have an ounce of strength.","An idea struck Liu Jie. He was glad that Wen Yu had not come.","Otherwise, they would need to grill at least two more fish, five more crabs, three more sticks of shrimp, another pile of scallops, and who knew how much more squid."]},{"number":476,"title":"Chapter 476: The Invite and the Third Person","paragraphs":["After they filled their stomachs, the group headed into the already set up tents to rest.","Zhou Luo called out the recently contracted Dark Snake Dragon Lizard. He wanted it for companionship as he stood watch, as well as to form a deeper bond with it in the meantime.","The Lava Dragon Lizard continued helping the Ethereal Jellyfish disturb the ocean floor to collect the Floating Silver Strands laying in the depths.","A thunderous yawn soon sounded out from Liu Jie’s tent, signifying his exhaustion.","The Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer went back to tearing off the Cold Snow Pine’s bark.","The Mother of Bloodbath handled spiritual ingredients very professionally.","The job was almost done, and the Mother of Bloodbath had been extremely thorough. It even turned the Cold Snow Pine’s tree bark into hemp thread. It planned to give it to Wen Yu to make something for Lin Yuan.","Listen utilized the downtime to start training the Pain Illusory Fox and the Three-Tailed Crimson Fox. He used the resonance between the clashing of the Pain Illusory Fox and the Three-Tailed Crimson Fox to improve their battle compatibility.","Lin Yuan noticed that the way Listen was training the Pain Illusory Fox, and the Three-Tailed Crimson Fox partially encompassed his own special brand of understanding.","Lin Yuan had enhanced the Silver VII/Fantasy I Pain Illusory Fox, and it was deemed a rather exquisite spirit-type fey.","The Pain Illusory Fox used pain as a medium to control and harm its targets.","It was an intangible means of fighting.","Compared to the Silver VII/Fantasy I Pain Illusory Fox, the Silver III/Fantasy I Three-Tailed Crimson Fox was a step above.","Thanks to the compatibility of their abilities, they were able to form a good partnership.","Although its constantly burning three tails gave the Three-Tailed Crimson Fox the look of a fire-type fey, it was undoubtedly a spirit-type fey.","The fire, which burned atop its tails, could weaken its targets and lower their defensive ability if it made contact. This strengthened the Three-Tailed Crimson Fox’s spiritual abilities, whether it was the damage it dealt or the level of control it could exert.","The Three-Tailed Crimson Fox also possessed a hypnotizing ability.","In solo combat, due to the fact that every spirit qi professional mostly had many feys, attacking power was key in securing victory.","Thus, a fey like the Three-Tailed Crimson Fox, which had controlling abilities, was not particularly helpful in solo combat.","However, when it came to team fights, the Three-Tailed Crimson Fox’s abilities would have great efficacy on the opponent’s main feys.","It was highly likely to be a key player in such fights.","When Listen heard Lin Yuan approaching, he stopped the fight between the Pain Illusory Fox and the Three-Tailed Crimson Fox.","The Three-Tailed Crimson Fox laid down by Listen’s leg and nestled on the ground as its three large tails lightly rested on Listen’s trousers, all in all looking very contented","The Pain Illusory Fox called softly to Listen, who nodded.","The snow-white Pain Illusory Fox darted to Lin Yuan with only a few steps. Its small claws landed on Lin Yuan’s leg, waggling as though it was greeting him before it returned to Listen’s side.","The Pain Illusory Fox clearly still remembered that Lin Yuan had helped it advance its grade and quality.","Listen assumed that Lin Yuan came over to issue an instruction.","“Young Master, does Big Brother Zhou need help?” he asked.","Lin Yuan shook his head and reached out to pat down the stray strands of hair at the back of his head.","“Listen, you’re of age and have enough power now. Do you have any plans to participate in the guild club’s S Tournament?”","Lin Yuan remembered that when Listen had mentioned his Star Web duel record, he had said his Star Tower level was just past level ten.","Given Listen’s power, he should have no problem reaching the Celestial Stairway.","However, Listen had never gone to fight, which could indicate that he did not like competitive fighting.","Even if Listen used a Willpower Rune to swear his undying loyalty to Lin Yuan, the latter would still be unable to force him to join his guild club.","Listen paused for a while. “Me?” he murmured unconsciously.","During his pause, Listen thought back to his childhood.","My elders always focused on preparing me as the sole heir to the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce. My days were filled with lessons on managing the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce and expanding its reach.","My elders might have been willing to part with half of the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s resources so that I could have powerful feys and abilities, but they never allowed me to fight on Star Web. They always thought it was a waste of time that could have been spent on learning how to manage the business.","As time passed, I became used to setting aside the joy I felt when fighting on Star Web. Even after my family died at sea three years ago, I continued working hard to maintain the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce. I didn’t have any time or energy to devote to fighting on Star Web.","However, I’ll admit that sometimes while training my feys, I take the opportunity to improve my own fighting abilities.","I never expected Lin Yuan to ask me to join his guild club...","Of course, I would love to join! I can’t believe he asked!","Ever since I pledged my and the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s loyalty to him, he poured a lot of resources into the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce. But I still haven’t made anything of myself. If Lin Yuan didn’t secretly protect me, I would have lost my life at the Royal Capital.","During this time, I’ve come to realize that he’s a good man who is easy to get along with. Being in his presence is relaxing. However, I’m constantly aware of my position as his subordinate. This said, he must be treating me like a friend rather than a subordinate since he’s willing to invite me.","Listen was touched beyond comprehension and chuckled at Lin Yuan’s question.","“Big Brother Liu and I started a guild club. We plan to join next year’s S Tournament. The name of the guild club is Dome Guild Club. As of now, we’re the two main members of the group. You’ll be the third if you decide to join.”"]},{"number":477,"title":"Chapter 477: Clouded Crane","paragraphs":["After Lin Yuan’s explanation and invitation, Listen bent down to pick up the Pain Illusory Fox and Three-tailed Crimson Fox.","“I’m in. I’ll increase my own power while also furthering the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s success. It will be done in four months,” said Listen.","Lin Yuan reached out his hand toward Listen and said, “Welcome, third member of Dome Guild Club.”","Listen gently placed his hand on the back of Lin Yuan’s as a symbol of their new bond as comrades.","Listen mentally came to a decision.","It looks like I’m about to fight on Star Web.","If Lin Yuan really takes part in next year’s S Tournament, given his and Liu Jie’s ability, they’re sure to obtain a B-level standing for the guild club.","Our Dome Guild Club has Black and the Radiance Hundred Sequence member Liu Jie. They will definitely attract immense attention once the member roster is released. I know I can’t be a Radiance Hundred Sequence member, but if I can reach Celestial Stairway, I won’t be known as the black sheep of the team.","Since I’m going to be a member of the team, I’ll have to make sure I’m irreplaceable. I need to prove myself to be a valuable asset worthy of being in such an amazing team. Otherwise, others will look down upon me, or the Star Web bigshots will magnify my mistakes and laugh at me. I don’t think my ego will ever recover.","When Lin Yuan and Listen were done talking, he returned to his tent.","Instead of hitting the sack, Lin Yuan entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Once he was in, Lin Yuan immediately noticed that the Pure Land of Bliss was filled with many snow-white feathers.","Morbius’ voice rang out in Lin Yuan’s mind. “Lin Yuan, something is wrong with Gray.”","Since Lin Yuan did not reply, Morbius continued speaking. “The Pure Land of Bliss is connected with the version of itself that’s both inside and outside the Spirit Lock Spatial Zone. At that time, the Pure Land of Bliss was outside and absorbing the World Grace. Gray had just recovered the genetic model and woken up. But, it accidentally absorbed some of the World Grace as well. This caused Gray’s genetic model to spike its promotion state.”","Morbius’ revelation delighted Lin Yuan.","Gray had been on the cusp of death, but now its genetic model was better than ever.","Who could have expected Gray to be granted such a prized opportunity for success?","It was an extremely rare chance for one’s genetic model to be promoted. It mostly only occurred to young feys.","It preserved the fey’s original genetic data while optimizing the genetic model, similar to the relationship between the Blue Flash Butterfly and the Blue Flash Purple Butterfly.","While the Blue Flash Purple Butterfly was in its cocoon, the Blue Flash Butterfly’s genetic model was promoted.","Usually, the promotion of the genetic model was a natural result of development.","This was the first time that it occurred due to a fey absorbing the World Cleansing.","“Although the spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone is pure enough, it’s not concentrated enough to fully support the promotion of Gray’s genetic model. We’ll need spirit qi crystals for that,” Morbius added.","Lin Yuan shifted his gaze toward the pile of spirit qi crystals.","He had enough spirit qi crystals to feel comfortable using up some of them.","This was too good of an opportunity for Gray, and there was no way Lin Yuan was going to let it pass.","Lin Yuan walked over to the pile of spirit qi crystals below the small limestone bowl and took one spirit qi crystal out.","Looking at the pile of spirit qi crystals made Lin Yuan feel energized.","Lin Yuan did not keep count of the exact number of spirit qi crystals, but he estimated the number to be at least 300.","If the Bronze X/Legend Morbius tried to combine all the spirit qi crystals, it would take at least six years.","The World Grace stolen from the Cold Snow Pine could potentially greatly increase Lin Yuan’s power.","He would not need to be thrifty like he was in the past when using the spirit qi crystals.","Lin Yuan held the spirit qi crystals and marched over to Gray.","Gray was still around the same size it used to be, but its mass had obviously increased.","Gray was slumbering soundly on the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus’ branches, its weight causing the branches to bend.","Gray’s impossibly white feathers, golden beak, and red crown were accentuated by the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus’s red flowers.","It gave the sleeping Gray an aura of unspeakable charm.","Lin Yuan used true data to check Gray’s attributes.","[Fey Name]: Cloud Crane","[Fey Species]: Crane species/Red Crane species","[Fey Grade]: Norma (1/10)l","[Fey Type]: Spiritual","[Fey Quality]: Normal","Abilities:","[Cloud Morph]: Turns its body into clouds. The cloud can obscure vision as well as block psychic abilities.","Gray’s name was now recorded as Cloud Crane in True Data after its genetic model was repaired.","It was a spiritual support-type fey.","Lin Yuan carefully scanned through Grey’s data.","When Lin Yuan saw Gray’s Normal ability, he was stunned.","Gray’s Cloud Morph appeared to be a defensive ability.","It could shield its user against attacks.","However, Gray also had the ability to block psychic invasions, allowing it to be used as a countersurveillance measure.","Cloud Morph would create a scene when used on land as the cloud coverage could only be used as a screen for the surroundings.","But what if it was used in the cloud-filled sky?","It could affect battles in a completely different way!","Especially if Gray’s grade was raised and the Cloud Morph’s range was increased. The screening ability would improve tremendously.","Until then, Cloud Morph might not be of much use to others.","However, it was incredibly useful to Lin Yuan. He had an unhatched Floating Island Whale, after all."]},{"number":478,"title":"Chapter 478: Heaven and Earth Fey!","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan was of the opinion that Cloud Morph and the Floating Island Whale was a perfect match.","The Floating Island Whale would rise to the sky after becoming a Fantasy Breed. The height it rose to was inconsequential given its immense size.","Even if Lin Yuan had the Ethereal Jellyfish, which had the spatial teleportation ability, it could establish a pathway between Sky City with Space Tunnel. It would essentially connect the land and sky.","Alas, it was not an infallible solution.","The Floating Island Whale was never regarded just as a floating piece of land in the sky. Its intention was always to be used as a formidable battle fortress.","Although its body was not strong, the Floating Island Whale would carry weapons and appliances which were necessary for battle.","The Floating Island Whale could also fly at rapid speed and was apt to become a method of transportation that could traverse the globe.","Lin Yuan could not keep such a battle fortress hidden in the sky forever.","It was disadvantageous for him to do so, and it would be a waste of its potential.","But now that he had the Cloud Crane, the Floating Island Whale could continue gliding in the sky and do so while remaining undiscovered.","Cloud Morph’s shielding ability was impressive in itself, but its psychic-blocking asset was an added bonus.","The stronger the Cloud Crane grew, the more powerful Cloud Morph would become.","Eventually, the Floating Island Whale could become a legend and continue existing in the sky indefinitely.","The more Lin Yuan thought about the prospects, the more thrilled he became. His grip increased along with his excitement, and the spirit qi crystals in his hand shattered.","He instructed Morbius to direct the pulsing spirit qi into the body of the sleeping Gray so that it could absorb the energy.","Unexpectedly, Gray did not seem any different from before after absorbing one spirit qi crystal.","Lin Yuan frowned slightly and placed his hand on Gray’s back.","He gathered the powerful spirit qi from the Spirit Lock spatial zone inside his body and channeled it into Gray.","The intense spirit qi traversed the surface layer of Gray’s body. Lin Yuan could feel every cell in Gray’s body gobbling up the spirit qi, akin to a starving Mother of Bloodbath that had not eaten for decades.","In the end, all the energy was consumed by Gray’s surface layer. Not one ounce of it penetrated the rest of Gray’s body.","Lin Yuan became certain that a large amount of spirit qi crystals would be needed for the promotion of Gray’s genetic model.","Feys who had never undergone the World Cleansing usually did not experience the elevation of their genetic model.","This meant that the opportunity that had presented itself to Gray was a one in a million draw of luck. It was nothing short of a miracle.","However, the promotion of its genetic model could be severed, which would cause Gray to lose its once chance for success.","It would be the equivalent of Lin Yuan personally destroying a gift from god.","Since Lin Yuan had decided to form a contract with Gray, he would need to nurture it the same way he did with Chimey and Genius.","Genius had started out as a mere housekeeping beast that had not even become a fey, while Chimey was a normal Songstress Bird that had failed to evolve its quality to Normal.","Despite it all, Lin Yuan was resolved to make the best out of their journey together.","He grabbed a fistful of spirit qi crystals and returned to Gray’s side.","He ordered Morbius to fuse and direct the pure spirit qi from every crystal he shattered into Gray’s body.","10 pieces...","20 pieces...","Only when they reached 25 pieces did the rate at which Gray devoured the spirit qi began to slow.","When the 30th crystal was used up, Gray finally stopped absorbing the spirit qi.","Suddenly, all of Gray’s feathers molted and fell.","Instead of falling to the ground, the feathers floated next to Gray, sustained by energy.","Gray continued the cycle of growing and dropping feathers.","This was when Lin Yuan realized why the Pure Land of Bliss had so many of Gray’s fallen feathers.","When he took a closer look at Gray’s new feathers, Lin Yuan noticed that each new set of feathers was different from the last.","Each new set of feathers looked more intricate and exquisite than the last like they were handmade pieces of art.","Lin Yuan thought that Gray’s feathers were far more daedal than the Divine Travel Black Swallow’s feathers, which he had used as a blueprint to make the Source Sand’s Metal Consume Manifestation feathers.","The last set of feathers that sprouted had subtle golden markings on them, giving Gray an even more mysterious appearance.","Lin Yuan felt that these new feathers were even better than Gray’s original ones.","The feathers which had fallen from Gray were suspended next to its body and formed a large white egg.","The egg’s shell gently throbbed as though it was incubating new life.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check Gray’s attributes again. He was instantly stunned.","Gray used to be a fey, but after its genetic model was promoted, it turned into a Heaven and Earth Fey like the Floating Island Whale.","Gray was no longer called Cloud Crane but Sky-Clouded Crane.","Lin Yuan was frazzled by Gray’s sudden transformation into a Heaven and Earth Fey.","Gray fell back into a deep sleep.","Only after it hatched from the egg would Gray gain a new life.","This was the difference between the contract-forming method of Heaven and Earth Feys and other feys.","Using True Data, Lin Yuan saw that Gray’s contract method was similar to the Floating Island Whale.","Both of them needed to feel the bloodline of their contractor during the incubation period. After they hatched, they would decide whether or not to seal the deal.","Lin Yuan thought back to when Gray used to cling to him.","Even if I don’t enhance the bloodline between Gray and me, it should still choose to form a contract with me. However, other than being able to enhance the bloodline between Heaven and Earth Feys and us, blood can also strengthen our bond. I can’t skimp on the amount of blood I use."]},{"number":479,"title":"Chapter 479: Enhancing the Elemental Shellfish","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan couldn’t help but put his hand on his forehead.","After each enhanced bloodline relationship with the Floating Island Whale, a large amount of blood in his body would be absorbed by the crystal eggshell of the Floating Island Whale, causing him to feel like his body was being emptied.","With Gray now, that was simply a double of being emptied and double the ‘pleasure’.","Lin Yuan felt that he should really ask Zhang Xiaobai’s care tips sometime later, and how he faced the Bloody Leech’s destruction.","Otherwise, no matter how strong a youth’s physique was, he couldn’t withstand the two Heaven and Earth Feys, the Floating Island Whale and the Sky-Clouded Crane!","Although he was against the idea, his body was incredibly honest!","He had already started to enhance the bloodline with the Sky-Clouded Crane, Gray.","He deliberately used the blood from his tongue for the first time, just like the first time he had enhanced the bloodline with the Floating Island Whale. Nearly two hours passed before he completed enhancing the bloodline with Gray and the Floating Island Whale.","During this time, Lin Yuan relied on his Jasmine Lily as it used its main flower to release life force and restore the qi and blood in his body.","But given his current state of being like a faucet, he would be dried up even if he were a swimming pool.","After Lin Yuan swayed in place, he sat on the ground. He let the Jasmine Lily use its Heal on him for three minutes without bothering about its side effects.","Due to the dizziness from blood loss, that extreme comfort nearly made him fall asleep in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, but after waking up from that extreme comfort, he recovered from the dizziness due to the blood loss.","Previously, when Morbius had been channeling the spirit qi in the spirit qi crystals to Gray to strengthen its genetic model, there was still a portion of spirit qi left.","Morbius asked Lin Yuan, “Yuan, Gray only consumed a trace of energy in the 31st energy crystal.","“The remaining energy should be able to allow four to five Bronze/Epic feys to reach Legend.”","As soon as Lin Yuan heard that, he didn’t even hesitate to take one Scorching Elemental Shellfish, two Celestine Elemental Shellfish, and two Aquamarine Elemental Shellfish out of the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","These five Elemental Shellfish were currently Bronze X/Epic. If he promoted them from Epic to Legend, then the speed at which they produced the elemental pearls would undoubtedly become faster than before.","Lin Yuan now regretted not promoting these five Elemental Shellfish from Epic to Legend with the spirit qi crystals previously.","After such a long time, it was unknown how many heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls had been lost.","After channeling the remaining spirit qi in the 31st spirit qi crystals that Morbius controlled into the five Elemental Shellfish, they all immediately became much larger than before.","The elemental patterns on them also became more obvious, and the color of the flesh was closer to the color of the different types of elements. When they opened, they all exhaled elemental energy that was like a smoky haze.","This meant that the four Elemental Shellfish that had grown larger had successfully been promoted to Legend.","However, due to the lack of remaining spirit qi in the spirit qi crystals, one of the Aquamarine Elemental Shellfish did not get promoted.","This situation could let Lin Yuan find out how much faster were the elemental pearls produced by the Bronze X/Legend Elemental Shellfish than the ones produced by the Bronze/Epic Elemental Shellfish.","Since elemental pearls from different Elemental Shellfish were produced differently, Lin Yuan didn’t choose carefully and took out that Bronze X/Legend Scorching Elemental Shellfish for comparison.","During his two hours of observation, Lin Yuan found that it produced a total of eight elemental pearls, while the Bronze X/Epic Aquamarine Elemental Shellfish produced six.","Although such a ratio didn’t seem too shocking, it was enough to be called an amazing fortune after it quantified a quarter of the difference over time. Of course, other people couldn’t achieve this accumulation of wealth unless they had such an inexhaustible blessed land with a high concentration of pure spirit qi like Morbius’ Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Lin Yuan took out the two young Elemental Shellfish that he had obtained from Master Jing Liu in exchange for 200 fire-elemental pearls.","He already had a plan in his mind. What he needed to do was to induce their mutation and turn them into Thick Earth Shellfish.","First of all, between the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls produced by different Elemental Shellfish, they could be circulated at a price of 1:1. Thus, there was actually not much difference no matter what kind of Elemental Shellfish he nurtured.","Lin Yuan wanted to evolve the two young Elemental Shellfish into Thick Earth Shellfish because the Source Sand wanted to improve its grade and rank.","Apart from relying on the spirit qi in the spirit qi crystals, the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls produced by the Thick Earth Shellfish were also an excellent choice for enhancement. At the same time, the pure earth energy in those heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls could temper the Source Sand.","With some inducement from Lin Yuan, the two young Thick Earth Shellfish were easily nurtured into Bronze X/Epic.","After that, he summoned the three Red Water Blood Snakes with the hornless dragon bloodline that he had gotten in a trade at the Indigo Azure Sea Market from the amber-button-shaped Diamond fey storage box.","They were the raw materials that the Mother of Bloodbath’s third exclusive skill, External Blood Bone, needed.","The Mother of Bloodbath’s exclusive skill and strength improvement couldn’t be sloppy. Therefore, Lin Yuan had asked the Mother of Bloodbath about the choice of the three Red Water Blood Snakes’ exclusive skills.","Their exclusive skills were not important for the Mother of Bloodbath. After being fused with the Mother of Bloodbath’s chelicerae, these three Red Water Blood Snakes would be equal to a part of its body. Hence, they would be dominated by it and become the same as its exclusive skill.","When Lin Yuan enhanced them, he didn’t need to consider the choice of their exclusive skills when they were promoted to Bronze."]},{"number":480,"title":"Chapter 480: Not a Self-Destructing Bucket!","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan couldn’t help but sigh as he looked at these three Red Water Blood Snakes. They indeed had the hornless dragon bloodline in them.","Half a day ago, they had been sprinkled with realgar powder but seemed unharmed now. All of them were spirited.","Lin Yuan enhanced the three Red Water Blood Snakes with the hornless dragon bloodline, and they were promoted to Bronze X/Epic a few hours later.","Even though their exclusive skills when they were promoted to Bronze were not important, Lin Yuan still promoted them to Elite/Epic before promoting them to Bronze.","From the three exclusive skills that appeared, he picked out the one that he thought was the most powerful.","Lin Yuan then took out a spirit qi crystal and crushed it. Under Morbius’ guidance, the three Bronze/Epic Red Water Blood Snakes, two Thick Earth Shellfish, and the Aquamarine Elemental Shellfish that had failed to raise its quality before were all enhanced.","Because the Aquamarine Elemental Shellfish had previously absorbed the high pure spirit qi from the spirit qi crystals, it was on the verge of breaking through to Legend. So this time, all six Bronze/Epic feys were promoted to Legend thanks to one spirit qi crystal.","Lin Yuan stored the three Bronze/Legend Red Water Blood Snakes into the Platinum fey storage box and was going to give them to the Mother of Bloodbath when he returned to the Royal Capital.","Immediately after that, he placed the Aquamarine Elemental Shellfish and Celestine Elemental Shellfish back into their original positions.","Although the Floating Island Whale, a Heaven, and Earth Fey, could devour the spirit qi, water energy, and wind energy in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, there was a limit to it.","Previously, the Aquamarine Elemental Shellfish and Celestine Elemental Shellfish were just enough for the Floating Island Whale’s consumption when they were at Epic.","After having their quality promoted now, Lin Yuan had two wind-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls produced by the Celestine Elemental Shellfish and two water-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls produced by the Aquamarine Elemental Shellfish every hour.","Since the immature Lifeform Sacrificial Fire in the Twin Red Pagoda’s main flower could not finish absorbing the fire-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearl produced by the Scorching Elemental Shellfish, the gathering speed had become a lot faster than before.","Coupled with the two earth-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls produced by the Thick Earth Elemental Shellfish, the Source Sand could only consume one over a period. Therefore, the earth-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls basically equated to being an appetizer.","Lin Yuan felt that although he had spent all the resources he could in the Indigo Azure Sea Market, he would soon get rich based on the current rate of resource accumulation.","Given the production speed of the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls in his hands, it wouldn’t be too much for him to be called the prince of elemental pearls!","Lin Yuan looked at the time and found that it was already five o’clock in the morning. He had stayed up overnight in the Spirit Lock spatial zone again.","Looking at the Elemental Shellfish constantly producing the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, he didn’t feel tired but fulfilled.","It was still early, as the agreed time to wake up with the others last night was 7:30. There were still nearly two hours left for him to continue enhancing the feys.","He first took out the fairy source-type lifeform, the Burning Sunflower.","When looking at this thumb-sized cactus-shaped Burning Sunflower, his expression paused when he was about to enhance it. Then he stored it back into the amber-button-shaped Diamond fey storage box.","Chu Ci was now outside with Cold Moon for training and must have become stronger. Lin Yuan didn’t know how strong she was now. Thus, it would be better to wait for her return and have some understanding of her feys before he took her Bronze/Epic Vajra Butterly over and promoted it together with the Burning Sunflower to Bronze/Legend.","Chu Ci had grown up. As her brother, even if he wanted to be good to his sister, he had to respect her. Lin Yuan intended to let Chu Ci choose the Burning Sunflower’s exclusive skill.","She was now also a combat-class spirit qi professional and was even clearer about her own path than others.","He now only hoped that after the Burning Sunflower was nurtured, it could let her combat style be less rough!","His Iron Bucket Sister Plan 3.0 was nurturing a solid iron bucket!","Not a self-destructing bucket!","If he raised her into a self-destructing bucket, Lin Yuan felt he would be simply letting down his identity as her older brother.","After putting away the Burning Sunflower, Lin Yuan took the Heaven and Earth Fey, the Blood Brew Grapevine, out of the amber-button-shaped Diamond fey storage box.","The Platinum IV/Epic Blood Brew Grapevine that he had traded in the Indigo Azure Sea Market was a mature Heaven and Earth Fey. For such a fey, it only needed to be supplied with enough blood.","The Blood Brew Grapevine could absorb the energy from blood to produce Blood Brew Grapes. It had a very high demand for the quality and quantity of blood.","If the Platinum Blood Brew Grapevine wanted to grow a bunch of Blood Brew Grapes, it at least needed the blood energy from 1,000 Platinum feys that couldn’t be supplied by ordinary blood. It must be the essence blood obtained after purification.","The Blood Brew Grapevine also had very demanding requirements for essence blood. If the quality of the essence blood was not up to par, the produced Blood Brew Grapes would be small.","Lin Yuan had previously speculated about Red Thorn’s Eyes of Relinquish and the Blood Brew Grapevine.","He was now a bit apprehensive and didn’t know whether the Blood Brew Grapevine could absorb the Eyes of Relinquish to produce Blood Brew Grapes.","Lin Yuan summoned Red Thorn from the leaf-shaped Diamond fey storage box. After Red Thorn saw him, it immediately became cheerful. It played with its huge flower that had obviously evolved more gill-shaped petals.","“Yuan... Red Thorn... misses you!”","Although its words from its gill-like flower were broken, Red Thorn had obviously shown what it wanted to express!","During this time, it could be said that Genius’ contributions couldn’t go unnoticed.","Ever since Genius had agreed to teach Red Thorn to speak, it had been going to the leaf-shaped Diamond fey storage box to guide Red Thorn dutifully."]},{"number":481,"title":"Chapter 481: Nurturing The Blood Brew Grapevine","paragraphs":["The leaf-shaped Diamond fey storage box used to contain the flesh of many dimensional lifeforms, so it gave off an odious stink.","However, once Red Thorn’s Mouth of Relinquish was activated, the energy waves emitted would be sufficient to force out any and all smells.","Genius only needed to land on the Mouth of Relinquish’s fleshy flowers when it entered the leaf-shaped Diamond fey storage box.","As such, Lin Yuan would no longer need to stuff paper balls made of leaf pulp up its nose.","Lin Yuan thought that Red Thorn was truly Genius’s disciple, for it put on airs just like Genius did.","Lin Yuan was proud to see that Red Thorn was already able to produce simple voice statements.","Red Thorn had still been a plain, unformed source seed half a year ago, but it had blossomed quickly under his wing.","Lin Yuan realized that Red Thorn’s intelligence level was increasing as well. When it was digesting flesh in the leaf-shaped Diamond fey storage box, it no longer stuffed itself mindlessly like it used to.","It would now sprout vines that extracted the flesh from the Gold dimensional lifeforms. It would then transport the soluble flesh through the roots connecting the vines and the ortets, all the way to the Mouth of Relinquish.","Next, the Mouth of Relinquish and Tongue of Relinquish would choose the best digesting agent suited to that particular dimensional lifeform before finally digesting the dimensional lifeform.","This method sped up the digestive process considerably.","However, the goal was not just to increase the digestion rate.","Lin Yuan thought that this was a sign of Red Thorn’s personality change. It was now conscious of its image and was trying to have etiquette.","When Red Thorn first grew the thornless vine, it had simply asked Lin Yuan to tie it into a butterfly knot.","But as time went on, Red Thorn started to want to improve its looks and requested Lin Yuan to use different colored ribbons to tie the butterfly knot.","The previously emptied stock of Eye of Relinquish had grown to 30 within a day.","Lin Yuan said to Red Thorn, “Red Thorn, can you harvest the Eyes of Relinquish which were meant to go into storage?”","Red Thorn had been playing with the ten large gill-shaped flowers, but it grew serious and spat out some spores once Lin Yuan spoke.","The spores sprouted two vines by Lin Yuan’s feet.","Red Thorn called out an Eye of Relinquish through the roots connected to the vines and dutifully handed it to Lin Yuan.","Although Red Thorn could only produce about 60 Eyes of Relinquish, they would immediately turn into a sea of flowers or an important means of attack when combined during battle.","Lin Yuan had also witnessed Red Thorn harvesting Eyes of Relinquish on command in a fight.","The thornless vine had been using the Eye of Relinquish as a toy. When Lin Yuan saw the Blood Brew Grapevines, he came up with the idea of using the Eye of Relinquish to nurture it.","The Mouth of Relinquish digested rapidly.","Unfortunately, Red Thorn’s rate of evolution was slow. As such, the Mouth of Relinquish could only start to replenish the Eye of Relinquish when the number fell below 60. Only then would Red Thorn activate the Mouth of Relinquish to turn the excess digested flesh into the Eyes of Relinquish for storage.","Thus, Lin Yuan’s depletion of the Eyes of Relinquish would not slow down Red Thorn’s evolution.","It only required a large intake of dimensional lifeform flesh.","Lin Yuan placed an Eye of Relinquish into the roots of the Blood Brew Grapevine.","As a Platinum IV/Epic fey, the Blood Brew Grapevine could consume nutrients through its roots. If the Blood Brew Grapevine could not absorb the pure energy from the Eye of Relinquish, Lin Yuan would need to go on Star Web to purchase Platinum fey blood.","The purchased Platinum fey blood would be used to nurture the Blood Brew Grapevine into growing Blood Brew Grapes.","When the Eye of Relinquish was placed at the Blood Brew Grapevine’s roots, Lin Yuan held his breath and watched the Blood Brew Grapevine’s movements.","What he saw was the Blood Brew Grapevine’s roots encapsulating the Eye of Relinquish, squeezing it tighter and tighter.","The sharp roots jabbed at the Eye of Relinquish.","Lin Yuan was surprised by what he saw.","He did not expect Red Thorn’s Eye of Relinquish to be so resilient. Or perhaps it was the Blood Brew Grapevine’s roots that were too weak.","Lin Yuan produced a feather made of Day and Night Spirit Silver using his Source Sand and slashed an opening in the Eye of Relinquish.","A few of the Blood Brew Grapevine’s roots were then able to tunnel in through the opening.","Lin Yuan soon noticed the rippling blood-red energy around the Blood Brew Grapevine.","The Blood Brew Grapevine’s seller had set up a shelf for it. All of a sudden, new vines were growing out of it.","The sticky red sap, where the Blood Brew Grapes had been slashed open, was slowly starting to dry.","When Lin Yuan reached out to touch it, the layer of red tree sap immediately fell away.","The wound had become shallow.","The Blood Brew Grapevine quickly absorbed the Eye of Relinquish.","After only 20 minutes, the blood in the Eye of Relinquish was almost all gone.","Lin Yuan noticed that the rate at which the Blood Brew Grapevine absorbed the Eye of Relinquish was similar to the rate at which Red Thorn produced the Eye of Relinquish.","Lin Yuan placed the remaining 29 Eyes of Relinquish at the Blood Brew Grapevine’s roots and then used the Day and Night Spirit Silver feather to cut an opening in every Eye of Relinquish.","The opening was small enough to ensure that the blood energy in each Eye of Relinquish would not leak while still allowing the Blood Brew Grapevine’s roots easy access."]},{"number":482,"title":"Chapter 482: Greed and Change","paragraphs":["When Lin Yuan was done, he noticed that the Blood Brew Grapevine was rather greedy.","It originally did not have many roots, but it had grown numerous more in order to absorb all the Eyes of Relinquish.","The new roots soon joined the old roots in entering the Eyes of Relinquish.","The Blood Brew Grapevine only started to absorb the blood energy in the Eyes of Relinquish after it had ensured that it had engulfed every piece.","Lin Yuan noticed that the Blood Brew Grapevine had its little tricks when it came to this process.","The Blood Brew Grapevine’s new roots were much sharper than the old ones, and they were covered with a wooden exterior.","The Blood Brew Grapevine no longer needed Lin Yuan’s help thanks to the new roots.","It could now break down the Eyes of Relinquish’s defenses on its own.","The blood energy from each of the 29 Eyes of Relinquish was eventually all absorbed into the Blood Brew Grapevine’s body.","The vines on top of the Blood Brew Grapevine started to playfully dangle its new roots.","With the addition of its new roots, the Blood Brew Grapevine looked as though it had grown twice in size.","Lin Yuan was unbothered.","The old person who had sold the Blood Brew Grapevine should have pruned all of its vines and leaves. All that was left was the main vine. This ensured that all the blood energy the Blood Brew Grapevine absorbed would be focused on growing Blood Brew Grapes along the main vine.","However, Lin Yuan preferred the Blood Brew Grapevine to grow more vines so as to increase the number of Blood Brew Grapes it produced at a time.","Although this would undoubtedly increase the Blood Brew Grapes’ growing time, not pruning the new vines could also preserve the energy in the Blood Brew Grapevine’s body. After all, the Blood Brew Grapevine needed to channel more blood energy into regrowing the parts that had been pruned.","The Mother of Bloodbath would need to eat an immeasurable number of Blood Brew Grapes if it wanted to promote to Myth III. As such, the Mother of Bloodbath would be able to eat its fill of Blood Brew Grapes whenever the Blood Brew Grapevine produced its maximum number of Blood Brew Grapes.","Lin Yuan did a quick check to ensure that everything was in order before storing both Red Thorn and the Blood Brew Grapevine into the leaf-shaped Diamond fey storage box.","Previously, Lin Yuan had not instructed Red Thorn to store its Eyes of Relinquish because of his experimentation on the Eyes of Relinquish.","But now that Lin Yuan was going to get Red Thorn to continuously produce Eyes of Relinquish to nurture the Blood Brew Grapevine, it was better to maintain the 60 Eyes of Relinquish on Red Thorn.","The extra Eyes of Relinquish would be placed at the Blood Brew Grapevine’s roots.","The Source Sand might be Lin Yuan’s current main choice of fey to use in battle, but Red Thorn’s fighting abilities could strike a team as a whole. It could only be of significant use under the right circumstances.","Lin Yuan was accustomed to expanding the range of effectiveness of his fighting power, for it allowed him to utilize the best action regardless of what situation he was facing.","Despite already having powerful guardians like the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer by his side—not to mention the Extreme Token the Moon Empress had given him—Lin Yuan felt it was best to remain on his toes.","Since the Blood Brew Grapevine could absorb the Eyes of Relinquish and was growing rapidly, Lin Yuan could now set his worries at ease.","This undeniably helped Lin Yuan save a large amount of money.","The Eyes of Relinquish came from water world dimensional lifeforms. They had enormous bodies, and each piece of their flesh was sold for cheap. It was the most affordable meat ingredient in the world.","Since Red Thorn could rely on these water world dimensional lifeforms to sustain itself, it saved Lin Yuan the effort of collecting the blood of feys.","Lin Yuan used to stress about how to procure the water world dimensional lifeforms, but one stroll through the Indigo Azure Sea Market had resolved that worry.","It was almost time for the dimensional rift’s active period. There was an endless stream of people coming to trade for water world dimensional lifeforms with the Indigo Azure Guards.","Lin Yuan planned to strike up a deal with the middle-aged man when he returned to the Royal Capital. It would be best if he managed to get his hands on some water world dimensional lifeform to store in the Diamond fey storage box.","Suddenly, Lin Yuan realized that if the Mother of Bloodbath knew that the Blood Brew Grapes it consumed were made from water world dimensional lifeforms, it might be repulsed.","Lin Yuan dismissed the thought as unimportant. The important thing was that the Blood Brew Grapes were packed full of the sparkling blood energy that the Mother of Bloodbath needed.","Now that he had finished all his additional chores, Lin Yuan could focus on his own affairs.","Lin Yuan took the Mountain-Containing Embryo he had traded out of the button-shaped fey storage box.","The Mountain-Containing Embryo was jumping around, and it looked like a bean to Lin Yuan.","The Mountain-Containing Embryo carried an air of virtue as it leaped about. It seemed as though this small yellow ball could even scale mountains. It could also be said that the Mountain-Containing Embryo felt like it was part of the mountains itself.","Lin Yuan turned the Source Sand into some landscape rocks and wrapped the jumping Mountain-Containing Embryo inside.","Lin Yuan could feel the Source Sand’s strange happiness, showing that it was glad to be of service to him.","Inside of the Mountain-Containing Embryo was the ever-changing consciousness of the mountains.","Thus, when the Source Sand was covering over the Mountain-Containing Embryo, it could use Metal Consume Manifestation to devour the Day and Night Spirit Silver. It would use its memory of the shape of the Divine Travel Black Swallow’s feather to produce the golden feathers Gray grew when it evolved into the Sky-Clouded Crane.","The golden feather was much more complicated to produce than the Divine Travel Black Swallow’s feathers. Hence, some time was needed in order to fully memorize and implement the change.","The Source Sand would also take time to fully absorb the Mountain-Containing Embryo’s altered abilities.","As such, Lin Yuan stored the hardworking Source Sand away."]},{"number":483,"title":"Chapter 483: Can’t Sit Even If","paragraphs":["While the Source Sand was changing into its button form, it looked as though it was housing a potato.","Lin Yuan could not help but wonder if this was what people were referring to when they said even the humblest objects carried a certain amount of majesty.","Since there was not much time left, Lin Yuan left the Spirit Lock spatial zone and returned to his tent.","The faint aroma of seafood porridge drifted into the tent. He realized that Big Brother Liu must have started on breakfast.","Lin Yuan stretched and strolled out of his tent.","When he walked out of the tent, Lin Yuan noticed that the Mother of Bloodbath had also woken up. It was standing next to Liu Jie, who was cooking a huge pot of seafood porridge.","Every now and then, it would toss a few pieces of shelled prawns, dried scallops, and abalone pieces into the bubbling pot.","The Mother of Bloodbath kept adding ingredients, and it did not look like it was going to stop anytime soon.","The more ingredients the Mother of Bloodbath threw in, the more vigorously Liu Jie’s eyelids twitched, especially when it added the abalone pieces.","Liu Jie finally had to stop it.","“If you add more abalone pieces, the porridge will be too thick!”","The Mother of Bloodbath stopped adding the seafood and asked, “This is my first time cooking. What if Lin Yuan, Listen, and the rest don’t like the taste because there are too few ingredients?”","Liu Jie pulled out a crystal bottle of salt and handed it to the Mother of Bloodbath.","“The seafood was bought first thing this morning. You also added some Platinum abalone liver juices. There’s no way it won’t taste delicious. All we need to do now is to add some salt to bring out the porridge’s freshness. About four shakes of this crystal bottle should be enough.”","Lin Yuan’s eyebrow jumped when he heard that the Mother of Bloodbath was the chef behind this morning’s breakfast.","But he saw how attentively Liu Jie was guiding it, even giving specific instructions on how much salt to add, so the food might as well have been cooked by Liu Jie himself.","The Mother of Bloodbath was more like a sous chef.","The blazing sun set the entire sky alight, and foamy waves crashed softly on the shores. The ocean spray was completely devoid of life.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower had utterly removed all traces of energy from the coastal seas, essentially leaving it barren.","It could very well take more than 100 years for the area to recover.","Without feys in the shores, there should be no danger as long as a water world dimensional rift did not open up here, making the area suitable for a holiday location.","Lin Yuan reveled in the abundant variety of ingredients, specifically the Mother of Bloodbath’s mouth-watering seafood porridge.","...","Unfortunately for the Zheng family, they were not having a gleeful time.","A middle-aged man with three scars on his face was pushing a wheelchair along a narrow path that cut through an expansive yard.","The dawn air was still pregnant with night chill. The skinny youth in the wheelchair had a thick blanket draped over him and was dressed in a set of white wool robes.","The scarred middle-aged man pulled the blanket tighter around the youth as he bowed and said, “Third Young Master, you’ve been out twice as long as usual. How about we return after walking through this alley?”","The skinny youth in the wheelchair was in a good mood as he replied, “No rush. I want to visit the cherry blossom forest after we’re done walking around here. It’s a pity that it doesn’t snow in Indigo Azure City. The red cherry blossoms aren’t as vibrant when they’re not viewed against the blank white canvas of snow.”","The scarred middle-aged man knew that the Third Young Master’s mood could not simply be described as good. He knew why the Third Young Master’s had such a bright and spirited demeanor.","“Third Young Master, there was a blizzard at sea last night, but it only lasted for a short while,” said the scarred middle-aged man.","The skinny youth chuckled.","“The snow might have stopped above the sea, but it must have moved to another area. It wouldn’t just end so abruptly. If only my legs were strong. I could have enjoyed the ocean view last night.”","The skinny youth suddenly asked, “Uncle Fu, you said that even Nightmare VI disappeared. How’s Second Brother taking it?”","The scarred middle-aged man did not respond because he knew that the Third Young Master was only engaging in soliloquy. He was actually detached from reality at the moment.","Disturbing him while he was in such a state would only spell trouble.","Suddenly, the Third Young Master heaved a sigh.","“Well, Second Brother’s legs are still working. At least, he’ll be able to do something about it. If he was like me, he’d truly be crippled by helplessness.”","The middle-aged man suddenly felt the initially exceptionally pleasant weather shift as a cold wind kicked up.","A figure surreptitiously appeared beside the skinny youth’s wheelchair.","He was dressed in black robes and had a figure which would tower over the average person, giving his black robe a wide and voluminous appearance.","The black figure whispered into the skinny youth’s ear, “Third Young Master, I’ve confirmed that Nightmare VI is dead. I’ve also sent the item as per your orders.”","The skinny youth in the wheelchair stretched contentedly, and his fingers rapped on the wheelchair’s armrest. His mood had apparently improved.","...","Lin Yuan emerged from the ocean, having just checked on the Ethereal Jellyfish’s progress of collecting the Floating Silver.","He realized that the Ethereal Jellyfish was collecting the Floating Silver Strands much faster than he had anticipated.","It had already collected 1/3 of the Floating Silver Strands from the ocean floor in just one night. This meant that all of the Floating Silver Strands would be collected at the same time tomorrow.","Zhou Luo’s Lava Dragon Lizard was instrumental in this result.","After spending a day in the ocean, Lin Yuan felt that spirit qi professionals had stringent criteria when picking their contracted feys.","The majority of feys could only control one of the three realms—the sea, the land, and the skies.","There were very few feys that could control two or even three.","Different feys could use different abilities in different environments.","For example, no matter how strong Liu Jie’s Insect Queen became, it could only rely on its Lightning Gathering Moths and Hurricane Owlet Moths to fight against enemies from the sea surface.","When it came to enemies that were submerged underwater, Liu Jie would be helpless.","Lin Yuan felt it was necessary for him to contract a real aquatic fey in the future besides Red Thorn that could fight underwater."]},{"number":484,"title":"Chapter 484: The Two Who Earned a Lot","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan’s phone suddenly rang. He couldn’t help but feel a little surprised when he saw the caller.","After picking up the phone, Lin Yuan heard the opposite party speak first.","“I don’t think it’s possible to exchange any dimensional lifeforms’ flesh for the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh anymore.”","The voice coming from the other end of the phone was very forthright, with a hint of apology.","Lin Yuan subconsciously replied, “It’s okay even if you can’t exchange any dimensional lifeforms’ flesh. I have a lot of abyss dimensional lifeforms’ flesh here as well.”","The middle-aged man on the other end of the phone realized that Lin Yuan had gotten the wrong idea and hurriedly said, “We exchanged the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh for the demon dimensional lifeforms’ flesh. It’s only because it’s easier to sell the disassembled spiritual materials from the demon dimensional lifeforms’ flesh.","“Our boss has found a way to exchange the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh for some basic supplies.","“Therefore, I would have to go back on the exchange condition that I promised you before.”","When Lin Yuan heard that, his eyebrows immediately jumped wildly.","He had managed to find a way to exchange for water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh with much difficulty, so he couldn’t just let it go like that.","Moreover, hundreds of Gold water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh would have to be consumed every day for Red Thorn to use its Mouth of Relinquish at full capacity to spawn the Eyes of Relinquish to nurture the Blood Brew Grapevine and allow Red Thorn to evolve its ability to breathe underwater.","Previously, those that he had exchanged were only enough for Red Thorn’s Mouth of Relinquish to consume for a month or so.","As Red Thorn became stronger and stronger, with acid secreted by the Tongue of Relinquish that specialized in digesting water world dimensional lifeforms, Lin Yuan’s demand for Gold water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh had to be on another level.","How could he not have the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh!?","The middle-aged man on the other side of the phone was an Indigo Azure Guard, so the boss he mentioned must be the Indigo Azure Guard Captain.","Lin Yuan didn’t know if he had come to the desolate island yesterday with the two Guard Envoys.","Since the Indigo Azure Guard Captain had done that in exchange for basic supplies, Lin Yuan could also provide basic supplies.","Apart from basic supplies, in order to be able to exchange Gold water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh, Lin Yuan would even be willing to take out some relatively rare materials.","As long as he could always use the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh, it was akin to doing the most economical thing.","“Uncle, I’m not only able to take out basic supplies here, but I can even provide fine goods and some rare spiritual materials to exchange for the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh.”","As he spoke, Lin Yuan was a bit puzzled. He needed the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh as rations for Red Thorn.","Why exactly did other people need such a smelly thing like the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh?","While Lin Yuan was puzzled, he didn’t know that the middle-aged man on the other end of the phone was even more puzzled.","What’s wrong with this world?","How can someone be willing to take out fine goods and rare spiritual materials to exchange for Gold water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh!?","Rich people are really something!","When Boss found a channel where he could exchange the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh for basic supplies, it was like New Year’s for the Indigo Azure Guards.","The Indigo Azure Guards usually discarded most of the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh every year.","The middle-aged man, who had previously discarded the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh, didn’t feel it was a waste, but it was a little painful to think about.","Lin Yuan soon heard the middle-aged man on the other end of the phone speak frankly again.","“If you can really take out fine goods and rare spiritual materials, our boss will naturally not refuse. However, if you want to reach long-term cooperation, you can’t buy as little at one time as before.”","The middle-aged man suddenly felt a burst of pleasure!","He now had the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh. Why did he suddenly feel that he was holding a precious bargaining chip and could start bargaining?","Lin Yuan felt even better after hearing the middle-aged man’s words.","“In the future, every time I exchange, it’ll be in the form of one Diamond fey storage box.","“We will still follow the previous price, except that I’ll convert the price of the demon dimensional lifeforms’ flesh according to the price sold on Star Web.","“The price of the fine goods and rare spiritual materials will also be based on the Star Web price. What do you think about it, Uncle?”","The middle-aged man had canceled the agreement of the previous transaction mainly due to the loss of value in the process of reselling the spiritual materials broken down from the demon flesh, which had been exchanged with the water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh.","In addition to the value loss, breaking down various demon flesh among the abyss dimensional lifeforms also took a lot of time, and he was willing to use fine goods and rare spiritual materials to exchange.","It would be like helping the middle-aged man offset the price difference in between. This middle-aged man should be willing to do so.","In Lin Yuan’s opinion, converting all the prices on Star Web was a more cost-effective price for the middle-aged man. After all, the price of the demon dimensional lifeforms’ flesh on Star Web was far more expensive than the actual value by about 1% to 2%.","As expected, Lin Yuan immediately heard the middle-aged man’s cheerful laughter after he finished speaking.","“You’re fastidious!”","Lin Yuan couldn’t help but be embarrassed when he heard how the middle-aged man had addressed him.","Previously, he had called him Uncle, but now, this middle-aged man was calling him Brother, so Lin Yuan couldn’t call him Uncle anymore.","At this moment, the middle-aged man said, “Brother, the active period of the dimensional rift is about to begin and will last for nearly half a year, so I can’t offer any more trades during this period.","“The next time should be six months later.","“If you need a lot of water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh, you need to finish the deal with me before tomorrow.","“Otherwise, our boss may empty all the dimensional lifeforms’ flesh now in exchange for some ordinary supplies that can improve the meals of the feys.”","After hearing the middle-aged man’s words, Lin Yuan immediately stated, “It might be better for me to look for you in Indigo Azure City. It just so happens that I have an empty Diamond fey storage box, which can just be filled up when trading.”","After agreeing on the location with the middle-aged man, Lin Yuan hung up the phone.","...","At that moment, a rather serious voice suddenly came from behind the middle-aged man, whose face was happy.","“Why are you smiling like that? Listen to you laughing at the door for nearly a minute!","“Why? You’ve finally found a girlfriend after being single your entire life?”"]},{"number":485,"title":"Chapter 485: Truly A Classy Person!","paragraphs":["The middle-aged man frowned and said, “Captain, don’t you think you should arrange a girlfriend for me after all my hard work?”","The Indigo Azure Guard Captain was the azure armor-wearing man Lin Yuan had met on the deserted island.","The Indigo Azure Guard Captain patted the middle-aged man’s shoulder and chided him playfully. “You brat, I’ve been single for five years longer than you! Are you really asking me to set you up now? Quickly, be serious now. Let’s go take care of all the water world dimensional lifeforms we have stored up. Then we’ll talk!”","The middle-aged man scratched the back of his head before smiling devilishly.","“Captain, I think I closed a huge deal. We don’t need to exchange half of the water world dimensional lifeform flesh for ordinary supplies.”","The Indigo Azure Guard Captain kicked the middle-aged man.","“Stop stalling and just speak what’s on your mind! I’ve been super-busy these two days and haven’t had much sleep. I’m in no mood to entertain you!”","After being kicked, the middle-aged man dutifully told the Indigo Azure Guard about the deal he had struck with Lin Yuan over the phone.","The Indigo Azure Guard Captain frowned slightly as the deal seemed too good to be true.","If the deal went through, the Indigo Azure Guards would be able to receive an enormous amount of basic supplies, fine goods, and rare spiritual materials before the dimensional rift.","However, such a sweet deal needed to be investigated thoroughly.","The Indigo Azure Guard Captain had come to ask the middle-aged man to go trade water world dimensional lifeform flesh with him. Now that they had another buyer, they could cover it on the way.","The possibility of being able to trade for rare spiritual materials and fine goods at hand would make anyone dive straight in.","“How much water world dimensional lifeform flesh does the other party want?”","The middle-aged man grinned from ear to ear.","“They want a Diamond fey storage box worth of it.”","The Indigo Azure Guard Captain was shocked and pondered over the information.","When he came back to his senses, the middle-aged was still standing at his original spot. He coughed and said, “Then what are you waiting for? Go and get ready! Besides the Diamond fey storage box, make extra preparations.”","The middle-aged man made a sound of acknowledgment and bustled off to prepare.","The Indigo Azure Guard Captain thought to himself, I’ll have to see for myself how this plays out. What kind of rare spiritual materials and fine goods will they use to exchange for the Diamond fey storage box?","There are so many kinds. The more popular items will be snatched up immediately. If it’s just some worthless items, it will mean they merely want to transfer the load onto me.","If that happens, I’m better off just trading for regular daily necessities.","After Lin Yuan hung up, he informed his comrades that he was going to head into Indigo Azure City first to trade.","Endless Summer told the Mother of Bloodbath to continue separating Nightmare VI’s spiritual ingredients.","It transformed into a gorgeous ball-shaped light purple flower and landed on the jade bead of Lin Yuan’s spirit qi clothes.","It gave Lin Yuan’s white attire a pop of color.","Apparently, Endless Summer planned to enter Indigo Azure City with Lin Yuan. It was taking precautionary measures against the Zheng family’s possible retaliation.","Lin Yuan understood where Endless Summer was coming from.","Despite its concerns, Lin Yuan felt that the Zheng family currently did not have the heart to come after them for revenge.","The Zheng family might be a veteran faction, but they had lost two of their emperor-class experts.","Moreover, two of their Spirit Guard Envoys were in Indigo Azure City, meaning the Zheng family was currently shorthanded.","At present, they needed to be more careful when they were in Indigo Azure City, in case the two veteran factions who allied with the Zheng family tried to cause him harm.","Although the loss of the two emperor-class experts was not enough to remove the three families’ hold on power, it did result in the Zheng family becoming the weakest link.","This time, the Mother of Bloodbath did not fight with Endless Summer about going to Indigo Azure City with Lin Yuan.","The Mother of Bloodbath might be Lin Yuan’s Path Protector, but Endless Summer was currently stronger.","In spite of the strong front it was putting up, the Mother of Bloodbath needed time to recover from its previous injury.","Liu Jie and Listen, who were free in the daytime, went into the ocean to help the Ethereal Jellyfish collect the Floating Silver Strands.","The Ethereal Jellyfish might be able to collect the Floating Silver Strands, but it lacked the fine motor skills to properly organize and store them.","Zhou Luo watched in shock as Liu Jie and Listen started competing again.","Zhou Luo did not understand why they would use something so bitter as a betting stake.","The Platinum Bitter Gourd Pulp might as well be poison.","When Lin Yuan arrived at the agreed-upon restaurant in Indigo Azure City, he realized the middle-aged man had not arrived.","He sat and observed the sight in the restaurant.","The place was abuzz with customers. It was still morning, but numerous customers were seated in the store and had ordered drinks, fruit platters, and sweet biscuits.","Lin Yuan ordered freshly squeezed watermelon juice as he waited for the middle-aged man.","He started to organize the fey storage box he had obtained from Jiao Hanzhong.","The leaf-shaped Diamond fey storage box held a fair amount of dimensional lifeform flesh, as well as some wild feys he had caught deep in the Endless Forest.","Hence, Lin Yuan planned on emptying Jiao Hanzhong’s fey storage box so it could be used to store the dimensional lifeforms.","Lin Yuan had never delved into Jiao Hanzhong’s fey storage box before. Now, he saw that Jiao Hanzhong had not gathered many resources.","He must have invested most of his resources on the Cold Snow Pine.","Almost immediately after, Lin Yuan realized he was wrong.","Jiao Hanzhong was truly a classy person!","The Diamond fey storage box had always been used to store supplies, but Jiao Hanzhong had managed to produce an atmosphere akin to Morbius’s Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Although it did not have the Spirit Lock spatial zone’s effects, its interior resembled a small garden."]},{"number":486,"title":"Chapter 486: Looking Forward to Working Together Again","paragraphs":["The fey box contained hundreds of flora and fauna that had obviously been carefully taken care of. The leaves were pruned to perfection, evidence of loving nurturing.","Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to check and found that many of the plants were of a rare species.","Unfortunately, they did not have much practical use as most of them were just edible ingredients.","There were 20 Platinum climbing roses that had grown flower buds.","The roses were a superior breed, and one stalk could probably sell for 10,000,000 Radiance dollars.","As long as there was a wall, regardless of the height, the climbing roses would be able to grow upward and bloom, creating a beautiful wall of flowers.","The scent from the large green petals acted as a natural mosquito and fly repellent but still attracted butterflies.","Jiao Hanzhong must have gone through a lot of trouble to collect all these plants because such rare plants could not be bought with money.","He must have spent decades collecting all of them.","The Class 5 Spirit Craftsman Hu Quan had already started to look for an architect to begin the Dome Guild Club’s construction.","The plants from Jiao Hanzhong’s fey storage box would be perfect as decoration in the guild club.","A small garden could also be built outside the mansion’s bamboo forest, where the rare plants could be cultivated.","Lin Yuan continued looking through the items inside of Jiao Hanzhong’s fey storage box. He discovered 50 source-type items inside.","Ignoring all the rare plants, this had to be the majority of Jiao Hanzhong’s wealth.","After Lin Yuan set aside the items he deemed more valuable and harder to source from the items he planned to trade for water world dimensional lifeform flesh.","When he was finally done organizing Jiao Hanzhong’s fey storage box, he took a big gulp of watermelon juice.","A few more gulps later, Lin Yuan caught sight of the middle-aged man walking toward him.","The middle-aged man waved at Lin Yuan when he saw him, and Lin Yuan hastily stood up to wave back.","Lin Yuan noticed a familiar figure next to the middle-aged man. It was the Indigo Azure Guard Captain he saw on the deserted island.","Lin Yuan waved in greeting to the Indigo Azure Guard Captain as well.","The Indigo Azure Guard Captain was shocked to see Lin Yuan.","The Indigo Azure Guard Captain did not expect the trading partner to be the same person who seemed to have a complicated relationship with the two Guard Envoys.","The middle-aged man took a seat opposite Lin Yuan and ordered peanuts. Lin Yuan handed Jiao Hanzhong’s fey storage box to him and asked, “Please take a look at the items inside. Do you think they’re worth trading for some water world dimensional lifeform flesh?”","Lin Yuan had already organized the items inside.","After he removed the items he wanted to keep for himself, he realized the remaining pile was rather scarce. Hence, he had added 200 Silver/Elite Usneas.","Lin Yuan had carefully calculated the value of the items and had deemed it more than enough.","When the middle-aged man was done looking through the items, the peanuts that he had popped into his mouth tumbled out.","The Indigo Azure Guard Captain frowned.","What’s wrong with him? How could he have asked me to introduce him to a girl? It would only ruin the poor girl’s life.","The middle-aged man passed the fey storage box to the Indigo Azure Guard Captain.","After the Indigo Azure Guard Captain was done looking through the fey storage box, his jaw dropped too.","If he had eaten peanuts like the middle-aged man, he would probably have choked.","One careful look was enough for the Indigo Azure Guard Captain to be certain that the items inside were definitely enough.","There were even Silver Usneas that could continuously reproduce. It was great value for money!","Although there were some risky items as well, if a hot item like the Usnea was priced according to Star Web prices, the masked youth would be able to sense his sincerity for sure.","The Indigo Azure Guard Captain handed the filled fey storage box as well as the extra dimensional lifeform flesh to Lin Yuan.","“I look forward to working together with you again!” said the Indigo Azure Guard Captain.","Lin Yuan did not reject the extra water world dimensional lifeform flesh, just like how the middle-aged man and the Indigo Azure Guard Captain did not reject the extra rare spiritual materials.","Lin Yuan set his worries at ease after the trade, as he would no longer need to be concerned over sourcing for water world dimensional lifeforms.","Lin Yuan had also saved a large sum of money.","The journey back was smooth.","Lin Yuan and Endless Summer were back on the deserted island.","The Mother of Bloodbath was almost done separating Nightmare VI.","When the Mother of Bloodbath saw Lin Yuan, it offered him all the resources it had gleaned from the Cold Snow Pine and the Dream-Eating Bat.","“Look at my handiwork. Haven’t I improved by leaps and bounds since the time I separated that old crow?”","Lin Yuan noticed it had been detail-orientated and separated out the different spiritual ingredients into different crystal bottles.","He gave the Mother of Bloodbath a thumbs up.","The Mother of Bloodbath could be a professional.","It proudly accepted Lin Yuan’s praise and stretched as it took out its phone.","“My phone is almost out of battery. Lend me your phone. I want to share the recipe for my grilled seafood with my online friends,” said the Mother of Bloodbath to Lin Yuan.","Despite his twitching eyebrows, Lin Yuan gave it his phone.","The Mother of Bloodbath had shared many of Liu Jie’s dishes, and its online friends had quickly become loyal fans.","However, only those who had tasted Liu Jie’s food would know the true joy behind it.","After becoming used to his delicious food, Lin Yuan could now feel that Spirit Food Pavilion’s food was not up to par.","There were just some dishes that Liu Jie was better at cooking."]},{"number":487,"title":"Chapter 487: Blooming Osmanthus","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan went into the ocean after giving the Mother of Bloodbath his phone.","He saw Liu Jie and Zhou Luo with Green Oxygen Sea Anemones over their mouths.","They were bundling the Floating Silver Strands the Ethereal Jellyfish had found into a ball.","Lin Yuan was about to help when Zhou Luo handed him the bundled Floating Silver Strands and pointed toward the surface of the water.","Both men floated up to the surface.","“Young Master, we’ve already formed a total of 47 bundles. Each bundle consists of a kilometer of Floating Silver Strands,” said Zhou Luo.","Lin Yuan gasped in spite of himself.","The Floating Silver Strands in his hands were already worth a small fortune.","Besides blocking spatial fluctuations, the Floating Silver could also be used to create the trunks of fey carriages or pad walls as an anti-spy mechanism.","Hu Quan could probably get numerous uses out of the Floating Silver Strands.","“You should get back to the shore, Young Master. You don’t need to go underwater. The three of us are more than capable of keeping up with the speed of your Ethereal Jellyfish. In fact, I find myself free a lot of the time,” said Zhou Luo ruefully.","Lin Yuan took into account Zhou Luo’s words and expression.","His mind immediately thought of the possibility that Liu Jie and Listen were up to another one of their strange competitions.","Since he was of no help underwater, Lin Yuan returned to the island.","He requested Liu Jie’s Insect Queen to produce a Hurricane Owlet Moth so he could dry his clothes and proceeded to return to his test.","He decided to enter the Spirit Lock spatial zone again as some time had passed, and he wanted to check if the Source Sand had changed in any way after absorbing the Mountain-Containing Embryo.","Zhou Luo dove underwater once again.","The more time Zhou Luo spent with Lin Yuan, the more he noticed the differences between Lin Yuan and other influential young masters.","Lin Yuan did not carry himself with their overwhelming arrogance.","Zhou Luo could distinctly feel the closeness and graciousness Lin Yuan extended to himself and others.","Meanwhile, Lin Yuan had realized a fragrance had arisen in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. It was a familiar scent because it was very similar to that of the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassias at the Radiant Moon Palace entrance.","However, it was heavier than the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia’s perfume.","The fragrance carried a subtle hint of bitterness.","When he had been strengthening Gray yesterday, Lin Yuan had noticed the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus, which had lost its tree core half a year ago, was growing a smattering of small flower buds.","Lin Yuan had been too focused on Gray yesterday and had not paid much attention to the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus’s changes.","Lin Yuan remembered that although the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus had demonstrated signs of recovering from its injuries before, it had never produced flower buds.","Yet, small scarlet flowers had bloomed all over the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus’s branches now.","The flowers were flooding the branches, almost completely obscuring the leaves.","Occasionally, some of the flowers would fall, landing on the white Pure Land of Bliss.","It resembled a rain of flowers and created the same ambiance of elegant beauty.","When the Pure Land of Bliss was absorbing the World Grace yesterday, it must have benefited the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus on top of it as well. If the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus received an unexpected boost, what about the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree?","Lin Yuan scanned the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree next to the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus and noticed that the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree’s branch that housed Chimey’s nest had grown a new branch.","Although the new branch did not increase the size of Chimey’s nest, it did make the nest appear more lustrous.","Lin Yuan could vaguely feel that the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree was sending gold energy to the nest at a slightly faster speed than before.","Such an increase was not noticeable if not scrutinized.","The Wind Speed Rapid Antelope Lin Yuan had put in charge was currently manipulating the wind into forming a vortex.","It was hard at work gathering the scarlet flowers that had fallen on the Pure Land of Bliss.","When the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope sensed Lin Yuan entering the Spirit Lock spatial zone, it bolted over to him and hopped around in delight. It was more affectionate than usual.","The Wind Speed Rapid Antelope had a different relationship with Lin Yuan than the other non-contracted feys he was nurturing.","The Wind Speed Rapid Antelope had seen for itself how Lin Yuan had swooped down and saved it from tipping over the cliff of death.","Lin Yuan had provided it with a lovely place to stay.","Thus, the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope felt as much gratitude and affection toward Lin Yuan as Chimey and Genius.","Lin Yuan stroked the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope’s small head.","Lin Yuan looked at the seven Bronze/Legend Elemental Shellfish he had placed around the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Other than those that had been absorbed by the Floating Island Whale and the Twin Red Pagoda, the rest of the Elemental Shellfish had produced elemental pearls.","The Wind Speed Rapid Antelope had gathered and placed them all neatly in a pile.","Lin Yuan marched over to the elemental pearls and took out the Celestine Elemental Shellfish’s heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearl. He then handed it to the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope.","Previously, Lin Yuan had never thought of nurturing the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope, which was why he had never invested resources into it.","But now, Lin Yuan had decided to nurture it. Although the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope did not have a good foundation, Lin Yuan did not despise it in the least.","The fallen flowers of the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus were precious.","The Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus flowers could be used as a rejuvenating supplement, had detoxing properties, and could suppress toxins in the body.","Although it did not have the same effects as the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia’s flowers, which had the Marrow Cleansing ability that improved the body’s genetic model, the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus’s flowers were still a premium edible ingredient.","The manor’s maple syrup consumed during breakfast could be replaced with the nectar of the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus’s flowers.","Lin Yuan noted the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope’s thoughtfulness.","The Wind Speed Rapid Antelope was a fey that could spiritually transform elemental energy, making it able to experience the pure blustering wind energy inside the elemental pearl.","The Wind Speed Rapid Antelope carefully nudged Lin Yuan’s hand, lowered its head, and swiveled its neck."]},{"number":488,"title":"Chapter 488: Closer to the Truth","paragraphs":["The Wind Speed Rapid Antelope’s action seemed to be hinting Lin Yuan help it wear the wind-elemental pearl on its neck.","Lin Yuan smiled and crushed the wind element heavenly-maiden-grade pearl before signaling for the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope to eat it.","The Wind Speed Rapid Antelope’s current intelligence was just like the reliant pets that people had in Lin Yuan’s previous life. As long as you take some action, they would be able to understand the meaning of your action. If Lin Yuan spoke to the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope with words, it still couldn’t understand.","Nonetheless, Lin Yuan spoke to the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope like how he spoke to Genius and Chimey. “Little fellow, with your current body, you will need to use one elemental pearl every three days. From now on, I will feed you one pearl every three days.”","The Wind Speed Rapid Antelope saw Lin Yuan crushing the nice pearl and passing it over with his palm. It didn’t understand why Lin Yuan was so wasteful and allowed it to eat such a great thing. However, the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope still delightfully licked all the pearl powder.","Lin Yuan shook his head helplessly. Is this little fellow afraid that the elemental pearl powder will go to waste, or is it washing my hand?! Isn’t this a little too clean!?","Since the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope wasn’t powerful innately and didn’t receive nurturing when it was young, Lin Yuan decided to rely on resources to develop the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope.","Such a priceless treasure was something Lin Yuan could obtain effortlessly. However, it was hard to find another Wind Speed Rapid Antelope that was so considerate and sensible. It was also able to use its instincts to tidy up the Spirit Lock spatial zone so orderly.","Even if he could find another one, Lin Yuan felt that it would never be as fateful as this little fellow here.","With the pleasant surprise of the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus blooming flowers, Lin Yuan went closer to observe the Cinnabar Osmanthus Haworthia that was living on the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus.","After taking a look, Lin Yuan realized that the Cinnabar Osmanthus Haworthia had already progressed from Gold VIII to Gold X. Furthermore, it grew long and thin tassels.","When Lin Yuan saw the tassels, he knew that it was an indication that the Cinnabar Osmanthus Haworthia was going to bear fruit.","Lin Yuan was truly looking forward to the Cinnabar Osmanthus Haworthia’s fruit. Once the fruit was ripe, it would allow Lin Yuan to enhance his spiritual energy. It was something that he never dared to meddle with.","Even though the enhancement wouldn’t be much, it could allow Lin Yuan to pick another fey without thinking about the limits of his spiritual energy, allowing him to have more choices.","After everything was settled, Lin Yuan made the Source Sand transform it into its sand form.","Lin Yuan realized that the Mountain-Containing Embryo was indeed smaller than before. However, the Source Sand was still in its original state and had yet to upgrade from Fantasy I to Fantasy II.","Nevertheless, Lin Yuan could obviously feel the Source Sand’s extreme transformation.","Previously, when the Source Sand was split in two, it would be to split up the original body and the sand that it produced by using the ground. But now, the Source Sand could produce a kind of sand that was high in density.","The high-density sand might not be superior in control as compared to the Source Sand itself, but Lin Yuan had better control over it than the Source Sand’s produced sand.","The amount of high-density sand might not be much, but it was totally enough to envelop Lin Yuan within a three-meter radius.","This certainly gave Lin Yuan a great and pleasant surprise for such a transformation to happen after the Source Sand absorbed the Mountain-Containing Embryo.","Lin Yuan planned to give this high-density sand the name Close Guard Sand.","The Close Guard Sand’s existence greatly improved Lin Yuan’s close-range defense and offense.","Lin Yuan was now able to feel the horrific increase in strength when one nurtured a fey with superior resources.","Lin Yuan was rejoicing that he hadn’t found another spiritual ingredient to nurture the Fantasy Breed Source Sand’s quality.","Lin Yuan took one piece of earth-elemental pearl and tossed it into the Source Sand. The Source Sand immediately transported the earth-elemental pearl to the side of the Mountain-Containing Embryo before circulating the sand. It made the earth-elemental pearl constantly rub and grind against the Mountain-Containing Embryo.","Lin Yuan suddenly felt that the Source Sand’s soul was probably... an old man? With the muddled intelligence it had at Gold/Fantasy, it already knew to rotate balls[1].","What would happen once it continued to develop?","Lin Yuan had yet to give the Source Sand a name, but since he knew that the Source Sand liked to rotate balls, why not call it Bunchy.","Lin Yuan wanted to make use of the boundless earth-elemental energy from the heavenly-maiden-grade earth-elemental pearl to temper the Source Sand’s elemental body.","The sand element was a variant of the earth element, and they were of the same source.","The Source Sand was an elemental source-type lifeform. Therefore, it had great benefits when being tempered by such pure earth-elemental energy. It would also help the Source Sand to increase its grade.","Upon sensing the Source Sand’s absorption speed, Lin Yuan speculated that the Source Sand would need to use around two heavenly-maiden-grade earth-elemental pearls per day. In other words, it would need 60 pearls in one month and 720 pearls in one year.","Such a consumption speed was something that few could afford. Even if they could afford it, how many would be willing to pour in such resources to their feys?","Nurturing feys was a process of using resources to roll a snowball. The ratio of investment and return wasn’t equal. However, it was obviously not realistic if the owner wanted the fey to evolve without any investment.","This was also why people with a strong foundation could nurture powerful feys with the prerequisite of having talent.","Naturally, Lin Yuan was more than willing to use any available resources when nurturing a fey.","Morbius was Lin Yuan’s contracted fey, and Morbius’ exclusive skill, Spirit Lock spatial zone, allowed Lin Yuan to have the confidence to carry out such nurturing processes.","As compared to the consumption of the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, the production of the elemental pearls was more than enough.","Lin Yuan then started to carry out the routine enhancement of Silver Usneas in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","This method he used to increase his spirit qi professional rank—consuming his spirit qi when enhancing feys—was simply too difficult!","After exiting the Spirit Lock spatial zone, Lin Yuan immediately felt the Ethereal Jellyfish sending a spirit wave toward him.","Lin Yuan’s eyes immediately widened. He knew that the secret hidden in the coastal sea had finally been revealed.","[1] Similar to the rotation of Baoding balls in the hand"]},{"number":489,"title":"Chapter 489: Got Sucked In","paragraphs":["Once Lin Yuan got out of the tent, he saw Listen sitting with drenched clothes while he constantly sent rations into his mouth.","Obviously, Listen had already used all of his stamina when trying to collect the Floating Silver Strands under the sea. From the looks of it, the winner and loser between Listen and Liu Jie had already been decided.","Lin Yuan walked beside Listen, took a bag of fresh fruits out of the button-shaped fey storage box, and asked, “What kind of bet did you make with Brother Liu this time?”","Listen responded with a bitter face, “It is the pulp of the Platinum Bitter Gourd. Originally, we were only betting on this, but I added on another condition that we cannot drink water three hours after finishing it.”","Lin Yuan reached out and patted on Listen’s shoulder while revealing a sympathetic expression.","It was fine to eat a Platinum Bitter Gourd; one would simply have a taste of bitterness that was enough to break the gallbladder. If the victim was to drink a few cups of sweet fruit juices or the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus’ nectar, it would quickly disperse the bitterness that was so extreme that it would make one think of death. However, not drinking water for three hours after eating the Bitter Gourd was simply too ridiculous! What kind of immortal condition was that!?","What difference was there to begging to play three days and three nights with a girlfriend? The extreme bitterness wasn’t something that would disperse just by enduring for a moment. Wouldn’t Listen have to experience the bitterness constantly for three hours?","Even Lin Yuan, who had suffered for the first half of his life, wouldn’t dare to imagine this sensation.","Lin Yuan then saw the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer holding a mobile phone each and fiddling with it.","These two Suzerain/Myth feys had already reached the extreme state of ‘hand on the phone and phone on the hand’.","However, the Mother of Bloodbath was using her mobile phone to share the delicacies that Liu Jie made in the foodie group, attracting some praise.","As for Endless Summer, it was in all sorts of accessory groups and being frenziedly promoted with all sorts of products.","Lin Yuan felt it was truly great. As long as Endless Summer didn’t dye her hair, anything was good.","When the Mother of Bloodbath saw Lin Yuan exiting the tent, she pursed her lips. Is there anyone more homebody than Lin Yuan in this world? We finally came to the sea, yet he is actually not enjoying the scenery and the sea breeze!","People who are always on Star Web are called fat homebodies! But apart from drinking less soft drinks, is there a difference between a skinny homebody and a fat homebody?","The Mother of Bloodbath stood up and was preparing to ask Lin Yuan to move around this barren island before going toward the sea to catch some crabs.","Immediately after, the Mother of Bloodbath saw Lin Yuan suddenly jumping into the sea.","As such, the Mother of Bloodbath could only sit back down and continue to play with her phone. However, she wasn’t chatting in the foodie group this time. She opened up the search engine and started searching: A skinny homebody suddenly loves sports and took the initiative to swim? What is going on?","The top search result came out with an answer: The skinny homebody is definitely diving underwater to see some babes. Anyone who is asking such a silly question definitely needs some nourishment for the brain!","Just as the Mother of Bloodbath was getting angry, she thought of the words, ‘see some babes’.","Liu Jie and Zhou Luo are naturally not babes! But their looks are considered outstanding. So what is going on when a skinny homebody dives into the sea to see handsome men?","The Mother of Bloodbath suddenly felt that the humans of the world were very hard to understand! Male spiders are easier to understand! But male spiders don’t know how to cook, so pass!","When Lin Yuan dove into the sea, he saw that Liu Jie was still standing on the seabed and constantly wrapping up the Floating Silver Strands. As for Zhou Luo, he was commanding the Lava Dragon Lizard to smash an underwater hill that was obviously many times harder than the other seabed rocks.","Lin Yuan came nearer and realized that the effects of the smashing from the Lava Dragon Lizard weren’t very significant. He immediately summoned Red Thorn and asked it to produce a huge group of brutal vine ramets.","The brutal vine ramets used the sharp thorns on the vines to constantly grind down the underwater hill.","After half an hour of the brutal vine ramets’ grinding and the Lava Dragon Lizard’s smashing, the final piece of Floating Silver Strand that was under the hill was removed.","Just as Liu Jie pulled out the last strand of the Floating Silver, the spatial zone within the sea suddenly vibrated violently. It was so violent that a giant opening was ripped open.","The giant opening immediately sucked Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, Zhou Luo, Red Thorn, and the Lava Dragon Lizard inside.","Due to the loss of the first layer of defense of the Spatial Magnets, and the second layer of defense of the Floating Silver Strands, once Lin Yuan and the others were sucked inside, a giant dimensional rift opened on the surface of the sea.","Immediately after, an unforeseen incident took place within the giant dimensional rift, causing it to shake.","The dark red giant rift suddenly gushed out with violent spatial energy. The spatial energy felt as though it was attempting to pull and make the dimensional rift opening even bigger.","As soon as Lin Yuan’s group vanished and when the dimensional rift suddenly appeared, the Mother of Bloodbath flashed and appeared where Lin Yuan had vanished.","The Mother of Bloodbath only saw the Ethereal Jellyfish trying to fiddle with the spatial zone with its soft tentacles as though it wanted to enter the dimensional rift that had a layer of restriction.","Surprisingly, once the soft tentacles touched the restriction, they were sliced into dust by the dimensional rift. However, the Ethereal Jellyfish seemed like it didn’t feel any pain and wanted to risk its life by squeezing inside.","The Mother of Bloodbath stopped the Ethereal Jellyfish and activated the fresh Blood Law. But even with all the blood energy in its hands, it hesitated to use it against the dimensional rift with the layer of restriction.","Endless Summer had an abnormally unpleasant expression. “Why is there a controlled pinnacle Class 3 water world dimensional rift here?","“What happened to the spatial zone within the water world dimensional rift? It actually upgraded the class of the dimensional rift.”","The Mother of Bloodbath that normally didn’t have any expression was now revealing a face of panic, helplessness, and self-blame.","The Mother of Bloodbath hugged the Ethereal Jellyfish and couldn’t help recalling how that youth had done everything he could during the World Cleansing.","He had allowed it, which had given up on enduring the World Cleansing during the Myth II upgrade, to transform into its human form.","It was Lin Yuan Path Protector, but it had actually lost the vigilance that it should have in this dangerous situation.","When outside, it should constantly be following Lin Yuan and following Lin Yuan under the sea. If it had been under the sea with Lin Yuan when the dimensional rift suddenly opened, it would have been able to react immediately. Lin Yuan wouldn’t have been sucked into the dimensional rift."]},{"number":490,"title":"Chapter 490: The Cold Moon in the Sky","paragraphs":["When a dimensional rift evolved, it was equivalent to sealing off the original dimensional space. This formed an independent spatial environment that was constantly ripping and expanding.","Even if the Mother of Bloodbath exerted all of its strength, it would not be able to tear open a dimensional rift that was in the process of evolving.","Moreover, even if someone had the ability to tear such a dimensional rift open, the Mother of Bloodbath would desperately rush to stop that person.","If a dimensional rift was torn open during the process of evolution, then its internal spatial energy would dissolve into chaos and collapse.","At that time, Lin Yuan would be ripped into pieces, destined to have no chance of survival.","Now, the Mother of Bloodbath held Lin Yuan’s Ethereal Jellyfish in its arms; they were the only thing with which it could determine Lin Yuan’s life and death.","Although the Mother of Bloodbath had suppressed its panic, the self-reproach written on its face was unabated.","It took to the air directly and returned to the deserted island, taking out the cell phone that it had previously received from Lin Yuan.","Despite being a Myth Breed fey, the hand with which the Mother of Bloodbath held Lin Yuan’s cell phone still trembled.","It had been alive for a long time. Yet, all the traces previously left by life paled in comparison to those left in this half a year.","Scenes of the times it had spent with Lin Yuan, from their very first meeting, flashed in its mind.","It would not abandon him now!","In the end, its entire life was integrated into the Return from Faraway mansion. The mansion had long been regarded by the Mother of Bloodbath as its home.","Spider feys had always been cruel, but once these cold-blooded feys were certain about something, they tended to be more sincere.","The Mother of Bloodbath forced itself not to let its thoughts wander any longer and lowered its head. Its eyes rested on the cell phone in its hands.","It took a deep breath and dialed a number on Lin Yuan’s cell phone.","It understood that it could not do anything now.","However, that person might have had some idea.","At Leaning Moon Mountain, where gulls and herons circled as butterflies fluttered...","The Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia gave off an elegant osmanthus fragrance, which permeated the air in front of the Radiant Moon Palace.","Today, there was something different about the Radiant Moon Palace—four tea attendants stood at its entrance.","Although their expressions were unusually serious, they revealed a hint of expectation.","Mystic Moon was standing beside the table with a jade pumpkin teapot in his hand within the inner palace.","His gaze was on the Moon Shadow Walkway within the inner palace.","The walkway led inwards to the Moon Empress’ bedchamber.","At this time, all of the Suzerain lotus flower feys in the inner palace’s lotus pond spouted haze.","This made the inner palace look like a fairyland shrouded in sunlight.","In the pond, the peony-like tails of a few Spirit-Siphon Goldfish, which had evolved from the Platinum to the Diamond grade at some point in time, occasionally surfaced.","Ripples emerged on the surface of the haze-shrouded lotus pond.","At that moment, Mystic Moon’s thoughts were obviously not on the jade pumpkin teapot in his hand.","Thus, as he was pouring tea from the teapot, he accidentally spilled some on the table. He hurriedly placed the teapot on the table before using a piece of cloth to wipe away the water stains.","Compared to the expressions of the four tea attendants standing at the entrance of the inner palace, the worry in Mystic Moon’s eyes was greater.","He could not help but mutter softly, “This is the Moon Empress’ third time reaching this Myth grade in the past few years. Not only did she fail in her last two attempts, but she also suffered heavy losses.","“I really hope that the Moon Empress will come out unscathed this time.”","At that moment, the cell phone that the Moon Empress had previously placed on the table suddenly began to ring.","Mystic Moon did not react immediately.","The Moon Empress’ cell phone seldom rang. Most of her calls came from Lin Yuan.","However, the Moon Empress had recently suggested that the Radiance Hundred Sequence should be changed.","Hence, the chance that it was the Radiance Sacred Hall contacting the Moon Empress had also increased.","Although Mystic Moon was one of the Moon Empress’ two Moon Envoys, he would not directly respond to her calls on her behalf.","That would be overstepping his authority.","Yet, right after the cell phone had stopped ringing, it sounded again, three times in a row.","It seemed that there was an urgent matter at hand.","Mystic Moon glanced at the cell phone and realized that it was Lin Yuan who had called.","He could not help frowning slightly. These three consecutive calls were rather pressing.","Could Lin Yuan have encountered something urgent?","The Moon Empress was currently in seclusion. If Lin Yuan really required urgent assistance, Mystic Moon himself could take care of the matter.","With that in mind, Mystic Moon picked up the phone.","Upon answering the call, he heard a strange female voice on the other end instead of Lin Yuan’s familiar one.","After hearing what the speaker had to say, Mystic Moon’s face darkened.","In an instant, a violent spiritual fluctuation spiraled from Mystic Moon’s body.","At the same time, magnificent bright silver patterns appeared on his forehead, cheeks, and palms. His pupils also turned dark silver.","Mystic Moon’s usually gentle voice acquired an edge of coldness and worry.","“Wait for me to inform the Moon Empress!”","Having said that, Mystic Moon spared a glance at the Moon Shadow Walkway of the inner palace.","He gnashed his teeth, grabbed the cell phone that he had yet to hang up, and headed towards the walkway.","Just then, in the bedchamber of the Moon Shadow Walkway, the Moon Empress’ originally shut eyes suddenly opened.","In the instant that the Moon Empress’ eyes opened, her demeanor was entirely transformed.","Her previous bearing was comparable to a bright moon shining diagonally across a large river, unparalleled in elegance and destined to be at the peak.","Now, all of her sharpness and nobility disappeared instantaneously, the bright moon reduced to a wisp of soft, gentle moonlight.","The hint of a smile hovered on the Moon Empress’ lips.","But right after that, her eyebrows knitted tightly together.","Abruptly, she could no longer sense the existence of the Extreme Token that she had given to Lin Yuan.","At that moment, she heard Mystic Moon’s voice at her door.","“Moon Empress, I have an important matter to report. It is regarding the Young Lord, so I had no choice but to bother you.”","Upon hearing Mystic Moon’s words, the Moon Empress immediately picked up the little rabbit beside her that was nibbling its carrot incessantly.","In a flash, she left her bedchamber.","When the Moon Empress appeared before Mystic Moon, he sensed her body’s condition and instantly knew that she had really broken through the boundary.","Now, she was already of a higher rank than an S-rank spirit qi professional.","Yet, Mystic Moon could not utter even a single congratulatory phrase to her.","He handed over the cell phone that was still on the line to the Moon Empress.","After picking up the call, the Moon Empress’ initially cold expression became impassive and calm in less than a moment.","Soon after, countless experts and ordinary people from the Radiance Federation raised their heads and looked toward the sky.","At that moment, the sky had suddenly transformed!","It had originally been midday, with the sun slanting slightly to the west.","In the blink of an eye, the white day had turned into black night, the scorching sun into a bright moon.","It was just that the moonlight radiating from the moon at that moment appeared unusually cold!"]},{"number":491,"title":"Chapter 491: Day Ends, Blood-Tinted Moon","paragraphs":["The Moon Empress was listening to the voice on the other end of the call when she heard the Mother of Bloodbath say that Lin Yuan had been sucked into a Class 3 dimensional rift outside of Indigo Azure City.","Moreover, it was not known what had gone wrong with this dimensional rift that even allowed it to evolve.","A smile suddenly blossomed on the Moon Empress’ originally emotionless face.","This smile was like an epiphyllum flower, bringing an instant of vividness.","Just as the Moon Empress smiled, the bright moon that had replaced the scorching sun and shed cold moonlight was abruptly stained with blood.","As the moon became tinted, its initial coldness transformed into murderous intent boiling in the horizon.","At that moment, within the Radiance Federation, the pupils of the experts looking at the horizon constricted at the same time.","As for the numerous ordinary people gazing at the sky, dust-laden memories were suddenly uncovered.","One day, ten years ago, a blood-stained moon had also hung in the sky from dusk to dawn.","Mystic Moon noticed that the Moon Empress’ expression revealed her shock.","Within her heart, the Moon Empress’ murderous intent and worry for the Young Lord were so thick that she laughed in her fury.","Yet, Mystic Moon’s own rage and worry were just as intense as the Moon Empress’.","Although Lin Yuan was the Moon Empress’ disciple and did not share blood ties with her, their master-disciple relationship meant that he could be considered her only heir.","Naturally, the Moon Empress regarded him as a treasure.","While she always displayed her might in her actions, she would also carefully consider how the most minute of details might affect the Young Lord’s feelings.","Even if Mystic Moon was not as meticulous as the Moon Empress in his treatment of Lin Yuan, just the sound of Lin Yuan calling him ‘Uncle Mystic’ was enough for Mystic Moon to also treat Lin Yuan as his only descendant.","It was just that the more Mystic Moon cared for Lin Yuan, the more he worried now.","When a dimensional rift was evolving, even if the Moon Empress had now reached that level, she could only destroy it. She still could not change the truth of this world’s spatial dimension laws or tear the dimensional rift open to save the Young Lord within it.","It could be said that the only chance of surviving after being sucked into a dimensional rift was to safely spend a period of time inside.","Only when the dimensional rift had evolved and was reopened did the people inside have an opportunity to escape it.","Upon seeing that the Moon Empress had hung up the phone, Mystic Moon immediately asked,","“Moon Empress, in the process of denying its evolution, the Class 3 water world dimensional rift that was originally controlled will recover its initial peak strength of Class 3. The Young Lord—”","Before Mystic Moon could finish his sentence, the Moon Empress’ cold voice interrupted him.","“Follow This Empress to the entrance of that evolving dimensional rift, and wait for This Empress’ disciple to return.”","How could the Moon Empress not know that when a controlled dimensional rift was evolving, it would recover the strength that it had possessed before being controlled?","However, the Moon Empress remained completely unperturbed by such danger.","She had paid attention to Black’s identity every step of the way.","Lin Yuan had many secrets and also many capabilities.","Even without the aid of the Extreme Token that she had given him, the Moon Empress believed that Lin Yuan would be able to find a way to survive in the pinnacle Class 3 water world dimensional rift.","It was just that during the active period of such a dimensional rift, Lin Yuan had stumbled upon a big secret hidden in Indigo Azure City’s coastal sea.","It was likely that the real danger that Lin Yuan had to face lay not in the dimensional lifeforms within the dimensional rift but in the enemy who was plotting everything in secret.","The Moon Empress’ face became increasingly shrouded in worry.","If she were to have planned all of this in secret, would she have allowed the pinnacle Class 3 water world dimensional rift to only have evolved one grade?","For the first time, a sense of powerlessness surged in the Moon Empress’ heart, causing her to immediately clench her fist.","This helplessness did not stem from her strength itself. She could sublimate mountains and oceans into states beyond the gaseous, liquid, and solid ones when the moonlight boiled.","She could skyrocket the grades and qualities of fey. What bothered her was that she could not change the rules governing space to directly rescue her disciple.","It was comparable to how a dead person could not come back to life.","Hence, the Moon Empress could only wait hopefully for her disciple to walk out of that evolving dimensional rift alive.","She could only wait, and only waiting remained.","Then, the Moon Empress’ pleasing pupils froze over with ice.","Standing in the Moon Shadow Walkway, she gazed far into the distance.","“The tree wishes for quiet, but the wind is unceasing. Now, this unceasing wind blows on This Empress’ disciple.”","The small rabbit in the Moon Empress’ arms reluctantly stopped gnawing on its carrot and put it away.","At this moment, its ears, which were always drooping, also stood up, shaking slightly.","An extreme purple hue rose in its eyes.","...","In a dark room within the Spirit Guards Headquarters, a black-robed and black-veiled woman was reading the letters in her hands.","After reading each letter, she would either lay it down on her left or roll up one of its corners and lay it down on her right.","At that moment, the woman’s gaze grew suddenly severe.","After setting down the letter that she was currently reading, she arrived before the Spirit Guards’ Chief Guard Pavilion in a flash.","Upon the black-robed woman’s sudden appearance, the two old men who had initially been standing before the pavilion hurriedly bowed and said, “We wish you immense peace, Chief Guard!”","After speaking, one of the old men bowed again and continued. “Night Chief Guard, look at where the Moon Empress is in the sky...”","The other old man then quickly added, “Night Chief Guard, why don’t you go and persuade...”","The black-robed, black-veiled woman did not acknowledge the old men’s words but turned her gaze to the sky.","“The clouds span ten thousand miles, the mountains form thousands of piles, the day is at its end, and the moon is tinted with blood.”","Having said that, the Spirit Guards’ Night Chief Guard picked the most alluring flower blooming on a peony in front of the Chief Guard Pavilion and flung it toward the horizon.","Beneath the blood-colored moonlight, this most beautiful peony flower appeared unusually delicate, as if soaked with blood.","The Night Chief Guard gazed intently at the blood-tinted moon on the horizon.","She realized that what had initially been one blood-stained moon were now two.","Her expression was hidden behind her black veil, but a sigh escaped from her lips.","“The moonlight blooms with a blood luster, and the first quarter and third quarter moon divide the moon.","“It’s too late to persuade her.”","After a while, the Night Chief Guard looked directly at the two old men by her side and said, “My left and right palm attendants, you do not need to concern yourself with this matter. After settling the Guard Envoy’s affairs, one of you will go north and the other south, one to Hearthstone City and the other to Cold Frost City to preside over them.”","Upon hearing the Night Chief Guard’s words, the two old men immediately bowed and retreated to follow her orders."]},{"number":492,"title":"Chapter 492: The Rekindled Radiant Flame","paragraphs":["The Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer were standing firmly at the entrance of this evolving dimensional rift.","After hanging up on the phone, the Mother of Bloodbath looked at the blood moon and pursed its lips. The thought of becoming strong in its mind had never been as strong as it was at this moment because it could only protect better when it was strong enough. At the same time, the Mother of Bloodbath understood that as a Path Protector, it must always be vigilant.","Listen, who was standing beside the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer, was looking at the evolving dimensional rift’s entrance with obvious concern on his face.","While he had sworn with the Willpower Rune to become Lin Yuan’s servant, he had also regarded his life as a bargaining chip for allegiance and as part of the oath.","In this case, Lin Yuan wouldn’t be affected if Listen died. At most, Lin Yuan would have only lost a servant, but it would be completely different if Lin Yuan died. Listen would also die.","However, Listen’s concern was not just for himself. Rather, he sincerely hoped that Lin Yuan, the youth who had saved him and given him a new lease of life, could get through it and survive.","...","An opening suddenly formed in the water world dimensional rift. Three figures, a huge two-headed lizard, and a strange plant were spat out.","After being spat out, Lin Yuan immediately looked at the surroundings. After a clear look at the surroundings, he subconsciously let the amber-button-shaped Source Sand at his sleeve turn into a wisp of fine sand and burrow in the rock layer beneath his feet. But immediately after, he furrowed even more.","When Liu Jie had pulled out the last Floating Silver Strand, and the entrance to the dimensional rift appeared abruptly, even though it was too late for Lin Yuan to do anything, he was quick-witted.","He knew that the 500 Spatial Magnets and so many Floating Silver Strands had been invested in hiding the dimensional rift that had suddenly appeared.","Someone had secretly set up the entrance of the dimensional rift. The fact that the entrance was in the sea showed that this dimensional rift that had suddenly appeared was a water world dimensional rift.","However, the surroundings now left Lin Yuan in disbelief. It was very humid inside the water world dimensional rift, and the air was filled with a lot of salty water vapor, but it was not a world completely submerged in the water.","As far as the eye could see, there was not even a single water world dimensional lifeform in the surrounding. Without the seawater, it would even be a challenge for such soft-bodied lifeforms that mostly had tentacles, like the water world dimensional lifeforms, to move.","In this environment without water, the high-grade water world dimensional lifeforms might be able to rely on a large amount of water vapor in the air to create a small water region to survive. However, the low-grade ones would undoubtedly die without water.","At that moment, Lin Yuan suddenly thought of the spatial fluctuations he and the Mother of Bloodbath had seen in the sea that had poured out a lot of water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh, including the Platinum water world dimensional lifeforms’ flesh.","The Platinum water world dimensional lifeforms naturally wouldn’t die out of thin air, nor would they chop themselves into pieces after death.","Coupled with the fact that this dimensional rift was completely different from the normal water world, it meant that there must be a huge problem.","As Lin Yuan allowed the Source Sand to turn into sand grains and burrow into the dry sea bed under his feet to create a large amount of sand, Liu Jie also immediately let the Insect Queen turned into an insect base on the spot, producing a large amount of Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects.","He looked at the surroundings and the entrance to the dimensional rift that had been sealed up behind him before looking at Lin Yuan and saying in a deep voice, “Lin Yuan, based on the strength of the dimensional fluctuations of this dimensional rift entrance, it should at least be a Class 3 dimensional rift.”","After saying that, Liu Jie looked at the layer of rampant dimensional energy and added, “And this is at least a Class 3 dimensional rift that is still evolving.”","Liu Jie’s words had expressed the seriousness of this matter. Lin Yuan knew that if the Class 3 water world dimensional rift evolved, it would become a Class 4 water world dimensional rift.","It was also now the active period of the dimensional rift, in which large variables appeared all of a sudden.","A Class 4 dimensional rift had Class 6 dimensional lifeforms that were akin to Suzerain feys. If it evolved to Class 5 by a freak combination of factors due to the active period, Class 7 dimensional lifeforms that were akin to Myth Breed feys might appear.","During the active period of the dimensional rift, there would be far more dimensional lifeforms than usual. If a lot of water world dimensional lifeforms that were akin to Myth Breed feys appeared, Indigo Azure City, which was extremely close to this place, would turn into a ruin that would be destroyed under the sea in a matter of moments.","Lin Yuan knew that there was only one possibility for the dimensional rift to evolve. There were more source-type items than usual at the hub of this water world dimensional rifts that connected to the water world.","He had encountered such a situation previously when training in the abyss dimensional rift. At that time, he hadn’t been directly involved. The Mother of Bloodbath had stepped in and solved the problem perfectly.","But now, only Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, and Zhou Luo could handle this matter.","When the dimensional rift evolved, as long as Lin Yuan hid at his current location, which was the entrance to the dimensional rift, it would be the safest way to escape after the dimensional rift evolved.","In order not to keep the potential enemies inside the rift from discovering him, Lin Yuan could also let the Source Sand precipitate numerous ferromanganese chain blades and let them combine into a spacious and airtight space. He, Liu Jie, and Zhou Luo would hide inside. Then the Source Sand would sink this confined space underground to hide them to the greatest extent.","However, Lin Yuan was not going to do so, just like how he had chosen to die to protect Millstone Town and resist the demons with everyone in the controlled Class 3 abyss dimensional rift.","This time, he also wanted to try to stop the evolution of this Class 3 water world dimensional rift beneath him. He still had the trump card his Master had given him, so even if he met a powerful enemy, he could still stand a chance.","Liu Jie shifted his gaze to Liu Jie and Zhou Luo and said in a deep voice, “Big Brother Liu, Zhou Luo, I want to go to the hub to stop the evolution of this dimensional rift.”","Lin Yuan did not speak very loudly, but it seemed to ignite a radiant flame in this humid air."]},{"number":493,"title":"Chapter 493: Blanket Search","paragraphs":["The glowing flames started as subdued embers in the humid air.","However, once Lin Yuan spoke, Liu Jie’s hesitant expression vanished. The brilliant glowing flames illuminated his eyes.","As a member of the Radiance Hundred, he was definitely going to put all his attention toward preventing the possible disaster from occurring outside Indigo Azure City.","But, he was also Lin Yuan’s retainer knight.","Liu Jie had long since dedicated himself to Lin Yuan, and every decision Liu Jie made received Lin Yuan’s stamp of approval.","Liu Jie’s undying faith stoked the already radiant light in his eyes.","When Zhou Luo heard Lin Yuan’s opinion, he mentally started to prepare for battle.","The resolution in Lin Yuan’s eyes spurred Zhou Luo on.","The dim flame was but a small bright spot. It took seed in the corner of Zhou Luo’s heart.","The longer he observed the surroundings, the more Lin Yuan felt that stopping the Class 3 water world’s evolution was going to be challenging.","The way Lin Yuan saw it, the largest obstacle was locating the dimensional hub connected to the dimensional rift.","Unfortunately, the Ethereal Jellyfish had not been sucked into the dimensional rift.","Liu Jie and Zhou Luo were not attuned to sensing spatial-type source lifeforms that could cause spatial fluctuations.","Thus, they had to go back to basics and start combing the area.","Liu Jie’s Insect Queen’s flying insects were the most suitable to conduct the search.","“Big Brother Liu, you take charge of the search. We have to find the dimensional hub’s location,” said Lin Yuan to Liu Jie.","Liu Jie started to pump spirit qi toward the Insect Queen, which had already transformed into an insect colony.","With Liu Jie injecting such a large amount of spirit qi into it, the Insect Queen’s valves inflated instantly.","The enormous amount of liquified energy surged through the valves quickly. The high-intensity vibrations changed the liquefied energy into sticky insect protein.","The insect protein was continuously produced and recirculated back into the Insect Queen’s body through the valves.","The vigorous vibrations caused the Insect Queen’s three-meter-tall insect colony to expand.","The entrance of the colony proceeded to spit out almost 200 Hurricane Owlet Moths.","Lin Yuan noticed that these 200 Hurricane Owlet Moths were different from the Hurricane Owlet Moths he saw the Insect Queen produce in the past.","They no longer had as strong of a wind energy fluctuation around their bodies.","These Hurricane Owlet Moths are probably the product of Liu Jie trying to conserve his and the Insect Queen’s spiritual power. He merely cloned a portion of the Hurricane Owlet Moth’s genetic model and created a different output.","These new Hurricane Owlet Moths flew into the sky in all directions.","Using Liu Jie’s current position as the base, the Hurricane Owlet Moths could act as his eyes in the dimensional rift.","It was necessary to conduct such surveillance in a foreign space like this. They needed to investigate the surroundings to ascertain where their possible enemies could be.","Since Lin Yuan had set his mind on preventing the dimensional rift’s evolution, he was definitely going to encounter enemies at some point.","Hence, a preemptive strike to understand the enemy’s movements and the situation was the plan’s next step. This way, he could stay one step ahead of them.","Liu Jie looked toward Liu Jie and said, “Given the Class 3 dimensional rift’s region, the Hurricane Owlet Moths will need at least six hours to thoroughly scope out the area.”","Lin Yuan’s brows drew together tightly.","Looking at the time, there was less than a day until the active period of the dimensional rift.","The evolution of the dimensional rift would be completed in 12 hours, during which Lin Yuan would need to find a way to stop it.","When they had been sucked into the dimensional rift, it had been open but had not started to evolve yet. The evolution had only started after they were sucked in.","Liu Jie’s Hurricane Owlet Moths needed six hours to finish the surveillance, meaning half of the time would be gone.","However, panicking was not going to solve any problems.","Lin Yuan knew this.","Lin Yuan made the rare decision to summon the Spirit-Drawing Ichthyosaur.","The last time Blackie had been summoned, it was still a Spirit-Gather Goldfish.","Lin Yuan placed Blackie in front of himself and Liu Jie and released Spirit Injection twice.","When Blackie had evolved into the Spirit-Drawing Ichthyosaur, Spirit Injection had also changed significantly.","Spirit Injection used to replenish the target’s spiritual power.","Now, it could also absorb the spirit qi from the air and direct it into the target’s body in the form of spiritual power within a window of time.","Initially, Lin Yuan did not think much of the change. It was because outside, the concentration of spirit qi in the air was too low.","As such, the improved ability had minimal effects.","However, the concentration of spirit qi in the Class 3 dimensional rift’s air was much higher than outside, greatly increasing the effectiveness of Spirit Injection.","In fact, Spirit Injection’s original ability to replenish spiritual power was now less effective than if it absorbed and transformed the spirit qi in the air.","Liu Jie did not expect Lin Yuan to have nurtured a fey that could replenish spiritual power.","The greatest fear Liu Jie had while commandeering the Insect Queen in a fight was that his spiritual power would run out.","Thus, he was always thrifty and calculative when it came to using the spiritual power in his body.","Now that Blackie could replenish his spiritual power, Liu Jie could be more liberal in using his spiritual power.","Liu Jie immediately used his spiritual power again to order the Insect Queen to release 200 more Hurricane Owlet Moth clones.","There were now double the number of Hurricane Owlet Moths in the sky, which allowed the surveillance efforts and search for the dimensional hub to be more efficient.","Liu Jie’s tightly shut eyes would now open in less than three hours instead of six.","When Liu Jie’s eyes finally flew open... his expression was grim!"]},{"number":494,"title":"Chapter 494: Is Master Powerful?","paragraphs":["While Liu Jie was using the Hurricane Owlet Moths to conduct surveillance, Lin Yuan was overexerting himself by drawing out massive amounts of spiritual power from his body.","He was activating the Source Sand that was underwater so that it could smash the rocks and generate tiny sand grains.","Lin Yuan stomped his feet and sighed.","The hardness of the underwater rocks in the dimensional rift is really no joke. It greatly surpasses that of the purple and black soil in the abyss dimensional rift.","Back in the controlled Class 3 abyss dimensional rift, Lin Yuan had sent the Source Sand to dive 100 meters and tunnel through the deep sediments so as to preserve the generated gravel’s durability.","Unexpectedly, at 10 meters underwater, the rate at which the Source Sand was smashing the rocks was much slower.","It was extremely difficult for the Source Sand to generate gravel in such an environment.","Although some better results could be obtained through the use of ferromanganese plating, it was still far below Lin Yuan’s expectations.","Finally, Lin Yuan calculated the odds and decided to limit the Source Sand to a depth of one or two meters.","The deeper the water, the harder the rocks became.","If the Source Sand only generated gravel at a depth of only one or two meters, it would be able to almost keep up with Lin Yuan’s expectations.","Nonetheless, the Source Sand was generating a significantly greater amount of gravel than was ever expected of it by Lin Yuan in battle.","Lin Yuan’s spiritual power was being depleted three times faster than before.","Even if Blackie continuously injected spiritual power into him, Lin Yuan could feel that his well of spiritual energy was close to running dry.","After all, Lin Yuan was only a C-rank spirit qi professional.","When Liu Jie opened his eyes, Lin Yuan hastily asked him, “Big Brother Liu, what did the Hurricane Owlet Moths discover?”","Liu Jie’s expression clearly warned that he was about to unleash bad news.","“I’ve discovered the dimensional hub’s location. I also found evidence of life in this zone,” said Liu Je solemnly.","Lin Yuan’s expression flattened as well. Yet, he plastered on a smile and said, “That’s good news. We’re now three hours ahead of our initial schedule.” Lin Yuan paused for a moment before continuing. “Big Brother Liu, please send out two more Hurricane Owlet Moths. They are to slowly fly toward where the dimensional hub is.”","Liu Jie was stunned by Lin Yuan’s request, but he did what was asked of him.","Without hesitation, Lin Yuan activated the Spirit Qi Imprint, which had been accumulating spirit qi all this time.","The moment the Spirit Qi Imprint was set off, the Spirit Qi Imprint markings on Blackie lit up.","To both Liu Jie and Zhou Luo’s astonishment, a tsunami of spiritual power exploded from Lin Yuan’s body.","Lin Yuan directed the spiritual power which had burst forth from him into the Source Sand underneath him.","The Source Sand immediately started smashing the rocks in the ocean floor in the direction of the dimensional hub, as led by the Hurricane Owlet Moths.","With Lin Yuan inputting such an enormous amount of spirit qi into it, the Source Sand started to churn out gravel at the same rate it used to. It was completely capable of keeping up with the Hurricane Owlet Moths that were flying slowly.","After producing the two Hurricane Owlet Moths, Liu Jie ordered the Insect Queen, “Use Blast Recovery.”","The Insect Queen’s body was alight with many green glowing spots. A wave of green fluids sprayed out of its valves.","While he commandeered the Insect Queen’s Flesh-Mincing Blade Insect, Liu Jie continued updating Lin Yuan on the surveillance results.","“The enemy has about 70 spirit qi professionals who possess Platinum feys. There are at least 20 of them who own Diamond feys. Since my Hurricane Owlet Moths are clones that only have a portion of the genetic model, they lack fighting abilities. Thus, my Hurricane Owlet Moths did not trespass past the formation of the spirit qi professionals who own Diamond quality feys. They were unable to reach the central zone. Due to this, I have no clue what kind of powers are guarding the central zone.”","Liu Jie added one more statement, “I don’t recognize the spirit qi professionals spotted by the Hurricane Owlet Moths, but most of their contracted feys have never been seen before in the Radiance Federation.”","When Liu Jie spoke, his mask hid his expression.","However, unadulterated murderous intent was evident in his gaze.","Lin Yuan was not surprised by Liu Jie’s report on the situation.","When they discovered the mother lode of Spatial Magnets, Lin Yuan had already made a speculation.","The surveillance results only proved his guess to be accurate.","Liu Jie’s revelation of the enemy’s power added a new sense of pressure on Lin Yuan.","Even if the Gold I/Fantasy I Source Sand evolved into a Fantasy II, it would still pale in comparison to the level of a Platinum fey.","Frankly, Liu Jie’s Platinum/Fantasy Breed Insect Queen was only at the level of a Diamond fey.","Zhou Luo was a king-class expert and had the Diamond/Fantasy I Lava Dragon Lizard, putting him ahead of Lin Yuan and Liu Jie in terms of power.","Unfortunately, the Lava Dragon Lizard was just a defense-type fey and was inept at offense.","The discrepancy in fighting abilities between them and the enemy was vast.","Moreover, the enemy could also be hiding a greater power that was still unknown to them.","Lin Yuan touched the Extreme Token hanging around his neck. It looked like he would need to use it to secure victory this time.","Lin Yuan removed the Extreme Token from around his neck and said to Liu Jie and Zhou Luo, “Inside of this lies the attacking domain of an expert. The strength of this attacking domain is sufficient to break the red crystal spiders that the Mother of Bloodbath threw at us on the deserted island.”","Lin Yuan was utterly unaware of the Moon Empress’ power.","All he knew was that she was a greatly venerated Class 5 Creation Master and that she possessed overwhelming power.","Since the Moon Empress was able to help the Mother of Bloodbath with its World Cleansing, she had to be more powerful than the Mother of Bloodbath.","Lin Yuan chose to reveal his trump card to Liu Jie and Zhou Luo now because he wanted to let them in on his plan and because he wanted to raise their morale during such a quagmire."]},{"number":495,"title":"Chapter 495: Do You Love Me, Seventh-chan?","paragraphs":["A gold war chariot drove along the clear sky above the coast.","The golden ripples in the sky glittered like a golden ocean, brighter than the boundless seas that reflected off it below.","The golden sky was laced with the radiance of victory. It was as though the golden expanse of the sky was crying out with the triumph of war.","Two golden metal warhorses trotted with their heads held high, giving the golden war chariot a devastatingly regal aura of power.","A girl with golden tresses, a ramrod straight posture, and golden eyes perched atop the chariot with a blank expression.","She left austerity and astringence in her wake.","Suddenly, several water vortexes erupted from the ocean and shot up toward the chariot.","Although the ocean was obviously blue, the gigantic water vortexes were black.","The inky black water vortexes engulfed the sky and threatened to destroy the golden field that was the sky.","A shallow glow glimmered in the manes of the warhorses pulling the chariot.","The shallow glow formed a barrier, preventing the obsidian water vortexes from breaching it.","When they were unable to break through the golden barrier, the black water vortexes immediately turned into chains.","The chains confined both the war chariot and the emotionless girl in an instant.","The golden-eyed girl’s lips curled into a playful smile that carried hints of contempt.","Pity was visible in those golden orbs of hers.","“Thou has been laying in wait for some time.”","When the last word fell from the golden-eyed girl’s lips, massive black tentacles floated out of the water.","The inky black tentacles gleamed with a shadowy glow, and they looked extremely smooth.","The black tentacles soon blanketed the azure surface of the ocean.","A withered elderly man stood on one of the black tentacles with a short-haired young woman by his side.","The old man was positioned a step behind the short-haired woman, and he looked at her with respect and affection.","The short-haired woman’s eyes were fixed on the golden girl. Her originally black pupils suddenly surged with bloodthirst and turned dark red.","From the short-haired woman’s gaze, one could tell that she bitterly resented the golden girl on the war chariot.","The elderly man lifted his head and looked at the golden girl in the sky.","The elderly man hissed. “Seventh Page War, you have to pay for your deeds in the Dark Continent.”","The golden girl’s voice dripped with pity and derision as she replied, “You want me to pay? Just because of the Nether Sea Jellyfish underneath your feet?”","The coast started to undulate.","A gargantuan black jellyfish adorned with purple light emerged from the water.","The hood on top of it seemed to swallow up the entire shore.","The Nether Sea Jellyfish compressed the water near the shore into a black droplet and launched it at the airborne golden war chariot.","As the black water droplet approached, Seventh Page War raised her hand relaxedly.","The golden war chariot was enveloped in a blinding light that was as bright as the sun.","The brilliant light dissolved the darkened surroundings created by the Nether Sea Jellyfish.","The two warhorses neighed and burst the water droplet, which rained down from the sky like a golden shower.","The golden precipitation descended upon the Nether Sea Jellyfish’s tentacles.","Each drop burned a small hole into the surface of the tentacles.","The holes grew and eventually disfigured the Nether Sea Jellyfish’s appearance.","The elderly man circulated his spiritual power and instructed the Nether Sea Jellyfish to continue maintaining the darkened surroundings as a means of countering.","Seventh Page War’s brow furrowed.","Her original expression of indifference was replaced with surprise and conflict.","Shortly after, as though she had just received bad news, her expression turned melancholy.","Seventh Page War’s countenance was severely grim. But, it also seemed like she no longer needed to attend to an urgent matter as she did not hastily start to haul attacks.","The short-haired woman’s originally hate-filled red eyes turned pink.","A pink demonic flower appeared in her hand.","The moment the pink flower materialized, the short-haired woman’s demeanor changed.","Her determination turned into a strange charm.","It was as though a breathtaking beauty had appeared amidst the dark shores and effulgent sky.","Her beauty could make anyone fall madly in love with her.","The short-haired woman leaped into the air and appeared beside Seventh Page War in an instant.","She held the demonic pink flower up to Seventh Page War and asked, “Am I pretty, Seventh-chan?”","A silver of scorn and bemusement flashed across Seventh Page War’s gaze, but not a trace of it remained a moment later.","Seventh Page War suddenly started acting like a young girl in the throes of love. It mumbled bashfully, “Yes.”","The short-haired woman’s pink eyes intensified in hue, but her tone was flirtatious. “Do you love me, Seventh-chan?”","Seventh Page War’s bashfulness turned up a notch.","“Yes.”","The short-haired woman asked in a gentle and alluring voice, “Loving someone means giving all of you to them. If you love me, will you die for me?”","Seventh Page War’s hypnotized and bashful face morphed into sorrow.","However, she did not hesitate to raise her arm as though she was ready to strike and end her life at any time.","A look of relief appeared on the short-haired woman’s face.","Instead of the joy of revenge, there was only grief and nostalgia.","Just when the short-haired woman thought Seventh Page War was about to take her own life before her, a pair of strong hands appeared in front of the short-haired woman. The hands crushed the demonic pink flower the short-haired woman held.","With one forceful squeeze, Seventh Page War reduced the demonic pink flower petals and stamen into powder."]},{"number":496,"title":"Chapter 496: Really Too Strong!","paragraphs":["An unbelievable look sprang up on the short-haired woman’s face. The beautiful flower in her hand was now left with only a short stem and root.","“Impossible!”","The mocking expression in the eyes of Seventh Page War was revealed at this moment.","“A sacred source lifeform, the Absolute Love Poppy.","“This is the first time I’ve seen a sacred source lifeform like this that can manipulate the soul of its kind. What a good thing.”","Just as Seventh Page War was speaking, the golden chariot underneath had disappeared. She stood in the air as she looked disdainfully at everything under her feet.","“It’s really interesting that the Dark Envoy, who the Seven States of Darkness jointly elected, is actually an expert who plays with emotions from the soul level.","“The Dark Continent has now become a cornerstone under Tower Canon. I have no time to take care of you, but you have taken the initiative to come.","“You’ve delayed my important business through your obstruction. You’re guilty of a very serious offense.","“As much as you’ve wasted one of my sacred source lifeforms, I’ll make all of you into wax figures and slowly repent under the Cleansing Spring.”","Seventh Page War frowned slightly. I didn’t expect that someone would discover my arrangements within the Radiance Federation.","But no matter who you are, it’s difficult for you to take this sacred source lifeform.","The Radiance Federation will have to accept the big gift with a bargaining chip that I’ve prepared.","However, Seventh Page War took her anger from all the loss out on this old man and woman in front of her. The short-haired woman still had an unbelievable look on her face.","“You have been charmed by the Absolute Love Poppy. Even if you’re stronger than me, I can feel it in advance if you break free from it!”","Seventh Page War was furious and lost interest in talking with this short-haired woman.","“How have I ever been charmed? I’m not the same as you.”","Just as Seventh Page War said that, she was surrounded by golden light and turned into a golden thorn apple.","The short-haired woman cried out in horror, “You’re actually not a human! You’re a plant-type fey!”","Just as Seventh Page War regained its original body, the old man on the Creation Breed Nether Sea Jellyfish’s tentacles summoned a small silver tuna-like fish on the spot. Then, the Nether Sea Jellyfish started to burn up like a dead tree.","Upon sensing the old man’s action, two golden petal lights shot out of the leaves of the golden thorn apple that Seventh Page War had transformed into. The two petal lights seemed to contain the grandeur of war.","The old man disregarded the safety of the Nether Sea Jellyfish, which had a large part of its tentacles still underwater, and let it wrap him with its black silk-like tentacles before using its huge body to go toward the two golden petal lights.","At that moment, the small silver tuna-like fish tore open the space. The old man immediately fled toward it with the short-haired woman.","In just a moment, the Nether Sea Jellyfish, which had come into contact with the two golden petal lights, landed on the surface of the sea like a rag.","Soon after, it sank into the deep sea, bringing a life force far beyond the large whale fall in the deep sea.","One of the golden lights continued with its momentum after blasting the Nether Sea Jellyfish.","Although it had still let the short-haired woman and the old man escape into the spatial rift that the small silver fish had torn opened, half of the old man’s body had been hit by this golden petal light, causing half of his body to end up like the Nether Sea Jellyfish.","Seventh Page War stood in the sky above the raging sea, watching the various fierce marine beasts at its feet nibbling away the feast left behind after the Nether Sea Jellyfish had blown up.","However, the Nether Sea Jellyfish’s flesh contained too much energy, so many greedy marine beasts that didn’t meet the strength requirements were blown into pieces by this energy, which in turn brought about a feast for other weaker marine beasts.","The sea was dyed red by the blood of an unknown number of marine beasts in just a moment.","Seventh Page War suddenly looked up, with a change of its disdainful posture. Instead, it looked at the sky with a grave expression and saw the sky darkened all of a sudden as the long silent night descended.","A white moon rose high in the silent night sky. Within a few moments, it was tinted with a layer of the color of blood.","It looked at the white moon that suddenly appeared in the sky being divided into the first quarter moon and third quarter moon that were drenched with a blood-colored luster. When Seventh Page War felt the intent of endless slaughter in the blood-colored moon, it frowned even more tightly.","The words coming out of its mouth no longer contained the kind of pity and mockery like before. They were only solemn.","“The moonlight blooms with a blood luster, and the first quarter and third quarter moon divide the moon.","“It seems I don’t have to go to the Radiance Federation anymore.”","Seventh Page War was about to summon the Radiance War Chariot to return when it revealed the same expression as when the short-haired woman used the Absolute Love Poppy.","Then it returned to normal and said softly, “Surprisingly, it has such a strong, charming effect on the souls of non-identical lifeforms. The Absolute Love Poppy is really good.","“But it doesn’t have much chance to bloom after all.”","As it spoke, Seventh Page War disgustingly shook the mud left behind by the Absolute Love Poppy on its hand.","The Radiance War Chariot went far, but there was something left on the sea.","“The beautiful pink flower is really tacky!","“I’ll fall in love with the kind of plant that can take a big bite of meat, look at me with deep affection, and bloom into a sea of flowers in a blink of an eye.”","The words remained for a moment before it was shattered by the sharp sea breeze and blown away to nowhere.","...","“Big Brother Liu, try to make the Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects burrow into the seabed underneath your feet.”","Lin Yuan’s words confused Liu Jie a little. Liu Jie was still constantly producing Lightning Gathering Moths and Plasma Caterpillars.","For the enemy, the lightning beam that the Lightning Gathering Moths could release after the Plasma Caterpillars had been charged with plasma was the strongest attack method that he could use at the moment.","Whenever the Plasma Caterpillars couldn’t spit out more plasma, Liu Jie would let the Insect Queen use its Blast Recovery to recover energy through the destruction of the Plasma Caterpillars that had lost their value, as scraps, allowing every trace of energy in the Insect Queen to emit its maximum value.","Upon receiving Lin Yuan’s instruction, Liu Jie was ready to let the Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects try to plow the seabed with their blade-like insect legs.","But in Liu Jie’s opinion, even if the Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects could burrow into the hard seabed underneath, it could only allow them to hide with a loss of mobility.","At that moment, Liu Jie suddenly noticed a huge vortex of quicksand had suddenly appeared on the seabed under Lin Yuan’s feet. His eyes lit up as he immediately understood what Lin Yuan meant.","Zhou Luo, who was looking at the quicksand vortex that had suddenly appeared under Lin Yuan’s feet and the sea of insects behind Liu Jie, took a huge gulp.","The younger generation was now simply too damn strong!"]},{"number":497,"title":"Chapter 497: The Beauty of Positional Warfare","paragraphs":["Zhou Luo felt that since Liu Jie was Radiance Hundred #30, it was not unexpected for him to have this level of ability.","The members at the forefront of the Radiance Hundred were all capable of being king-class experts.","Zhou Luo compared his current level of power and the level he was at before meeting Lin Yuan.","Given Platinum IX/Fantasy I Lava Dragon Lizard’s power, how long will I be able to fend off Liu Jie’s Insect Queen’s sea of insects? As a king-class expert, my spiritual power is A-rank. I have a much larger capacity for spiritual power than Liu Jie.","However, the Insect Queen has the exclusive ability to produce insect bombs. The exploding insects not only enable the Insect Queen to recover spiritual energy, but they can also inflict a decent amount of damage.","Will my Lava Dragon Lizard die in the struggle against the Insect Queen’s insect swarm in the long run? The final odds don’t look good. After seeing Liu Jie unleash his power, I now understand the fighting abilities that come with youth.","On the other hand, Lin Yuan’s power shocked me to the core. When I saw him without his mask, I was surprised a young man like him possessed so many resources. I found out that he’s Black later on. However, his powers have now significantly transcended the level Black demonstrated on Star Web. As usual, he continues to hide his true power. I never saw the tsunami of spiritual power he released coming.","Although Zhou Luo was able to feel the enormous amount of spiritual power Lin Yuan injected downward, he did not know it was meant for the elemental source-type lifeform below.","Many parts of the seafloor below had already been smashed into yellow sand.","Liu Jie was currently instructing many Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects to tunnel into the large swirling quicksand that had appeared by Lin Yuan’s feet.","After the Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects tunneled into the quicksand, Liu Jie’s eyes brightened.","From the connected consciousness between the Insect Queen and the Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects, Liu Jie saw the project Lin Yuan had been working on on the seafloor during the past few hours.","On the seafloor were numerous tunnels leading toward the dimensional hub.","The tunnels were wide enough to fit five Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects. Even the Shield Ladybugs would be able to move freely in the tunnels.","The arrangement of the tunnels allowed the Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects that had entered through the quicksand to form orderly groups.","Now, Liu Jie’s previously obvious armada was obscured.","The quicksand in the seafloor also increased the Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects striking opportunities.","The Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects could shoot out of any portion of the tunnels to attack.","“Big Brother Liu, we can begin filibustering.”","Lin Yuan inhaled deeply and injected the majestic spiritual power into Blackie.","Blackie started using Spirit Injection unceasingly on Liu Jie to replenish his depleted spiritual power.","Liu Jie suddenly realized that ever since the surge in Lin Yuan’s spiritual power, Lin Yuan no longer cared about the amount of spiritual power he exhausted when activating Blackie to use Spirit Injection.","The spiritual power entering Liu Jie’s body felt like a shot of vitalization.","More! More! More! Rise more!","Liu Jie quickly directed the spiritual power into the Insect Queen and instructed it to produce more Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects, Plasma Caterpillars, Lightning Gathering Moths, and Hurricane Owlet Moths.","He wanted to grow the army of insects under his control as much as possible.","Liu Jie knew that he was the core output position of their three-man team.","In order for their team to be able to deal the greatest damage, Liu Jie did not hold back in his efforts to produce the best insect army.","Lin Yuan was also aware of his role in this fight and the responsibilities that came with it.","Lin Yuan was an all-rounded contestant.","However, Lin Yuan’s defensive capabilities were undeniably weak as they were limited to only being to provide individual protection.","Zhou Luo was in charge of defense within their team, so Lin Yuan did not need to shoulder any part of the burden.","In terms of output, Lin Yuan only had Red Thorn, the Acid Corrosion Queen Bee, and the Source Sand in his arsenal because Chimey was asleep.","Red Thorn’s sea of flowers could deal a considerable amount of damage to a large number of dimensional lifeforms at a time, but it only had the power of a Silver/Fantasy Breed. The ensuing battle was above its level.","Thus, Lin Yuan assigned himself to be a healing and supporting role.","The responsibility of healing would fall to the Jasmine Lily.","The support would be provided by Blackie that could replenish spiritual power, while the Source Sand would try to control the situation at the same time.","The Source Sand could also apply a layer of sand on the exterior of the Shield Ladybugs, which could help buffer some of the damage.","Although the effects of the sand layer would not be evident on just one bug, the effects would be immeasurable if applied to the entire insect army.","The plan relied on the assumption that Lin Yuan was fine with Blackie unceasingly draining the spiritual power in the Spirit Qi Imprint. Essentially, Lin Yuan had become a battery that supplied Liu Jie with spiritual power.","Two hours flew by in the blink of an eye. Lin Yuan continued helping the Source Sand to create gravel on the seafloor while at the same time replenishing Liu Jie’s spiritual power.","By the end of the two hours, 2/3 of the spiritual power that Lin Yuan had injected into the Spirit Qi Imprint was already gone.","Zhou Luo felt desensitized.","He had already lost track of the number of insects he watched tunnel into the quicksand.","Even flying insect-species feys like the Lightning Gathering Moths and Hurricane Owlet Moths entered the sand with their wings wrapped around their bodies.","What a scary master and retainer knight!","They had managed to raise their fighting power by several times in just two hours!","Lin Yuan could sense the Insect Queen’s insects through his Source Sand, and he felt his confidence spike slightly.","During the process of transporting the insect army through the quicksand, Lin Yuan felt himself appreciating the unique beauty of warfare."]},{"number":498,"title":"Chapter 498: Hunting-Ashes","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan’s Source Sand was the link that created the insect army’s positional warfare.","The initially flexible formation was now even more flexible, and they would be able to get into position swiftly.","It would also change the visible section of the insect army into a type of surprise attack.","Both Liu Jie and Lin Yuan halted their movements and smiled at each other. Lin Yuan turned to smile at Zhou Luo and said, “We can begin.”","Lin Yuan and Liu Jie sat astride the Lava Dragon Lizard’s back while Zhou Luo rode at the front of the Lava Dragon Lizard.","The 10-meter-long Lava Dragon Lizard spread its legs and bolted toward the dimensional hub.","On the Lava Dragon Lizard’s back, Lin Yuan noticed it was much more enjoyable to ride land feys than flying feys.","In the sky, there were only clouds for as far as the eye could see.","However, riding a fey that was charging about on land allowed him to take in the ephemeral scenery around, which was an incomparable delight.","Inside the evolving Class 3 dimensional rift was interminable ocean water that emanated a distinct salty redolence.","Lin Yuan narrowed his eyes and inhaled deeply to calm his nerves.","He knew that a battle to the death was imminent.","Blood would be shed, and deaths were unavoidable.","Despite Lin Yuan having taken out his Master’s Extreme Token and showing it to Liu Jie and Zhou Luo as a means of boosting morale, he could not repeat the action flippantly.","No one knew whether the enemy camp scoped out by Liu Jie’s Hurricane Owlet Moths was hiding a greater peril.","Moreover, during the evolution of the dimensional rift, an obstacle of turbulence would be formed outside the dimensional hub’s inner layer’s source-type lifeforms.","During the evolution of the Class 3 dimensional rift into Class 4, the dimensional obstacle at the surface would be as strong as Diamond quality.","Either Zhou Luo or Liu Jie would be able to break through.","However, if the dimensional rift’s evolution was to Class 5, the dimensional obstacle at the surface could only be broken by the power of Suzerain and above.","In order to prevent the dimensional rift’s evolution, breaking the dimensional obstacle was the minimum requirement.","Thus, Lin Yuan could not show his trump card until they arrived at the dimensional hub.","Lin Yuan kept this notion to himself, but the other two men were well aware.","Zhou Luo was about to speak, but he hesitated and turned to look at Lin Yuan and Liu Jie. He noticed the resolute expressions on their faces.","Zhou Luo smirked and turned back to stroke his buddy, the Lava Dragon Lizard.","His own gaze became determined as a grin spread across his face. He seemed to have come to some sort of decision.","Lin Yuan’s expression suddenly tensed, and he sensed the report coming from the Source Sand.","“Prepare for battle. The enemy is here,” he said.","...","Five source-type items were at the dimensional hub. The aura they emitted generated dimensional ripples at the dimensional hub.","These dimensional ripples widened the doorway linking to the water world.","Next to the five pieces of source-type items was an opaque glowing mass of rainbow light.","A transparent light yellow shell covered the glowing mass.","There were also remnants of shattered transparent light yellow pieces near the five pieces of source-type items.","Clearly, there used to be a transparent light yellow shell around the five pieces of source-type items as well, but it was broken.","A well-put-together man wearing an outfit adorned with many gemstones stood next to the dimensional hub.","His hair was grey, his face was deathly pale, and his eyes were a dull gray that was completely devoid of the spark of life.","Nonetheless, flecks of light occasionally streaked past the man’s eyes, giving him a less lifeless deportment. Instead, they made him look extremely treacherous.","A tall man with a head of short dark green hair walked up to stand by the gray-haired man’s side.","“Lord Hunting-Ashes, I’ve already sent out the people you designated as per your instructions. But those people—”","The tall, dark green-haired man was not done speaking when he was interrupted by the gray-haired man.","“Just sent them out as I instructed. Have the rest of the people finished drinking the medicine I instructed you to distribute?” He impatiently snapped.","The dark green-haired man trembled and hastily replied, “Yes, Lord Hunting-Ashes. They’re all done drinking.”","The gray-haired man touched the waist of his attire, namely the black jewels that were about the size of quail eggs.","“Did you drink the medicine too?” he asked.","The dark green-haired man gnashed his teeth as sweat dripped down his face. He anxiously pulled out a bottle and gulped down the gray liquid contents.","The gray-haired man extended his arm and patted the other man’s face.","“Ten minutes later, bring me the people who drank the medicine,” he ordered.","The dark green-haired man retreated hurriedly and proceeded to carry out the gray-haired man’s order.","The gray-haired man stood at the same spot for about five minutes.","The gray-haired man kept his gaze fixed on the evolving Class 3 dimensional hub during those five minutes. His face split into a grotesque smile.","“The evolving dimensional rift is completely cut off from the outside space. I don’t need to listen to Lord Seventh Page War’s orders. The stupid crow is dead now, which means so are the three king-class experts under it. No issue. I, Hunting-Ashes, shall accomplish Lord Seventh Page War’s final order,” he murmured under his breath.","The grey-haired man gently clapped his hands, and a gray fly appeared nearby.","At that same time, a screen seemed to have disappeared around the area, revealing a pot of thriving thorn apple."]},{"number":499,"title":"Chapter 499: Evolving to Class 5","paragraphs":["The gray-haired man humbly walked over to the thorn apple and fell to his knees.","The glimmer that was in the gray eyes had disappeared, leaving only sincerity.","“Tower Canon, Tower of War, Battlefield Division’s Ashes Team. Hunting-Ashes greets Lord Seventh Page War. I’m willing to sacrifice my unworthy life to carry out your decree.”","The gray-haired man dipped his head and kowtowed before the thorn apple. He reached out and plucked the golden lush thorn apple from the ground, holding it gingerly.","He threw the golden thorn apple into the evolving Class 3 dimensional rift.","With the energy of the dimensional hub, the golden thorn apple started to slowly wither.","The wilting golden thorn apple released a large burst of energy, pushing the dimensional hub’s spatial energy up a level.","This resulted in the evolving dimensional rift to open and widen by three times.","Four pieces of source-type items immediately fell from the ripped-open dimensional rift.","When the decay of the thorn apple reached the flower core, more energy was released.","The recently evolved water world dimensional rift instantly began to evolve toward Class 5.","At that moment, the gray-haired man caught sight of the tall, dark green-haired man he had dispatched, leading about 50 people toward him.","The gray-haired man fished out a small palm-sized plate. It was carved with intricate and complex golden patterns.","The plate shook, and a large purplish-gray egg appeared in the man’s hand.","The people behind the tall man looked intensely troubled.","However, the tall man was as deadpan as ever, his eyes completely devoid of life.","It seemed as though he knew what was coming.","A dark-skinned man emerged from the crowd and asked the gray-haired man, “Lord Hunting-Ashes, we might not have been in a dead-end if someone had discovered us being sucked into the dimensional rift here. But since you evolved the dimensional rift, you’ve essentially locked the dimensional rift. Now we—”","The dark-skinned man did not even manage to finish speaking as one look from the gray-haired man made him shut up.","The dark-skinned man’s chest tightened, and he felt as though a layer of dust had settled over his heart. The pressure was indescribable.","“Where do you want to go if we don’t seal this up?” enquired the gray-haired man.","The dark-skinned man’s face tensed. The way he looked at the gray-haired man displayed much less obedience than the tall man.","“Of course we need to stay here to continue doing as Lord Chanter Crow says.”","At the mention of Chanter Crow, disgust flashed across the gray-haired man’s face.","“The crow wanted you to stay here to maintain the dimensional rift’s regular functionality and the covert operations outside of the dimensional rift. Is it done? If someone barges in, it’ll be your responsibility to become guardians.”","A dark green-haired girl frowned. Her tone lacked respect, and she was suspicious. “Lord Hunting-Ashes, the contracted feys we have here are normally used to maintain the dimensional rift’s regular functionality. Their abilities are not suited for battle. If we are to become guardians, we will suffer losses for sure. Lord Crow will be displeased. May I ask where the three king-class experts under Lord Crow are? We need them to stabilize the situation. They’ll be of much more use than us.”","The green-haired girl’s tone suddenly changed to one of overt fury. “Lord Hunting-Ashes, the 30 people you sent out are usually in charge of cleaning. By sending them to the front lines, you’ve signed their death sentences. Who shall do the cleaning now?”","The gray-haired man scanned the faces of the people present. He turned, forced a smile, and said to the tall man, “I must have caused a lot of trouble for you by sending you out on tasks. I didn’t know that I had lost so much influence. I wonder if the Chanting Crow would dare speak to me in such a manner if he was still alive!”","When the tall man heard what the gray-haired man said and glimpsed his expression, he was immediately gripped by terror.","Although Lord Crow was a peak Suzerain/Myth II fey, it was only a Chanter in the Tower of War.","Meanwhile, Hunting-Ashes might not possess much power, but he was affiliated with an impressive Battlefield Division team.","The Ashes Team members held higher positions than the Tower of War’s Chanters, some of whom were comparable with Lead Chanters.","Every Ashes Team member controlled a carcinoma fey that could incite disasters. Lord Seventh Page War had handpicked each fey.","The entrance of any Ashes Team member in battle was sure to result in destruction.","However, they had been keeping a low profile since they were here.","Luckily, they had been guarding the dimensional hub and had not learned that Lord Crow had died.","Otherwise, they might not have been able to bring themselves to move, even if Lord Hunting-Ashes’s signal flag had been raised.","The tall man was preparing to speak and control the situation, but he suddenly felt a stabbing pain in his abdomen.","The tall man fell to the ground.","His contracted fey came out despite not having been summoned.","The tall man’s pain seemed to intensify, and he sprawled out on the ground feebly.","The tall man closed his eyes in resignation and prepared to draw his last breath.","The other 50 people who had come with the tall man all exhibited the same symptoms.","Hunting-Ashes pumped spiritual power into the large purplish-gray egg in his hands.","An elegantly slender poisonous bee hatched from the egg. Its body mirrored the color of the egg.","When the poisonous bee appeared, the gray-haired man instructed it to fly to the faces of each fallen spirit qi professional.","The bee’s stinger pierced the back of each of their heads, and something strange started occurring at the back of their heads"]},{"number":500,"title":"Chapter 500: Enemies Like Construction Association’s Support Staff","paragraphs":["The gazes of every spirit qi professional who had been stung by the purplish-gray bee became calm.","However, the contracted feys of these spirit qi professionals looked as though they were under psychic torture. They were thrashing about violently.","The purplish-gray poisonous bee’s stinger injected the eye of each person present.","Including the tall man, a total of 51 spirit qi professionals and 72 feys instantly stopped breathing.","Shortly after, a bone-chilling chewing noise sounded from the feys’ bodies.","A blade-covered worm emerged from the bodies of each and every fey. The worms devoured the host fey they grew out, and their bodies rapidly increased in size.","Approximately 25 of the worms grew to about 5 meters.","The blades that jutted out of all over their bodies were razor sharp.","The remaining 47 worms grew to about 3 meters, but the blades that covered their bodies were just as bountiful in quantity.","However, the blades that covered the 47 worms were not as sharp as those on the bodies of the 5-meter worms.","Everything on site was guzzled up in a flash, leaving only the gray-haired man and the 72 large blade-covered worms.","The gray-haired man extended his arm, and the purplish-gray poisonous bee landed on it.","It was cleaning its stinger with its mouth.","The gray-haired man muttered to himself, “The Blade Queen Bee’s first batch of eggs is of such low quality. What a waste! But, these Blade Worms’ battle prowess is much higher than that crowd. These 25 Diamond Blade Worms and 47 Gold Blade Worms should be able to complete Lord Seventh Page War’s decree!”","The gray-haired man waved his arm and dispatched all the Blade Worms.","He turned and walked to the stronghold in the distance.","Inside the stronghold were seven enormous long-dead feys that had clearly been pumped full of a premium preservative.","They had begun mummifying, but no decomposition existed.","The gray-haired man whispered to the Blade Queen Bee, “Eat these seven feys.”","The Blade Queen Bee was slightly against the idea, but it still stung each of the dead feys.","Soon, the Blade Queen Bee started consuming the enormous feys’ liquefied flesh.","The gray-haired man stood nearby with his eyes closed. He seemed to be doing mental calculations.","When he felt the Blade Queen Bee land on his palm, the gray-haired man closed his palm and crushed it without hesitation.","“Apologies, Lord Seventh Page War! I killed the Blade Queen Bee you entrusted to me, but it had to be done so I can better complete your decree,” he murmured.","The gray-haired man plucked a greyish purple crystal from the mangled remnants of the Blade Queen Bee.","He then wiped the Blade Queen Bee’s carcass on a wall, repeating the wiping motion multiple times.","“The Blade Queen Bee ate the seven Diamond/Fantasy Breed feys, and the crystallized venom stored in its body exploded. Yet, it was only about as strong as one full force strike by a Diamond V/Fantasy Breed. If those seven feys the Blade Queen Bee ate were still alive, the crystallized venom could have been as strong as the full force strike of a Diamond X/Fantasy Breed!”","After walking out of the stronghold, the gray-haired man gently clapped to summon a fey.","“It’s the most fitting death to die for Lord Seventh Page War’s decree. It’ll be wonderful to see the Class 5 dimensional rift’s opening! Will the sacred source lifeform that falls from the Class 5 dimensional rift and the unbroken sacred source lifeforms at the dimensional hub cause the dimensional rift to evolve again?” he whispered.","A buzzing gray fly landed on the gray-haired man’s shoulder.","The gray-haired man’s demeanor suddenly became unnatural. His aura weakened, and his silhouette could only be seen when he moved.","...","When they heard Lin Yuan say the enemy was here, Liu Jie and Zhou Luo went into battle mode.","“Big Brother Liu, my Source Sand can only sense a rough estimate of the number of enemies. It can’t sense their level of power. I’m going to create an area of quicksand about half a meter wide. Send out two Hurricane Owlet Moths and 10 Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects to check on the enemy’s power,” said Lin Yuan anxiously.","Liu Jie immediately instructed the Insect Queen to concentrate its consciousness on the 10 Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects and Hurricane Owlet Moths.","After checking on the enemy, Liu Jie’s face twisted with shock.","He was not shocked by the mightiness of the enemy but by how vulnerable they were.","There were only 30 spirit qi professionals who were all riding on a few Diamond Giant Cattle.","There were also about 40 feys of a variety of species charging toward them.","The 30 spirit qi professionals and feys looked more like the support staff of the Construction Association rather than oncoming enemies.","Although a large proportion of the feys did not belong to species that the Radiance Federation produced, a small proportion of them was.","These feys were not skilled at fighting.","For example, the Diamond Giant Cattle was the Construction Association’s favorite fey.","The Giant Cattle could transport materials and be able to speed up the Construction Association’s workflow by three times.","Liu Jie never expected to face off against such enemies.","Only a few of the Giant Cattle and the other 40 feys’ grade was Diamond.","With such enemies, Liu Jie was certain of attaining victory even if Lin Yuan had not used his spiritual power to help him create the insect army. Liu Jie could have used his normal fighting style."]}]);
